values
  ('68842059602335710', 'OCTB', 2017, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Sung Boon-Chung, Paul Chung Shing-Yuen', 'Paul Chung Shing-Yuen', 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Sam Lee, Chen Miqi, Justin Cheung Kin-Sing, Yumiko Cheng Hei-Yi, Emme Wong Yi-Man, Kathy Tong Yee', null, 'Undercover detective Chen Feng Xiang in a crack after a large group of cadres transferred to civilian, but in eight years after being an anti-black group to recapture. As the current rivers and lakes on the most troublesome triad leader are Chen Feng Xiang then younger brother Zhang Zhi Qiang, Feng Xiang re-out of the "rivers and lakes." He joined Zhang Shaojun led by the anti-black team and the new villain tostart dealing with the hands of the old friends and enemies, which makes Feng Xiang once dilemma. There are three years since the return of Hong Kong, gangs intend to take advantage of a big ticket. Feng Xiang in the investigation of a case of the disappearance of the leader, but found a century of Hong Kong triad history of the shaking big conspiracy.', 'Undercover detective Chen Feng Xiang in a crack after a large group of cadres transferred to civilian, but in eight years after being an anti-black group to recapture. As the current rivers and lakes on the most troublesome triad leader are Chen Feng Xiang then younger brother Zhang Zhi Qiang, Feng Xiang re-out of the "rivers and lakes." He joined Zhang Shaojun led by the anti-black team and the new villain tostart dealing with the hands of the old friends and enemies, which makes Feng Xiang once dilemma. There are three years since the return of Hong Kong, gangs intend to take advantage of a big ticket. Feng Xiang in the investigation of a case of the disappearance of the leader, but found a century of Hong Kong triad history of the shaking big conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65x556N9QEsNpZmvKL7rSHkw5KL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74689'),
  ('685132161713448622', 'Octo: Emotional Investigator Shinno Akari', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Marie Iitoyo, Yuka Kageyama, Kodai Asaka, Rena Matsui, Kenta Hamano, Yoji Iwase', null, 'Shinno Akari is a detective with a special ability. She is able to see the eight human emotions in color. Due to a case, she teams up with Detective Kazehaya Ryo. They work together to reveal the truth behind heinous crimes.', 'Shinno Akari is a detective with a special ability. She is able to see the eight human emotions in color. Due to a case, she teams up with Detective Kazehaya Ryo. They work together to reveal the truth behind heinous crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6q04tcuZp1KTlInxWjyj4zqRPhY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203663'),
  ('197878551316984701', 'October Faction', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Damian Kindler', null, 'Aurora Burghart, Gabriel Darku, Tamara Taylor, J.C. MacKenzie, Megan Follows, Wendy Crewson, Maxim Roy, Stephen McHattie', 'TV-MA', 'Monster hunters Fred and Deloris Allen tangle with evil ... and family drama with their teenage twins. From the comics by Steve Niles and Damien Worm.', 'Monster hunters Fred and Deloris Allen tangle with evil ... and family drama with their teenage twins. From the comics by Steve Niles and Damien Worm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yrXh19tH2ThJHXriORT16WKbBi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93826'),
  ('159375659197138088', 'October Road', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'André Nemec, Scott Rosenberg', null, 'Bryan Greenberg, Laura Prepon, Tom Berenger, Warren Christie, Brad William Henke, Evan Jones, Jay Paulson, Slade Pearce', 'TV-PG', 'When Nick Garrett was 18, he packed up his truck and said goodbye for a summer road trip that turned into 10 years of being away. He has since become a literary celebrity in New York, living off the fame and fortune of his best-selling novel and movie, based on his hometown friends. To the literary world, Nick defined a generation, but to his hometown, he betrayed them by sharing secrets. Now, without inspiration for a new book, Nick returns to his hometown to find that feelings toward him have changed.', 'When Nick Garrett was 18, he packed up his truck and said goodbye for a summer road trip that turned into 10 years of being away. He has since become a literary celebrity in New York, living off the fame and fortune of his best-selling novel and movie, based on his hometown friends. To the literary world, Nick defined a generation, but to his hometown, he betrayed them by sharing secrets. Now, without inspiration for a new book, Nick returns to his hometown to find that feelings toward him have changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDgOxRaPI0iAHaWWyzcSJUqjVbs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1255'),
  ('987336504026513908', 'Octonauts', 2010, 'Animation, Kids', 'Michael C. Murphy, Vicki Wong', null, 'Keith Wickham, Simon Greenall, Jo Wyatt, Rob Rackstraw, Ross Breen, Teresa Gallagher, Michael Murphy, Paul Panting', 'TV-Y', 'Follows an underwater exploring crew made up of stylized anthropomorphic animals, a team of eight adventurers who live in an undersea base, the Octopod, from where they go on undersea adventures with the help of a fleet of aquatic vehicles.', 'Follows an underwater exploring crew made up of stylized anthropomorphic animals, a team of eight adventurers who live in an undersea base, the Octopod, from where they go on undersea adventures with the help of a fleet of aquatic vehicles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYUhUSKWKpSBahaWLUQIPckAy8p.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:37472'),
  ('495267957721752609', 'Octonauts: Above & Beyond', 2021, 'Animation, Kids, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'The Octonauts expand their exploration beyond the sea -- and onto land! With new rides and new friends, they''ll protect any habitats and animals at risk.', 'The Octonauts expand their exploration beyond the sea -- and onto land! With new rides and new friends, they''ll protect any habitats and animals at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1V7IYlTVyGmjwiEH9SvPZREzfom.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:132983'),
  ('435714258375445514', 'Oda Cinnamon Nobunaga', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Tomokazu Sugita, Akane Kumada, Kenyu Horiuchi, Tessyo Genda, Miyu Irino, Takahiro Sakurai, Kenichi Suzumura', 'TV-14', 'Before he died at Honnouji in 1582, the great warlord Oda Nobunaga stood before a statue of Buddha and thought to himself that he''d committed so many sins that he''d very likely be reborn as a dog. He never expected that Buddha would take his words literally, however, but the next thing he''s aware of, he''s in the body of a Shiba Inu named Shinamon in modern Japan! Less than thrilled at the fact that his human warlord consciousness is trapped in the instinct-bound body of an adorable house pet, Nobunaga struggles between making the best of it (he can have that ruff all the Europeans were wearing!) and being frustrated with his reality (the ruff turns out to be a bath hat and now he has to have a bath). Is it better or worse that many of his fellow warriors also seem to have been reincarnated in canine form – and that his enemy looks like he lucked out and got to be a human?', 'Before he died at Honnouji in 1582, the great warlord Oda Nobunaga stood before a statue of Buddha and thought to himself that he''d committed so many sins that he''d very likely be reborn as a dog. He never expected that Buddha would take his words literally, however, but the next thing he''s aware of, he''s in the body of a Shiba Inu named Shinamon in modern Japan! Less than thrilled at the fact that his human warlord consciousness is trapped in the instinct-bound body of an adorable house pet, Nobunaga struggles between making the best of it (he can have that ruff all the Europeans were wearing!) and being frustrated with his reality (the ruff turns out to be a bath hat and now he has to have a bath). Is it better or worse that many of his fellow warriors also seem to have been reincarnated in canine form – and that his enemy looks like he lucked out and got to be a human?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyERYxCgqgPnT4tVrdykeWmTgMY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91343'),
  ('292869680320219441', 'Odd Family 11', 2011, 'Family, Comedy', 'Kankuro Kudo', null, 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Yasuko Mitsuura, Seishirou Katou, Gen Hoshino, Kasumi Arimura, Seiichi Tanabe, Hirosue Ryoko, Kitaro', null, 'Minoru Sanada is a cameraman with little skills in his profession. His wife Megumi runs a cafe, but the cafe doesn''t have any customers. Yet, the couple has 8 chidren.', 'Minoru Sanada is a cameraman with little skills in his profession. His wife Megumi runs a cafe, but the cafe doesn''t have any customers. Yet, the couple has 8 chidren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R75Ij4LjbNLcOtzbMW02L560Dg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41739'),
  ('635364861573388911', 'Odd Mom Out', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jill Kargman', null, 'Jill Kargman, K.K. Glick, Joanna Cassidy, Sean Kleier, Abby Elliott, Andy Buckley', null, 'Acclaimed author Jill Kargman plays a version of herself as she navigates the treacherous and elite ecosystem of New York''s Upper East Side, and the uber-wealthy mommy clique inhabiting this fantastically outrageous domain.', 'Acclaimed author Jill Kargman plays a version of herself as she navigates the treacherous and elite ecosystem of New York''s Upper East Side, and the uber-wealthy mommy clique inhabiting this fantastically outrageous domain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2mh5mjEhr5LpWHA39WB1jpignp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62810'),
  ('293439849071422180', 'Odd Squad', 2014, 'Comedy, Crime, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Kids', 'Tim McKeon, Adam Peltzman', null, 'Millie Davis, Dalila Bela, Isaac Kragten, Christian Distefano, Filip Geljo, Anna Cathcart, Sean Michael Kyer, Eshaan Buadwal', 'TV-G', 'Odd Squad saves the day whenever something unusual happens.', 'Odd Squad saves the day whenever something unusual happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRVaHKUbUF7e97po0fulgG4yM3h.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:73549'),
  ('413203696791361905', 'Odd Squad Mobile Unit', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paEK8mGCYI1DoeO7kRr11IWtsnJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:319273'),
  ('720237960555972015', 'Oddballs', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'James Rallison, Ethan Banville', null, 'James Rallison, Julian Gant, Kimberly Brooks, Carl Faruolo, Gary Anthony Williams', 'TV-Y7', 'Bubble-shaped boy James questions anything and everything that annoys him. The result? An awesome life of odd adventure with his two best friends.', 'Bubble-shaped boy James questions anything and everything that annoys him. The result? An awesome life of odd adventure with his two best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCJ60PDEXgavJ1vxWAjW1PMuZd6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:204684'),
  ('4986734277778052', 'Oddity Archive', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Ben Minnotte', 'Ben Minnotte', 'Ben Minnotte', null, 'The Oddity Archive is a web series that revolves around the "cultural dustbin", especially as it pertains to media. The Archive also functions as an actual archive of sorts, with a modest collection of off-air Betamax and VHS recordings (about 400 total as of June, 2014). There''s also a decent collection of ephemeral video, "ripoff" and "drugstore" LP''s/cassettes/8-tracks, as well as (working) obsolete technology.', 'The Oddity Archive is a web series that revolves around the "cultural dustbin", especially as it pertains to media. The Archive also functions as an actual archive of sorts, with a modest collection of off-air Betamax and VHS recordings (about 400 total as of June, 2014). There''s also a decent collection of ephemeral video, "ripoff" and "drugstore" LP''s/cassettes/8-tracks, as well as (working) obsolete technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR3vmpzfzyhiEwaTO2BwUfeHY4a.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:215920'),
  ('9999019628309114', 'ODDTAXI', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Baku Kinoshita', null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Ryohei Kimura, Riho Iida, Takashi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kenji Hamada, Koudai Sakai, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'While working as a taxi driver on the hectic streets of Tokyo, a reticent walrus gets pulled into a mystery involving a missing teenage girl.', 'While working as a taxi driver on the hectic streets of Tokyo, a reticent walrus gets pulled into a mystery involving a missing teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztyo4gSDWuxV83png18W3Av2XNW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116727'),
  ('903698962205779044', 'Ode to Joy', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'A Nai', 'Maggie Jiang, Yang Caiyu, Karlina Zhang, Zhang Huiwen, Li Haofei, Shawn Dou, Wang Anyu, Jing Chao', null, 'Five independent, career-driven women living in the Ode to Joy apartment building navigate love, ambition, and personal growth as they chase fulfillment on their own terms. As they try to make it in the big city, each faces unique challenges and romantic entanglements while discovering who they truly want to be.', 'Five independent, career-driven women living in the Ode to Joy apartment building navigate love, ambition, and personal growth as they chase fulfillment on their own terms. As they try to make it in the big city, each faces unique challenges and romantic entanglements while discovering who they truly want to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvVittrRPohBv5rQXWbghTDOPn9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66370'),
  ('597290926387113362', 'Odekake Kozame', 2023, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'The story follows a little shark character, Kozame-chan''s adventures in Yauo town, which smells "nostalgic." From radio exercises to festival stalls to meeting with friends, Kozame-chan has a variety of heartwarming experiences in the town.', 'The story follows a little shark character, Kozame-chan''s adventures in Yauo town, which smells "nostalgic." From radio exercises to festival stalls to meeting with friends, Kozame-chan has a variety of heartwarming experiences in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64qo6XZ1wr8AOwpnaeIs0onjmbP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:227218'),
  ('269959442176095518', 'Oderbruch', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Adolfo J. Kolmerer, Arend Remmers, Christian Alvart', null, null, null, 'The sinister discovery of numerous murder victims shocks the Oderbruch region. The serial murder case brings Detective Roland Voit to his hometown to work with Polish police officer Stanislaw Zajak. Voit’s former colleague and childhood sweetheart, Maggie Kring, is also called in to join the police investigation when her family comes under immediate suspicion. In their investigation, Maggie and Voit delve deep into their own past to finally uncover the true circumstances of the death of Maggie’s brother and the sinister truth of this case, which lies beyond human imagination.', 'The sinister discovery of numerous murder victims shocks the Oderbruch region. The serial murder case brings Detective Roland Voit to his hometown to work with Polish police officer Stanislaw Zajak. Voit’s former colleague and childhood sweetheart, Maggie Kring, is also called in to join the police investigation when her family comes under immediate suspicion. In their investigation, Maggie and Voit delve deep into their own past to finally uncover the true circumstances of the death of Maggie’s brother and the sinister truth of this case, which lies beyond human imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rKJPelmeE98zFIAQeUp5HhsQK8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228866'),
  ('23469450392112510', 'Odisea Burbujas', 1981, 'Comedy, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Silvia Roche', null, null, 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSnyF6kJdycCoB1GjPCLntO7OMl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114283'),
  ('2426996145369706', 'Odyssey 5', 2002, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Manny Coto', null, 'Peter Weller, Sebastian Roché, Christopher Gorham, Leslie Silva, Kenneth Mitchell, Gina Clayton, Phillip Jarrett, Lindy Booth', null, 'Odyssey 5 is a Canadian science fiction series that first ran in 2002 on Showtime in the United States and on Space in Canada. Odyssey 5 is the brainchild of Manny Coto, who served as a script-writer and executive producer during the series run. Through his website and in interviews, Coto has expressed his interest in returning to the series at some point, either continuing it or giving it a conclusion.', 'Odyssey 5 is a Canadian science fiction series that first ran in 2002 on Showtime in the United States and on Space in Canada. Odyssey 5 is the brainchild of Manny Coto, who served as a script-writer and executive producer during the series run. Through his website and in interviews, Coto has expressed his interest in returning to the series at some point, either continuing it or giving it a conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFmvX3lFdBXRkSsTqS2eUoDTdC3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1898'),
  ('27975543413351662', 'Odznak Vysočina', 2022, 'Crime', null, null, 'Monika Hilmerová, Simona Zmrzlá, Martin Hofmann, Michal Suchánek, Patrik Děrgel, Martina Jindrová', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqWEfUaaXTP5KbJibkB51D5DoYz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:153996'),
  ('513174167223989465', 'Of Kings and Prophets', 2016, 'Drama', 'David Boyd, Duane Clark', null, 'Ray Winstone, Oliver Rix, Simone Kessell, Nathaniel Parker, Haaz Sleiman, James Floyd, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, Jeanine Mason', 'TV-14', 'An epic biblical saga of faith, ambition and betrayal as told through the eyes of the battle-weary King Saul, the resentful prophet Samuel and the resourceful young shepherd David—all on a collision course with destiny that will change the world. One thousand years before Christ, the first king of the Israelites, Saul, struggles to unify the 12 Israelite tribes and defend his fledgling nation against savage enemy attacks. The prophet Samuel relays a message from God to King Saul that he must destroy one of Israel''s ancient enemies. But when Saul defies that message, Samuel prophesies that the Lord will tear the kingdom of Israel from him and choose another in his place. In time, Saul comes to realize that his greatest threat will not come from his enemies, but from the shepherd, David.', 'An epic biblical saga of faith, ambition and betrayal as told through the eyes of the battle-weary King Saul, the resentful prophet Samuel and the resourceful young shepherd David—all on a collision course with destiny that will change the world. One thousand years before Christ, the first king of the Israelites, Saul, struggles to unify the 12 Israelite tribes and defend his fledgling nation against savage enemy attacks. The prophet Samuel relays a message from God to King Saul that he must destroy one of Israel''s ancient enemies. But when Saul defies that message, Samuel prophesies that the Lord will tear the kingdom of Israel from him and choose another in his place. In time, Saul comes to realize that his greatest threat will not come from his enemies, but from the shepherd, David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5pSXFYmpQiTaq9ECKKMm7xjU3t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65814'),
  ('67519532131469622', 'Of Money and Blood', 2023, 'Drama', 'Xavier Giannoli, Frédéric Planchon, Jean-Baptiste Delafon', 'Fabrice Arfi', 'Vincent Lindon, Niels Schneider, Ramzy Bedia, Judith Chemla, David Ayala, Olga Kurylenko, Yvan Attal, André Marcon', null, 'The scam of the century, which occurred in France and Europe between 2008 and 2009. Billions gone up in smoke on the new financial market of "carbon quotas" invented to fight against global warming. The association of Belleville crooks with a trader from the wealthy neighborhoods, tracked by an obsessive investigator. When human passions are unleashed beyond simple interest. Based on the investigative book by Fabrice Arfi.', 'The scam of the century, which occurred in France and Europe between 2008 and 2009. Billions gone up in smoke on the new financial market of "carbon quotas" invented to fight against global warming. The association of Belleville crooks with a trader from the wealthy neighborhoods, tracked by an obsessive investigator. When human passions are unleashed beyond simple interest. Based on the investigative book by Fabrice Arfi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHt195lEFZxIR0Mq9z1SBhgukcR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203819'),
  ('413148920814806944', 'Off Camera with Sam Jones', 2014, 'Talk', 'Sam Jones', 'Sam Jones', 'Sam Jones', 'TV-14', 'Photographer and director Sam Jones sits down with the myriad professionals of television and movies, and other celebrities (great skateboarders, for example), to discuss their development before fame, their passions beyond their careers, and gives them a space to open up about their insight into their business and their own abilities. Filmed in black and white, with a few deep cushion chairs and sparse set, the show relies on Sam''s ability to relate to the guests and their will to speak freely with him.', 'Photographer and director Sam Jones sits down with the myriad professionals of television and movies, and other celebrities (great skateboarders, for example), to discuss their development before fame, their passions beyond their careers, and gives them a space to open up about their insight into their business and their own abilities. Filmed in black and white, with a few deep cushion chairs and sparse set, the show relies on Sam''s ability to relate to the guests and their will to speak freely with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFzCudeLabyjvwh0n5C9rEtCqVy.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:102758'),
  ('858278489392398981', 'Off Campus', 2026, 'Drama', 'Gina Fattore, Louisa Levy', null, 'Ella Bright, Belmont Cameli, Mika Abdalla, Antonio Cipriano, Jalen Thomas Brooks, Stephen Kalyn, Josh Heuston, Khobe Clarke', null, 'Hannah Wells tutors hockey captain Garrett Graham to win over her crush. Their deal becomes real connection as they face their pasts. Friends Logan, Dean, Tucker, and Allie navigate college life and love.', 'Hannah Wells tutors hockey captain Garrett Graham to win over her crush. Their deal becomes real connection as they face their pasts. Friends Logan, Dean, Tucker, and Allie navigate college life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QVyjW4MRsZgqUXbTMlcIWMNEXq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273240'),
  ('835059354245341510', 'Off Centre', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Weitz, Chris Weitz, Danny Zuker', null, 'Eddie Kaye Thomas, Sean Maguire, Lauren Stamile, John Cho, Jason George', null, 'Off Centre is an American sitcom that aired on The WB network from October 14, 2001 to October 31, 2002. Created by Chris Weitz, Paul Weitz, and Danny Zuker, the series was heavily promoted as "from the guys who brought you American Pie".', 'Off Centre is an American sitcom that aired on The WB network from October 14, 2001 to October 31, 2002. Created by Chris Weitz, Paul Weitz, and Danny Zuker, the series was heavily promoted as "from the guys who brought you American Pie".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imDCSdyfz4X1M1mwCQn5BDVRCea.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2681'),
  ('487064182729061267', 'Off Pedder', 2008, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Catherine Tsang, Luo Zhen Yue', 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King, Wai-Keung Wong, Lai Chun Tsang', 'Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Aimee Chan, Joyce Cheng Yan-Yi, Wong Cho-Lam, Alvina Kong Yan-Yin, Raymond Chiu', null, 'The sitcom is about office politics in a magazine company, as well as family and romantic relationships amongst the characters, with the majority of the cast from Best Selling Secrets.', 'The sitcom is about office politics in a magazine company, as well as family and romantic relationships amongst the characters, with the majority of the cast from Best Selling Secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jjVBzeGjkHA0qhRXNQGN2nooqS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125561'),
  ('45490311185460696', 'Off Script with The Hollywood Reporter', 2023, 'Talk', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'THR’s famed Roundtables are reimagined for broadcast and offer a fresh perspective on a classic, showcasing the collective brilliance of the entertainment industry''s finest and funniest minds as never before.', 'THR’s famed Roundtables are reimagined for broadcast and offer a fresh perspective on a classic, showcasing the collective brilliance of the entertainment industry''s finest and funniest minds as never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yWslXH87dJgNg1UFuQrcuzyE4n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:239650'),
  ('205144607202315221', 'Off the Air', 2011, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Dave Hughes', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A collection of psychedelic and visually complex animation, art, and culture.', 'A collection of psychedelic and visually complex animation, art, and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZrln31dbJx6jhEYqz37zd1BvGQ.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:39479'),
  ('852640368976763241', 'Off the Hook', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marie Jardillier', null, 'Tiphaine Daviot, Manon Azem, Oussama Kheddam, Charlotte de Turckheim, Zinedine Soualem, Héléna Noguerra', 'TV-MA', 'Realizing they both have a toxic relationship to the Internet, roommates Léa and Manon decide to do the unthinkable: abandon all devices for 30 days.', 'Realizing they both have a toxic relationship to the Internet, roommates Léa and Manon decide to do the unthinkable: abandon all devices for 30 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27y3YRnu1UiQ7MhOAQpeB5rwWfz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207470'),
  ('42185579356847640', 'Off the Map', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jenna Bans', null, 'Jonathan Castellanos, Valerie Cruz, Caroline Dhavernas, Jason George, Zach Gilford, Mamie Gummer, Martin Henderson, Rachelle Lefevre', 'TV-14', 'La Ciudad de las Estrellas, a tiny town in the South American jungle, is home to an understaffed, understocked medical clinic where three idealistic doctors come looking for change.', 'La Ciudad de las Estrellas, a tiny town in the South American jungle, is home to an understaffed, understocked medical clinic where three idealistic doctors come looking for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s25iy6jAQotC5eJY3FbXJYnUwBB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32806'),
  ('1129872310175172848', 'Off the Record', null, 'News', 'Tim Skubick', null, 'Tim Skubick, Jamie Paisley', 'TV-PG', 'Off the Record is a weekly, political talk program produced by Michigan public television station WKAR-TV in East Lansing, Michigan, and broadcast statewide on PBS member stations throughout Michigan. Off The Record is hosted by Michigan''s senior capitol correspondent, Tim Skubick. The program covers the governor, legislature, political campaigns and state government. Off the Record has two segments, opening with a panel of reporters discussing recent news for 15 minutes followed by a roundtable interview with a politician or newsmaker.', 'Off the Record is a weekly, political talk program produced by Michigan public television station WKAR-TV in East Lansing, Michigan, and broadcast statewide on PBS member stations throughout Michigan. Off The Record is hosted by Michigan''s senior capitol correspondent, Tim Skubick. The program covers the governor, legislature, political campaigns and state government. Off the Record has two segments, opening with a panel of reporters discussing recent news for 15 minutes followed by a roundtable interview with a politician or newsmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DK7dBSFcRI2dNb7TZOb9mcbKzI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:17693'),
  ('820719649854217226', 'Office Girls', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ko Chia-Yen, Roy Chiu, Tia Li, Lang Tsu-Yun, Shu-yao Kuo, Janel Tsai, James Wen, Patrick Lee', 'TV-14', 'A department store mogul has his son work incognito in a menial job to prove his worthiness, while female co-workers teach him how normal people live.', 'A department store mogul has his son work incognito in a menial job to prove his worthiness, while female co-workers teach him how normal people live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foMmyGrwtIaI9vbDYPFjGg06xwc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40480'),
  ('559495417982980640', 'Offline', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Nikita Efremov, Denis Shvedov, Polina Maksimova, Nikita Kologrivyy, Marina Vorozhischeva, Alyona Konstantinova, Tina Stoyilkovich, Egor Kenzhametov', null, 'BeHappy is a secret invisible application that serves to buy drugs through a smartphone. Its users face a serious opponent who hides under the name of Anonymus. He informs them that he has managed to disclose the data of everyone who has ever used this application and now he gives them a choice - to go to the police and confess everything or play a game with death. What happens if you lose this game becomes clear when Be Happy users receive a photo of kladen with his throat cut.', 'BeHappy is a secret invisible application that serves to buy drugs through a smartphone. Its users face a serious opponent who hides under the name of Anonymus. He informs them that he has managed to disclose the data of everyone who has ever used this application and now he gives them a choice - to go to the police and confess everything or play a game with death. What happens if you lose this game becomes clear when Be Happy users receive a photo of kladen with his throat cut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjmoYnd7K0DeFIqjn7B1apsUIoq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:200720'),
  ('468535994584830785', 'Offspring', 2010, 'Drama', 'Imogen Banks, John Edwards, Debra Oswald', 'Tony McNamara', 'Asher Keddie, Kat Stewart, Richard Davies, Linda Cropper, Jane Harber, Alicia Gardiner, Eddie Perfect', null, 'An exuberant drama set in Melbourne''s Fitzroy, centering on Nina Proudman and her struggle to deal with her fabulously messy family, her hunt for a decent love life and her tendency to overthink and fly off into fantasy.', 'An exuberant drama set in Melbourne''s Fitzroy, centering on Nina Proudman and her struggle to deal with her fabulously messy family, her hunt for a decent love life and her tendency to overthink and fly off into fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0lZo55EY4Mxf5MdkYoVoIkOR8W.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:33155'),
  ('792893813224137019', 'Offworld', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Fran Araújo, Isa Campo, Rafael Cobos', null, 'Miquel Fernández, Patricia López Arnaiz, Luis Callejo, Melina Matthews, Jesús Carroza, Ainhoa Santamaría, María Vázquez, Miguel Garcés', 'TV-MA', 'A solar storm hits the Earth, causing a widespread blackout. In this new reality, five stories unfold, focusing on characters who struggle to adapt to a world without electricity, telecommunications or means of transport, where they are forced to face up to their most primal needs, instincts and fears.', 'A solar storm hits the Earth, causing a widespread blackout. In this new reality, five stories unfold, focusing on characters who struggle to adapt to a world without electricity, telecommunications or means of transport, where they are forced to face up to their most primal needs, instincts and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvQ0rGelkrMRn2JO42fcFd1elMp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155548'),
  ('257352834926319128', 'Oggy and the Cockroaches', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jean-Yves Raimbaud', null, 'Kaycie Chase', 'TV-Y7', 'Oggy, an anthropomorphic cat, would prefer to spend his days watching television and eating, but is continuously pestered by three roaches: Joey, Marky and Dee Dee. The cockroaches'' slapstick mischief ranges from plundering Oggy''s refrigerator to hijacking the train he just boarded. In many situations Oggy is also helped by Jack, who is more violent and short-tempered than him and is also annoyed by the cockroaches. Bob, a short-tempered bulldog, also appears in the show, and is Oggy''s neighbor.', 'Oggy, an anthropomorphic cat, would prefer to spend his days watching television and eating, but is continuously pestered by three roaches: Joey, Marky and Dee Dee. The cockroaches'' slapstick mischief ranges from plundering Oggy''s refrigerator to hijacking the train he just boarded. In many situations Oggy is also helped by Jack, who is more violent and short-tempered than him and is also annoyed by the cockroaches. Bob, a short-tempered bulldog, also appears in the show, and is Oggy''s neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFAN9aKm0OblOr30ROejJCV8rGf.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2777'),
  ('710364812998508939', 'Oh Baby', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Susan Beavers', null, 'Cynthia Stevenson, Joanna Gleason, Jessica Walter, Doug Ballard, Jack Coleman', 'TV-G', 'Tracy is a successful career woman who longs to be a mom. When her boyfriend refuses to commit, Tracy decides she can''t wait around...', 'Tracy is a successful career woman who longs to be a mom. When her boyfriend refuses to commit, Tracy decides she can''t wait around...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs6G5RZ3q9w1aEFgJE3eFOcmc5j.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6635'),
  ('514288276968453201', 'Oh Hell!', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Johannes Boss', null, 'Mala Emde, Salka Weber, Knut Berger, Deborah Kaufmann, Thomas Loibl, Rosa Henriette Löwe, Madieu Ulbrich, Roland Bonjour', 'TV-MA', 'Follow Helene, who is in her mid-twenties and who is not nicknamed “Hell” for nothing. Her life is anything but relaxed, Helen jumps from one job to the next and privately she keeps stumbling into big and small blunders. Sometimes she wishes she were like her best friend Maike, who travels the world and has already had some success professionally. When she meets the cello teacher Oskar, something like consistency seems to develop for the first time. But can "Hell" lead a quiet and happy life - and does she even want it?', 'Follow Helene, who is in her mid-twenties and who is not nicknamed “Hell” for nothing. Her life is anything but relaxed, Helen jumps from one job to the next and privately she keeps stumbling into big and small blunders. Sometimes she wishes she were like her best friend Maike, who travels the world and has already had some success professionally. When she meets the cello teacher Oskar, something like consistency seems to develop for the first time. But can "Hell" lead a quiet and happy life - and does she even want it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0EI6nLIOEnOLsAw9g0mNO6CV2v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135387'),
  ('550302077308820407', 'Oh My Baby', 2020, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Noh Sun-jae, Nam Gi-hoon', 'Yang Hyuk-moon', 'Jang Na-ra, Go Joon, Park Byung-eun, Jung Gun-joo, Jang Kwang, Kim Hye-ok, Kim Jae-hwa, Park Soo-young', 'TV-14', 'A 39-year-old single woman who wants to have a child without getting married. She has three men in her radar and has trouble choosing between them. They walk into her life when she’s already hopeless about love and marriage.', 'A 39-year-old single woman who wants to have a child without getting married. She has three men in her radar and has trouble choosing between them. They walk into her life when she’s already hopeless about love and marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83H0ji4wWHVngwQ1EdxhwHZymvq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101243'),
  ('552196001613187146', 'Oh My General', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Clarence Ford', 'Shi Chen Gong Zi', 'Ma Sichun, Peter Sheng, Wang Churan, Sookie Pan, Wang Xuan, Zhang Junming, Liu Weihua, Zhang Yao', 'NR', 'The peculiar love story between a stoic and strong female general Ye Zhao, and a good-for-nothing but gorgeous prince Zhao Yujin, after they were betrothed to each other by the Empress Dowager.', 'The peculiar love story between a stoic and strong female general Ye Zhao, and a good-for-nothing but gorgeous prince Zhao Yujin, after they were betrothed to each other by the Empress Dowager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZdM4oIt5utpvmJ6K2lGlAuaVNF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75953'),
  ('327881026328571761', 'Oh My Ghost', 2015, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Soap', null, null, 'Park Bo-young, Cho Jung-seok, Lim Ju-hwan, Kim Seul-gi, Kwak Si-yang, Park Jung-ah, Lee Hak-ju, Kang Ki-young', null, 'Na Bong Sun may be a skilled sous chef, but she lacks the self-esteem to shine professionally and socially. Beyond her cooking talents, however, is an uncanny ability to communicate with ghosts. One day, her mystic senses go out of control when the seductive ghost of Shin Soon Ae possesses her. Imbued with a fiery new "personality," Bong Sun starts turning heads, including that of Kang Sun Woo, the hottest chef in town and Bong Sun''s secret crush!', 'Na Bong Sun may be a skilled sous chef, but she lacks the self-esteem to shine professionally and socially. Beyond her cooking talents, however, is an uncanny ability to communicate with ghosts. One day, her mystic senses go out of control when the seductive ghost of Shin Soon Ae possesses her. Imbued with a fiery new "personality," Bong Sun starts turning heads, including that of Kang Sun Woo, the hottest chef in town and Bong Sun''s secret crush!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOcfOZn9jFQqUdBznfMDPkgXEik.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63119'),
  ('700805416996576560', 'Oh My Ghost', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Arak Amornsupasiri, Nuengthida Sophon, Keerati Mahapreukpong, Nat Sakdatorn, Thanidaphat Tinsutthinanon, Daraneenute Pasutanavin, Vivid Bavornkiratikajorn, Malinee Adelaide Coates', 'TV-MA', 'Jiew is a modest girl who works at a restaurant washing dishes and is in love with Artit, the chef. She huddles in a cramped little room, doesn''t sleep at night, and is always late for work. But she has a big secret: she sees ghosts. And Khaopun, a virgin ghost who doesn''t understand why her soul can''t go to heaven, doesn''t leave Jiew alone. Khaopun is sure that only losing her virginity will help her to ascend to heaven, and therefore she uses Jiew''s body to seduce Artit and achieve what she wants.', 'Jiew is a modest girl who works at a restaurant washing dishes and is in love with Artit, the chef. She huddles in a cramped little room, doesn''t sleep at night, and is always late for work. But she has a big secret: she sees ghosts. And Khaopun, a virgin ghost who doesn''t understand why her soul can''t go to heaven, doesn''t leave Jiew alone. Khaopun is sure that only losing her virginity will help her to ascend to heaven, and therefore she uses Jiew''s body to seduce Artit and achieve what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM8LViuq1kyPSGA2iilLeQ13hP9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82792'),
  ('558516483922671789', 'Oh My Ghost Clients', 2025, 'Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Yim Soon-rye', 'Kim Bo-tong, Yoo Seung-hee', 'Park Soo-oh, Jung Kyung-ho, Seol In-a, Cha Hak-yeon, Tang Joon-sang, Yoo Seon-ho, Kang Hye-won', null, 'No Mu-jin is a labor attorney who happens to see ghosts. After coming back from the brink of death, he begins solving labor problems requested by ghosts.', 'No Mu-jin is a labor attorney who happens to see ghosts. After coming back from the brink of death, he begins solving labor problems requested by ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysc63ghJEM5mXBd9qWEgB0ohWTy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233221'),
  ('200560342382902168', 'Oh My Grad', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Wong Wai-Sing', null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Bob Lam Shing-Ban, Joyce Cheng Yan-Yi, BabyJohn Choi Hon-Yik, Wong Cho-Lam, Woo Fung, Helena Law Lan', null, 'Education is not about grades, teaching is not just taking attendance and grading papers. Born to a family of educators, school principal To Ming-Chi is full of passion for education, but loses his job when the school is closed down. He winds up returning to the rundown college that his parents had established, beginning a new chapter of his educational career. He encounters all types of students, along with a difficult-to-handle tiger mom Cheung Chun-Keung, making the college''s final year both splendid and plagued with misfortunes.', 'Education is not about grades, teaching is not just taking attendance and grading papers. Born to a family of educators, school principal To Ming-Chi is full of passion for education, but loses his job when the school is closed down. He winds up returning to the rundown college that his parents had established, beginning a new chapter of his educational career. He encounters all types of students, along with a difficult-to-handle tiger mom Cheung Chun-Keung, making the college''s final year both splendid and plagued with misfortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TIGJNDYWUUscVGAK17QLntBywt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95683'),
  ('552196958259166472', 'Oh My Venus', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Hyung-suk', 'Kim Eun-ji', 'So Ji-sub, Shin Min-a, Jung Gyu-woon, Yoo In-young, Sung Hoon, Henry Lau, Ban Hyo-jung, Choi Il-hwa', null, 'Dumped by her boyfriend of 15 years for gaining weight, a lawyer gets help from a hotshot personal trainer to get in shape and turn her life around.', 'Dumped by her boyfriend of 15 years for gaining weight, a lawyer gets help from a hotshot personal trainer to get in shape and turn her life around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elIZQeU3SGotjc4PDOwlcaaYTgm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64320'),
  ('1009985616855657750', 'Oh No! Here Comes Trouble', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kuan-Hui Lin', 'Kuan-Hui Lin', 'Tseng Jing-hua, Vivian Sung, Peng Cian-you, Cheryl Yang, Mario Pu, Lü Hsueh-feng, Chang Yung-cheng', null, 'After a bus accident leaves high school student Yiyong in a coma for over a year, he awakens with his grandfather’s supernatural powers. His once ordinary life turns into a thrilling ghost-filled adventure alongside his school rival, Cao Guangyan, and rookie policewoman Chen Chuying.', 'After a bus accident leaves high school student Yiyong in a coma for over a year, he awakens with his grandfather’s supernatural powers. His once ordinary life turns into a thrilling ghost-filled adventure alongside his school rival, Cao Guangyan, and rookie policewoman Chen Chuying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu5RBzB0V2UocKMnFRfoWCufMdt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202753'),
  ('561509205314412890', 'Oh Yeah! Cartoons', 1998, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Fred Seibert', 'Eric Bryan', 'Josh Server', 'NR', 'Oh Yeah! Cartoons was an American animation showcase that appeared on the Nickelodeon cable channel. Oh Yeah! was an animation project guided by Fred Seibert, former Creative Director of MTV Networks and President of Hanna-Barbera. Produced by Frederator Studios, it ran as part of Nickelodeon''s Nicktoons lineup, and in its second season, was hosted by Kenan Thompson of All That and Kenan & Kel fame; Then later by Josh Server, from All That, for its third season. Bill Burnett composed the show''s theme music. Oh Yeah! Cartoons was distributed by Nelvana outside of the United States.', 'Oh Yeah! Cartoons was an American animation showcase that appeared on the Nickelodeon cable channel. Oh Yeah! was an animation project guided by Fred Seibert, former Creative Director of MTV Networks and President of Hanna-Barbera. Produced by Frederator Studios, it ran as part of Nickelodeon''s Nicktoons lineup, and in its second season, was hosted by Kenan Thompson of All That and Kenan & Kel fame; Then later by Josh Server, from All That, for its third season. Bill Burnett composed the show''s theme music. Oh Yeah! Cartoons was distributed by Nelvana outside of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JhgHPsYKsmd8Ndl7EX2Pbomdti.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1498'),
  ('411593664595562684', 'Oh, Suddenly Egyptian God', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Welcome to the world of the Egyptian gods. This is where the famous gods of Ancient Egypt, from Anubis to Thoth, live their lives freely. How freely, you ask? Bastet appears out of nowhere, singing and dancing. Medjed is always stone-faced. Horus works a part-time job. Set is devoted to pulling pranks. Ra''s off traveling and rarely comes home... All the Gods basically just do whatever they want! These cute mascot Egyptian deities make the most of their unrestrained divine lives. The extremely popular characters of "Oh, Suddenly Egyptian God" now have their own anime!', 'Welcome to the world of the Egyptian gods. This is where the famous gods of Ancient Egypt, from Anubis to Thoth, live their lives freely. How freely, you ask? Bastet appears out of nowhere, singing and dancing. Medjed is always stone-faced. Horus works a part-time job. Set is devoted to pulling pranks. Ra''s off traveling and rarely comes home... All the Gods basically just do whatever they want! These cute mascot Egyptian deities make the most of their unrestrained divine lives. The extremely popular characters of "Oh, Suddenly Egyptian God" now have their own anime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LsPEKs6IyzZ71IppJMXCLRe31z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106126'),
  ('1091181419604999853', 'Oh! Boarding House', 2022, 'Drama', '펭귄', null, 'Shin Yong-seok, Lim Sung-kyun, Shin Ki-hwan, Kim Hee-jung, Hojin, Han Seo-wool', 'TV-PG', 'While living with a few other young men in his mother''s boardinghouse, Sul-won navigates new responsibilities — and unexpected romance.', 'While living with a few other young men in his mother''s boardinghouse, Sul-won navigates new responsibilities — and unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OGRUIzzAvpfea0mBqkTHYEf4sj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158149'),
  ('603783700044352299', 'Oh! Edo Rocket', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Romi Park, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Koichi Yamadera, Yoko Soumi, Chika Fujimura, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Shinya Fukumatsu', 'TV-MA', 'Oh! Edo Rocket is a stage play written for the Gekidan Shinkansen theater troupe by Kazuki Nakashima. It was adapted into an anime TV series in April 2007, directed by Seiji Mizushima and produced by Studio Madhouse. It is a comedic story often breaking the fourth wall, that involves a firework maker in medieval Edo and his efforts to build a rocket to carry an alien back to her people on the moon. The series made its North American television debut on the FUNimation Channel on November 15, 2010.', 'Oh! Edo Rocket is a stage play written for the Gekidan Shinkansen theater troupe by Kazuki Nakashima. It was adapted into an anime TV series in April 2007, directed by Seiji Mizushima and produced by Studio Madhouse. It is a comedic story often breaking the fourth wall, that involves a firework maker in medieval Edo and his efforts to build a rocket to carry an alien back to her people on the moon. The series made its North American television debut on the FUNimation Channel on November 15, 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoiJ5wLZDHNGN0tEebMyi7dZ79B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34180'),
  ('1026520651094647048', 'Oh! Master', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Jo Jin-kuk', 'Lee Min-ki, Nana, Kang Min-hyuk, Lee Hwi-hyang, Sunwoo Jae-duk, Kim Ho-jung, Cho Seung-yeon, Woo Hee-jin', null, 'A romantic comedy about a thriller dramas screenwriter and an actress that specializes in romantic comedy. While the writer chooses not to date, the actress cannot seem to date.', 'A romantic comedy about a thriller dramas screenwriter and an actress that specializes in romantic comedy. While the writer chooses not to date, the actress cannot seem to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6jzA36ZqMsekoGHlSYtEMPh2pG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119368'),
  ('373104551611464896', 'Oh! My Assistant', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Song Seung-hyun, Ko Chan-bin, Lee Do-ha, Seo Hyo-myeong', null, 'Seon-ho is an artist who draws adult webtoons. It started as an easy way to make money, but it''s caused some unexpected side effects.', 'Seon-ho is an artist who draws adult webtoons. It started as an easy way to make money, but it''s caused some unexpected side effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYk0zbjdcNBWNe2uMM4ceKakUKR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215384'),
  ('983167184865776214', 'Oh! My Emperor', 2018, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, '柳暗花溟, Yin Hang, 李珊珊', 'Jason Koo, Zhao Lusi, Xiao Zhan, Wu Jiacheng, Peng Chuyue, Emn Chen, Song Nanxi, Showna Xie', null, 'Luo Feifei, a girl from the 21st century, was transported to a mysterious world of the past -Huang Dao Guo. In the nation of Huang Dao, its leadership is rotated among the 12 constellation owners every thousand years. There, Fei Fei meets the current emperor of the nation, Beitang Yi, who also owns the Capricorn constellation.', 'Luo Feifei, a girl from the 21st century, was transported to a mysterious world of the past -Huang Dao Guo. In the nation of Huang Dao, its leadership is rotated among the 12 constellation owners every thousand years. There, Fei Fei meets the current emperor of the nation, Beitang Yi, who also owns the Capricorn constellation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyglJ0REVEYUeUldbVvvG23jxDb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:79808'),
  ('1100599908450189153', 'Oh! My Goddess', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Kousuke Fujishima', null, 'Masami Kikuchi, Aya Hisakawa, Kikuko Inoue, Yumi Touma, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Issei Futamata, Junko Asami', 'TV-14', 'When college student Keiichi Morisato dials the wrong number while ordering for some food at his dormitory, he accidentally gets connected to the Goddess Hotline and a beautiful goddess named Belldandy appears out of a mirror in front of him. After getting kicked out of the dorm, Keiichi and Belldandy move to an old shrine and soon afterwards, Belldandy''s sisters Urd and Skuld move in.', 'When college student Keiichi Morisato dials the wrong number while ordering for some food at his dormitory, he accidentally gets connected to the Goddess Hotline and a beautiful goddess named Belldandy appears out of a mirror in front of him. After getting kicked out of the dorm, Keiichi and Belldandy move to an old shrine and soon afterwards, Belldandy''s sisters Urd and Skuld move in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5NGnOLHRrRtlxQHBfrbqzor98M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29117'),
  ('1040589861595359938', 'Oh! Youngsim', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Jeon Seon-young', 'Song Ha-yoon, Donghae, Lee Min-jae, Jung Woo-yeon, Wang Ji-hye, Song Yeong-jae, Lami', null, 'Oh Young-Sim is single and in her 30''s. She has worked as a TV variety show PD for 8 years. She wants to make people laugh with her TV shows, but they were always cancelled due to low popularity ratings. Her career is now in a crisis.', 'Oh Young-Sim is single and in her 30''s. She has worked as a TV variety show PD for 8 years. She wants to make people laugh with her TV shows, but they were always cancelled due to low popularity ratings. Her career is now in a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofpx6iGF1L7Mdor0Oq5mlF5HxF8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211692'),
  ('400107779637877049', 'Ohanahan', 1966, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Kōji Takahashi, Masahiko Tsugawa, Atsuko Kawaguchi, Shunichi Nakamura, Kaoru Kusuda, Tokue Hanazawa, Toshie Kimura, Shirō Ōtsuji', null, 'The 6th NHK Asadora. Starring Fumie Kashiyama as a woman, born in the Meiji era, who raises a family by herself.', 'The 6th NHK Asadora. Starring Fumie Kashiyama as a woman, born in the Meiji era, who raises a family by herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvLeJxlfKOhPXH3KQ6l2UO1kiCk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209417'),
  ('1006155336615152748', 'Ohsama Sentai King-Ohger', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Taisei Sakai, Aoto Watanabe, Erica Murakami, Yuzuki Hirakawa, So Kaku, Masashi Ikeda, Masato Yano, Akira Ishida', null, 'There is an ancient prophecy shared amongst the kingdoms of Chikyu- 2,000 years after their fall, the Territorial Empire Bugnarok will once again rise up to kill all humans. However, five kings and their guardian deity, King-Ohger, will stand up to face them. This is the story of kings who will defend Chikyu, as well as a coming-of-age story for one young man who will achieve kingship henceforth.', 'There is an ancient prophecy shared amongst the kingdoms of Chikyu- 2,000 years after their fall, the Territorial Empire Bugnarok will once again rise up to kill all humans. However, five kings and their guardian deity, King-Ohger, will stand up to face them. This is the story of kings who will defend Chikyu, as well as a coming-of-age story for one young man who will achieve kingship henceforth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euSDSrIyUhWbac1tzmg9d3KtmSE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213439'),
  ('229459293562068410', 'Oi Treis Harites', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Thanasis Papathanasiou, Michalis Reppas', 'Thanasis Papathanasiou, Michalis Reppas', 'Anna Panagiotopoulou, Nena Menti, Mina Adamaki, Anna Kyriakou, Michalis Reppas', null, 'The Haritou family''s ancestral home was initially inhabited only by the unmarried youngest daughter, Irini. However, in the first episode of the series, her older and widowed sister, Olga, moves into the same house until the construction of the new house she is building is completed. Although initially they thought that her move would be temporary, it eventually became permanent for the entire series. At the same time, the middle daughter, Maria, decides to move into her ancestral home and stay with her sisters, because she caught her husband, Yannis, red-handed with her best friend.', 'The Haritou family''s ancestral home was initially inhabited only by the unmarried youngest daughter, Irini. However, in the first episode of the series, her older and widowed sister, Olga, moves into the same house until the construction of the new house she is building is completed. Although initially they thought that her move would be temporary, it eventually became permanent for the entire series. At the same time, the middle daughter, Maria, decides to move into her ancestral home and stay with her sisters, because she caught her husband, Yannis, red-handed with her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqXhxs6ZSRkZuc8IxlBp5IK90Qr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:102147'),
