  ('430723872621837676', 'OK K.O.! Let''s Be Heroes', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ian Jones-Quartey', null, 'Courtenay Taylor, Ashly Burch, Ian Jones-Quartey, Kate Flannery, David Herman, Jim Cummings', null, 'Animated comedy set in the futuristic year of 201X, where the world is populated by video game and manga-esque characters.', 'Animated comedy set in the futuristic year of 201X, where the world is populated by video game and manga-esque characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3V2IL48S9l5iLz4LtdWl9x5aXLZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72468'),
  ('268109647802175957', 'OK! TV', 2011, 'News', null, null, 'Matt Johnson, Kate Walsh, Jeff Brazier, Jenny Frost', null, 'OK! TV is an early evening magazine programme, broadcast on Channel 5 as a brand extension of celebrity title OK! Magazine. It replaced the former magazine and discussion show Live from Studio Five on 14 February 2011, and was presented by Kate Walsh and Matt Johnson, both of whom later left the programme. Jeff Brazier and Jenny Frost replaced Walsh and Johnson in August 2011 and presented the show until its cancellation. The show was made by the 5 News team and produced by Sky News for Channel 5. On 8 November 2011, it was announced that the show has been cancelled by Channel 5. The show aired its final edition on 16 December after ten months on air due to the contract for 5 News returning to ITN.', 'OK! TV is an early evening magazine programme, broadcast on Channel 5 as a brand extension of celebrity title OK! Magazine. It replaced the former magazine and discussion show Live from Studio Five on 14 February 2011, and was presented by Kate Walsh and Matt Johnson, both of whom later left the programme. Jeff Brazier and Jenny Frost replaced Walsh and Johnson in August 2011 and presented the show until its cancellation. The show was made by the 5 News team and produced by Sky News for Channel 5. On 8 November 2011, it was announced that the show has been cancelled by Channel 5. The show aired its final edition on 16 December after ten months on air due to the contract for 5 News returning to ITN.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbKHleMiAEqz471pRvOINFKij0K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35340'),
  ('424367120216741251', 'Okami-san and Her Seven Companions', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Yui Horie, Kanae Itou, Shintaro Asanuma, Kimiko Koyama, Miyu Irino, Hirofumi Nojima, Aki Toyosaki', null, 'Ryōko Ōkami is a spunky high school girl who is a member of a "fixer" club called the Otogi High School Bank. She fixes the school''s problems with her partner Ringo Akai ("Akazukin-chan").', 'Ryōko Ōkami is a spunky high school girl who is a member of a "fixer" club called the Otogi High School Bank. She fixes the school''s problems with her partner Ringo Akai ("Akazukin-chan").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikVewHWOnU7rZg1lluApogpjoM3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68637'),
  ('639699989830797705', 'OKITSURA: Fell in Love with an Okinawan Girl, but I Just Wish I Know What She''s Saying', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Akari Kito, Fairouz Ai', 'TV-14', 'When Teruaki Nakamura transfers to laid-back Okinawa, he falls for the lively Kyan-san—but her dialect is a complete mystery to him. With Higa-san translating, Teru''s misunderstanding-filled island life takes off... and subtle hints suggest Higa-san might want his heart too. On this serene island, love flows as freely as the ocean breeze!', 'When Teruaki Nakamura transfers to laid-back Okinawa, he falls for the lively Kyan-san—but her dialect is a complete mystery to him. With Higa-san translating, Teru''s misunderstanding-filled island life takes off... and subtle hints suggest Higa-san might want his heart too. On this serene island, love flows as freely as the ocean breeze!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VICqDMbB1K3MWZjtqxVEvl7ror.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245561'),
  ('65726432838147151', 'Oklahoma City Bombing: One Day in America', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'On April 19, 1995, the deadliest act of domestic terrorism in U.S. history devastated the nation, claiming 168 lives - including 19 children - and injuring hundreds more. The bombing of the Alfred P. Murrah Federal Building shattered families and changed America forever.', 'On April 19, 1995, the deadliest act of domestic terrorism in U.S. history devastated the nation, claiming 168 lives - including 19 children - and injuring hundreds more. The bombing of the Alfred P. Murrah Federal Building shattered families and changed America forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MKgkrUYVeLnJbPbIZNqrf8L71k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286671'),
  ('674394144167240369', 'Oktoberfest: Beer and Blood', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alexis Wittgenstein, Ronny Schalk, Christian Limmer', 'Christian Limmer, Christian Lex, Niko Schulz-Dornburg', 'Mišel Matičević, Martina Gedeck, Klaus Steinbacher, Mercedes Müller, Francis Fulton-Smith, Brigitte Hobmeier, Maximilian Brückner, Markus Krojer', 'TV-MA', 'A young girl falls in love with a poor brewer''s son. Their relationship is opposed by the girl''s father, a rich mobster who has come to town to try to bully his way into the inner circle of Munich''s brewery dynasties.', 'A young girl falls in love with a poor brewer''s son. Their relationship is opposed by the girl''s father, a rich mobster who has come to town to try to bully his way into the inner circle of Munich''s brewery dynasties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4feT03w8nrxw7mNS3nsFdP23bfd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94002'),
  ('959846066774751205', 'Okupas', 2000, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bruno Stagnaro', null, 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Diego Alonso, Ariel Staltari, Franco Tirri, Ana Celentano, Dante Mastropierro, Sergio Podeley, Jorge Sesán', 'NR', 'During the year 2000, Ricardo, Pollo, Walter and Chiqui occupied a house in the Buenos Aires neighborhood of Congreso. The four young people forge a strong friendship that leads them to go through different stories of crime, drugs and social marginalization.', 'During the year 2000, Ricardo, Pollo, Walter and Chiqui occupied a house in the Buenos Aires neighborhood of Congreso. The four young people forge a strong friendship that leads them to go through different stories of crime, drugs and social marginalization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uf6L2w2QRomahGMCniHskNOQWf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60549'),
