  ('136999205288356096', 'Oliver Twist', 1999, 'Drama', null, 'Alan Bleasdale', 'Sam Smith, David Ross, Julie Walters, Marc Warren, Lindsay Duncan, Michael Kitchen, Robert Lindsay, Andy Serkis', null, 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jc57GnVsKcIOGlEWf5qF7bOaOs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13880'),
  ('758999090266319757', 'Oliver Twist', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sarah Phelps', null, 'William Miller, Adam Arnold, Timothy Spall, Tom Hardy, Sophie Okonedo, Edward Fox', 'NR', 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he''s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin''s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKq8lSVNVq0ybaLMcNGK6P6YuZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13296'),
