  ('120820009891558418', 'Olympo', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ibai Abad, Laia Foguet, Jan Matheu', null, 'Clara Galle, Nuno Gallego, Nira Osahia, Agustín Della Corte, María Romanillos, Andy Duato, Najwa Khliwa, Juan Perales', 'TV-MA', 'When a swimmer collapses at a high-performance sports center, Amaia investigates the extreme risks her fellow athletes are taking to feed their ambition.', 'When a swimmer collapses at a high-performance sports center, Amaia investigates the extreme risks her fellow athletes are taking to feed their ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2X06R82PG2HVZl6h7YeXXT11EEP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259669'),
  ('945303981008892511', 'Olympus', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Nick Willing', null, 'Tom York, Sonya Cassidy, Spencer Drever, Graham Shiels, Wayne Burns, Sophia Lauchlin Hirt, John Emmet Tracy, Vanessa Walsh', 'TV-14', 'The story of how a few brave men and women banished the Gods to the realm of the unconscious - a place they called the Underworld or the Kingdom of Hades. The series follows the protagonist as he seeks the truth about his past, which may be intertwined with the Gods themselves.', 'The story of how a few brave men and women banished the Gods to the realm of the unconscious - a place they called the Underworld or the Kingdom of Hades. The series follows the protagonist as he seeks the truth about his past, which may be intertwined with the Gods themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYAPVAMJWXGQ9s8ORnlEDUZqX9Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62229'),
  ('692425172614440492', 'Omamori Himari', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Matsuoka, Michiko Neya, Ami Koshimizu, Iori Nomizu, Daisuke Hirakawa, Asuka Ohgame, Chiaki Takahashi, Kaoru Mizuhara', 'TV-MA', 'The slapstick romantic comedy centers around an ordinary 16-year-old high school boy named Yūto Amakawa who is protected by a spirit—specifically, a beautiful, sword-wielding cat girl spirit named Himari. Yūto is descended from a family that has subjugated demons since time immemorial. The charm that once protected him is now impotent, but fortunately, at that same moment, Himari appears before him as his new guardian.', 'The slapstick romantic comedy centers around an ordinary 16-year-old high school boy named Yūto Amakawa who is protected by a spirit—specifically, a beautiful, sword-wielding cat girl spirit named Himari. Yūto is descended from a family that has subjugated demons since time immemorial. The charm that once protected him is now impotent, but fortunately, at that same moment, Himari appears before him as his new guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FKVuV9jBeTHRFBD0zCVPORieQB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37555'),
  ('633187221318060980', 'Omar', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Walid Seif', 'Walid Seif', 'Ghassan Massoud, Samer Ismail, Mehyar Khaddour, Mai Skaf, Bernadette Hodeib, Qasim Melho, Fadi Sobieh, Mohammad Hadaki', null, 'A historical saga about the second caliph and Commander of the Faithful Omar Bin Al-Khattab and his pivotal role in the Islamic State.', 'A historical saga about the second caliph and Commander of the Faithful Omar Bin Al-Khattab and his pivotal role in the Islamic State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypNn2XybknDmxDOXDWcToFtVYMV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58887'),
  ('852358591606520792', 'Omnibus', 1952, 'Talk', 'Robert Saudek', null, 'Alistair Cooke', 'NR', 'Omnibus is an American, commercially sponsored, educational television series.', 'Omnibus is an American, commercially sponsored, educational television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7edfag05o6ytr65askkEplQrcG.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:3768'),
  ('708064030844758479', 'Omnibus', 1967, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Omnibus was an arts-based BBC television documentary series, broadcast mainly on BBC1 in the United Kingdom. The programme was the successor to the long-running arts-based series ''Monitor''. It ran from 1967 until 2003, usually being transmitted on Sunday evenings. During its 35-year history, the programme won 12 Bafta awards. Among the series'' best remembered documentaries are Cracked Actor, a profile of David Bowie, and Rene Magritte, a graduate film by David Wheatley, ''Madonna: Behind the American dream'', a film produced by Nadia Hagger, and a profile of the British film director Ridley Scott. For a season in 1982, the series was in a magazine format presented by Barry Norman. The series was replaced by ''Imagine'' hosted by Alan Yentob.', 'Omnibus was an arts-based BBC television documentary series, broadcast mainly on BBC1 in the United Kingdom. The programme was the successor to the long-running arts-based series ''Monitor''. It ran from 1967 until 2003, usually being transmitted on Sunday evenings. During its 35-year history, the programme won 12 Bafta awards. Among the series'' best remembered documentaries are Cracked Actor, a profile of David Bowie, and Rene Magritte, a graduate film by David Wheatley, ''Madonna: Behind the American dream'', a film produced by Nadia Hagger, and a profile of the British film director Ridley Scott. For a season in 1982, the series was in a magazine format presented by Barry Norman. The series was replaced by ''Imagine'' hosted by Alan Yentob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VgL1w0koQ0cJK01OTTg5kkc7qx.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:5674'),
  ('654627179210469644', 'Omniscient', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Pedro Aguilera', null, 'Carla Salle, Jonathan Haagensen, Guilherme Prates, Sandra Corveloni, Luana Tanaka, Edmilson Cordeiro, Marcello Airoldi', null, 'In a city where citizens are monitored 24/7, a tech employee must outsmart her surveillance drone in order to investigate a murder.', 'In a city where citizens are monitored 24/7, a tech employee must outsmart her surveillance drone in order to investigate a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqRkvPen8xg2e878b88RAPIPhU8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98510'),
  ('703461205080094313', 'On Air with Ryan Seacrest', 2004, 'Talk, News', 'Ryan Seacrest', null, 'Ryan Seacrest', null, 'On Air with Ryan Seacrest is an American syndicated television talk show, which ran from January 12, 2004 through September 17, 2004. It was distributed in the United States and Canada by Twentieth Television.', 'On Air with Ryan Seacrest is an American syndicated television talk show, which ran from January 12, 2004 through September 17, 2004. It was distributed in the United States and Canada by Twentieth Television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2ioh1Bgk8l2GJSOUvq0OEi03pT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10493'),
  ('767498748137542439', 'On Becoming a God in Central Florida', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Matt Lutsky, Robert Funke', 'Carlos Rios', 'Kirsten Dunst, Théodore Pellerin, Beth Ditto, Mel Rodriguez, Ted Levine', 'TV-MA', 'In the early 1990s, a recently widowed, impoverished Orlando water park employee schemes and cons her way up the ranks of the multi-billion dollar pyramid scheme which ruined her financially in the first place.', 'In the early 1990s, a recently widowed, impoverished Orlando water park employee schemes and cons her way up the ranks of the multi-billion dollar pyramid scheme which ruined her financially in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH2XKRDtyY3V2ySbrEPwytiYEut.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80703'),
  ('92727352617048926', 'On Call', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Tim Walsh, Elliot Wolf', null, 'Troian Bellisario, Brandon Larracuente', 'TV-MA', 'Traci Harmon, a veteran female training officer, and her rookie male ride-along, Alex Diaz, navigate the loss of a fellow officer and politics of modern day policing — in the department and on the streets of Long Beach.', 'Traci Harmon, a veteran female training officer, and her rookie male ride-along, Alex Diaz, navigate the loss of a fellow officer and politics of modern day policing — in the department and on the streets of Long Beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MvgPuQfBrJ54lGqTZ6dwhG61rC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236429'),
  ('824056969753918176', 'On Children', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yu Pei-hua, Madeline Wu, Chen Wei-Ling', 'Tzu-Ying Hung, Xiao-Le Wu', null, null, 'Adapted from the novel by author Wu Hsiao-Le, the series consists of five independent stories about parenting, as well as children''s pressures of growing up, when faced with the tragic consequences of social pressure, parental oppression and family dysfunction. Each story is told in two parts in this ten-part series.', 'Adapted from the novel by author Wu Hsiao-Le, the series consists of five independent stories about parenting, as well as children''s pressures of growing up, when faced with the tragic consequences of social pressure, parental oppression and family dysfunction. Each story is told in two parts in this ten-part series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsprgeXnSIJfrWF2w4i8cYF1KEA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80759'),
  ('195876694822317705', 'On Cinema', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Gregg Turkington, Tim Heidecker', null, 'Tim Heidecker, Gregg Turkington', 'TV-MA', 'Tim Heidecker reviews the latest movies in theaters with a special guest.', 'Tim Heidecker reviews the latest movies in theaters with a special guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TDQEYCS8HmvY7d8udmeS2ILqFl.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:76345'),
  ('147571360963113890', 'On Death Row', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog', null, 'Werner Herzog', null, 'A two part series on an inside look at a maximum security prison in Texas featuring interviews with death row inmates.', 'A two part series on an inside look at a maximum security prison in Texas featuring interviews with death row inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om3zDi14MgPkxdr7qvJtI0euptr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:56988'),
  ('41509079534813321', 'On Marriage', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, '“And they lived happily ever after” is an ending we are all too familiar with. On Marriage focuses on portraying all those struggles that couples encounter when they give up themselves to fulfill their marriage. In this anthology series, each individual episode explores varying meanings of marriage from five unique perspectives.', '“And they lived happily ever after” is an ending we are all too familiar with. On Marriage focuses on portraying all those struggles that couples encounter when they give up themselves to fulfill their marriage. In this anthology series, each individual episode explores varying meanings of marriage from five unique perspectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fz4XBOXC2iJnUpynLCnC33PiOxs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209918'),
  ('719790609038189999', 'On My Block', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Lauren Iungerich, Eddie Gonzalez, Jeremy Haft', null, 'Sierra Capri, Jason Genao, Brett Gray, Diego Tinoco, Jessica Marie Garcia', 'TV-14', 'In a rough Los Angeles neighborhood, four smart, funny and streetwise teens find their lifelong friendship tested as they begin high school.', 'In a rough Los Angeles neighborhood, four smart, funny and streetwise teens find their lifelong friendship tested as they begin high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6oviv65UEducvjAdH3sYYaxdu2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:76747'),
  ('512117216011994993', 'On n''est pas couché', 2006, null, 'Laurent Ruquier, Catherine Barma', null, 'Laurent Ruquier, Éric Zemmour, Jonathan Lambert, Éric Naulleau, Michaël Grégorio, Ghislaine Ottenheimer', null, 'On n''est pas couché was a French talk show broadcast on France 2 on Saturdays at 11 p.m., hosted by Laurent Ruquier assisted by various columnists.', 'On n''est pas couché was a French talk show broadcast on France 2 on Saturdays at 11 p.m., hosted by Laurent Ruquier assisted by various columnists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqS4UYGr850VOZJaV5979qjS9T1.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:46249'),
  ('830074812000301279', 'On Patrol: First Shift', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, 'Dan Abrams, Sean Larkin, Curtis Wilson', 'TV-14', 'Dan Abrams, Sean "Sticks" Larkin and Curtis Wilson discuss what''s in store for the upcoming episode of On Patrol: Live and provide a sneak peak of the departments and officers that the cameras will be following. The hosts will also look back at the most memorable moments from past episodes including everything from police pursuits to encounters with unforgettable suspects, as well as inspiring acts of heroism and courage under fire.', 'Dan Abrams, Sean "Sticks" Larkin and Curtis Wilson discuss what''s in store for the upcoming episode of On Patrol: Live and provide a sneak peak of the departments and officers that the cameras will be following. The hosts will also look back at the most memorable moments from past episodes including everything from police pursuits to encounters with unforgettable suspects, as well as inspiring acts of heroism and courage under fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WYmejW5eaiDpeC4vzSDZKZYAS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:206386'),
  ('102957969150189603', 'On Patrol: Live', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', null, null, 'Dan Abrams, Curtis Wilson, Sean Larkin', 'TV-14', '"On Patrol: Live" follows police officers and sheriff''s deputies from diverse agencies in different cities across the country for three hours. Program hosts Dan Abrams, retired Tulsa Police Department Sgt. Sean "Sticks" Larkin and Deputy Sheriff Curtis Wilson provide minute-by-minute perspective and analysis from a central studio location during footage. Local residents from the communities of featured departments are given the opportunity to have a firsthand experience during ride-alongs with officers on live nights.', '"On Patrol: Live" follows police officers and sheriff''s deputies from diverse agencies in different cities across the country for three hours. Program hosts Dan Abrams, retired Tulsa Police Department Sgt. Sean "Sticks" Larkin and Deputy Sheriff Curtis Wilson provide minute-by-minute perspective and analysis from a central studio location during footage. Local residents from the communities of featured departments are given the opportunity to have a firsthand experience during ride-alongs with officers on live nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ravWNzlxManKzM7Vj6TFL5rVlW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:204646'),
  ('760488359560432026', 'On Patrol: Live Special', 2026, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The most intense, jaw-dropping and unforgettable moments from REELZ’s hit documentary series On Patrol: Live. These specials show highlights from the more than 50 cameras rolling live on Friday and Saturday nights, following law enforcement officers from across the country. It’s an unflinching look at everything from high-speed pursuits and unpredictable pit maneuvers, to the takedown of felons on the run, surprising hiding spots, and officer interactions with their communities.', 'The most intense, jaw-dropping and unforgettable moments from REELZ’s hit documentary series On Patrol: Live. These specials show highlights from the more than 50 cameras rolling live on Friday and Saturday nights, following law enforcement officers from across the country. It’s an unflinching look at everything from high-speed pursuits and unpredictable pit maneuvers, to the takedown of felons on the run, surprising hiding spots, and officer interactions with their communities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjafSKzKl7GdWtXThJzxFpKktaK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317221'),
  ('70244640733561480', 'On the Air', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Frost, David Lynch', null, 'Ian Buchanan, Marla Rubinoff, Nancye Ferguson, Miguel Ferrer, Marvin Kaplan, Tracey Walter, David L. Lander, Gary Grossman', null, 'The year is 1957. The cast and crew of the Lester Guy Show are extremely apprehensive about their upcoming live television broadcast on the Zoblotnick Broadcasting Co. network. Lester Guy despises fellow cast member Betty Hudson for unknowingly becoming more popular than him and schemes to destroy her career. Only two of the seven episodes were written by David Lynch.', 'The year is 1957. The cast and crew of the Lester Guy Show are extremely apprehensive about their upcoming live television broadcast on the Zoblotnick Broadcasting Co. network. Lester Guy despises fellow cast member Betty Hudson for unknowingly becoming more popular than him and schemes to destroy her career. Only two of the seven episodes were written by David Lynch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSvDzCnUCMzH6bvkGQv3Ps0sJJS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3465'),
  ('607529976757031138', 'On the Buses', 1969, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Reg Varney, Bob Grant, Stephen Lewis, Doris Hare, Anna Karen', null, 'On the Buses is a British comedy series created by Ronald Wolfe and Ronald Chesney, broadcast in the United Kingdom from 1969 to 1973. The writers'' previous successes with The Rag Trade and Meet the Wife were for the BBC, but the corporation rejected On the Buses, not seeing much comedy potential in a bus depot as a setting. The comedy partnership turned to a friend, Frank Muir, Head of Entertainment at London Weekend Television, who loved the idea; the show was accepted and despite a poor critical reception became a hit with viewers.', 'On the Buses is a British comedy series created by Ronald Wolfe and Ronald Chesney, broadcast in the United Kingdom from 1969 to 1973. The writers'' previous successes with The Rag Trade and Meet the Wife were for the BBC, but the corporation rejected On the Buses, not seeing much comedy potential in a bus depot as a setting. The comedy partnership turned to a friend, Frank Muir, Head of Entertainment at London Weekend Television, who loved the idea; the show was accepted and despite a poor critical reception became a hit with viewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xomwMTba1nx7qbycf7q3Nts9WhE.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:774'),
  ('1108697792616606105', 'On the Case with Paula Zahn', 2009, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Paula Zahn', 'TV-14', 'Award winning journalist Paula Zahn unravels shocking crimes interviewing those closest to the case including lawyers, the victim''s family, detectives and the convicted murderer themselves.', 'Award winning journalist Paula Zahn unravels shocking crimes interviewing those closest to the case including lawyers, the victim''s family, detectives and the convicted murderer themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Hbir2fSCFr52t3snqMnzKRreV7.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:25181'),
  ('434951542432845745', 'On the Edge', 1991, null, null, null, 'Deric Wan, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Samantha Chuk Man-Kwan, Cheung Fung-Lei, Lily Ng Lai-Chu, Amy Wu Mei-Yee', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IhIwtiQKSFM4WcABFcfcZZF9e5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88093'),
  ('1046170256979593860', 'On the Edge: World Cup Ski Racing', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Follow Olympic champions - including Mikaela Shiffrin, Lindsey Vonn, Marco Odermatt, Lucas Pinheiro Braathen and more - as they navigate the dramatic landscapes of Europe and North America on the Audi FIS Ski World Cup circuit. The series explores their personal journeys, on and off the snow, and the culture of the sport as they endure the grind of a global season all in pursuit of Olympic gold.', 'Follow Olympic champions - including Mikaela Shiffrin, Lindsey Vonn, Marco Odermatt, Lucas Pinheiro Braathen and more - as they navigate the dramatic landscapes of Europe and North America on the Audi FIS Ski World Cup circuit. The series explores their personal journeys, on and off the snow, and the culture of the sport as they endure the grind of a global season all in pursuit of Olympic gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSLAWa0JBmrUMxACuTjffgyjH7x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:312720'),
  ('768812535745937016', 'On The First Beat', 2007, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sammul Chan, Ron Ng Cheuk-Hai, Joey Yung Jo-Yee, Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Kate Tsui Tsz-Shan, Chin Ka-Lok, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui', null, 'On the First Beat is a TVB modern action series broadcast in June 2007. The series is a direct sequel to 2005''s The Academy. The main cast features Ron Ng, Sammul Chan and Chin Ka Lok from the original series and new cast including Michael Tao, Sonija Kwok, Joey Yung, Kenny Kwan and Kate Tsui. The story continues on with the two male leads in the series with their growth as young police officers with personal conflicts in their bonds as friends and romantic relationships. The drama is about the life of a group of Hong Kong police officers and cadets inside and outside of work. A direct sequel, E.U. was produced and airred in 2009 continued with Ron Ng and Sammul Chan, alongside Michael Miu, Kathy Chow, Elanne Kwong, and Michael Tse.', 'On the First Beat is a TVB modern action series broadcast in June 2007. The series is a direct sequel to 2005''s The Academy. The main cast features Ron Ng, Sammul Chan and Chin Ka Lok from the original series and new cast including Michael Tao, Sonija Kwok, Joey Yung, Kenny Kwan and Kate Tsui. The story continues on with the two male leads in the series with their growth as young police officers with personal conflicts in their bonds as friends and romantic relationships. The drama is about the life of a group of Hong Kong police officers and cadets inside and outside of work. A direct sequel, E.U. was produced and airred in 2009 continued with Ron Ng and Sammul Chan, alongside Michael Miu, Kathy Chow, Elanne Kwong, and Michael Tse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5j61Bjpx8KKp4ZAzS6jx8O0dWK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3514'),
  ('619440847507547475', 'On the Ice', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maksim Kulagin', null, 'Angelina Pakhomova, Artyom Bystrov, Viktoriya Tolstoganova, Pyotr Fyodorov, Mariya Akhmetzyanova, Roman Evdokimov, Natalya Zemtsova, Maryana Spivak', null, 'Figure skater Ksenia returns to her hometown to finally find out the truth about the tragedy of a decade ago, when her figure skating partner died. Having become a children''s coach at the same sports school, she quickly realizes that behind the brilliance of "elite sports" there is still silence, pressure and fear. Coaches maintain the illusion of well-being, parents nod approvingly from the stands, and children''s destinies continue to break under the weight of other people''s ambitions. In this world, injuries are inherited, and every family has secrets they don''t want to talk about out loud. And it is among these carefully hidden "skeletons in the closet" that the answer lies — the one that Ksenia has been afraid of all these years.', 'Figure skater Ksenia returns to her hometown to finally find out the truth about the tragedy of a decade ago, when her figure skating partner died. Having become a children''s coach at the same sports school, she quickly realizes that behind the brilliance of "elite sports" there is still silence, pressure and fear. Coaches maintain the illusion of well-being, parents nod approvingly from the stands, and children''s destinies continue to break under the weight of other people''s ambitions. In this world, injuries are inherited, and every family has secrets they don''t want to talk about out loud. And it is among these carefully hidden "skeletons in the closet" that the answer lies — the one that Ksenia has been afraid of all these years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoYqgYnccitkpQeu8wnhmEgndw7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315843'),
  ('779835832276644014', 'On the Road', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Shen Jie', 'Liu Ye, Mei Ting, Bao Jianfeng, Ma Yili, Zeng Li, Cheng Yu, Zheng Qi, Xue Haowen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4foub2qHN5wqZJc1i6S0rjrcNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93982'),
  ('436608644509397197', 'On the Roam', 2024, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jason Momoa', 'TV-MA', 'Follow Jason Momoa as he travels the country chasing art, adventure, and friendship through the lens of craftsmanship.', 'Follow Jason Momoa as he travels the country chasing art, adventure, and friendship through the lens of craftsmanship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUiODjPOFhJygwsWvxADr3EjMfs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242945'),
  ('1067714304443885209', 'On the Verge', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julie Delpy', 'Julie Delpy', 'Julie Delpy, Sarah Jones, Elisabeth Shue, Alexia Landeau', 'TV-MA', 'Four women, a chef, a single mom, an heiress, and a job seeker dig into love and work, with a generous side of midlife crises, in pre-pandemic LA.', 'Four women, a chef, a single mom, an heiress, and a job seeker dig into love and work, with a generous side of midlife crises, in pre-pandemic LA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plN3s9SzplgkFX4kT93ZWIOoCSB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127108'),
  ('1047741642501068595', 'On The Waterfront', 1980, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Siu Sang', null, 'Kenneth Tsang, Michelle Yim, Candice Yu On-On, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Yung Wai-Man, Mannor Chan Man-Na, Cheung Ying', null, 'Gao Tianyuan and his wife Zhuo Feng''er live in seclusion in the Tian Shan mountains due to his father''s dismissal from officialdom. They go down the mountain to reunite with his father but he is suddenly killed, and Feng''er defects to Tianzheng Sect''s leader, Ren Wo weihuai. Devastated, Tianyuan starts a new life under a false identity until he meets Sikong Aoshi and becomes involved in the martial world again. He decides to seek revenge for his father''s death and becomes an official, but his impatience leads to a dangerous mistake. Later, he discovers that the real culprit wants to rebel and dominate the martial world, and he teams up with Aoshi to eliminate the threat.', 'Gao Tianyuan and his wife Zhuo Feng''er live in seclusion in the Tian Shan mountains due to his father''s dismissal from officialdom. They go down the mountain to reunite with his father but he is suddenly killed, and Feng''er defects to Tianzheng Sect''s leader, Ren Wo weihuai. Devastated, Tianyuan starts a new life under a false identity until he meets Sikong Aoshi and becomes involved in the martial world again. He decides to seek revenge for his father''s death and becomes an official, but his impatience leads to a dangerous mistake. Later, he discovers that the real culprit wants to rebel and dominate the martial world, and he teams up with Aoshi to eliminate the threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNraKwR0UqHUGGY3xsie3isOPkI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107993'),
  ('1091166643644070342', 'Once', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Soap', 'Jorge Edelstein', 'Javier Castro Albano, Marcos Osorio Vidal, Alberto Muñoz', 'Mariano González, Juan David Penagos, Sebastián Athié, Luan Brum, Paulina Vetrano, Javier Eloy Bonanno, Renato Quattordio, Fausto Bengoechea', 'NR', 'The series revolves around Gabo, a soccer-loving teenager who, upon receiving a scholarship from the prestigious Sports Academic Institute (IAD) of Buenos Aires, will see his dream of playing at Los Halcones Dorados, the renowned amateur team of the school, and also his longing to become a professional footballer.', 'The series revolves around Gabo, a soccer-loving teenager who, upon receiving a scholarship from the prestigious Sports Academic Institute (IAD) of Buenos Aires, will see his dream of playing at Los Halcones Dorados, the renowned amateur team of the school, and also his longing to become a professional footballer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4vPg3QsTJJh6C5MHARTb5CyqOu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72637'),
  ('744741053076707387', 'Once Again', 2020, 'Drama', 'Yang Hui-seung, Lee Jae-sang', 'Yang Hui-seung', 'Lee Min-jung, Lee Sang-yeob, Cheon Ho-jin, Cha Hwa-yeon, Lee Cho-hee, Oh Yoon-ah, Oh Dae-hwan, Lee Jung-eun', null, 'Back at square one as divorcees, four siblings take another shot at love and dreams — after mustering up the courage to convince their parents first.', 'Back at square one as divorcees, four siblings take another shot at love and dreams — after mustering up the courage to convince their parents first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oV3yxKG56IMQvdXzYn2GodT79rb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99490'),
  ('294914119104843775', 'Once Again', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Hyun-jun, Moon Ji-yong, Kang Woo-jung', null, 'Fifteen years after losing Kang Ji-hoon, Jae-woo wakes in 2007 with a chance to fix the past—if he can reach the boy who no longer knows him.', 'Fifteen years after losing Kang Ji-hoon, Jae-woo wakes in 2007 with a chance to fix the past—if he can reach the boy who no longer knows him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYZZdiJSx1xJu1Q49qZrcH4m4Z5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209477'),
  ('230484110589973548', 'Once and Again', 1999, 'Drama', 'Edward Zwick, Marshall Herskovitz', null, 'Sela Ward, Billy Campbell, Jeffrey Nordling, Susanna Thompson, Shane West, Julia Whelan, Evan Rachel Wood, Meredith Deane', null, 'The series depicts the family of a single mother and her romance with a single father.', 'The series depicts the family of a single mother and her romance with a single father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FVdrgWH2EwrYtQzXNsu0ax1TEk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:638'),
  ('511740960520709138', 'Once Upon a Bite', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Chen Xiaoqing', null, 'Lihong Li', null, 'Filmed over a period of four years, this food documentary journeys to 22 countries across six continents, focusing on areas where “East meets West” in the dining scene and delves into the rise and changes in Chinese cuisines worldwide.', 'Filmed over a period of four years, this food documentary journeys to 22 countries across six continents, focusing on areas where “East meets West” in the dining scene and delves into the rise and changes in Chinese cuisines worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6plBmVJfWLA5UD8tcIvI2QUrTN.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:83670'),
  ('1050327734322537078', 'Once Upon a Small Town', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kwon Seok-jang', null, 'JOY, Choo Young-woo, Baek Sung-chul, Baek Ji-won, Jeong Seok-yong, Roh Jae-won, Park Ye-ni, Na Chul', null, 'Against his wishes a veterinarian from the big city relocates to the countryside, where he meets a policewoman, a town insider with a friendly secret.', 'Against his wishes a veterinarian from the big city relocates to the countryside, where he meets a policewoman, a town insider with a friendly secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DNkebzIQNAzr5YSi96RCZ0D3Q6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133678'),
  ('171512576296191605', 'Once Upon a Time', 2011, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Edward Kitsis, Adam Horowitz', null, 'Lana Parrilla, Colin O''Donoghue, Robert Carlyle, Gabrielle Anwar, Dania Ramirez, Mekia Cox, Andrew J. West, Alison Fernández', 'TV-PG', 'There is a town in Maine where every story book character you''ve ever known is trapped between two worlds, victims of a powerful curse. Only one knows the truth and only one can break the spell.', 'There is a town in Maine where every story book character you''ve ever known is trapped between two worlds, victims of a powerful curse. Only one knows the truth and only one can break the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u95scYysMZvBoekSLmMNJjeqXcY.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39272'),
  ('99492534059920199', 'Once Upon a Time in Iraq', 2020, 'Documentary', 'James Bluemel', null, 'Ashley Gilbertson, Andy Serkis, George W. Bush, Tony Blair, Saddam Hussein, Dexter Filkins, John Nixon', null, 'With unique personal archive from civilians and soldiers from both sides of the conflict, this series takes viewers closer to the realities of war and life under Isis than they have ever been before.', 'With unique personal archive from civilians and soldiers from both sides of the conflict, this series takes viewers closer to the realities of war and life under Isis than they have ever been before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UAZKSIMiFc9luJsVyZ2y84pg8b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105978'),
  ('772404430540613140', 'Once Upon a Time in Lingjian Mountain', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Guowang Bixia', 'Xu Pengpeng', 'Xu Kai, Sandrine Pinna, Zhu Yuanbing, Gao Yuer, Guo Xiaoting, Roger Kwok Chun-On, James Wen, Zheng Yawen', null, 'Wang Lu, a young genius, joins the renowned Spirit Blade Sect during a time of looming crisis across the nine continents. Under the guidance of his eccentric and sharp-tongued mentor Wang Wu, who hides centuries of wisdom behind a youthful appearance, he embarks on an unconventional path to immortal cultivation. Through constant clashes and unlikely camaraderie, the two strive to become the strongest sages of their time.', 'Wang Lu, a young genius, joins the renowned Spirit Blade Sect during a time of looming crisis across the nine continents. Under the guidance of his eccentric and sharp-tongued mentor Wang Wu, who hides centuries of wisdom behind a youthful appearance, he embarks on an unconventional path to immortal cultivation. Through constant clashes and unlikely camaraderie, the two strive to become the strongest sages of their time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjybBoxfCwAdoHgMxDqhtqjuDi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95380'),
  ('1100295846900926101', 'Once Upon a Time in Northern Ireland', 2023, 'Documentary', 'James Bluemel', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Twenty-five years on from a peace agreement being reached, Once Upon a Time in Northern Ireland shares intimate, unheard testimonies from all sides of the conflict.', 'Twenty-five years on from a peace agreement being reached, Once Upon a Time in Northern Ireland shares intimate, unheard testimonies from all sides of the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC2ZzXvZOrgoYD8tR59d836rKN6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226328'),
  ('654764762112827248', 'Once Upon a Time in Qingdao', 2015, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Xinjian Zhang', null, 'Huang Bo, Liu Xiangjing, Gong Zheng, Wang Shuangbao, Sa Rina, Fu Miao, Huang Xiaolei, Wang Kai', null, 'The series follows the lives of three brothers as they struggle through the turbulent political period before the war. They become part of the first-generation immigrant entrepreneurial path in Qingdao. The story began in 1904 when the Jinan Railway opened and ends with the outbreak of war in 1937.', 'The series follows the lives of three brothers as they struggle through the turbulent political period before the war. They become part of the first-generation immigrant entrepreneurial path in Qingdao. The story began in 1904 when the Jinan Railway opened and ends with the outbreak of war in 1937.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dhteZDRu8hRZI8eieMhCgrgLZn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66969'),
  ('735602353491426113', 'Once Upon a Time in Russia', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Roman Novikov', null, 'Azamat Musagaliev, Denis Dorokhov, Olga Kartunkova, David Tsallaev, Ekaterina Morgunova, Teimuraz Taniyah, Aleksandr Ptashenchuk, Zaurbek Baytsaev', null, 'Russia is the richest country with a lot of oil, gas and problems. A humorous satirical show consisting of all-Russian social and everyday realities, “Once Upon a Time in Russia” does not solve any of them. It laughs at them.', 'Russia is the richest country with a lot of oil, gas and problems. A humorous satirical show consisting of all-Russian social and everyday realities, “Once Upon a Time in Russia” does not solve any of them. It laughs at them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9xhRinXylbOPaGfg0e6fTg1tWA.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:67877'),
  ('987766213007532302', 'Once Upon a Time in Shanghai', 1996, 'Drama', null, null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Pat Poon, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Carol Cheng, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Nadia Chan Chung-Ling, Noel Leung, Lui Fong', null, 'Set in 1930s Shanghai, the story opens with legendary gambler Gon and his vow to recover his father''s casino from Shanghai tycoon Fung In his quest, he becomes acquainted with Sou and uncovers her fiance''s nefarious conspiracy. Sou gives her heart to Gon, but he can''t forget his old love Gu. Meanwhile, up-and-coming gangster Hui Man Keung is quickly making his name in Shanghai. Crossing paths during chaotic times, Hui, Gon, and Ding Lik become brothers and business partners, but Fung recruits Hui and Ding to his side through backhanded methods. Though deeply in love with Fung''s daughter Ching Ching, Hui can only turn away from love and friendship when Fung''s true nature is revealed. Fung, however, is not about to just let Hui walk away.', 'Set in 1930s Shanghai, the story opens with legendary gambler Gon and his vow to recover his father''s casino from Shanghai tycoon Fung In his quest, he becomes acquainted with Sou and uncovers her fiance''s nefarious conspiracy. Sou gives her heart to Gon, but he can''t forget his old love Gu. Meanwhile, up-and-coming gangster Hui Man Keung is quickly making his name in Shanghai. Crossing paths during chaotic times, Hui, Gon, and Ding Lik become brothers and business partners, but Fung recruits Hui and Ding to his side through backhanded methods. Though deeply in love with Fung''s daughter Ching Ching, Hui can only turn away from love and friendship when Fung''s true nature is revealed. Fung, however, is not about to just let Hui walk away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A96bE9vsWGOqAaytCiw44wJ0BlO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125911'),
  ('204159753093270203', 'Once Upon a Time in Wonderland', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Edward Kitsis, Adam Horowitz', null, 'Sophie Lowe, Michael Socha, Emma Rigby, Naveen Andrews, Peter Gadiot, John Lithgow', 'TV-PG', 'In Victorian England, the young and beautiful Alice tells a tale of a strange new land that exists on the other side of a rabbit hole. Thinking Alice insane, her doctors aim to make her forget everything. While Alice is ready to put it all behind her, she knows this world is real. In the nick of time, the Knave of Hearts and the White Rabbit save her from a doomed fate. Together, the trio tumble down the rabbit hole to Wonderland, where nothing is impossible.', 'In Victorian England, the young and beautiful Alice tells a tale of a strange new land that exists on the other side of a rabbit hole. Thinking Alice insane, her doctors aim to make her forget everything. While Alice is ready to put it all behind her, she knows this world is real. In the nick of time, the Knave of Hearts and the White Rabbit save her from a doomed fate. Together, the trio tumble down the rabbit hole to Wonderland, where nothing is impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0Tq3A9CzvzjGWR3L7xBuqIAoJT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57754'),
  ('832171917027905295', 'Once Upon a Time... Happily Never After', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Manolo Caro', null, 'Sebastián Yatra, Rossy de Palma, Asier Etxeandia, Daniela Vega, Mariana Treviño, Mariola Fuentes, Itziar Castro, Mónica Mara', 'TV-MA', 'A couple forced to separate must find each other in another life to break a spell on their town, where no one can fall in love.', 'A couple forced to separate must find each other in another life to break a spell on their town, where no one can fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBJZlUhmZnTSWc47W0lCEyNBU3J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114156'),
  ('849548313407850383', 'Once Upon a Time... Life', 1987, 'Animation, Kids, Documentary, Family', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Roger Carel, Gilles Laurent, Marie-Laure Beneston, Alain Dorval, Henry Djanik', 'TV-Y7', 'Attention please! Are you ready for an adventurous tour through the human body? With a lot of humour, our physical appearance is being introduced from head to toe along cells and organs in an educational way. The heart, blood, nerves and kidneys, each single one is a miracle which renders life possible.', 'Attention please! Are you ready for an adventurous tour through the human body? With a lot of humour, our physical appearance is being introduced from head to toe along cells and organs in an educational way. The heart, blood, nerves and kidneys, each single one is a miracle which renders life possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cylnl0qQp4OnicoLgRUx4gOhOW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2632'),
  ('76073592497382389', 'Once Upon a Time… Man', 1978, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Roger Carel, Annie Balestra, Albert Barillé, Yves Barsacq, Claude Bertrand, Patrick Préjean', 'NR', 'The history of mankind from prehistoric times to the 20th century.', 'The history of mankind from prehistoric times to the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hriITDZrjwz9B5SIS1SPRkYBFEf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6080'),
  ('357505553596203657', 'Once Upon a Time… Space', 1982, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Alain Dorval, Roger Carel, Vincent Ropion, Annie Balestra', 'NR', 'During their perilous journeys through the vastness of the universe, Maestro and his many friends meet strange creatures from distant stars and face energy and ecological problems.', 'During their perilous journeys through the vastness of the universe, Maestro and his many friends meet strange creatures from distant stars and face energy and ecological problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0ZSPFtVLEryUdypEqt5s6Dm4W1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4727'),
  ('1007542445085858413', 'Once Upon a Time... The Americas', 1992, 'Animation, Documentary, Family', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Roger Carel, Olivier Destrez, Marie-Laure Beneston, Patrick Préjean, Sady Rebbot, Vincent Ropion, Jacques Brunet', null, '"Once upon a time ... the Americas" tells us the story of this vast continent, from the very first inhabitants to the present day, including the Aztecs and the Incas, the conquistadors, the war of independence or the gold Rush. Through our usual sympathetic heroes (Maestro, Pierrot, Petit Gros, le Teigneux, le Nabot, etc.), we travel from time to time, always with the aim of teaching us something.', '"Once upon a time ... the Americas" tells us the story of this vast continent, from the very first inhabitants to the present day, including the Aztecs and the Incas, the conquistadors, the war of independence or the gold Rush. Through our usual sympathetic heroes (Maestro, Pierrot, Petit Gros, le Teigneux, le Nabot, etc.), we travel from time to time, always with the aim of teaching us something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gStlZULqXYpk5dTbrpO30RwqXAl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5065'),
  ('1023740461004867557', 'Once Upon a Time... The Discoverers', 1994, 'Animation, Documentary, Family', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Roger Carel, Albert Augier, Olivier Destrez, Michel Paulin, Patrick Préjean, Sady Rebbot, Gilles Tamiz', 'NR', 'From flashes of genius to curious experiments, humankind''s innovations lead explorers and inventors on a brilliant journey of discovery in this series.', 'From flashes of genius to curious experiments, humankind''s innovations lead explorers and inventors on a brilliant journey of discovery in this series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c03JknMzBbYlO1ZhOxDpMp82HGR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5402'),
  ('479708184937737595', 'Once Upon a Time... The Explorers', 1996, 'Animation, Documentary, Family', 'Albert Barillé', null, 'Roger Carel, Olivier Destrez, Hélène Levesque, Patrick Préjean, Daniel Beretta', 'NR', 'Il était une fois... les Explorateurs is a French animated TV series from 1996. Directed by Albert Barillé.', 'Il était une fois... les Explorateurs is a French animated TV series from 1996. Directed by Albert Barillé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAByj3prSRKtFTw8FjaX6MeepBW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4213'),
  ('1019264300083172892', 'Once Upon a Witch''s Death', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshino Aoyama, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Miharu Hanai, Aina Suzuki, Rumi Okubo, Hina Youmiya, Atsumi Tanezaki, Shizuka Itoh', null, 'Meg Raspberry is just an apprentice witch celebrating her 17th birthday. That is, until Faust, her magic teacher and Perennial Witch of the Seven Sages, suddenly reveals she is going to die. To stop the Death Sentence curse, Meg must create the Seed of Life using tears of joy from 1,000 people. Join Meg on her travels as she collects the happy tears from everyone she meets to gain eternal life!', 'Meg Raspberry is just an apprentice witch celebrating her 17th birthday. That is, until Faust, her magic teacher and Perennial Witch of the Seven Sages, suddenly reveals she is going to die. To stop the Death Sentence curse, Meg must create the Seed of Life using tears of joy from 1,000 people. Join Meg on her travels as she collects the happy tears from everyone she meets to gain eternal life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gr2mDFSGHhiEYrNfP6vbYtuNrT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258055'),
  ('247015817955262289', 'Once We Get Married', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nian Hua Fu Liu', 'Shang Menglu', 'Wang Yuwen, Wang Ziqi, Ian Yi, Zhong Lili, Yang Yue, Li Junchen, Chen Xun, Ma Rui', null, 'Fashion buyer Gu Xixi bought Alex''s couture wedding dresses for her clients. During a private reception, she got acquainted with Yin Sichen, the black-bellied president who came to discuss business cooperation with Alex. An incident occured leading to the two people to temporarily maintain a contract cooperative relationship for a win-win situation pertaining to Alex. The two with opposite personalities gradually found love in this contract marriage. Adapted from novel "Flash Marriage CEO''s Contract Wife" by Xiang Wang.', 'Fashion buyer Gu Xixi bought Alex''s couture wedding dresses for her clients. During a private reception, she got acquainted with Yin Sichen, the black-bellied president who came to discuss business cooperation with Alex. An incident occured leading to the two people to temporarily maintain a contract cooperative relationship for a win-win situation pertaining to Alex. The two with opposite personalities gradually found love in this contract marriage. Adapted from novel "Flash Marriage CEO''s Contract Wife" by Xiang Wang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnmp5NOErypJwJYJXTzYQ3EwsR9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135349'),
  ('473796057693835966', 'Once We Were Six', 2019, 'Soap, Drama', 'Angela Chaves', 'Angela Chaves, Bernardo Guilherme, Daisy Chaves', 'Glória Pires, Antonio Calloni, Danilo Mesquita, Nicolas Prattes, Giullia Buscacio, André Luiz Frambach, Simone Spoladore, Ricardo Pereira', null, 'The plot tells the history and daily life of the Lemos Family between the 1920s and 1940s. Júlio works in a fabric store and has the ambition of getting rich to offer his family a good life. His wife, Lola, does everything she can to keep her family together, because she believes that this way they can move on.', 'The plot tells the history and daily life of the Lemos Family between the 1920s and 1940s. Júlio works in a fabric store and has the ambition of getting rich to offer his family a good life. His wife, Lola, does everything she can to keep her family together, because she believes that this way they can move on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FycKv7Eky5pvgOYhZzhdYj1IUz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105733'),
  ('317482425361246826', 'One Against All', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Thomas Stavros, Gustavo Lipsztein, Breno Silveira', null, 'Júlio Andrade, Julia Ianina, João Fernandes, Roberto Birindelli, Sílvio Guindane, Rita Guedes, Brenda Sabryna, Julia Konrad', 'NR', 'The story of Cadu, a public defender who sees his life change after being mistaken for a drug dealer.', 'The story of Cadu, a public defender who sees his life change after being mistaken for a drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3o7f2Xjwl5hcoiioR9eGdD9ezHt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67158'),
  ('469553555737728115', 'One and Only', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Mobao Feibao', 'Ren Jialun, Bai Lu, Wang Xingyue, Li Yiru, Su Mengyun, Wu Mansi, Fu Jun, Liang Aiqi', null, 'Zhou Sheng Chen was raised by his brother, the Emperor, until the age of thirteen, when he set out to defend the border and establish himself as a loyal and accomplished general. Cui Shi Yi, the well-read daughter of an esteemed family, has been betrothed to the Crown Prince since birth. However, political scheming and tragic events result in Cui Shi Yi falling mute, her former fiance becoming a child Emperor, and Zhou Sheng Chen returning to the capital amidst a cloud of political turmoil.', 'Zhou Sheng Chen was raised by his brother, the Emperor, until the age of thirteen, when he set out to defend the border and establish himself as a loyal and accomplished general. Cui Shi Yi, the well-read daughter of an esteemed family, has been betrothed to the Crown Prince since birth. However, political scheming and tragic events result in Cui Shi Yi falling mute, her former fiance becoming a child Emperor, and Zhou Sheng Chen returning to the capital amidst a cloud of political turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iN8GBlkEdngye6igvqC2JQhgrZ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129117'),
  ('212853598124703227', 'One Big Happy', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Liz Feldman', null, 'Nick Zano, Elisha Cuthbert, Kelly Brook, Rebecca Corry, Chris Williams, Brandon Mychal Smith', 'TV-14', 'Best friends Lizzy (gay and a bit type-A) and Luke (straight and more laid back) are like family. When they were kids and both of their parents were getting divorces, they stuck together, and they''ve been there for each other ever since. Now, all grown up and still single, they''ve decided to start a family of their own. No, not like that (there are some lines even they won''t cross) - we''re talking the non-romantic, go-to-the-doctor''s-office type of baby-making.', 'Best friends Lizzy (gay and a bit type-A) and Luke (straight and more laid back) are like family. When they were kids and both of their parents were getting divorces, they stuck together, and they''ve been there for each other ever since. Now, all grown up and still single, they''ve decided to start a family of their own. No, not like that (there are some lines even they won''t cross) - we''re talking the non-romantic, go-to-the-doctor''s-office type of baby-making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fku61Zx2kwklMhbLhK4eyhx3dD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61849'),
  ('333821469709859825', 'One Call Bar', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Aleksander Fomin', 'Aleksander Fomin, Sergei Levitan, Andrey Orlov', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Kai Aleks Getts, Pavel Vorozhtsov, Oksana Akinshina, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Anton Kuznetsov, Leonid Yarmolnik, Ivan Makarevich', null, 'In the One Call bar, anyone can call a deceased loved one by agreeing to a deadly game of Russian roulette. Investigator Andrey Morozov is looking for his missing son, and all the evidence leads to a mysterious bar that appears in different places, leaving behind the bodies of dead visitors.', 'In the One Call bar, anyone can call a deceased loved one by agreeing to a deadly game of Russian roulette. Investigator Andrey Morozov is looking for his missing son, and all the evidence leads to a mysterious bar that appears in different places, leaving behind the bodies of dead visitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAJtwJPnNohoGEHkr1wh5qHlP0x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250727'),
