  ('830778487029469206', 'One the Woman', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yoon', 'Kim Yoon', 'Lee Hanee, Lee Sang-yun, Lee Won-keun, Jin Seo-yeon, Kim Chang-wan, Kim Won-hae, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Na Young-hee', null, 'A corruption inspector suddenly inherits a great fortune. In this mystery, she tries to regain her memory.', 'A corruption inspector suddenly inherits a great fortune. In this mystery, she tries to regain her memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnyBDlgdHucHa14sZl0MS8fZRUO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129479'),
  ('391369184829138942', 'One Thousand and One Nights', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kudret Sabancı', null, 'Halit Ergenç, Bergüzar Korel, Tardu Flordun, Ceyda Düvenci, Tomris İncer, Metin Çekmez, Ergün Demir, Yonca Şahinbaş', 'NR', 'Sehrazat, a young widow who is financially unable to treat her terminally ill young son, is forced to address to her charming boss, asking for help. The proposal by her boss changes her life forever.', 'Sehrazat, a young widow who is financially unable to treat her terminally ill young son, is forced to address to her charming boss, asking for help. The proposal by her boss changes her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRdTWjflcTN3k0I06OAJgWrL20Q.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:17915'),
  ('722751834443122339', 'One Thousand and One Nights', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Lucia Maria Zei', null, 'Vanessa Hessler, Marco Bocci, Bettina Zimmermann, Paz Vega, Raffaella Rea, Rolf Kanies, Stipe Erceg', 'TV-G', 'Shahrazad travels through desert searching for the man she loves and who she believes she has lost forever. She arrives at a castle, the home of a prince who kills anyone who dares enter. She convinces the prince to grant her one night to tell him a story, their story, a story that lasts one thousand and one nights...', 'Shahrazad travels through desert searching for the man she loves and who she believes she has lost forever. She arrives at a castle, the home of a prince who kills anyone who dares enter. She convinces the prince to grant her one night to tell him a story, their story, a story that lasts one thousand and one nights...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QgjpKVYSfzwKavac5aoLJfoxLH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75557'),
  ('404849355025054567', 'One Tree Hill', 2003, 'Drama', 'Mark Schwahn', null, 'James Lafferty, Bethany Joy Lenz, Sophia Bush, Austin Nichols, Robert Buckley, Shantel VanSanten, Jackson Brundage, Lee Norris', 'TV-14', 'In Tree Hill, North Carolina two half brothers share a last name and nothing else. Brooding, blue-collar Lucas is a talented street-side basketball player, but his skills are appreciated only by his friends at the river court. Popular, affluent Nathan basks in the hero-worship of the town, as the star of his high school team. And both boys are the son of former college ball player Dan Scott whose long ago choice to abandon Lucas and his mother Karen, will haunt him long into his life with wife Deb and their son Nathan.', 'In Tree Hill, North Carolina two half brothers share a last name and nothing else. Brooding, blue-collar Lucas is a talented street-side basketball player, but his skills are appreciated only by his friends at the river court. Popular, affluent Nathan basks in the hero-worship of the town, as the star of his high school team. And both boys are the son of former college ball player Dan Scott whose long ago choice to abandon Lucas and his mother Karen, will haunt him long into his life with wife Deb and their son Nathan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOrelBaAhp7DZbPTivDwKEyPslC.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:269'),
  ('1101647598270885331', 'One Trillion Dollars', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Philip Froissant, Alessandra Mastronardi, Oliver Masucci, Greta Scacchi, Carl Malapa, Stefano Cassetti, Orso Maria Guerrini, Carsten Bjørnlund', null, 'By way of a one-trillion-dollar inheritance, John Fontanelli becomes the richest man in the world. This inheritance comes with a prophecy: he is to restore humankind’s lost future. Powerful opponents are intent on preventing this endeavor.', 'By way of a one-trillion-dollar inheritance, John Fontanelli becomes the richest man in the world. This inheritance comes with a prophecy: he is to restore humankind’s lost future. Powerful opponents are intent on preventing this endeavor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doPA7mtsXEgOUyJr5iNDPi3ck2V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234717'),
  ('1079288588033550613', 'One Way or Another', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Manuela Burló Moreno', null, 'Marta Martín, Saida Benzal, Itziar Castro', null, 'Former best friends Hache and Belen reunite in Malasana, the hippest neighborhood in Madrid. Hache is freshly single and still mourning the demise of her relationship, while Belen is a struggling actor. As they fumble their way through unexpected setbacks, dating mishaps, and apartment woes, they soon realize that life is better together.', 'Former best friends Hache and Belen reunite in Malasana, the hippest neighborhood in Madrid. Hache is freshly single and still mourning the demise of her relationship, while Belen is a struggling actor. As they fumble their way through unexpected setbacks, dating mishaps, and apartment woes, they soon realize that life is better together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1l3YCp8rHcOP0DVq5fplWpt97S8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105939'),
  ('715405885324388700', 'One Week Friends', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshitaka Yamaya, Sora Amamiya, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Rumi Okubo, Shintaro Asanuma, Mai Nakahara, Junji Majima', 'TV-14', 'High school sophomore Yūki Hase noticed that Kaori Fujimiya, his classmate, was always alone. He tried to start a conversation with her but was turned down: "My memories of friendship can last only a week," she said. Despite of knowing this shocking truth, Yūki keeps trying to be Kaori''s "new" friend every week.', 'High school sophomore Yūki Hase noticed that Kaori Fujimiya, his classmate, was always alone. He tried to start a conversation with her but was turned down: "My memories of friendship can last only a week," she said. Despite of knowing this shocking truth, Yūki keeps trying to be Kaori''s "new" friend every week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GUz9NEePmrEw0ULIKWBFmt6S4t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60827'),
  ('6207696312591314', 'One-Punch Man', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-PG', 'Saitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of “special” training, though, he’s become so strong that he’s practically invincible. In fact, he’s too strong—even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch, and it turns out that being devastatingly powerful is actually kind of a bore. With his passion for being a hero lost along with his hair, yet still faced with new enemies every day, how much longer can he keep it going?', 'Saitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of “special” training, though, he’s become so strong that he’s practically invincible. In fact, he’s too strong—even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch, and it turns out that being devastatingly powerful is actually kind of a bore. With his passion for being a hero lost along with his hair, yet still faced with new enemies every day, how much longer can he keep it going?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT10AxJIXVvRwFAew4tt2RhzJrD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63926'),
  ('500336689799257192', 'ONE: High School Heroes', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Lee Jung-ha, Kim Do-wan, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Joo-ryoung, Shin Jun-seop, Lee Chan-hyeong, Shin Jae-whi, Lim Sung-kyun', null, 'A former model student, pushed by domestic abuse and bullying, joins a group that stands up to school violence and defends its victims.', 'A former model student, pushed by domestic abuse and bullying, joins a group that stands up to school violence and defends its victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWK4QcYrLGITRNDvhLelm66j4Er.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233219'),
  ('778285450712440614', 'Onegai My Melody', 2005, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'NR', 'My Melody arrives on Earth much to the surprise of her rivals, Kuromi and Baku. Together with one of the junior high school students, Yumeno Uta, they decide to protect the dreams of the people with the help of magic.', 'My Melody arrives on Earth much to the surprise of her rivals, Kuromi and Baku. Together with one of the junior high school students, Yumeno Uta, they decide to protect the dreams of the people with the help of magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GsORSlMqJdE9sya9f0JAoLIkT2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:23589'),
  ('1109065108253181985', 'ONI: Thunder God''s Tale', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Daisuke "Dice" Tsutsumi', null, 'Momona Tamada, Craig Robinson, Archie Yates, Brittany Ishibashi, George Takei, Anna Akana, Charlet Chung, Robert Kondo', 'TV-Y7', 'In a mystical world of Japanese gods and spirits, a courageous girl strives to follow in her mysterious father''s footsteps and find her true powers.', 'In a mystical world of Japanese gods and spirits, a courageous girl strives to follow in her mysterious father''s footsteps and find her true powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0WL7vIxEYWeDUnnUm2sDz21l5i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201213'),
  ('695750161582884545', 'OniAi', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Daisuke Suzuki', null, 'Ryota Osaka, Ibuki Kido, Minori Chihara, Asami Shimoda, Eri Kitamura', 'TV-MA', 'Adorable young Akiko is thrilled to be reuniting with Akito, the handsome older brother she hasn’t seen in years! In fact, she might be a little too excited about living under the same roof with her precious big bro. This pint-sized cutie has a serious brother complex, and she’s definitely not interested in sharing his attention. Unfortunately for little sister, she and Akito won’t be living alone: three gorgeous girls from the student council will be along for the ride! So much for the peaceful existence Akito was craving. Big Brother the dreamy will have to stay on his toes to avoid the advances of Sis and her ravishing rivals!', 'Adorable young Akiko is thrilled to be reuniting with Akito, the handsome older brother she hasn’t seen in years! In fact, she might be a little too excited about living under the same roof with her precious big bro. This pint-sized cutie has a serious brother complex, and she’s definitely not interested in sharing his attention. Unfortunately for little sister, she and Akito won’t be living alone: three gorgeous girls from the student council will be along for the ride! So much for the peaceful existence Akito was craving. Big Brother the dreamy will have to stay on his toes to avoid the advances of Sis and her ravishing rivals!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHaRoBJfNhzbzq6B0R4Gn4nq1lc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62696'),
  ('36686182745794764', 'Onihei', 2017, 'Drama, Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Kenyu Horiuchi, Junko Iwao, Daisuke Namikawa, Romi Park, Sayaka Senbongi, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'The historical novel series depicts Heizou Hasegawa, who metes justice on wrongdoers and supervises the crackdown on arsonists and robbers in Japan''s Edo period (1603-1868).', 'The historical novel series depicts Heizou Hasegawa, who metes justice on wrongdoers and supervises the crackdown on arsonists and robbers in Japan''s Edo period (1603-1868).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZAvfpUzxhFheutfxEUjQxt0QmA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70943'),
  ('709302700822516793', 'ONIMAI: I''m Now Your Sister!', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Marika Kouno, Kaori Ishihara, Hisako Kanemoto, Minami Tsuda, Kana Yuuki, Natsumi Hioka', 'TV-14', 'When lazy, erotic-game loving Mahiro Oyama is transformed into a girl by his younger scientist sister''s experiments, he becomes determined to change back, only to recognize that with his new opportunity, he may want to turn his life around.', 'When lazy, erotic-game loving Mahiro Oyama is transformed into a girl by his younger scientist sister''s experiments, he becomes determined to change back, only to recognize that with his new opportunity, he may want to turn his life around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpvVSr6ThPQFISYc9xRVR7MKjDF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198152'),
  ('343835503036213192', 'Onimusha', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Akio Otsuka, Hochu Otsuka, Daiki Yamashita, Subaru Kimura, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Makoto Furukawa, Aya Yamane', 'TV-MA', 'With a demonic, soul-consuming weapon in hand, can a legendary swordsman and a samurai brotherhood defeat a bloodthirsty zombie uprising?', 'With a demonic, soul-consuming weapon in hand, can a legendary swordsman and a samurai brotherhood defeat a bloodthirsty zombie uprising?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfRmDHegR8OpU3859lBz9YHgD79.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210945'),
  ('92983880878334233', 'Onipan!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Norihiro Naganuma', 'Yume Nozaki, Mika Negishi, Kokona Nonaka', 'TV-14', 'Over the centuries, oni (AKA demons of Japanese folklore) got a pretty bad reputation. Now it’s up to three plucky oni kids — sunny Tsutsuji, cool Tsuyukusa and boisterous Himawari — to improve human-oni relations through love, friendship and superpowered underpants!', 'Over the centuries, oni (AKA demons of Japanese folklore) got a pretty bad reputation. Now it’s up to three plucky oni kids — sunny Tsutsuji, cool Tsuyukusa and boisterous Himawari — to improve human-oni relations through love, friendship and superpowered underpants!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82oJwoYSvaV8RZTp0Yozys8mrs2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156911'),
  ('976658346757992901', 'Only Boo!', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Mamiao', 'Sureechay Kaewses', 'Suvijak Piyanopharoj, Dechchart Tasilp, Napat Patcharachavalit, Peerakan Teawsuwan, Pansa Vosbein', null, 'Moo dreams of stardom, but his mother sends him away to focus on school. There, he meets Kang, and as romance blooms, his rising career threatens their future.', 'Moo dreams of stardom, but his mother sends him away to focus on school. There, he meets Kang, and as romance blooms, his rising career threatens their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9XVUpkAdNMx6NoRffkoGPr2OPj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237343'),
  ('1127640422779780091', 'Only Connect', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'Victoria Coren Mitchell', 'NR', 'The fiendishly difficult quiz show in which two teams of three contestants have to find the connection between seemingly unrelated clues, where patience and lateral thinking are as vital as knowledge.', 'The fiendishly difficult quiz show in which two teams of three contestants have to find the connection between seemingly unrelated clues, where patience and lateral thinking are as vital as knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEHa9QTvbdzuZFRX3hL7KBV3UxU.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:8425'),
  ('455032919664900047', 'Only Fools and Horses', 1981, 'Comedy', 'John Sullivan', null, 'David Jason, Nicholas Lyndhurst, Buster Merryfield, Gwyneth Strong, Tessa Peake-Jones, Patrick Murray, Sue Holderness, Roger Lloyd Pack', null, 'Only Fools and Horses.... Is a British sitcom created and written by John Sullivan. Seven series were originally transmitted on BBC One from 1981 to 1991, with sixteen sporadic Christmas specials aired until 2003. In working-class Peckham in south-east London, ambitious market trader Derek ''Del Boy'' Trotter and his younger half-brother Rodney, explore their highs and lows in life, in particular their attempts to get rich. Initially not an immediate hit and receiving little promotion early on, it later achieved consistently high ratings, and the 1996 episode "Time on Our Hands" (originally billed as the series finale) holds the record for the biggest UK audience for a sitcom episode, attracting 24.3 million viewers. The series bears a significant influence on British culture, contributing several words and phrases to the English language.', 'Only Fools and Horses.... Is a British sitcom created and written by John Sullivan. Seven series were originally transmitted on BBC One from 1981 to 1991, with sixteen sporadic Christmas specials aired until 2003. In working-class Peckham in south-east London, ambitious market trader Derek ''Del Boy'' Trotter and his younger half-brother Rodney, explore their highs and lows in life, in particular their attempts to get rich. Initially not an immediate hit and receiving little promotion early on, it later achieved consistently high ratings, and the 1996 episode "Time on Our Hands" (originally billed as the series finale) holds the record for the biggest UK audience for a sitcom episode, attracting 24.3 million viewers. The series bears a significant influence on British culture, contributing several words and phrases to the English language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QznQBwr4aqPIQTiymL7obM3qOK.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:72'),
  ('514052762160505597', 'Only for Love', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Qiao Yao', 'Yang Qianzi', 'Bai Lu, Dylan Wang, Miles Wei, Liu Dongqin, Jiang Peiyao, Shen Yujie, Liu Minghao, Kou Zhenhai', null, 'Zheng Shuyi, a reporter who excels at her job and is determined to land a front-page story, has tried very hard to earn an exclusive interview with top financial executive Shi Yan. Their love story then blossoms due to a mistake. Zheng Shuyi has written numerous reports through her in-depth research of various industries while Shi Yan is constantly looking for socially responsible start-ups to invest in as he hopes to give back to society as much as he can. Shi Yan finds that Zheng Shuyi''s opinions conveyed through her reports coincide with his own, so he agrees to let her write a series of reports on their company. The two eventually open up new opportunities in their career and also find love.', 'Zheng Shuyi, a reporter who excels at her job and is determined to land a front-page story, has tried very hard to earn an exclusive interview with top financial executive Shi Yan. Their love story then blossoms due to a mistake. Zheng Shuyi has written numerous reports through her in-depth research of various industries while Shi Yan is constantly looking for socially responsible start-ups to invest in as he hopes to give back to society as much as he can. Shi Yan finds that Zheng Shuyi''s opinions conveyed through her reports coincide with his own, so he agrees to let her write a series of reports on their company. The two eventually open up new opportunities in their career and also find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSDZcX0FIJJRMNiL7n9J39LyK46.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233194'),
  ('613273237849337667', 'Only Friends', 2023, 'Drama', 'TheNeoClassic', null, 'Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Sahaphap Wongratch, Trai Nimtawat, Way-ar Sangngern, Gawin Caskey, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Tharatorn Jantharaworakarn, Patsit Permpoonsavat', 'TV-PG', 'A group of business students running a hostel blur the lines between friendship and romance.', 'A group of business students running a hostel blur the lines between friendship and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RgM3uOPOmQ9ipzyom25WLC3hpk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:217807'),
  ('1036239915389301526', 'Only Friends: Dream On', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sahaphap Wongratch, Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Way-ar Sangngern, Gawin Caskey, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Tharatorn Jantharaworakarn, Trai Nimtawat, Kanaphan Puitrakul', null, 'Senior theater student Jack sets out to create an ambitious stage production, Romeo and Romeo-a bold, male-male re-imagining of the classic Romeo and Juliet. What begins as a dream project soon becomes an emotional minefield when Jack casts friends, exes and their admirers. As rehearsals intensify, unresolved feelings, unspoken crushes, desire, jealousy, and rivalry spiral out of control. Caught between art and emotion, six friends find their relationships tested to the limit.', 'Senior theater student Jack sets out to create an ambitious stage production, Romeo and Romeo-a bold, male-male re-imagining of the classic Romeo and Juliet. What begins as a dream project soon becomes an emotional minefield when Jack casts friends, exes and their admirers. As rehearsals intensify, unresolved feelings, unspoken crushes, desire, jealousy, and rivalry spiral out of control. Caught between art and emotion, six friends find their relationships tested to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ycVkOhKfm9FAa69m6eMiKfflOT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315472'),
  ('665741019404278013', 'Only Joling', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Gerard Joling, Glenn Vervoort, Willem Joling, Gerdi Joling, Wino Omtzigt, Marc Goud, Roos, Emma', null, 'In the real-life soap Only Joling, Gerard is followed in the run-up to his 65th birthday and his 40th anniversary in the entertainment world and that is of course accompanied by many hilarious and extravagant moments.', 'In the real-life soap Only Joling, Gerard is followed in the run-up to his 65th birthday and his 40th anniversary in the entertainment world and that is of course accompanied by many hilarious and extravagant moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4azdgQYBHIioKwqnS57rm4yPvZZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:282316'),
  ('892161073739916410', 'Only Love', 2014, 'Family, Romance', null, 'Choi Yoon-jung', 'Seo Ha-jun, Lim Se-mi, Lee Kyu-han, Nam Bo-ra, Yoon Jong-hoon, Kim Ye-won, Lee Hyun-wook, Song Ok-suk', null, 'Kim Tae-yang is a physician and Choi Yoo-ri is a broadcasting producer. Choi Jae-min is a dandy-ish executive at a clothing company and Kim Saet-byul is an unwed mother. Kim Woo-joo is much younger than Hong Mi-rae. As these three couples fall in love, they explore issues of age difference, blood ties and adoption, and wealth and poverty.', 'Kim Tae-yang is a physician and Choi Yoo-ri is a broadcasting producer. Choi Jae-min is a dandy-ish executive at a clothing company and Kim Saet-byul is an unwed mother. Kim Woo-joo is much younger than Hong Mi-rae. As these three couples fall in love, they explore issues of age difference, blood ties and adoption, and wealth and poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iauYBDkz2gxvuAiuPtReQHNbDXR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61130'),
  ('308793391004214239', 'Only Murders in the Building', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Steve Martin, John Hoffman', null, 'Steve Martin, Martin Short, Selena Gomez, Michael Cyril Creighton', 'TV-MA', 'Three strangers share an obsession with true crime and suddenly find themselves wrapped up in one.', 'Three strangers share an obsession with true crime and suddenly find themselves wrapped up in one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yjFVQZuW8aofZ5Cgol8iImsVFp.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:107113'),
  ('983294796305480003', 'Only When I Laugh', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Eric Chappell', null, 'James Bolam, Peter Bowles, Christopher Strauli, Richard Wilson', null, 'Only When I Laugh is an ITV1 sitcom broadcast from 29 October 1979 to 16 December 1982 for four series with seven episodes each, and a Christmas special in 1981. The title is the answer to the question, "Does it hurt?" A naïve middle-class man is admitted to an NHS hospital ward, shared with a working-class layabout and an upper-class hypochondriac. The trio never fail to cause a nuisance for the poor, unsuspecting staff.', 'Only When I Laugh is an ITV1 sitcom broadcast from 29 October 1979 to 16 December 1982 for four series with seven episodes each, and a Christmas special in 1981. The title is the answer to the question, "Does it hurt?" A naïve middle-class man is admitted to an NHS hospital ward, shared with a working-class layabout and an upper-class hypochondriac. The trio never fail to cause a nuisance for the poor, unsuspecting staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4foqTmcf97Tn2yyoFrXsaMbqxfM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:20460'),
  ('1015009037459509532', 'Only You', 2025, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sirilak Kwong, Kornnaphat Sethratanapong, Marilyn Kate Gardner, Thanchanok Yutthasarnsiri, Nisachon Tuamsoongnuen, Paswitch Boorananut, Thidarut Pruethong, Peerakrit Phacharaboonyakiat', null, 'A bodyguard''s assignment to protect a former schoolmate — now a famous performer — deepens as unexpected feelings ignite between them.', 'A bodyguard''s assignment to protect a former schoolmate — now a famous performer — deepens as unexpected feelings ignite between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uunNzunr9B94vzMysdremYfTLdZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271341'),
  ('28212199789528159', 'Only You: An Animated Shorts Collection', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'What’s a story only you can tell? Inspired by this prompt, a diverse group of artists bring their personal stories to life across a spectacular range of animated styles and genres, including horror, comedy and fantasy.', 'What’s a story only you can tell? Inspired by this prompt, a diverse group of artists bring their personal stories to life across a spectacular range of animated styles and genres, including horror, comedy and fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDPLmXjSzkp3R29t2DYgK70dEMD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220897'),
  ('833205836944143375', 'Onmyo Kaiten Re:Birth Verse', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taihi Kimura, Maaya Uchida, Ryohei Kimura, Kaito Ishikawa, Anna Nagase, Marina Inoue, Chihaya Yoshitake', null, 'Narihira Takeru is a delinquent who often thinks about Tsukimiya, the girl who appears in his dreams. After an unexpected accident, Takeru finds himself in a parallel universe, and the world that Tsukimiya lives in. When Takeru and Tsukimiya are slain by a monster, he awakens again and realizes he has leapt through time. Now, Takeru must train with Abe Seimei to fight for Tsukimiya’s life!', 'Narihira Takeru is a delinquent who often thinks about Tsukimiya, the girl who appears in his dreams. After an unexpected accident, Takeru finds himself in a parallel universe, and the world that Tsukimiya lives in. When Takeru and Tsukimiya are slain by a monster, he awakens again and realizes he has leapt through time. Now, Takeru must train with Abe Seimei to fight for Tsukimiya’s life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5DnBhyW5BtTQH1k2sx2BSwCWxM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285828'),
  ('46673702444973246', 'Onmyoji', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Shintaro Asanuma, Yui Ishikawa, Kenji Hamada, Daisuke Kishio, Rina Sato', 'TV-MA', 'In the gilded enclave of the imperial court, Minamoto Hiromasa befriends the mystic Abe Seimei, solving tricky cases rising from the demonic realm.', 'In the gilded enclave of the imperial court, Minamoto Hiromasa befriends the mystic Abe Seimei, solving tricky cases rising from the demonic realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRMdU69ZbPzZNU5p6yEhtoNcj6O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210946'),
  ('785321386801171561', 'Onmyou Taisenki', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yoshihiko Tomisawa', null, 'Yukimasa Kishino, Kenta Miyake, Akeno Watanabe, Jun Fukuyama, Akemi Kanda, Anri Katsu, Banjo Ginga, Hisafumi Oda', 'TV-PG', 'All his life, Riku Tachibana has been raised by his grandfather. For some reason, the old man has always been fond of strange hand gestures, and they''ve rubbed off on Riku, who performs them almost subconsciously, to his classmates'' great amusement. One day, however, it suddenly becomes clear to Riku what his grandfather has been surreptitiously teaching him. And the teachings could mean the difference between life and death for Riku.', 'All his life, Riku Tachibana has been raised by his grandfather. For some reason, the old man has always been fond of strange hand gestures, and they''ve rubbed off on Riku, who performs them almost subconsciously, to his classmates'' great amusement. One day, however, it suddenly becomes clear to Riku what his grandfather has been surreptitiously teaching him. And the teachings could mean the difference between life and death for Riku.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj8UtXq7HbEDhnc0a7KKbGV5ya1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34175'),
  ('875089649376467405', 'Onyx Equinox', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Sofia Alexander', null, 'Alejandro Vargas-Lugo, Juan Arturo Maldonado, Olivia Brown, Sofia Alexander, Carolina Ravassa, Patrick Pedraza, Kimberly Woods', 'TV-MA', 'A young Aztec boy is saved from death by the gods and chosen to act as ‘humanity’s champion,’ forced to discard his apathy toward his fellow man and prove humanity’s potential in a fight that spans across fantastical-yet-authentic Mesoamerican cultures.', 'A young Aztec boy is saved from death by the gods and chosen to act as ‘humanity’s champion,’ forced to discard his apathy toward his fellow man and prove humanity’s potential in a fight that spans across fantastical-yet-authentic Mesoamerican cultures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCPi4hXHjLQWv7j2TVsWoLE99Uw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99777'),
  ('604530287849239255', 'Ōoku: The Inner Chambers', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Eriko Matsui, Yuki Kaji, Kikuko Inoue, Jun Fukuyama, Tomokazu Seki, Miyuki Satou, Sanae Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'In an alternate history where the male population is nearly decimated, eligible men serve as concubines to the woman shogun inside the walls of the Ooku.', 'In an alternate history where the male population is nearly decimated, eligible men serve as concubines to the woman shogun inside the walls of the Ooku.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elhdgeFlJ4jvUGzaVEMweGY9vFS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223121'),
  ('263698018483270996', 'Op zee gebleven', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:318186'),
  ('397225173425635743', 'Open All Hours', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Roy Clarke', null, 'Ronnie Barker, David Jason, Lynda Baron', null, 'Open All Hours is a British television sitcom created and written by Roy Clarke, starring Ronnie Barker as penny-pinching corner-shopkeeper Albert Arkwright, and David Jason as his nephew and assistant Granville. The programme originated as a 1973 episode of Barker’s comedy anthology Seven of One, and later ran for 26 episodes; the first series broadcast on BBC2, the remaining three series broadcast on BBC1.', 'Open All Hours is a British television sitcom created and written by Roy Clarke, starring Ronnie Barker as penny-pinching corner-shopkeeper Albert Arkwright, and David Jason as his nephew and assistant Granville. The programme originated as a 1973 episode of Barker’s comedy anthology Seven of One, and later ran for 26 episodes; the first series broadcast on BBC2, the remaining three series broadcast on BBC1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHjQwVkQRJW12yz3Wg74QdQq90j.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2180'),
  ('610023116593989368', 'Open Marriage', 2023, null, 'Anna Kurbatova, Ivan Kitaev', null, 'Marina Aleksandrova, Anton Vasilyev, Vladimir Yaglych, Polina Maksimova, Gosha Kutsenko, Yuliya Gavrilina, Konstantin Kryukov, Sofia Lebedeva', null, 'Seva and Oksana are over forty. They have three children, a large apartment in the center of Moscow, and both have established careers. An enviable life, they are an exemplary couple. Caught in the midst of minor conflicts, accumulated claims and low self-esteem, Oksana cheats on Seva for the first time in 20 years of marriage and ... confesses this to her husband. Instead of the inevitable drama, Oksana suggests that Seva try... an open marriage. Seva reluctantly agrees, because he himself has been living by double standards for a long time, he has a mistress, his youngest son''s teacher. After all, it''s a win-win for him. Spouses step into the uncharted territory of an open marriage — hello, freedom!', 'Seva and Oksana are over forty. They have three children, a large apartment in the center of Moscow, and both have established careers. An enviable life, they are an exemplary couple. Caught in the midst of minor conflicts, accumulated claims and low self-esteem, Oksana cheats on Seva for the first time in 20 years of marriage and ... confesses this to her husband. Instead of the inevitable drama, Oksana suggests that Seva try... an open marriage. Seva reluctantly agrees, because he himself has been living by double standards for a long time, he has a mistress, his youngest son''s teacher. After all, it''s a win-win for him. Spouses step into the uncharted territory of an open marriage — hello, freedom!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFcLOQnqA4lUUo2hxvtkEj6tby7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230318'),
  ('827756345954342090', 'Open Your Eyes', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', null, 'Kasper Bajon, Igor Brejdygant', 'Maria Wawreniuk, Ignacy Liss, Marcin Czarnik, Wojciech Dolatowski, Zuzanna Galewicz, Sara Celler-Jezierska, Marta Nieradkiewicz, Magdalena Kumorek', null, 'After a tragic accident, an amnesiac teen tries to rebuild her life at a memory disorders center but becomes suspicious of her unconventional treatment.', 'After a tragic accident, an amnesiac teen tries to rebuild her life at a memory disorders center but becomes suspicious of her unconventional treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50nfmMwCoQ5DDoVL0lrpCuKjJIs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129676'),
  ('1105341446313260922', 'Operación Pacífico', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Soap', 'Alberto González', null, 'Majida Issa, Mark Tacher, Julio Bracho, Christian Tappán, Luciano D''Alessandro, Shany Nadan, Emmanuel Orenday, Jorge López', null, 'The story of Captain Amalia Ortega, leader of a secret unit, whose mission is to capture the most wanted Mexican drug trafficker, putting both her profession and family''s life at risk.', 'The story of Captain Amalia Ortega, leader of a secret unit, whose mission is to capture the most wanted Mexican drug trafficker, putting both her profession and family''s life at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obYae85E176ODqVVZDAPxUQ741f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99310'),
  ('653679777929591480', 'Operación triunfo', 2001, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chenoa, Noemí Galera, Cristina Lora', null, 'Reality-show talent contest aimed to find the country''s next solo singing sensation, putting a selection of hopefuls through their paces by getting them to sing a variety of cover versions of popular songs, with tutoring from various professionals.', 'Reality-show talent contest aimed to find the country''s next solo singing sensation, putting a selection of hopefuls through their paces by getting them to sing a variety of cover versions of popular songs, with tutoring from various professionals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Qfq22zP5PeUKJfN5bFPFJtJz5i.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:12513'),
  ('723101466311701841', 'Operation Buffalo', 2020, 'Drama', 'Peter Duncan, Tanya Phegan', null, 'Ewen Leslie, Jessica De Gouw, James Cromwell, Tony Martin, Shaka Cook, Alan Dukes, Sam Parsonson, Alexander Bertrand', null, 'A captivating drama set in Maralinga, South Australia, at the height of the Cold War. At a remote army base carrying out British nuclear testing, paranoia runs rife and nuclear bombs are not the only things being tested, as loyalty, love, and betrayal are pitted against each other.', 'A captivating drama set in Maralinga, South Australia, at the height of the Cold War. At a remote army base carrying out British nuclear testing, paranoia runs rife and nuclear bombs are not the only things being tested, as loyalty, love, and betrayal are pitted against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tL3YiXGRK8b0ylhrDaoYyIqrQHY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99940'),
  ('589279884480664066', 'Operation Love', 2007, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Masami Nagasawa, Naohito Fujiki, Nana Eikura, Yuta Hiraoka, Gaku Hamada, Hiroshi Mikami, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'A missed confession of love haunts a young man on his best girl friend''s wedding day. Sudden appearance of a mysterious Angel enables him to go back in time to regain the love of his life. Will he succeed? A romantic comedy of young Ken who missed a chance to confess his love in the past and ended up attending the wedding of his childhood love. Deep with regret as he helplessly watches the wedding party proceed, suddenly time stops and an Angel appears asking him whether he would like to just start over. Astounded as he is, Ken asks to do so, thereby embarking on a journey that will supposedly change everything. All does not go well however, as fate seems to be a resilient force that refuses to change...', 'A missed confession of love haunts a young man on his best girl friend''s wedding day. Sudden appearance of a mysterious Angel enables him to go back in time to regain the love of his life. Will he succeed? A romantic comedy of young Ken who missed a chance to confess his love in the past and ended up attending the wedding of his childhood love. Deep with regret as he helplessly watches the wedding party proceed, suddenly time stops and an Angel appears asking him whether he would like to just start over. Astounded as he is, Ken asks to do so, thereby embarking on a journey that will supposedly change everything. All does not go well however, as fate seems to be a resilient force that refuses to change...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA0a6nR7YQaV9YhIlgkkJ27toQD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14037'),
  ('325264382375068900', 'Operation Petticoat', 1977, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'Paul King, Joseph Stone', null, 'Melinda Naud, Jim Varney, Randolph Mantooth, Jo Ann Pflug, Fred Kareman, Scott McGinnis, Robert Hogan, Warren Berlinger', null, 'Based on the 1959 WWII comedy of the same name; during the Second World War, a Navy officer commands a pink sub with a crew of five rescued Army nurses and a combat-phobic supply officer.', 'Based on the 1959 WWII comedy of the same name; during the Second World War, a Navy officer commands a pink sub with a crew of five rescued Army nurses and a combat-phobic supply officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/149mTyxjVTNM4Ib96GR46Cn484G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:40190'),
  ('1142013351843857274', 'Opgelicht in de Liefde?', 2025, 'Crime, Reality', null, null, 'Ellie Lust, John Warrink', null, 'In Opgelicht in de Liefde for RTL5, Ellie Lust confronts fraudsters who have manipulated, seduced, lied to and financially exploited their victims. "The police and the judiciary can do little or nothing, because, usually, no criminal offense is committed," the channel said.', 'In Opgelicht in de Liefde for RTL5, Ellie Lust confronts fraudsters who have manipulated, seduced, lied to and financially exploited their victims. "The police and the judiciary can do little or nothing, because, usually, no criminal offense is committed," the channel said.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcOh0GfWnw9cvm21cDtJx8CjP9J.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284769'),
  ('1028328313689071233', 'Oppenheimer', 1980, 'Drama', null, 'Peter Prince', 'Sam Waterston, John Carson, Shane Rimmer, Alexander Knox, Jana Shelden, Phil Brown, Edward Hardwicke, David Suchet', null, 'This seven-part series highlights scientist J. Robert Oppenheimer from 1938 to 1953 as he develops the Atomic bomb.', 'This seven-part series highlights scientist J. Robert Oppenheimer from 1938 to 1953 as he develops the Atomic bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP5dFYoP6vUUNavVDX98a5q01tq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8771'),
  ('783711926409751777', 'Opposite Sex', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein', null, 'Milo Ventimiglia, Margot Finley, Kyle Howard, Chris Evans, Allison Mack, Lindsey McKeon', 'TV-14', 'After his mother''s death, Jed Perry and his father move to northern California, where Jed enrolls at Evergreen Academy. Along with Jed, only two other boys attend the formerly all-girls school.', 'After his mother''s death, Jed Perry and his father move to northern California, where Jed enrolls at Evergreen Academy. Along with Jed, only two other boys attend the formerly all-girls school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYSX5NFjFbHPVMbo26M3VJtPYYl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4030'),
  ('1032652432289114275', 'Orange', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Seiichiro Yamashita, Makoto Furukawa, Natsumi Takamori, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Rika Kinugawa', 'TV-PG', 'One day, Naho Takamiya receives a letter written to herself from ten years in the future. As Naho reads on, the letter recites the exact events of the day, including the transfer of a new student into her class named Kakeru Naruse. The Naho from ten years later repeatedly states that she has many regrets, and she wants to fix these by making sure the Naho from the past can make the right decisions—especially regarding Kakeru. What''s more shocking is that she discovers that ten years later, Kakeru will no longer be with them. Future Naho asks her to watch over him closely.', 'One day, Naho Takamiya receives a letter written to herself from ten years in the future. As Naho reads on, the letter recites the exact events of the day, including the transfer of a new student into her class named Kakeru Naruse. The Naho from ten years later repeatedly states that she has many regrets, and she wants to fix these by making sure the Naho from the past can make the right decisions—especially regarding Kakeru. What''s more shocking is that she discovers that ten years later, Kakeru will no longer be with them. Future Naho asks her to watch over him closely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GGkAhfjZy9rOvUD7K927vnltZA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66958'),
  ('84023806053052782', 'Orange Days', 2004, 'Drama', null, 'Eriko Kitagawa', 'Ko Shibasaki, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Hiroki Narimiya, Miho Shiraishi, Eita Nagayama, Manami Konishi, Yu Yamada, Juri Ueno', 'TV-14', 'A psychology major meets a prickly violinist on campus. As they communicate through sign language, their new relationship helps them face their fears.', 'A psychology major meets a prickly violinist on campus. As they communicate through sign language, their new relationship helps them face their fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nlKtzVxFyTxEg1U0MyClsFAbOy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2268'),
  ('506080199174936367', 'Orange Is the New Black', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Jenji Kohan', null, 'Taylor Schilling, Laura Prepon, Kate Mulgrew, Natasha Lyonne, Selenis Leyva, Elizabeth Rodriguez, Dascha Polanco, Danielle Brooks', 'TV-MA', 'A crime she committed in her youthful past sends Piper Chapman to a women''s prison, where she trades her comfortable New York life for one of unexpected camaraderie and conflict in an eccentric group of fellow inmates.', 'A crime she committed in her youthful past sends Piper Chapman to a women''s prison, where she trades her comfortable New York life for one of unexpected camaraderie and conflict in an eccentric group of fellow inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekaa7YjGPTkFLcPhwWXTnARuCEU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1424'),
  ('322225927007549789', 'Orange Marmalade', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Seok Woo', null, 'Yeo Jin-goo, Kim Seol-hyun, Lee Jong-hyun, Song Jong-ho, Lee Il-hwa, Gil Eun-hye, An Kil-kang, Yoon Ye-hee', null, 'Despite a 200-year-old treaty between humans and vampires, both races still don''t get along. Amidst the looming tension, Jung Jae Min, a posh yet kindhearted high school student, quickly falls for the mysterious new girl Baek Ma Ri. But can Ma Ri conceal her true vampire identity and give love an honest chance? If these star-crossed lovers can find the courage to make the leap, Jae Min and Ma Ri may just be the key to a final resolution between humans and vampires...', 'Despite a 200-year-old treaty between humans and vampires, both races still don''t get along. Amidst the looming tension, Jung Jae Min, a posh yet kindhearted high school student, quickly falls for the mysterious new girl Baek Ma Ri. But can Ma Ri conceal her true vampire identity and give love an honest chance? If these star-crossed lovers can find the courage to make the leap, Jae Min and Ma Ri may just be the key to a final resolution between humans and vampires...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y59CKPFxdz51BN3K4SeeO5Ift0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62669'),
  ('623592149827702578', 'Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit', 1990, 'Drama', null, 'Jeanette Winterson', 'Charlotte Coleman, Geraldine McEwan, Emily Aston, Kenneth Cranham, Elizabeth Spriggs, Cathryn Bradshaw, Celia Imrie, Freda Dowie', null, 'Seven-year-old Jess is removed from her peculiar Pentecostal home and sent to school.', 'Seven-year-old Jess is removed from her peculiar Pentecostal home and sent to school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMETYbPN7PJeSkEpKeOlSrzStTV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1669'),
  ('351921412667301996', 'Orb: On the Movements of the Earth', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'After learning heretical teachings about the Earth and the Sun, a child prodigy searches for his master''s hidden research while evading the Inquisition.', 'After learning heretical teachings about the Earth and the Sun, a child prodigy searches for his master''s hidden research while evading the Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crV1eBtpI5F4nlMwzrBrh4zZuFV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204635'),
  ('255035307440075107', 'Orbit: Earth''s Extraordinary Journey', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kate Humble, Helen Czerski', null, 'Right now you''re hurtling around the sun at 64,000 miles an hour (100,000 kms an hour). In the next year you''ll travel 584 million miles, to end up back where you started. Presenters Kate Humble and Dr Helen Czerski follow the Earth''s voyage around the sun for one complete orbit, to witness the astonishing consequences this journey has for us all.', 'Right now you''re hurtling around the sun at 64,000 miles an hour (100,000 kms an hour). In the next year you''ll travel 584 million miles, to end up back where you started. Presenters Kate Humble and Dr Helen Czerski follow the Earth''s voyage around the sun for one complete orbit, to witness the astonishing consequences this journey has for us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDeUohNTSNHDHGmsXLH42YaOgLr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44724'),
  ('343878036626382583', 'Ordeal by Innocence', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Bill Nighy, Anthony Boyle, Anna Chancellor, Morven Christie, Crystal Clarke, Christian Cooke, Alice Eve, Matthew Goode', 'TV-MA', 'The black sheep of the Argyll family, Jack Argyll, was accused of murdering their matriarch a year ago, but now a man shows up on their doorstep claiming Jack’s innocence. The family must come to terms with this news and the fact that the real killer might still be among them.', 'The black sheep of the Argyll family, Jack Argyll, was accused of murdering their matriarch a year ago, but now a man shows up on their doorstep claiming Jack’s innocence. The family must come to terms with this news and the fact that the real killer might still be among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCNgaOIViqrFyo9duHUd76h50BZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74430'),
  ('421357260713380072', 'Ordinace v růžové zahradě', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucie Konečná', null, 'Martin Zounar, Zlata Adamovská, Petr Rychlý', null, 'Ordinace v růžové zahradě je původní český televizní seriál z lékařského prostředí, který vysílá televize Nova. Seriál se začal vysílat 6. září 2005. Nejprve vyprávěl životní osudy lékařů soukromé gynekologické kliniky, jejich příbuzných a přátel, od 15. ledna 2008 se seriál pod názvem Ordinace v růžové zahradě 2 zaměřuje na prostředí chirurgie, plastické chirurgie a pediatrie. Děj se odehrává ve fiktivní obci Kamenice.', 'Ordinace v růžové zahradě je původní český televizní seriál z lékařského prostředí, který vysílá televize Nova. Seriál se začal vysílat 6. září 2005. Nejprve vyprávěl životní osudy lékařů soukromé gynekologické kliniky, jejich příbuzných a přátel, od 15. ledna 2008 se seriál pod názvem Ordinace v růžové zahradě 2 zaměřuje na prostředí chirurgie, plastické chirurgie a pediatrie. Děj se odehrává ve fiktivní obci Kamenice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI0YdSKZXWG5DHcjpgILH9IqyZE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:50895'),
  ('510687962452442991', 'Ordinary Greatness', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Zhang Ruoyun, Bai Lu, Wang Jingchun, Xu Kaicheng, Cao Lu, Ning Li, Zhao Yang, Wang Tonghui', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FFZ6BKObmieClCogTrPSezyjLd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203042'),
  ('704649596892160772', 'Ordinary Joe', 2021, 'Drama', 'Matt Reeves', null, 'James Wolk, Natalie Martinez, Charlie Barnett, Elizabeth Lail', 'TV-PG', 'Explore the three parallel lives of Joe Kimbreau after he makes a pivotal choice at a crossroads in his life. The series asks the question of how different life might look if you made your decision based on love, loyalty or passion.', 'Explore the three parallel lives of Joe Kimbreau after he makes a pivotal choice at a crossroads in his life. The series asks the question of how different life might look if you made your decision based on love, loyalty or passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAse8siiwhuT24h0oaindlriFj8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122198'),
  ('629671338928254321', 'Ordinary Lies', 2015, 'Drama', 'Daniel Brocklehurst', 'Daniel Brocklehurst', 'Max Beesley, Jason Manford, Michelle Keegan, Cherrelle Skeete, Sally Lindsay, Mackenzie Crook, Kris Mochrie, Kevin Sutton', null, 'Exploring what happens when a bunch of white lies spiral out of control and the effect it has on an ordinary group of colleagues and friends.', 'Exploring what happens when a bunch of white lies spiral out of control and the effect it has on an ordinary group of colleagues and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1X7rtIG2x5ExfCRgJrTZG75C6BS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62108'),
  ('470839422886680021', 'Oreimo', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Ayana Taketatsu, Satomi Sato, Saori Hayami, Hitomi Nabatame, Kana Hanazawa', 'TV-14', 'Oreimo follows the daily life of an ordinary high school boy named Kyousuke Kousaka. Kyousuke’s younger sister Kirino is a pretty fashion model, but also hides a dark secret of being an otaku of adult games. Kyousuke is the only person to whom Kirino reveals her hidden obsession and other issues.', 'Oreimo follows the daily life of an ordinary high school boy named Kyousuke Kousaka. Kyousuke’s younger sister Kirino is a pretty fashion model, but also hides a dark secret of being an otaku of adult games. Kyousuke is the only person to whom Kirino reveals her hidden obsession and other issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efZcn6XAMhz4n5vHVKRPVvvBfJ2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:56353'),
  ('565764099887697477', 'Orelsan: Never Show This to Anyone', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Clément Cotentin, Christophe Offenstein', null, 'Orelsan, Skread, Gringe, Clément Cotentin, Ablaye', null, 'In the early 2000s, Aurelien Cotentin is a young middle-class man from Caen with an uncertain future. When he gets into rap music with his friends, he''s really starting from the bottom. Yet, through hardships, controversies and constantly being filmed by his admiring little brother, Aurelien becomes Orelsan, one of the most popular French artists of his generation, changing the rap genre forever.', 'In the early 2000s, Aurelien Cotentin is a young middle-class man from Caen with an uncertain future. When he gets into rap music with his friends, he''s really starting from the bottom. Yet, through hardships, controversies and constantly being filmed by his admiring little brother, Aurelien becomes Orelsan, one of the most popular French artists of his generation, changing the rap genre forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av5G8I2doVY3OdxPMQHKduq4al0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:135184'),
  ('1076315783117299067', 'Oreshura', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Chinatsu Akasaki, Yukari Tamura, Hisako Kanemoto, Ai Kayano, Nao Toyama, Risa Taneda, Kaori Nazuka', 'TV-14', 'A young boy called Eita enters high school aiming for the National University School of Medicine. Because of his parents'' divorce and his goal, he shuns anything to do with romance or love. One day Masuzu, the school beauty with the silver hair, who''s just returned to the country, enters his life in a most unexpected way. Chiwa, his childhood friend since elementary school, will not let this go without a fight.', 'A young boy called Eita enters high school aiming for the National University School of Medicine. Because of his parents'' divorce and his goal, he shuns anything to do with romance or love. One day Masuzu, the school beauty with the silver hair, who''s just returned to the country, enters his life in a most unexpected way. Chiwa, his childhood friend since elementary school, will not let this go without a fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eG5MoVNpVQGg1v8jN7fbyYgRdMe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53296'),
  ('582828475902636041', 'ORESUKI Are you the only one who loves me?', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Haruka Tomatsu, Haruka Shiraishi, Sachika Misawa, Yuma Uchida, Shiori Mikami, Shuka Saito, Nao Toyama', 'TV-14', 'Kisaragi Amatsuyu is invited out alone by the cool beauty upperclassman Cosmos and his childhood friend Himawari. Expecting to hear their confessions, he triumphantly goes to meet each of them in turn. But Cosmos and Himawari both instead confess to Amatsuyu that they like his friend. Amatsuyu fights this lonely battle, but there is another girl who is looking at him. She is a gloomy girl with glasses and braids. Amatsuyu finds that he hates her, because she''s always turning her sharp tongue only on him and finding enjoyment in his troubles. But it turns out that she''s the only one who actually does like him.', 'Kisaragi Amatsuyu is invited out alone by the cool beauty upperclassman Cosmos and his childhood friend Himawari. Expecting to hear their confessions, he triumphantly goes to meet each of them in turn. But Cosmos and Himawari both instead confess to Amatsuyu that they like his friend. Amatsuyu fights this lonely battle, but there is another girl who is looking at him. She is a gloomy girl with glasses and braids. Amatsuyu finds that he hates her, because she''s always turning her sharp tongue only on him and finding enjoyment in his troubles. But it turns out that she''s the only one who actually does like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL1LMvajOlOSXCYK4YxG18ZU4it.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93019'),
  ('118214214479376872', 'Ori Princess', 2011, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', '彭雪梅', null, '廖琦, 史旭杰, 刘婷婷', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cum0Q5Epl4TWSUJzdp0eCmvkzv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:87930'),
  ('865135778313347147', 'Orient', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Soma Saito, Rie Takahashi, Satoshi Hino, Hiro Shimono, Azumi Waki, Wataru Hatano', 'TV-14', 'During the Warring States era, the feuding generals were suddenly struck down one after another by the demonic Kishin. In the 150 years since, groups of individuals have continued to resist Kishin control. They are called Bushi bands. When they were young, Musashi and Kojiro would hear tales about the Bushi from Kojiro''s father, and the two of them dream to form the strongest Bushi band. One day, as Musashi struggles with his choices, he witnesses humans being torn apart by oni. Forced to face the truth, Musashi rises up against the powerful oni to make his dream with Kojiro come true!', 'During the Warring States era, the feuding generals were suddenly struck down one after another by the demonic Kishin. In the 150 years since, groups of individuals have continued to resist Kishin control. They are called Bushi bands. When they were young, Musashi and Kojiro would hear tales about the Bushi from Kojiro''s father, and the two of them dream to form the strongest Bushi band. One day, as Musashi struggles with his choices, he witnesses humans being torn apart by oni. Forced to face the truth, Musashi rises up against the powerful oni to make his dream with Kojiro come true!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE5cgpooUbp8XJK7tPlJxjz5kp5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115911'),
  ('157764851921492462', 'Origin', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mika Watkins', null, 'Sen Mitsuji, Natalia Tena, Tom Felton, Siobhán Cullen, Philipp Christopher, Madalyn Horcher, Nora Arnezeder, Fraser James', null, 'A group of troubled passengers wake up on a damaged spaceship abandoned in deep space, each having left behind a dark past in search of a fresh start on a newly colonized planet. As their terrifying situation spirals into paranoia, they come to realize that the greatest threat to their dream of starting over – and indeed their lives – is something far darker than the pasts they were so desperate to escape.', 'A group of troubled passengers wake up on a damaged spaceship abandoned in deep space, each having left behind a dark past in search of a fresh start on a newly colonized planet. As their terrifying situation spirals into paranoia, they come to realize that the greatest threat to their dream of starting over – and indeed their lives – is something far darker than the pasts they were so desperate to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h01iyro5u51wr2e6bXadHjmQ5Dd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82875'),
  ('454570038694951680', 'Origins: The Journey of Humankind', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Erik Nelson', null, 'Jason Silva, Mark Monroe', 'TV-14', 'Hosted by Jason Silva, Origins: The Journey of Humankind rewinds all the way back to the beginning and traces the innovations that made us modern.', 'Hosted by Jason Silva, Origins: The Journey of Humankind rewinds all the way back to the beginning and traces the innovations that made us modern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJ5mJS7mCHhBsmYCrNB8lSMrwak.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70386'),
  ('1066634076047231180', 'Oríllese a la Orilla', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Abel Solis', null, 'Armando Hernández, Michelle Rodríguez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN2UVP8xl58XMxmnX4SRFKDyGCt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:259017'),
  ('190426652015386517', 'Orphan Black', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Graeme Manson, John Fawcett', null, 'Tatiana Maslany, Jordan Gavaris, Josh Vokey, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Ari Millen, Kevin Hanchard, Kristian Bruun', 'TV-MA', 'A streetwise hustler is pulled into a compelling conspiracy after witnessing the suicide of a girl who looks just like her.', 'A streetwise hustler is pulled into a compelling conspiracy after witnessing the suicide of a girl who looks just like her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjFYkWMafg71sihs1aa7IDx17aS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:56296'),
  ('128522437026404847', 'Orphan Black: Echoes', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Anna Fishko', null, 'Krysten Ritter, Keeley Hawes, Rya Kihlstedt, Amanda Fix, Avan Jogia, James Hiroyuki Liao', 'TV-MA', 'In the near future, a group of women weave their way into each other''s lives and embark on a thrilling journey, unravelling the mystery of their identity and uncovering a wrenching story of love and betrayal.', 'In the near future, a group of women weave their way into each other''s lives and embark on a thrilling journey, unravelling the mystery of their identity and uncovering a wrenching story of love and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iz8w67Q6pJBB7JJiczA95YlHrfG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206916'),
  ('325422025438635028', 'Orphan Flowers', 2015, 'Family, Drama', 'Gül Abus Semerci, Yelda Eroğlu', null, 'Ipek Karapinar, Özgür Çevik, Biran Damla Yılmaz, Veda Yurtsever, Gökçe Akyıldız, Naz Çağla Irmak, Hazar Motan, Aleyna Solaker', null, '"Eylül" is a 16 year old girl sexual harassment by her stepfather , and her mother did not believe her and she went with "Eylül" to the orphanage , and left her daughter there. Then Eylül become friends with the girls in the orphanage and every girl have a own story. The girls trying to divorce Eylül''s mother and her husband many times. "Feride" is an assistent in the orphanage who is always helping the girls when they need her.', '"Eylül" is a 16 year old girl sexual harassment by her stepfather , and her mother did not believe her and she went with "Eylül" to the orphanage , and left her daughter there. Then Eylül become friends with the girls in the orphanage and every girl have a own story. The girls trying to divorce Eylül''s mother and her husband many times. "Feride" is an assistent in the orphanage who is always helping the girls when they need her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAmL6JoFB5sW96V7O5yVC5zRB9N.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69246'),
  ('232484688928571296', 'Orphen', 1998, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Showtaro Morikubo, Mayumi Izuka, Omi Minami, Kazue Ikura, Hekiru Shiina, Konami Yoshida, Ryotaro Okiayu, Jouji Nakata', null, 'Orphen finds himself living in a quiet town and taking on a student - Majic Lin, his landlord''s son. Life is quiet and fairly lazy until the day Cleao Everlasting comes home from boarding school, and stumbles into Orphen''s quietly laid plans for the sword that sits on her family''s mantle: the Sword Of Baltanders. It turns out that the sword is actually one of three magical artifacts that Orphen will need if he is to save Azalie, and, in fact, was the very sword Azalie used in her experiment that ended with her unfortunate transformation. Before he can obtain it, however, the Bloody August assaults the town looking for the sword. To find the other Baltander''s relics, Orphen sets off with his apprentice, little miss Everlasting and two short-statured misfits.', 'Orphen finds himself living in a quiet town and taking on a student - Majic Lin, his landlord''s son. Life is quiet and fairly lazy until the day Cleao Everlasting comes home from boarding school, and stumbles into Orphen''s quietly laid plans for the sword that sits on her family''s mantle: the Sword Of Baltanders. It turns out that the sword is actually one of three magical artifacts that Orphen will need if he is to save Azalie, and, in fact, was the very sword Azalie used in her experiment that ended with her unfortunate transformation. Before he can obtain it, however, the Bloody August assaults the town looking for the sword. To find the other Baltander''s relics, Orphen sets off with his apprentice, little miss Everlasting and two short-statured misfits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzgAdxDsNPV518GV1R4xP16VLqK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61337'),
  ('1065689556609367569', 'Oruchuban Ebichu', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Michie Tomizawa, Kotono Mitsuishi, Tomokazu Seki, Mitsuo Iwata', null, 'Ebichu the hamster seems like the perfect house pet: she cleans, shops, cooks, does laundry, and anything to please her master, known only as "Office Lady" (OL). Unfortunately, OL and her unfaithful boyfriend, combined with Ebichu''s uncontrollable exuberance and love for ice cream, often earn her severe and bloody punishment. However, Ebichu doesn''t seem to mind the abuse if she achieves her goal of making her beloved master a little bit happier.', 'Ebichu the hamster seems like the perfect house pet: she cleans, shops, cooks, does laundry, and anything to please her master, known only as "Office Lady" (OL). Unfortunately, OL and her unfaithful boyfriend, combined with Ebichu''s uncontrollable exuberance and love for ice cream, often earn her severe and bloody punishment. However, Ebichu doesn''t seem to mind the abuse if she achieves her goal of making her beloved master a little bit happier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eibWpEh9TdoDdMRM4yrc9UwfPHu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19238'),
  ('42138385296755571', 'Os Aspones', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Alexandre Machado, Fernanda Young', null, 'Selton Mello, Andréa Beltrão, Marisa Orth, Drica Moraes, Pedro Paulo Rangel', null, 'Moira, Anete and Caio are employees of a public office who do nothing in the office, which has lost some government attention over the years. Until a new boss arrives, Tales, with his intern Leda, and makes the old employees suffer with new and many jobs to do.', 'Moira, Anete and Caio are employees of a public office who do nothing in the office, which has lost some government attention over the years. Until a new boss arrives, Tales, with his intern Leda, and makes the old employees suffer with new and many jobs to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uEEIUJIVlzdoYo0pGXJUsKpUT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5068'),
  ('179580874959535150', 'Os Maias', 2001, 'Drama, Soap', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral', 'Maria Adelaide Amaral, João Emanuel Carneiro, Vincent Villari', 'Fábio Assunção, Ana Paula Arósio, Walmor Chagas, Leonardo Vieira, Simone Spoladore, Selton Mello, Osmar Prado, Matheus Nachtergaele', null, 'Pedro da Maia, meets a beautiful woman called Maria Monforte with whom he gets married despite his father''s objection. The marriage produces a son, Carlos Eduardo, and a daughter. Some time later, Maria Monforte falls in love with Tancredo and runs away to Italy with him, taking her daughter along. When Pedro finds out, he goes with his son to his father''s house where he commits suicide. Carlos stays at his grandfather''s house and is educated by him. Carlos, becomes a doctor and opens his own office. Later he meets a gorgeous woman, Maria Eduarda. The two fall in love and have dozens of nights together. Eventually Carlos finds out later that Maria lied to him about her past and he starts fearing the worst. In the end, Carlos finds out that Maria is his sister. He informs her that they are siblings and that they cannot live like this anymore. Carlos, to forget his tragedies, goes for a trip around the world.', 'Pedro da Maia, meets a beautiful woman called Maria Monforte with whom he gets married despite his father''s objection. The marriage produces a son, Carlos Eduardo, and a daughter. Some time later, Maria Monforte falls in love with Tancredo and runs away to Italy with him, taking her daughter along. When Pedro finds out, he goes with his son to his father''s house where he commits suicide. Carlos stays at his grandfather''s house and is educated by him. Carlos, becomes a doctor and opens his own office. Later he meets a gorgeous woman, Maria Eduarda. The two fall in love and have dozens of nights together. Eventually Carlos finds out later that Maria lied to him about her past and he starts fearing the worst. In the end, Carlos finds out that Maria is his sister. He informs her that they are siblings and that they cannot live like this anymore. Carlos, to forget his tragedies, goes for a trip around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNh0tF6h8H5Jm21Ujt6Y9B6K5Dn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78655'),
  ('144984611037684579', 'Os Mutantes: Caminhos do Coração', 2008, 'Soap, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tiago Santiago', 'Tiago Santiago, Doc Comparato, Altenir Silva', 'Bianca Rinaldi, Leonardo Vieira, Julianne Trevisol, Marcos Pitombo, Sacha Bali, Cássio Ramos, Maytê Piragibe, Juan Alba', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74Y6IWQpjbDnCvNwbQvCJfkJY2b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216699'),
  ('129010663383840001', 'Os Normais', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Fernanda Young, Alexandre Machado', 'Alexandre Machado, Fernanda Young', 'Fernanda Torres, Luiz Fernando Guimarães', 'NR', 'Rui and Vani, are a couple facing normal discussions, problems and situations such as infidelity and convivency problems, but they solve it with great humor.', 'Rui and Vani, are a couple facing normal discussions, problems and situations such as infidelity and convivency problems, but they solve it with great humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ULaMBSsEB3jArOe19jxgJvpW8N.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15166'),
  ('364271493883700754', 'Osamake: Romcom Where the Childhood Friend Won''t Lose', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Inori Minase, Ayane Sakura, Saori Onishi, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'My childhood friend Shida Kuroha seems to have feelings for me. She lives next door, and is small and cute. With an outgoing character, she''s the caring Onee-san type, this being one of her greatest strengths. ...But, I already have my first love, the beautiful idol of our school, and the award-winning author, Kachi Shirokusa! Thinking about it rationally, I should have no chances with her, but, while walking home from school, she only talks to me, with a smile even! I might actually have a chance, don''t you think?! Or so I thought, but then I heard that Shirokusa already has a boyfriend, and my life took a turn for the worse. I want to die. Why is it not me?! Even though she was my first love... As I was drowning in despair and depression, Kuroha whispered. —If it''s that tough for you, then how about we get revenge? The best revenge ever, that is~', 'My childhood friend Shida Kuroha seems to have feelings for me. She lives next door, and is small and cute. With an outgoing character, she''s the caring Onee-san type, this being one of her greatest strengths. ...But, I already have my first love, the beautiful idol of our school, and the award-winning author, Kachi Shirokusa! Thinking about it rationally, I should have no chances with her, but, while walking home from school, she only talks to me, with a smile even! I might actually have a chance, don''t you think?! Or so I thought, but then I heard that Shirokusa already has a boyfriend, and my life took a turn for the worse. I want to die. Why is it not me?! Even though she was my first love... As I was drowning in despair and depression, Kuroha whispered. —If it''s that tough for you, then how about we get revenge? The best revenge ever, that is~', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmVZuD4vr3fMwaPNvSuPZmQ76ai.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110975'),
  ('87144891571444566', 'Oscar''s Oasis', 2010, 'Animation', null, null, 'Marie Facundo, Sly Johnson', 'TV-G', 'Oscar, a lizard in the middle of the desert, finds himself misadventures wherever he goes.', 'Oscar, a lizard in the middle of the desert, finds himself misadventures wherever he goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wk7dZ7qoocFZqzvr37SfO5nKncr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39914'),
  ('168336744722970294', 'Oshin', 1983, 'Drama, Family, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ayako Kobayashi, Yuko Tanaka, Nobuko Otowa, Shirô Namiki, Oji Michio, Yoshioka Yuichi, Watanabe Tomiko, Kazuko Takamori', null, 'Oshin is a Japanese serialized morning television drama, which aired on broadcaster NHK from April 4, 1983 to March 31, 1984. The series follows the life of Shin Tanokura during the Meiji period up to the early 1980s. Shin was called "Oshin", which is an archaic Japanese cognomen.', 'Oshin is a Japanese serialized morning television drama, which aired on broadcaster NHK from April 4, 1983 to March 31, 1984. The series follows the life of Shin Tanokura during the Meiji period up to the early 1980s. Shin was called "Oshin", which is an archaic Japanese cognomen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hut6ivvxG1da3ZC6tyJHlh9C7kw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6231'),
  ('143391593646468665', 'OSHINOKO', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Sakurai, Nagisa Saito, Nanoka Hara, ano, Mizuki Kayashima, Asuka Saito, Kana Kurashina, Nobuaki Kaneko', 'TV-14', 'Two fans of pop idol Ai are reincarnated as her "secret" baby twins, Aqua and Ruby, and grow up supporting her until the tragic day she is stabbed by a stalker. Flash forward a few years later, and Aqua and Ruby are high-school students determined to make it on their own in the cut-throat world of entertainment for personal reasons.', 'Two fans of pop idol Ai are reincarnated as her "secret" baby twins, Aqua and Ruby, and grow up supporting her until the tragic day she is stabbed by a stalker. Flash forward a few years later, and Aqua and Ruby are high-school students determined to make it on their own in the cut-throat world of entertainment for personal reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSrDlOqPZOS4SpUX9CMlGKLerHZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244377'),
  ('348482451628223212', 'Osmosis', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Audrey Fouché', null, 'Agathe Bonitzer, Hugo Becker, Yuming Hey, Luna Silva, Manoel Dupont, Lena Lapres, Gaël Kamilindi, Stéphane Pitti', null, 'In Paris of the near future, a dating app matches singles with their soul mates by mining their brain data. But decoding true love comes at a price.', 'In Paris of the near future, a dating app matches singles with their soul mates by mining their brain data. But decoding true love comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Icp1ZemXeyzvqNe7xP3f8HVhzw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85424'),
  ('362532215212449160', 'Osomatsu-kun', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Fujio Akatsuka', null, 'Kaneta Kimotsuki, Mayumi Tanaka, Yo Inoue, Tōru Ōhira', 'NR', 'The adventures of Iyami, a con artist who''s always looking for a quick buck, and Chibita, his short-statured kid partner-in-crime, as they make trouble for their town and constantly cause friction with the Matsuno sextuplets, a clan of rowdy identical 10-year-old brothers led by the eldest, Osomatsu.', 'The adventures of Iyami, a con artist who''s always looking for a quick buck, and Chibita, his short-statured kid partner-in-crime, as they make trouble for their town and constantly cause friction with the Matsuno sextuplets, a clan of rowdy identical 10-year-old brothers led by the eldest, Osomatsu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncgwDP7QF62xqPZVqA8pZBu2nBq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121372'),
  ('1134534680815124881', 'Ossan''s Love', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kei Tanaka, Kotaro Yoshida, Kento Hayashi, Rio Uchida, Daichi Kaneko, Shuko Ito, Kazuya Kojima, Hidekazu Mashima', null, 'First his boss shocks him with a confession of love, then his roommate. Maybe one of them is Soichi''s Mr. Right after all.', 'First his boss shocks him with a confession of love, then his roommate. Maybe one of them is Soichi''s Mr. Right after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slb2EQzIZX9hSGudERgqddS417q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80051'),
  ('1079277766483365761', 'Ossan''s Love Thailand', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Pirapat Watthanasetsiri, Sahaphap Wongratch', 'TV-PG', 'Heng''s dull love life turns chaotic as his boss Kongdech, roommate Mo, and childhood friend Chicha confess their love, leaving him in a whirlwind of emotions.', 'Heng''s dull love life turns chaotic as his boss Kongdech, roommate Mo, and childhood friend Chicha confess their love, leaving him in a whirlwind of emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQHMLqv5nV5UOSAjoPQDzf9OYH5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:237329'),
  ('659655451014836720', 'Oswald', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Dan Yaccarino', null, 'Fred Savage, David L. Lander, Crystal Scales, Debi Derryberry, Laraine Newman, Mel Winkler, Daran Norris, J. Grant Albrecht', 'TV-Y', 'The story of a blue octopus and his dog that looks like a hotdog, named Weenie, and their friends like Daisy the daisy, and Henry the penguin. They go on adventures in their town that usually involve a problem that needs to be solved.', 'The story of a blue octopus and his dog that looks like a hotdog, named Weenie, and their friends like Daisy the daisy, and Henry the penguin. They go on adventures in their town that usually involve a problem that needs to be solved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0FBRubIK3ys3zolPDQFVxt1DgA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13712'),
  ('41644038426244333', 'Otaku Elf', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Ozaki, Ami Koshimizu, Haruka Aikawa, Hitomi Sekine, Teru Ikuta, Rie Kugimiya, Kana Ichinose, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-14', 'Koito Koganei works as the teenage shrine maiden at the Takamimi Shrine, catering to the whims of its resident: a centuries-old elf who loves video games as much as she hates going outside! Line up your offerings for the otaku elf—some energy drinks, chips and video games will do nicely—and watch her new friends scramble to keep up!', 'Koito Koganei works as the teenage shrine maiden at the Takamimi Shrine, catering to the whims of its resident: a centuries-old elf who loves video games as much as she hates going outside! Line up your offerings for the otaku elf—some energy drinks, chips and video games will do nicely—and watch her new friends scramble to keep up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88gro99hKLdiS4b8QqOK2AFE6ac.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204112'),
  ('239845381992468522', 'Other People''s Money', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jan Schomburg', 'Pål Sletaune, Astrid Øye, Jan Schomburg', 'Justus von Dohnányi, Nils Strunk, Karen-Lise Mynster, David Dencik, Lars Brygmann, Dia Jovanovic, Philippe Graber', null, 'The cum-ex scandal has caused 146 billion euros in losses in several countries. Inspired by true events, two women from Germany and Denmark are trying to put an end to it.', 'The cum-ex scandal has caused 146 billion euros in losses in several countries. Inspired by true events, two women from Germany and Denmark are trying to put an end to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqUhktvv8y52DqXM3EC1C9MW7iY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286537'),
  ('879015992582973377', 'Other Space', 2015, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Paul Feig', null, 'Trace Beaulieu, Neil Casey, Eugene Cordero, Joel Hodgson, Conor Leslie, Bess Rous, Karan Soni, Milana Vayntrub', 'TV-PG', 'Meet the team of the UMP cruiser, a barely-functional starship led by an aggressively cheerful Captain with a with a barely-competent crew, including a clueless navigator, a brain damaged mechanic, a bickering couple,a man with gills raised to be an organ farm for his brother and ART, the billionaire turned robot. When their ship is drawn into a different universe, they must to learn to work together while dealing with space clouds, robot rebellions, and the occasional alien attack.', 'Meet the team of the UMP cruiser, a barely-functional starship led by an aggressively cheerful Captain with a with a barely-competent crew, including a clueless navigator, a brain damaged mechanic, a bickering couple,a man with gills raised to be an organ farm for his brother and ART, the billionaire turned robot. When their ship is drawn into a different universe, they must to learn to work together while dealing with space clouds, robot rebellions, and the occasional alien attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7I489Kf2uNLNPEQOEJDudijFKlb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62383'),
  ('1068208753607176720', 'Otherside Picnic', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Ai Kayano, Rina Hidaka, Miyu Tomita', 'TV-14', 'Friendless college girl Sorawo finds a door to another world one day — a strangely post-apocalyptic-feeling Otherside with serene emptiness, which becomes her new “special place.” There, she meets one other human, the beautiful and independent Toriko, and they explore the abandoned Otherside together.', 'Friendless college girl Sorawo finds a door to another world one day — a strangely post-apocalyptic-feeling Otherside with serene emptiness, which becomes her new “special place.” There, she meets one other human, the beautiful and independent Toriko, and they explore the abandoned Otherside together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNtsvbLZHaBrltl0ljAqhymXFgV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100077'),
  ('400268357487983534', 'Otherworld', 1985, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Roderick Taylor', null, 'Gretchen Corbett, Tony O''Dell, Jonathan Banks, Jonna Lee, Sam Groom', null, 'Otherworld is an American science fiction series that aired for only eight episodes from January 26 to March 16, 1985 on CBS. It was created by Roderick Taylor as a sort of Lost in Space on Earth. Taylor gave himself a cameo role in each episode.', 'Otherworld is an American science fiction series that aired for only eight episodes from January 26 to March 16, 1985 on CBS. It was created by Roderick Taylor as a sort of Lost in Space on Earth. Taylor gave himself a cameo role in each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJXMzkMfZN8LOZcjFNAn1VRRowJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1613'),
  ('1119158148851505545', 'Otogi Manga Calendar', 1961, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'The show was about historical events through a character who was not aware of what happened on this day in history. Sometimes photographs and film footages were mixed in with the animations to explain what historical event had taken place. The research archives came from the Mainichi Shinbun newspaper where the director''s Fuku-chan manga was printing at the time.', 'The show was about historical events through a character who was not aware of what happened on this day in history. Sometimes photographs and film footages were mixed in with the animations to explain what historical event had taken place. The research archives came from the Mainichi Shinbun newspaper where the director''s Fuku-chan manga was printing at the time.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:210220'),
  ('840807369821796473', 'Otogi Zoshi: The Legend of Magatama', 2004, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kumi Sakuma, Shin-ichiro Miki, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kan Tokumaru, Kenta Miyake, Wasabi Mizuta, Otoya Kawano, Kohsei Hirota', 'NR', 'The time is 972 A.D. in Kyoto, the capital of ancient Japan. Kyoto is becoming a corrupt and run-down city; selfish samurai and onmyoji, who care only about gaining political power are everywhere. To make matters worse the city is suffering from famine and widespread disease. Unable to ignore the condition of the city any longer, the Imperial Court decides to send Minamoto no Raiko, a famous samurai well-known for his archery skills, to recover a legendary gem said to hold mysterious power to save the world. However Raiko also falls ill to disease. Instead his youngest sister, Hikaru, decides secretely to make the journey in his place. Hikaru meets many people, and has many adventures while on her trip for the legendary gem.', 'The time is 972 A.D. in Kyoto, the capital of ancient Japan. Kyoto is becoming a corrupt and run-down city; selfish samurai and onmyoji, who care only about gaining political power are everywhere. To make matters worse the city is suffering from famine and widespread disease. Unable to ignore the condition of the city any longer, the Imperial Court decides to send Minamoto no Raiko, a famous samurai well-known for his archery skills, to recover a legendary gem said to hold mysterious power to save the world. However Raiko also falls ill to disease. Instead his youngest sister, Hikaru, decides secretely to make the journey in his place. Hikaru meets many people, and has many adventures while on her trip for the legendary gem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUguUsinKK36H6oXOkqsefIOA2J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34739'),
  ('798735301510760381', 'Our Beloved Summer', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Na-eun', null, 'Choi Woo-shik, Kim Da-mi, Kim Sung-cheol, Roh Jeong-eui, Ahn Dong-gu, Jeon Hye-won, Park Jin-joo, Lee Jun-hyuk', 'TV-14', 'Years after filming a viral documentary in high school, two bickering ex-lovers get pulled back in front of the camera — and into each other''s lives.', 'Years after filming a viral documentary in high school, two bickering ex-lovers get pulled back in front of the camera — and into each other''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bA15g6OLmhQ2HkURRaCztA2jwqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135897'),
  ('1129634268740742964', 'Our Blooming Youth', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jung Hyun-jung', 'Jung Hyun-jung', 'Park Hyung-sik, Jeon So-nee, Pyo Ye-jin, Yun Jong-seok, Lee Tae-seon, Heo Won-seo, Cho Seong-ha, Jung Woong-in', null, 'Prince Lee Hwan receives a cursed letter from a supernatural entity detailing several dark predictions for his future and is horrified to realize that the curses are indeed coming true one by one. Min Jae-yi, on the other hand, finds herself wanted by the local authorities after being unjustly accused of murdering her family members and unilaterally calling off her arranged marriage.', 'Prince Lee Hwan receives a cursed letter from a supernatural entity detailing several dark predictions for his future and is horrified to realize that the curses are indeed coming true one by one. Min Jae-yi, on the other hand, finds herself wanted by the local authorities after being unjustly accused of murdering her family members and unilaterally calling off her arranged marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT5IgnXCslaUILqQhDUuXRzyEqI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154889'),
  ('958149098562911659', 'Our Blues', 2022, 'Drama', 'Noh Hee-kyung', null, 'Lee Byung-hun, Shin Min-a, Cha Seung-won, Lee Jung-eun, Han Ji-min, Kim Woo-bin, Uhm Jung-hwa, Kim Hye-ja', null, 'Romance is sweet and bitter — and life riddled with ups and downs — in multiple stories about people who live and work on bustling Jeju island.', 'Romance is sweet and bitter — and life riddled with ups and downs — in multiple stories about people who live and work on bustling Jeju island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sT5Mlt5UmKiGfBisccwmD4LnPRD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135840'),
  ('773478312081132943', 'Our Boys', 2019, 'Drama', 'Joseph Cedar, Tawfik Abu Wael, Hagai Levi', null, 'Shadi Mar''i, Adam Gabai, Noa Koler, Lior Ashkenazi, Tzahi Grad, Jony Arbid, Michael Aloni, Shlomi Elkabetz', 'TV-MA', 'Three Jewish teenagers are kidnapped and murdered by Hamas militants in the summer of 2014, leading to the retaliatory killing of 16-year-old Palestinian Muhammad Abu Khdeir and a conflict that forever changes the lives of Jews and Arabs alike.', 'Three Jewish teenagers are kidnapped and murdered by Hamas militants in the summer of 2014, leading to the retaliatory killing of 16-year-old Palestinian Muhammad Abu Khdeir and a conflict that forever changes the lives of Jews and Arabs alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccxAhKRcfjPdlFuIbdrkVdgCGos.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91752'),
  ('731040573005421753', 'Our Cartoon President', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Stephen Colbert, Matt Lappin, Chris Licht', null, 'Jeff Bergman, Emily Lynne, John Viener, Cody Lindquist, Gabriel Gundacker', 'TV-14', 'A hilarious look into the Trump presidency, animation style. Starring two-dimensional avatars of Donald Trump and his merry band of insiders and family members, this cutting-edge comedy presents the truish adventures of Trump, his confidants and bon vivants through the eyes of an imaginary documentary crew.', 'A hilarious look into the Trump presidency, animation style. Starring two-dimensional avatars of Donald Trump and his merry band of insiders and family members, this cutting-edge comedy presents the truish adventures of Trump, his confidants and bon vivants through the eyes of an imaginary documentary crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVmH4R0d34UHH3n9ODWbPC3ALn7.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:75804'),
  ('748486634978649964', 'Our Dad', 2025, 'Reality, Family', null, null, null, null, 'Our Dad is a life observation reality show featuring a "Neighborhood Parents Group" composed of Fu Shou''er, Miao Miao, Chun Wu, Xu Xin, and Yang Zi, with Oscar Tao serving as the "Intern Dad." The show focuses on the interactions and growth between fathers and their children, presenting viewers with the most authentic, heartwarming, and entertaining portrayals of parent-child relationships.', 'Our Dad is a life observation reality show featuring a "Neighborhood Parents Group" composed of Fu Shou''er, Miao Miao, Chun Wu, Xu Xin, and Yang Zi, with Oscar Tao serving as the "Intern Dad." The show focuses on the interactions and growth between fathers and their children, presenting viewers with the most authentic, heartwarming, and entertaining portrayals of parent-child relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqL3kE2KohZPakjsIymWySuiRCt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283765'),
  ('525862578036261280', 'Our Dating Sim', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lee Yun Seul', 'Lee Yun Seul', 'Lee Seung-gyu, Lee Jong-hyuk, Yu Seong-yong, Kim So-young, Sung Ryung', null, 'Lee Wan and Shin Ki Tae were best friends in school, but Lee Wan harbored romantic feelings for Shin Ki Tae and confessed them, causing the two to part on unhappy terms. Seven years later, they''re both navigating the job market, with Shin Ki Tae working as a programming ace at a gaming startup and Lee Wan pursuing his passion for illustration. When Shin Ki Tae''s company starts looking for an illustrator for a new dating-themed game, Lee Wan applies for the job, raising the possibility of a second chance at romance.', 'Lee Wan and Shin Ki Tae were best friends in school, but Lee Wan harbored romantic feelings for Shin Ki Tae and confessed them, causing the two to part on unhappy terms. Seven years later, they''re both navigating the job market, with Shin Ki Tae working as a programming ace at a gaming startup and Lee Wan pursuing his passion for illustration. When Shin Ki Tae''s company starts looking for an illustrator for a new dating-themed game, Lee Wan applies for the job, raising the possibility of a second chance at romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t01f39og3yxan93TbeJ6P4aUtMN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221102'),
  ('947722154429329806', 'Our Dating Story: The Experienced You and the Inexperienced Me', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Saori Onishi, Aoi Koga, Ayaka Fukuhara, Tomori Kusunoki, Fukushi Ochiai, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Tomoaki Maeno', null, 'Ryuto Kashima is the school''s gloomy introvert, and he''s got a crush on Runa Shirakawa, the popular girl. After losing a bet to classmates, he confesses his feelings to Runa one day. Shocked and secretly just as inexperienced as Ryuto, Runa agrees to date him. The relationship grows between two people who are as similar as they are different. Will their young love blossom? Time will tell!', 'Ryuto Kashima is the school''s gloomy introvert, and he''s got a crush on Runa Shirakawa, the popular girl. After losing a bet to classmates, he confesses his feelings to Runa one day. Shocked and secretly just as inexperienced as Ryuto, Runa agrees to date him. The relationship grows between two people who are as similar as they are different. Will their young love blossom? Time will tell!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNKQNAyOO4d1zrpQGXESSkdzfUD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209845'),
  ('708687797901395701', 'Our Days', 2024, 'Family', 'Lang Lang', 'Rao Hui, Jin Jin', 'Bai Baihe, Li Chun, Wang Yuwen, Chen He, Yu Jinwei, Zhang Tao, Ding Yongdai, Liu Jia', null, 'The three daughters of Xiang Zhijun live in Shanghai, Kunshan, and Suzhou. Xiang Qian, 35, is established in her career; Xiang Zhong, 31, is actively pursuing her goals; and Xiang Nan, 26, is cheerful and optimistic. Despite facing personal challenges, the sisters support each other and grow through their experiences, guided by their parents'' advice.', 'The three daughters of Xiang Zhijun live in Shanghai, Kunshan, and Suzhou. Xiang Qian, 35, is established in her career; Xiang Zhong, 31, is actively pursuing her goals; and Xiang Nan, 26, is cheerful and optimistic. Despite facing personal challenges, the sisters support each other and grow through their experiences, guided by their parents'' advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDPjahJx8T59nFls568RdZn564k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245500'),
  ('111262382278575080', 'Our Dazzling Days', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Johnny Huang, Guan Xiaotong, Xu Ruohan, Wang Tianchen, Guo Jinglin, Jia Bing, Zhao Shuzhen, Wu Qianying', null, 'In the 1990s, orphan Zhang Xiaoman grows up in the industrial city of Tiexicheng, earning the title “Son of Tiexicheng” for his loyalty and integrity. Alongside the steady Xia Lei and the brave Yan Xiaodan, he experiences a passionate youth. As economic changes force them to leave their hometown to search for new opportunities, they eventually return, weaving a touching story of unwavering loyalty and finding their way back home.', 'In the 1990s, orphan Zhang Xiaoman grows up in the industrial city of Tiexicheng, earning the title “Son of Tiexicheng” for his loyalty and integrity. Alongside the steady Xia Lei and the brave Yan Xiaodan, he experiences a passionate youth. As economic changes force them to leave their hometown to search for new opportunities, they eventually return, weaving a touching story of unwavering loyalty and finding their way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuIlP0FseRHfKylVZ9V5S4O5kDf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272681'),
  ('914898574570966599', 'Our dear neighbors', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Daniel Besse, Agnès Besse', null, 'Thierry Samitier, Pauline Chappey, Lévanah Solomon, Daniel-Jean Colloredo, Issa Doumbia, Julien Frison, Talina Boyaci, Michèle Garcia', null, 'Large family or recomposed, teenagers tortured by their hormones, mothers overwhelmed family, students and party rascals, pretty sexy neighbor, retired always on the lookout for a gossip ... Life and relations - sometimes friendly, sometimes tense , but always funny of a band of neighbors who cross every day, like millions of French ... In front of the landing, in the elevator, while leaving the garbage cans or leaving to work ...', 'Large family or recomposed, teenagers tortured by their hormones, mothers overwhelmed family, students and party rascals, pretty sexy neighbor, retired always on the lookout for a gossip ... Life and relations - sometimes friendly, sometimes tense , but always funny of a band of neighbors who cross every day, like millions of French ... In front of the landing, in the elevator, while leaving the garbage cans or leaving to work ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lswwTxFiNXJB7LGmwR7smFM7gF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65881'),
  ('116535196477486936', 'Our Dining Table', 2023, 'Drama, Family', 'Mita Ori', 'Ayumi Shimo', 'Atsuhiro Inukai, Hiroki Iijima, Maeyama Kuuga, Ryuji Harada, Seika Furuhata, Ikuma Kobayashi, Tomohiro Ichikawa, Sora Nagano', null, 'A reclusive man’s world begins to open when a riceball-loving boy and his older brother draw him into their warm, homemade weekend tradition.', 'A reclusive man’s world begins to open when a riceball-loving boy and his older brother draw him into their warm, homemade weekend tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pV8ojqCCynL8jp1wsfJQKlUOlcX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222366'),
