  ('826226222650563279', 'Our Flag Means Death', 2022, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'David Jenkins', 'Natalie Torres', 'Rhys Darby, Taika Waititi, Ewen Bremner, Joel Fry, Samson Kayo, Nathan Foad, Vico Ortiz, Con O''Neill', 'TV-MA', 'After trading in the seemingly charmed life of a gentleman for one of a swashbuckling buccaneer, Stede Bonnet becomes captain of the pirate ship Revenge. Struggling to earn the respect of his potentially mutinous crew, Stede’s fortunes change after a fateful run-in with the infamous Captain Blackbeard. Stede and crew attempt to get their ship together and survive life on the high seas.', 'After trading in the seemingly charmed life of a gentleman for one of a swashbuckling buccaneer, Stede Bonnet becomes captain of the pirate ship Revenge. Struggling to earn the respect of his potentially mutinous crew, Stede’s fortunes change after a fateful run-in with the infamous Captain Blackbeard. Stede and crew attempt to get their ship together and survive life on the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6CAdKXyR9RMWXZrWAETlSk7b7v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:109939'),
  ('765890581243600257', 'Our Friends in the North', 1996, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Peter Flannery', null, 'Christopher Eccleston, Gina McKee, Mark Strong, Daniel Craig, Peter Vaughan, Alun Armstrong, David Bradley, Freda Dowie', null, 'An epic tale of a changing Britain over four decades, seen through the eyes of four friends.', 'An epic tale of a changing Britain over four decades, seen through the eyes of four friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xImmi68GbBcetgHocvINFNgnXRB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11838'),
  ('232603566885266196', 'Our Generation', 2025, 'Drama', 'Yun Zhu', null, 'Zhao Jinmai, Zhang Linghe, Dong Jie, Bao Jianfeng, Shen Jiayu, Wu Sheng, Ma Qiyue, Zuo Linjie', null, 'Lin Qile and Jiang Qiaoxi reconnect in high school after a childhood friendship and a lingering misunderstanding. As they navigate youth''s ups and downs alongside their classmates, they grow through shared experiences and step into new horizons.', 'Lin Qile and Jiang Qiaoxi reconnect in high school after a childhood friendship and a lingering misunderstanding. As they navigate youth''s ups and downs alongside their classmates, they grow through shared experiences and step into new horizons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rusZtGamDuSyXkX8zWERdces6u7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261128'),
