  ('1068737318641412564', 'Pam & Tommy', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Siegel', null, 'Lily James, Sebastian Stan, Seth Rogen, Nick Offerman, Taylor Schilling, Jason Mantzoukas', 'TV-MA', 'This comedic series takes on the true story behind the release of the first ever viral video in history — the sex tape of Pamela Anderson and Tommy Lee.', 'This comedic series takes on the true story behind the release of the first ever viral video in history — the sex tape of Pamela Anderson and Tommy Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Hfb3EsnvlPChr01jErXDTsdan.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114925'),
  ('302012493132940216', 'Pamela Rose: The Series', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Julien Rappeneau', 'Olivier Baroux, Martin Darondeau, Kad Merad', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Shirine Boutella, Lionel Abelanski, Mélanie Doutey, Claudia Tagbo, Ophélia Kolb, Panayotis Pascot', null, 'Agents Richard Bullit and Douglas Riper must hunt down a serial killer targeting high-profile YouTubers.', 'Agents Richard Bullit and Douglas Riper must hunt down a serial killer targeting high-profile YouTubers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHLpsOlbwFfaOh7JtVx0EpwQq7u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238193'),
  ('263001600698844372', 'Pan Am', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jack Orman, Nancy Hult Ganis', null, 'Christina Ricci, Margot Robbie, Karine Vanasse, Kelli Garner, Mike Vogel, Michael Mosley, Jeremy Davidson', 'TV-PG', 'In this modern world, air travel represents the height of luxury and Pan Am is the biggest name in the business. The planes are glamorous, the pilots are rock stars and the stewardesses are the most desirable women in the world. They''re trained to handle everything from in-air emergencies to unwanted advances—all without rumpling their pristine uniforms or mussing their hair.', 'In this modern world, air travel represents the height of luxury and Pan Am is the biggest name in the business. The planes are glamorous, the pilots are rock stars and the stewardesses are the most desirable women in the world. They''re trained to handle everything from in-air emergencies to unwanted advances—all without rumpling their pristine uniforms or mussing their hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmWRWH4CEXzxuMtImHzepWqqfkf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39259'),
  ('1093568463841613353', 'Pan de Peace!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ibuki Kido, Erii Yamazaki, Madoka Asahina, Moe Toyota, Nichika Omori, Natsuko Hara, Yu Shimamura', null, 'The "cute and soft bread four-panel manga" centers around Minami, an air-headed girl who is starting high school and who loves eating bread for breakfast. Baked goods bring happiness everyday to her and her classmates the reliable Yuu, the pastry-baking Fuyumi, and the independent Noa.', 'The "cute and soft bread four-panel manga" centers around Minami, an air-headed girl who is starting high school and who loves eating bread for breakfast. Baked goods bring happiness everyday to her and her classmates the reliable Yuu, the pastry-baking Fuyumi, and the independent Noa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC5Uf6FvirpGZzbza1XUPbZh78z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66110'),
  ('61181538823824304', 'Pan Tau', 1970, 'Family', 'Ota Hofman, Jindřich Polák', null, null, null, 'Pan Tau always had a gentle expression and a friendly smile, he was elegantly dressed in a stroller, with an umbrella and a white carnation in the lapel. Foremost, he was famous for his magic bowler hat. By tapping on his hat, Pan Tau was able to change his appearance into a puppet, to conjure up miscellaneous objects or to do other magic. His most characteristically behavior is that he would help children who were experiencing some sort of difficulties in-between their dreams and reality, like finding a place for skiing, settling family problems on Christmas, and even give a boy a good time at a fair when he is supposed to have piano lessons. To adults, he usually remained invisible.', 'Pan Tau always had a gentle expression and a friendly smile, he was elegantly dressed in a stroller, with an umbrella and a white carnation in the lapel. Foremost, he was famous for his magic bowler hat. By tapping on his hat, Pan Tau was able to change his appearance into a puppet, to conjure up miscellaneous objects or to do other magic. His most characteristically behavior is that he would help children who were experiencing some sort of difficulties in-between their dreams and reality, like finding a place for skiing, settling family problems on Christmas, and even give a boy a good time at a fair when he is supposed to have piano lessons. To adults, he usually remained invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLYcRefMfWuZm1KqVfForigaHIG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54309'),
  ('636241211070514507', 'Panchayat', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chandan Kumar, Deepak Kumar Mishra, Arunabh Kumar', 'Chandan Kumar', 'Jitendra Kumar, Raghubir Yadav, Neena Gupta, Chandan Roy, Faisal Malik, Sanvikaa, Durgesh Kumar, Ashok Pathak', 'TV-14', 'Panchayat is a comedy-drama, which captures the journey of an engineering graduate Abhishek, who for lack of a better job option joins as secretary of a panchayat office in a remote village of Uttar Pradesh. Stuck between crazy villagers and a difficult village lifestyle Abhishek starts his job with the sole motivation of getting out of there as soon as possible, for which he even prepares for CAT.', 'Panchayat is a comedy-drama, which captures the journey of an engineering graduate Abhishek, who for lack of a better job option joins as secretary of a panchayat office in a remote village of Uttar Pradesh. Stuck between crazy villagers and a difficult village lifestyle Abhishek starts his job with the sole motivation of getting out of there as soon as possible, for which he even prepares for CAT.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPPhduQk1eX0MAE2JDaQRh3UZB5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:101352'),
  ('275912653358695973', 'Pancho Villa: The Centaur of the North', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', null, 'Jorge A. Jimenez, Juan Luis Medina, Leonardo Alonso, Pablo Abitia, Josue Guerra, Armando Hernández, Said Sandoval, Gabriela Cartol', null, 'This is the story of Doroteo Arango, of a life that began on the wrong side of the law, to becoming "Pancho Villa", the feared commander and key figure in the Mexican Revolution. Buried within the story is a man fixated on his own myth, a man whose efforts to become a larger-than-life figure would shape history, but also leave him with many vengeful and powerful enemies.', 'This is the story of Doroteo Arango, of a life that began on the wrong side of the law, to becoming "Pancho Villa", the feared commander and key figure in the Mexican Revolution. Buried within the story is a man fixated on his own myth, a man whose efforts to become a larger-than-life figure would shape history, but also leave him with many vengeful and powerful enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evmzCQZhU0sBXG8CDZIrjrrH5Di.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128329'),
  ('440055378129352713', 'Panda', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mathieu Leblanc, Thomas Mansuy', null, 'Julien Doré, Ophélia Kolb, Gustave Kervern, Hélène Vincent, Maxence Lapérouse, Vincent Heneine, Mathis Bour', 'TV-MA', 'Relaxed pacifist, matcha addict, and convinced vegan, Panda runs a small shack in a remote corner of the Camargue. No phone, no computer, no car; he lives with his 16-year-old in this perfect cocoon of peace and serenity, avoiding anything resembling conflict. How to imagine that this wise man in flip-flops and a faded t-shirt was once a cop? And not just any cop. One of the best. Unfortunately, even in paradise, there''s no way to be completely peaceful. When his former life comes knocking at the door, Panda finds himself obliged to return to duty... But in his own way. Without weapons or violence and not too early in the morning. Zen, you know.', 'Relaxed pacifist, matcha addict, and convinced vegan, Panda runs a small shack in a remote corner of the Camargue. No phone, no computer, no car; he lives with his 16-year-old in this perfect cocoon of peace and serenity, avoiding anything resembling conflict. How to imagine that this wise man in flip-flops and a faded t-shirt was once a cop? And not just any cop. One of the best. Unfortunately, even in paradise, there''s no way to be completely peaceful. When his former life comes knocking at the door, Panda finds himself obliged to return to duty... But in his own way. Without weapons or violence and not too early in the morning. Zen, you know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229641'),
  ('582813873552015767', 'Panda and Hedgehog', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', null, '한준영', 'Donghae, Yoon Seung-ah, Choi Jin-hyuk, Yoo So-young, Yang Hee-kyung, Park Keun-hyong, Hwang Byeong-gug, Park Ha-na', null, 'Ms Panda and Mr Hedgehog is a South Korean romantic comedy television series starring Lee Donghae of Super Junior and Yoon Seung-ah. It was broadcast on Channel A from August 18, 2012 to October 7, 2012. The story is about Go Seung-ji, a prickly patissier who teams up with Pan Da-yang, an easygoing pastry shop owner, to open a successful new cafe.', 'Ms Panda and Mr Hedgehog is a South Korean romantic comedy television series starring Lee Donghae of Super Junior and Yoon Seung-ah. It was broadcast on Channel A from August 18, 2012 to October 7, 2012. The story is about Go Seung-ji, a prickly patissier who teams up with Pan Da-yang, an easygoing pastry shop owner, to open a successful new cafe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2deFrwS2F9S1wr17EipAcR3C4Y3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49934'),
  ('1014419442779579425', 'Pandemic', 2007, 'Drama', 'Armand Mastroianni', 'Jackie Zabel, Bryce Zabel', 'Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Faye Dunaway, French Stewart, Eric Roberts, Renée Taylor, Vincent Spano, Bruce Boxleitner, Bob Gunton', null, 'The bird flu virus spreads through Los Angeles as a doctor from the CDC races to find a vaccine.', 'The bird flu virus spreads through Los Angeles as a doctor from the CDC races to find a vaccine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5aUXmUAC82kqpImokPXkL11isW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41322'),
  ('283727721562540440', 'Pandemic: How to Prevent an Outbreak', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Syra Madad', null, 'In this docuseries, meet the heroes on the front lines of the battle against influenza and learn about their efforts to stop the next global outbreak.', 'In this docuseries, meet the heroes on the front lines of the battle against influenza and learn about their efforts to stop the next global outbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHo4wXphisnd2MFZFa6EHDJLwkA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96557'),
  ('686128900797456637', 'Pandillas guerra y paz', 1999, 'Drama', 'Gustavo Bolívar', null, 'Juan Sebastián Calero, Marlon Moreno, Francisco Bolívar, Jose Luis Paniagua', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDmM6FkLy9i9KPcqI4siORNWH9Y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113558'),
  ('547932815513195086', 'Pandora', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Mark A. Altman', null, 'Priscilla Quintana, Noah Huntley, Ben Radcliffe, Vikash Bhai, Oliver Dench, Sergio Hernandes, Kwame Agyei, Tegen Short', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2199, a young woman who has lost everything finds a new life at Earth''s Space Training Academy where she learns to defend the galaxy from intergalactic threats.', 'In the year 2199, a young woman who has lost everything finds a new life at Earth''s Space Training Academy where she learns to defend the galaxy from intergalactic threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiFgP8qmJ44C60fKof2BIlUGiIe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90670'),
  ('1085152388502818106', 'Pandora Hearts', 2009, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jun Mochizuki', null, 'Junko Minagawa, Ayako Kawasumi, Akira Ishida, Kana Hanazawa, Daisuke Ono', 'TV-14', 'Oz Vessalius, heir to one of the duke houses, has just turned fifteen. His life is rich and carefree, darkened only by the constant absence of his father. At his coming-of-age ceremony, however, everything changes. For no reason that he can discern, he''s cast into the prison known as the "Abyss", only to be saved by a "chain" known as Alice, the bloodstained black rabbit. It is unknown why was he cast into Abyss, how does Alice factor into it all, and what does the organization known as "Pandora" want with him.', 'Oz Vessalius, heir to one of the duke houses, has just turned fifteen. His life is rich and carefree, darkened only by the constant absence of his father. At his coming-of-age ceremony, however, everything changes. For no reason that he can discern, he''s cast into the prison known as the "Abyss", only to be saved by a "chain" known as Alice, the bloodstained black rabbit. It is unknown why was he cast into Abyss, how does Alice factor into it all, and what does the organization known as "Pandora" want with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2lKV5adYVtjbVixacccZwUdFAR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35971'),
  ('988985421175263228', 'Pandora: Beneath the Paradise', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Soon-ok', 'Hyun Ji-min', 'Lee Ji-ah, Lee Sang-yun, Jang Hee-jin, Park Ki-woong, Bong Tae-gyu, Han Soo-yeon, Cha Kwang-soo, Ahn Nae-sang', 'TV-MA', 'Hong Taera gets trapped in a fate like that of Pandora in Greek mythology. With a perfect husband and a lovely daughter, Taera leads a life envied by all. However, her repressed memories resurface. She sets out to take revenge and protect her beloved family.', 'Hong Taera gets trapped in a fate like that of Pandora in Greek mythology. With a perfect husband and a lovely daughter, Taera leads a life envied by all. However, her repressed memories resurface. She sets out to take revenge and protect her beloved family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D2dw3zmReQpTeYn5eVuVhkps1K.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203344'),
  ('765798171807607383', 'Pandora''s Box', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', null, 'Pandora''s Box is a six-part 1992 BBC documentary television series which examines the consequences of political and technocratic rationalism. The episodes deal, in order, with communism in The Soviet Union, systems analysis and game theory during the Cold War, economy in the United Kingdom during the 1970s, the insecticide DDT, Kwame Nkrumah''s leadership in Ghana during the 1950s and 1960s and the history of nuclear power.', 'Pandora''s Box is a six-part 1992 BBC documentary television series which examines the consequences of political and technocratic rationalism. The episodes deal, in order, with communism in The Soviet Union, systems analysis and game theory during the Cold War, economy in the United Kingdom during the 1970s, the insecticide DDT, Kwame Nkrumah''s leadership in Ghana during the 1950s and 1960s and the history of nuclear power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vFwXMA2xDSYQZK04iG42I7855P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5877'),
  ('894956611773137723', 'Panhandle', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicholas Stoller, Carla Kettner', null, 'Luke Kirby, Lorenza Izzo, Tiana Okoye, Glenn Morshower, Landon Chase Dubois, Lesley Ann Warren, Melanie Minichino, Forrest Goodluck', 'TV-MA', 'Since personal tragedy struck five years ago, loquacious, eccentric Bell Prescott hasn''t left the rambling property on the Apalachicola River that he shares with his mother.', 'Since personal tragedy struck five years ago, loquacious, eccentric Bell Prescott hasn''t left the rambling property on the Apalachicola River that he shares with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mt8cGIRth22K0Uv22XZvUI0Xmkg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210095'),
  ('1146549332745869721', 'Pani Poni Dash!', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiwa Saito, Ai Nonaka, Fumiko Orikasa, Kana Ueda, Kayo Sakata, Satsuki Yukino, Yui Horie', 'TV-PG', 'The girls of Class 1-C are starting their tenth-grade year with a new teacher: Becky Miyamoto, an 11-year-old MIT grad! She’s an intellectual titan—but can she handle the temperamental teens and idiotic aliens that await her instruction?', 'The girls of Class 1-C are starting their tenth-grade year with a new teacher: Becky Miyamoto, an 11-year-old MIT grad! She’s an intellectual titan—but can she handle the temperamental teens and idiotic aliens that await her instruction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVxyoXXK4PiJVnQzaPJhENZzbbD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89086'),
  ('570785715752533274', 'Panic', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Lauren Oliver', null, 'Olivia Scott Welch, Mike Faist, Jessica Sula, Camron Jones, Leslie Ann Leal, Enrique Murciano, Ray Nicholson, David Thompson', 'TV-MA', 'In the forgotten town of Carp, Texas, Panic is the only way out. Every summer the graduating seniors risk their lives competing in a series of challenges for the chance to win life-changing money. After the death of two players the stakes—and danger—have never been higher.', 'In the forgotten town of Carp, Texas, Panic is the only way out. Every summer the graduating seniors risk their lives competing in a series of challenges for the chance to win life-changing money. After the death of two players the stakes—and danger—have never been higher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNsVFQsXW5CYtFkrDSu5BmLEtdF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122530'),
  ('247737425153736363', 'Pano', 2016, 'Documentary, News', null, null, null, null, 'Pano is a weekly magazine with penetrating reports around the big themes of our time. Themes that should interest all Flemish people and make them self-reflect. Pano wants to focus on strong, human stories, but also hard research journalism. Reporting own stories and news is a priority. For this show, the redaction teams of the old één program "Koppen" and the old Canvas program "Panorama" were combined into one.', 'Pano is a weekly magazine with penetrating reports around the big themes of our time. Themes that should interest all Flemish people and make them self-reflect. Pano wants to focus on strong, human stories, but also hard research journalism. Reporting own stories and news is a priority. For this show, the redaction teams of the old één program "Koppen" and the old Canvas program "Panorama" were combined into one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeGcWV3peGXwfGVxXfCywiHF5V1.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:82137'),
