  ('443960617431928056', 'Paul American', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jake Paul, Logan Paul, Jutta Leerdam, Nina Agdal, Pam Stepnick, Greg Paul', 'TV-MA', 'Global sports and entertainment superstars Jake and Logan Paul are pulling back the curtain for their latest venture: a family reality TV show.', 'Global sports and entertainment superstars Jake and Logan Paul are pulling back the curtain for their latest venture: a family reality TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5eZ4LHuIEdN8Rzs6DagK0wisPa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283393'),
  ('648248133588089522', 'Paul Merton: Driving Amazing Trains', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Quentin Clarke', null, 'Paul Merton', null, 'Paul’s fascination with trains stems from his childhood. His father was a driver on the London Underground and when, as a young boy, Paul witnessed his dad driving a train across Putney Bridge, it sparked a lifelong fascination of railways. Now, he is following in his father’s footsteps by joining the drivers upfront and in control of some of the world’s most amazing trains and experiencing the best views as he travels through breathtaking landscapes in the UK and Europe. From steep gradients and tight curves to pinpoint platform stops, Paul will learn what it takes to keep these mighty machines on track. Visiting Germany, France, Switzerland, Wales, Northern England and Isle of Wight, he’ll meet the people who keep the railways running - from engineers and conductors to passengers with fascinating stories of their own.', 'Paul’s fascination with trains stems from his childhood. His father was a driver on the London Underground and when, as a young boy, Paul witnessed his dad driving a train across Putney Bridge, it sparked a lifelong fascination of railways. Now, he is following in his father’s footsteps by joining the drivers upfront and in control of some of the world’s most amazing trains and experiencing the best views as he travels through breathtaking landscapes in the UK and Europe. From steep gradients and tight curves to pinpoint platform stops, Paul will learn what it takes to keep these mighty machines on track. Visiting Germany, France, Switzerland, Wales, Northern England and Isle of Wight, he’ll meet the people who keep the railways running - from engineers and conductors to passengers with fascinating stories of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHRwlf3xBPbW4xRXEqoF8soExBH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318099'),
  ('184886793653568998', 'Paula', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Conor McPherson', 'Denise Gough, Tom Hughes, Owen McDonnell, Jane Brennan, Siobhán Cullen', null, 'A chemistry teacher''s life is turned upside down after a one-night stand with James. They become locked in a dance of destruction. Only one can survive.', 'A chemistry teacher''s life is turned upside down after a one-night stand with James. They become locked in a dance of destruction. Only one can survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6M7Rpkzfw3OU9j0MDJvmTfrDAK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71866'),
  ('30387433856969036', 'Pauline', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sebastian Colley, Philipp Kässbohrer, Matthias Murmann', null, 'Sira-Anna Faal, Ludger Bökelmann, Lukas von Horbatschewsky, Johanna Hens, Andrea Sawatzki, Dimitrij Schaad, Nikeata Thompson', null, 'Pauline gets pregnant after a one-night stand with Lukas. Something is very wrong with the pregnancy. When Luke reveals that he is the son of the devil incarnate and heir to hell, nothing is ever the same again. Between the fronts of demons and angels, Pauline''s pregnancy also gives her supernatural abilities. She becomes the decisive force in the epic battle between good and evil.', 'Pauline gets pregnant after a one-night stand with Lukas. Something is very wrong with the pregnancy. When Luke reveals that he is the son of the devil incarnate and heir to hell, nothing is ever the same again. Between the fronts of demons and angels, Pauline''s pregnancy also gives her supernatural abilities. She becomes the decisive force in the epic battle between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sE4qMJJ3fwGZkBgYin3OA2lrGoL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224042'),
  ('405452543263726755', 'Paulo, o Apóstolo', 2025, 'Drama, Soap', 'Cristiane Cardoso', 'Cristiane Cardoso', 'Murilo Cezar, Anna Melo, Michelle Batista, Enzo Ciolini, Floriano Peixoto, Rosanne Mulholland, Arthur Alavarse, Duda Matte', null, 'It follows Saul of Tarsus, a young Pharisee who undergoes a profound transformation, a story of redemption, spiritual battles, and human-divine relationships, highlighting love, betrayal, and sacrifice.', 'It follows Saul of Tarsus, a young Pharisee who undergoes a profound transformation, a story of redemption, spiritual battles, and human-divine relationships, highlighting love, betrayal, and sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRFFSL5cid6hbi6rQQycZKgg2AN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283073'),
  ('50057772821242656', 'Pauw & Witteman', 2006, null, null, null, 'Jeroen Pauw, Paul Witteman', null, 'Pauw & Witteman is a Dutch late-night talk show, hosted by Jeroen Pauw en Paul Witteman. It is generally focused on current affairs and politics. It is broadcast every weekday at 11 pm on Nederland 1. It is produced by Dutch public broadcasters NPS and VARA. During summer Pauw & Witteman are replaced by Knevel & Van de Brink, a talk show hosted by Andries Knevel and Thijs van den Brink, produced by the dutch evangelical broadcasting company, the EO.', 'Pauw & Witteman is a Dutch late-night talk show, hosted by Jeroen Pauw en Paul Witteman. It is generally focused on current affairs and politics. It is broadcast every weekday at 11 pm on Nederland 1. It is produced by Dutch public broadcasters NPS and VARA. During summer Pauw & Witteman are replaced by Knevel & Van de Brink, a talk show hosted by Andries Knevel and Thijs van den Brink, produced by the dutch evangelical broadcasting company, the EO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXEuVWU3ZaY9iKc4zUGO9QyjBlw.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:32913'),
  ('759515467234048766', 'PAW Patrol', 2013, 'Animation, Kids', 'Keith Chapman', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'Marshall, Rocky, Rubble, Zuma and Skye are doing their best to protect the people of their town. Led by Ryder, a tech-savvy 10-year-old boy, each of them is equipped with special equipment and together they help anyone who finds themselves in trouble. No task is too big for them and no puppy is too small.', 'Marshall, Rocky, Rubble, Zuma and Skye are doing their best to protect the people of their town. Led by Ryder, a tech-savvy 10-year-old boy, each of them is equipped with special equipment and together they help anyone who finds themselves in trouble. No task is too big for them and no puppy is too small.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HXkgUBO5OF8ZK9XbY69RM4S5rv.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:57532'),
  ('256637753123377055', 'Pawn Stars', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rick Harrison, Corey Harrison, Austin Lee Russell', 'TV-PG', 'Go inside the colorful world of the pawn business. At the Gold & Silver Pawn Shop on the outskirts of Las Vegas, generations of the Harrison family run the family business, and there’s clashing and camaraderie every step of the way.', 'Go inside the colorful world of the pawn business. At the Gold & Silver Pawn Shop on the outskirts of Las Vegas, generations of the Harrison family run the family business, and there’s clashing and camaraderie every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YxmQmoSbv9bXHYWIEDztstZguC.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:21755'),
  ('329860049891334442', 'Payback', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Debbie O''Malley', 'Debbie O''Malley', 'Morven Christie, Peter Mullan, Prasanna Puwanarajah, Derek Riddell, Steven Mackintosh, Grace Chilton, Eileen Duffy, Steven Miller', null, 'Lexie Noble lives a great life on the outskirts of Edinburgh… until her husband is murdered. As she struggles to make sense of what happened, she learns he had been laundering money for notorious crime boss Cal Morris. As a partner in her late husband''s accountancy firm, both Morris and the police will be interested in controlling her next moves.', 'Lexie Noble lives a great life on the outskirts of Edinburgh… until her husband is murdered. As she struggles to make sense of what happened, she learns he had been laundering money for notorious crime boss Cal Morris. As a partner in her late husband''s accountancy firm, both Morris and the police will be interested in controlling her next moves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyOjMsKgKv7yHD1exMfddRbjS1X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218346'),
  ('322324681218309107', 'Payback: Money and Power', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Won-tae, Kim Won-suk', null, 'Lee Sun-kyun, Moon Chae-won, Son Eun-seo, Kang You-seok, Park Hoon, Choi Chul-min, Kim Hong-pa, Lee Ki-young', null, 'Eun Yong, a money business titan and an affluent financial capitalist, has been living a life of a recluse in the pastures of Mongolia. Eun returns to Korea when his nephew Tae-chun and his late benefactor''s daughter Joon-gyeong enlists his help. He prepares for war against corrupt powers to protect his beloved family and to avenge the death of a dear old friend.', 'Eun Yong, a money business titan and an affluent financial capitalist, has been living a life of a recluse in the pastures of Mongolia. Eun returns to Korea when his nephew Tae-chun and his late benefactor''s daughter Joon-gyeong enlists his help. He prepares for war against corrupt powers to protect his beloved family and to avenge the death of a dear old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYMPoSUPI0MQPMKUFPVa32aXxPb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209751'),
  ('634856896665998177', 'Payitaht: Abdulhamid', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Serdar Akar', null, 'Bülent İnal, Duygu Gürcan, Hakan Boyav, Bahadır Yenişehirlioğlu, Taner Ertürkler, Halil Kumova, Ercan Demirel, Yusuf Aytekin', null, 'The fight of Abdülhamid II to keep the Ottoman Empire and Caliphate alive.', 'The fight of Abdülhamid II to keep the Ottoman Empire and Caliphate alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmaWiokhUVDsVkCfoWaQEDFZFFP.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:70788'),
  ('261758684078875613', 'Paytakht', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Siroos Moghaddam', null, 'Mohsen Tanabandeh, Ahmad Mehranfar, Rima Raminfar, Alireza Khamseh, Mehran Ahmadi, Nasrin Nosrati, Hooman Hajabdollahi, PedramFaizi', 'TV-PG', 'Paytakht is a popular Iranian TV series portraying the life a Mazandarani family.', 'Paytakht is a popular Iranian TV series portraying the life a Mazandarani family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcx50NR7iYm0xqmJCzDXajjpucf.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:100754'),
  ('820065675357401295', 'PB&J Otter', 1998, 'Animation, Kids', 'Jim Jinkins', null, 'Gwen Shepherd, Jackie Hoffman, Corinne Orr, Nancy Giles, Jenell Slack-Wilson, Gina Marie Tortorici, Adam Rose, Chris Phillips', 'TV-Y', 'Peanut, Jelly, and Baby Butter Otter live on a houseboat along with all of their friends. Whenever they get into a situation where they need to think, they perform "The Noodle Dance" until one of them gets an idea.', 'Peanut, Jelly, and Baby Butter Otter live on a houseboat along with all of their friends. Whenever they get into a situation where they need to think, they perform "The Noodle Dance" until one of them gets an idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTAQVBNVb9socC2IpjVqZuU4hKr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4230'),
  ('970849860659835458', 'PBS News Hour', 1975, 'News', 'Jim Lehrer, Robert MacNeil', null, 'Amna Nawaz, Geoff Bennett', 'TV-G', 'America''s first and longest running hour-long nightly news broadcast known for its in-depth coverage of issues and current events.', 'America''s first and longest running hour-long nightly news broadcast known for its in-depth coverage of issues and current events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNPew1EYKdLiV9fiRme6hm2ejWb.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:1655'),
  ('344628562792139744', 'PBS News Weekend', 2013, 'News', null, null, 'John Yang', 'NR', 'A summary of the day’s national and international news, using renowned experts to provide in-depth analysis. Each weekend broadcast contains original, in-depth field reporting on topics including education, healthcare, the economy, energy, science and technology, religion, finance and the arts.', 'A summary of the day’s national and international news, using renowned experts to provide in-depth analysis. Each weekend broadcast contains original, in-depth field reporting on topics including education, healthcare, the economy, energy, science and technology, religion, finance and the arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs5QZaTGOEQLqYmUQXXEeGP7NmU.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:58287'),
  ('182293778274361634', 'PCC, Secret Power', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Gabriel Feltran', 'Guilherme Cesar', null, 'TV-MA', 'A piercing four-part docuseries exploring the rise of Brazil’s largest crime organization, Primeiro Comando da Capital – better known as the PCC. The First Command of the Capital (PCC) holds the hegemony of crime in São Paulo, but also an international presence. Narrated by the "brothers", the secret of the PCC''s power is revealed in its structure: a masonry of crime, implacable in your ideals.', 'A piercing four-part docuseries exploring the rise of Brazil’s largest crime organization, Primeiro Comando da Capital – better known as the PCC. The First Command of the Capital (PCC) holds the hegemony of crime in São Paulo, but also an international presence. Narrated by the "brothers", the secret of the PCC''s power is revealed in its structure: a masonry of crime, implacable in your ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knWnRrzCf1DOWAr4ee3FweVVuCC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201320'),
  ('749769511034180922', 'Pé na Jaca', 2006, 'Soap', 'Carlos Lombardi', 'Sebastião Maciel, Mauro Wilson, Nélio Abbade', 'Marcos Pasquim, Fernanda Lima, Murilo Benício, Juliana Paes, Deborah Secco, Flávia Alessandra, Bruno Garcia, Rodrigo Lombardi', null, 'Pé na Jaca is a Brazilian telenovela that was produced and aired by TV Globo from November 20, 2006 and June 15, 2007. Featured Murilo Benício, Juliana Paes, Fernanda Lima, Marcos Pasquim, Betty Lago, Fúlvio Stefanini, Alexandre Schumacher, Carla Marins, Ricardo Tozzi, Fernanda de Freitas, Daniele Suzuki, Rodrigo Lombardi, Bruno Garcia, Flávia Alessandra and Deborah Secco in the lead roles.', 'Pé na Jaca is a Brazilian telenovela that was produced and aired by TV Globo from November 20, 2006 and June 15, 2007. Featured Murilo Benício, Juliana Paes, Fernanda Lima, Marcos Pasquim, Betty Lago, Fúlvio Stefanini, Alexandre Schumacher, Carla Marins, Ricardo Tozzi, Fernanda de Freitas, Daniele Suzuki, Rodrigo Lombardi, Bruno Garcia, Flávia Alessandra and Deborah Secco in the lead roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ay0yolMrgWfP29ZtFP7AbVeuhj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50731'),
  ('272955205097702192', 'Peace! Friendship! Chewing gum!', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Petr Vnukov, Natalia Lavrova, Aleksey Ivanov', 'Egor Gubarev, Egor Abramov, Fedor Roschin, Valentina Lyapina, Yura Borisov, Stepan Devonin, Ksenia Katalymova, Arthur Beschastny', null, 'The year is 1993. 14-year-old Alex Ryabinin lives a normal teenage life - looking for adventure, trying to protect himself from hooligans, does not want learn music, does not know how to meet girls and which adults to follow as an example. On the one hand - an honest but poor family with a saleswoman mother and a father who is a docent, on the other - the dangerous world of an Afghan veteran Uncle Alik. And there''s also the girl Zhenya, whose encounter triggers a series of irreversible events that will forever change the life of Alex. Running away from hooligans, Alex steals a car of local criminal authority, and in an instant everything changes. Will he be able to cope with all the problems, being in the heart of events? Will he be able to save his family and finally understand who he is? Only one thing is clear - life will never be the same again. Not for Alex himself, nor for the whole of Russia.', 'The year is 1993. 14-year-old Alex Ryabinin lives a normal teenage life - looking for adventure, trying to protect himself from hooligans, does not want learn music, does not know how to meet girls and which adults to follow as an example. On the one hand - an honest but poor family with a saleswoman mother and a father who is a docent, on the other - the dangerous world of an Afghan veteran Uncle Alik. And there''s also the girl Zhenya, whose encounter triggers a series of irreversible events that will forever change the life of Alex. Running away from hooligans, Alex steals a car of local criminal authority, and in an instant everything changes. Will he be able to cope with all the problems, being in the heart of events? Will he be able to save his family and finally understand who he is? Only one thing is clear - life will never be the same again. Not for Alex himself, nor for the whole of Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrWnxsRU4kJkfYiBGjQJapOW5N5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:102359'),
  ('808430111635150132', 'Peacemaker', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Jouji Nakata, Mitsuki Saiga, Yumiko Kobayashi, Junichi Suwabe, Kappei Yamaguchi, Kenji Nomura, Masashi Ebara, Mikako Takahashi', null, 'For 15-year-old Tetsunosuke Ichimura, childhood innocence has given way to a blinding thirst for revenge. Haunted by the vicious slaying of his parents, Tetsu decides to seek out the Shinsengumi, an elite group of swordsmen sworn to protect the capital. The Shinsengumi are engaged in a brutal conflict with the Choshu rebels, the same ruthless killers who murdered Tetsu''s parents. In the name of justice - and against the will of his older brother - Tetsu desperately hopes to join the Shinsengumi. But an incident late one night forces him to face reality. The Shinsengumi show themselves capable of the same brutality as his parents'' murderers. Wading through a sea of espionage, intrigue, and flowing blood, the young boy must decide whether to shed his humanity and become a demon of the Shinsengumi, or to relinquish his hatred and become a Peacemaker in the spirit of his father. Revenge is sweet, but is it worth losing your soul?', 'For 15-year-old Tetsunosuke Ichimura, childhood innocence has given way to a blinding thirst for revenge. Haunted by the vicious slaying of his parents, Tetsu decides to seek out the Shinsengumi, an elite group of swordsmen sworn to protect the capital. The Shinsengumi are engaged in a brutal conflict with the Choshu rebels, the same ruthless killers who murdered Tetsu''s parents. In the name of justice - and against the will of his older brother - Tetsu desperately hopes to join the Shinsengumi. But an incident late one night forces him to face reality. The Shinsengumi show themselves capable of the same brutality as his parents'' murderers. Wading through a sea of espionage, intrigue, and flowing blood, the young boy must decide whether to shed his humanity and become a demon of the Shinsengumi, or to relinquish his hatred and become a Peacemaker in the spirit of his father. Revenge is sweet, but is it worth losing your soul?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zOrmT7rDoeFWNNKOG6dErCXGbR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21788'),
  ('88625536519265303', 'Peacemaker', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'James Gunn', null, 'John Cena, Danielle Brooks, Freddie Stroma, Jennifer Holland, Steve Agee, Frank Grillo, Robert Patrick', 'TV-MA', 'The continuing story of Peacemaker, a vainglorious superhero/supervillain who believes in peace at any cost — no matter how many people he has to kill. After a miraculous recovery from his duel with Bloodsport, Peacemaker soon discovers that his freedom comes at a price.', 'The continuing story of Peacemaker, a vainglorious superhero/supervillain who believes in peace at any cost — no matter how many people he has to kill. After a miraculous recovery from his duel with Bloodsport, Peacemaker soon discovers that his freedom comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYzbGcYnOUlvj2fa76pTgIXogd7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110492'),
  ('461405089928180126', 'Peach Boy Riverside', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruka Shiraishi, Nao Toyama, Mao Ichimichi, Toshiki Masuda, Megumi Toda, Jiro Saito, Haruka Tomatsu, Mayu Mineda', 'TV-14', '"This is a tale that took place long ago. There once lived an old man and an old woman. The old man went into the woods to cut down some grass and the old woman went to the river to... (You know the rest.) The ogres had finally been defeated, but apparently, there were more ogres living elsewhere, so Peach Boy crossed the sea... It was an amazing feat to defeat the ogres and a joyous feat that Peach Boy saved many lives. But the one thing that went wrong... Was that they had fun. This is nothing more than a "What if"... What if there was more than one peach that tumbled down the river?', '"This is a tale that took place long ago. There once lived an old man and an old woman. The old man went into the woods to cut down some grass and the old woman went to the river to... (You know the rest.) The ogres had finally been defeated, but apparently, there were more ogres living elsewhere, so Peach Boy crossed the sea... It was an amazing feat to defeat the ogres and a joyous feat that Peach Boy saved many lives. But the one thing that went wrong... Was that they had fun. This is nothing more than a "What if"... What if there was more than one peach that tumbled down the river?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LgbUpJiaEDsMnbsnWioqjxbuaW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107003'),
  ('714303333063032615', 'Peach Girl', 2005, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Saeko Chiba, Kenichi Suzumura, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Megumi Nasu, Mami Kingetsu, Show Hayami, Junichi Suwabe, Miho Yamada', null, 'Momo, a high school student, is torn between two love interests, each of whom possess great qualities.', 'Momo, a high school student, is torn between two love interests, each of whom possess great qualities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct6qyHx22Ebkm2Blo6AY3Wys5Mm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31729'),
  ('501466063989302092', 'Peach Lover', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Niwat Naknuan, Nuttapart Tuntistinchai, Theerameth Pheerabawornsuk, Asavarid Pinitkanjanapun, Panurat Panyafu, Praptpadol Suwanbang', null, 'A dedicated fan wins the chance to co-star with his favorite adult content creator, only for their work to turn into a real relationship.', 'A dedicated fan wins the chance to co-star with his favorite adult content creator, only for their work to turn into a real relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Oz2MUYYp0iTRlpTKgQCovA7cGp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305105'),
  ('822402638120541158', 'Peach of Time', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Yang Joo-hyun', 'Choi Jae-hyun, Karn Kritsanaphan, Sittichok Pueakpoolpol, Jung Ae-yeun, Yoon Hee-seok, Ahn Da-bi, Kim Hye-na, Kim Hyun-jin', null, 'Peach travels to Korea to meet Yoon-oh, his online friend. As he bonds with Yoon-oh, tensions with Yoon-oh''s mother and Peach''s unexpected emotions surface.', 'Peach travels to Korea to meet Yoon-oh, his online friend. As he bonds with Yoon-oh, tensions with Yoon-oh''s mother and Peach''s unexpected emotions surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLuyqAWUWeY9lWiZtlggn1Bu3Ev.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129673'),
  ('1092777598967296261', 'Peacock', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Steve Stamp, Ben Murray', 'Steve Stamp, Ben Murray', 'Allan Mustafa, Henry Perryment, Lucien Laviscount, Thomas Gray, Sophia Di Martino, Jaz Hutchins, Steve Stamp, Jonathan Livingstone', null, 'A trainer tries to make his way as an instructor at a gym where the clientele doesn''t take physical fitness very seriously.', 'A trainer tries to make his way as an instructor at a gym where the clientele doesn''t take physical fitness very seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVH9O5AM6c0qt4SKnIgKwnCUY5z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:199904'),
  ('100665347961643626', 'Peak Practice', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, 'Maggie O''Neill, Susannah Corbett, Eva Pope, Gray O''Brien, Simon Shepherd', 'TV-14', 'Peak Practice is a British drama series about a GP surgery in Cardale — a small fictional town in the Derbyshire Peak District — and the doctors who worked there. It ran on ITV from 10 May 1993 to 30 January 2002 and was one of their most successful series at the time. It originally starred Kevin Whately as Dr Jack Kerruish, Amanda Burton as Dr Beth Glover and Simon Shepherd as Dr Will Preston, though the roster of doctors would change many times over the course of the series. Cardale was based on the Staffordshire village of Longnor for the final series, but was previously based in the Derbyshire village of Crich, although certain scenes were filmed at other nearby Derbyshire towns and villages, most notably Matlock, Belper and Ashover.', 'Peak Practice is a British drama series about a GP surgery in Cardale — a small fictional town in the Derbyshire Peak District — and the doctors who worked there. It ran on ITV from 10 May 1993 to 30 January 2002 and was one of their most successful series at the time. It originally starred Kevin Whately as Dr Jack Kerruish, Amanda Burton as Dr Beth Glover and Simon Shepherd as Dr Will Preston, though the roster of doctors would change many times over the course of the series. Cardale was based on the Staffordshire village of Longnor for the final series, but was previously based in the Derbyshire village of Crich, although certain scenes were filmed at other nearby Derbyshire towns and villages, most notably Matlock, Belper and Ashover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLIufTXrMV54MIiYjkpw3l69HTv.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:13286'),
  ('368243903428658041', 'Peaky Blinders', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Cillian Murphy, Paul Anderson, Sophie Rundle, Natasha O''Keeffe', 'TV-MA', 'A gangster family epic set in 1919 Birmingham, England and centered on a gang who sew razor blades in the peaks of their caps, and their fierce boss Tommy Shelby, who means to move up in the world.', 'A gangster family epic set in 1919 Birmingham, England and centered on a gang who sew razor blades in the peaks of their caps, and their fierce boss Tommy Shelby, who means to move up in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUUqzWa2LnHIVqkaKVlVGkVcZIW.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:60574'),
  ('818793055256874076', 'Peanuts by Schulz', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Charles M. Schulz, Alexis Lavillat', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Aiden Lewandowski, Emma Yarovinsky, Bella Stine, Jude Perry, Cassidy May Benullo, Caleel Harris, Lily Zager, Finn Carr', 'TV-G', 'Remember the legendary comic strip, celebrated all over the world? Now, watch it come to life on screen! Peanuts brings to you the vintage charm and timeless stories of Charlie Brown''s gang with a renewed zest. Join in the adventurous world of the wildly imaginative, supremely confident and world-famous beagle, Snoopy.', 'Remember the legendary comic strip, celebrated all over the world? Now, watch it come to life on screen! Peanuts brings to you the vintage charm and timeless stories of Charlie Brown''s gang with a renewed zest. Join in the adventurous world of the wildly imaginative, supremely confident and world-famous beagle, Snoopy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQSASTQBhpMDRwl0SsnlqzFDHeQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66514'),
  ('360517172911752210', 'Pearson', 2019, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Aaron Korsh, Daniel Arkin', null, 'Gina Torres, Bethany Joy Lenz, Simon Kassianides, Eli Goree, Chantel Riley, Isabel Arraiza', 'TV-14', 'Powerhouse lawyer Jessica Pearson adjusts to the dirty world of Chicago politics.', 'Powerhouse lawyer Jessica Pearson adjusts to the dirty world of Chicago politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aI0KQTi3YgXZfI5gxfK6A8lP39U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85950'),
  ('530586915427067305', 'Pebble Mill', 1991, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'Pebble Mill was a re-launched version of the 1970s daily chat show Pebble Mill (also known as Pebble Mill At One for a while) which aired on BBC1 in the United Kingdom. The series premiered on October 14, 1991. The show was a mixture of celebrity guests and music. Alan Titchmarsh was a presenter on the show throughout it''s complete run. Other presenters included Judi Spiers, Gloria Hunniford and Ross King.', 'Pebble Mill was a re-launched version of the 1970s daily chat show Pebble Mill (also known as Pebble Mill At One for a while) which aired on BBC1 in the United Kingdom. The series premiered on October 14, 1991. The show was a mixture of celebrity guests and music. Alan Titchmarsh was a presenter on the show throughout it''s complete run. Other presenters included Judi Spiers, Gloria Hunniford and Ross King.', null, 5, 'tmdb:tv:24156'),
  ('812964626533396269', 'Pechino Express', 2012, 'Reality', 'Ludo Poppe', null, null, null, 'Ten pair of friends will compete in a race along a path of ten thousand miles, in stages that require three days for each trip which have specific goals.', 'Ten pair of friends will compete in a race along a path of ten thousand miles, in stages that require three days for each trip which have specific goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97WBjxeRtwLwapHeHTig7Xt8xMd.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:63876'),
  ('556540525211357231', 'Pecola', 2001, 'Animation', 'Naomi Iwata', null, 'Miyuki Ichijou', 'TV-Y', 'The show stars Pecola, a curious and hyperactive penguin who tries to help the people of Cube Town but often wreaks havoc instead. Pecola is an orphaned penguin who lives with Pecolias, his grandfather. Cube Town is a small, isolated coastal village that contains an art museum, a beach, a lighthouse, and a canal. It is located adjacent to Crescent Bay surrounded by the Rookery Mountains coastal range and serviced by regular ships which deliver mail, food, and other supplies, as well as occasional tourists from a nearby metropolis named Cubic City. The heights above it lead into Glacier Valley which is snowbound even during summer.', 'The show stars Pecola, a curious and hyperactive penguin who tries to help the people of Cube Town but often wreaks havoc instead. Pecola is an orphaned penguin who lives with Pecolias, his grandfather. Cube Town is a small, isolated coastal village that contains an art museum, a beach, a lighthouse, and a canal. It is located adjacent to Crescent Bay surrounded by the Rookery Mountains coastal range and serviced by regular ships which deliver mail, food, and other supplies, as well as occasional tourists from a nearby metropolis named Cubic City. The heights above it lead into Glacier Valley which is snowbound even during summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bn9pp0ka0Wk31h9v0A6MRwOsMc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11041'),
  ('1080557960333493236', 'Pedal to Metal', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Andrés Delgado, Renata Vaca, Benny Emmanuel, Gerardo Taracena, David Montalvo, Silverio Palacios', null, 'After a race they drive in ends fatally, friends Kike and Noche flee to Mexico City to hide, rebuild their lives and escape danger ... or at least try.', 'After a race they drive in ends fatally, friends Kike and Noche flee to Mexico City to hide, rebuild their lives and escape danger ... or at least try.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rW5ZP07VP0NMx26wwzcIRps6FJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158913'),
  ('435795702274868373', 'Pedro El Escamoso', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap, Family', 'Luis Felipe Salamanca, Dago García', null, 'Miguel Varoni, Aura Helena Prada, Sandra Reyes, Jairo Camargo, Fernando Solórzano, Andrea Guzmán, Diego Ramos, Carlos Kajú', 'TV-14', 'A charming man moves to the big city and falls for a female executive in this comedic telenovela.', 'A charming man moves to the big city and falls for a female executive in this comedic telenovela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0DhAsHHiFpMmbe6zWG6F15gh4f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132908'),
  ('61197803615332529', 'Pee-wee as Himself', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paul Reubens, Cassandra Peterson, Debi Mazar, David Arquette, Natasha Lyonne, Lynne Marie Stewart, Tracy Newman', 'TV-MA', 'A kaleidoscopic portrait told in two parts tracing the life of the imaginative artist.', 'A kaleidoscopic portrait told in two parts tracing the life of the imaginative artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/245axX0GN2QQE8KwXGKEvAVl1YP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277685'),
  ('998255064137441697', 'Pee-wee''s Playhouse', 1986, 'Kids, Comedy', 'Paul Reubens', null, 'Paul Reubens, Lynne Marie Stewart, Laurence Fishburne, Suzanne Kent, S. Epatha Merkerson, John Paragon, Alison Mork, William Marshall', 'TV-PG', 'Join Pee-Wee Herman and his friends Chairry, Miss Yvonne, Cowboy Curtis, Jambi the Genie and others as they play around in Pee-Wee''s magical Playhouse!', 'Join Pee-Wee Herman and his friends Chairry, Miss Yvonne, Cowboy Curtis, Jambi the Genie and others as they play around in Pee-Wee''s magical Playhouse!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Oe5DGK9mlMQ0JkuWlfOMRL0qCA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4612'),
  ('489614965053391092', 'Peep and the Big Wide World', 2004, 'Animation', 'Kaj Pindal', null, 'Jamie Watson, Joan Cusack, Maxwell Uretsky, Amanda Soha', 'TV-Y', 'Peep is a newly hatched chicken who goes on daily adventures with his friends Chirp the robin and Quack the duck. The pals live a large urban park they call "the big wide world" and is the setting for all their lessons. Peep learns specific science concepts on his travels, while the series also incorporates real kids playing and experimenting in their own big wide worlds.', 'Peep is a newly hatched chicken who goes on daily adventures with his friends Chirp the robin and Quack the duck. The pals live a large urban park they call "the big wide world" and is the setting for all their lessons. Peep learns specific science concepts on his travels, while the series also incorporates real kids playing and experimenting in their own big wide worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h57yV94qcZcoGf3BNQQUtQa8wvi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1812'),
  ('1063037975110744382', 'Peep Show', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Sam Bain, Andrew O''Connor, Jesse Armstrong', null, 'David Mitchell, Robert Webb', 'TV-MA', 'Peep Show follows the lives of two men from their twenties to thirties, Mark Corrigan, who has steady employment for most of the series, and Jeremy "Jez" Usbourne, an unemployed would-be musician.', 'Peep Show follows the lives of two men from their twenties to thirties, Mark Corrigan, who has steady employment for most of the series, and Jeremy "Jez" Usbourne, an unemployed would-be musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rdoQ0cTjsEQLIwEjhBV8U98oUm.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:815'),
  ('484345634880883073', 'Peepoodo & The Super Fuck Friends', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Balak', null, 'Jeanne Chartier, Brigitte Lecordier, Brice Chevillard', 'TV-MA', 'An educative series for children over 18 years old that explores sexuality without taboos and in all its forms, including dicks and nipples. A positive sexuality, that is unrestrained and totally ignores prejudices… culminating into one single message: tolerance.', 'An educative series for children over 18 years old that explores sexuality without taboos and in all its forms, including dicks and nipples. A positive sexuality, that is unrestrained and totally ignores prejudices… culminating into one single message: tolerance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJnvyzMP4md3f1Xx0wumftXCC6l.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81553'),
  ('136775021345767309', 'Peerless Battle Spirit', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'On the Canglan Continent, warriors cultivate their power by communicating with heaven and earth through their martial spirits. Our protagonist, Qin Nan, the young master of the Qin family, accidentally obtains a fragment of the soul of the God of War, a mysterious being from the ancient era. From that moment on, Qin Nan defies his destiny and begins an upward journey. Along his way, he meets beautiful immortal women, defeats celestial geniuses, and becomes invincible in all battles, eventually becoming a supreme and revered Celestial God', 'On the Canglan Continent, warriors cultivate their power by communicating with heaven and earth through their martial spirits. Our protagonist, Qin Nan, the young master of the Qin family, accidentally obtains a fragment of the soul of the God of War, a mysterious being from the ancient era. From that moment on, Qin Nan defies his destiny and begins an upward journey. Along his way, he meets beautiful immortal women, defeats celestial geniuses, and becomes invincible in all battles, eventually becoming a supreme and revered Celestial God', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64GQlNTY22QJE48WLn2AEJhpqW1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252788'),
  ('434036002603773885', 'Peg + Cat', 2013, 'Kids, Animation', 'Billy Aronson, Jennifer Oxley', null, 'Hayley Faith Negrin, Dwayne Hill, Christian Distefano, Thamela Mpumlwana', 'TV-Y', 'Meet Peg, a curious and spunky preschooler, and her feline companion, Cat, who will rely on math "to tackle social and relationship issues and everyday problems like cleaning up a messy bedroom," Rotenberg says. Some of their dilemmas may be zany — like how to get 100 chickens back into their coop or how to feed a horde of hungry pirates with just one banana — but it''s all solvable via mathematics and a zippy song.', 'Meet Peg, a curious and spunky preschooler, and her feline companion, Cat, who will rely on math "to tackle social and relationship issues and everyday problems like cleaning up a messy bedroom," Rotenberg says. Some of their dilemmas may be zany — like how to get 100 chickens back into their coop or how to feed a horde of hungry pirates with just one banana — but it''s all solvable via mathematics and a zippy song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLLoF9lYMsEq4jPBNczkrCwVjrR.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:62694'),
  ('1026203023030661042', 'Pegasus Market', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Sol-ji', 'Kim Byong-chul, Lee Dong-hwi, Jung Hye-sung, Park Ho-san, Lee Soon-jae, Yeon Woo, Jeong Min-sung, Kang Hong-suk', null, 'Employees at a struggling mart embrace their roles as kings, defying the customer-centric norms. The manager strives to revive the store, battling against a ruthless boss determined to ruin it.', 'Employees at a struggling mart embrace their roles as kings, defying the customer-centric norms. The manager strives to revive the store, battling against a ruthless boss determined to ruin it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aj6YtrojEGktaN5lNeMZ9aZM3On.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92707'),
  ('666750192342190816', 'Pékin Express', 2006, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', 'Ludo Poppe', null, 'Stéphane Rotenberg', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FTtjQqz19eJKWxYFll2FDLid1Z.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:80605'),
  ('904334342092265663', 'Pen Tor', 2004, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Shahkrit Yamnarm, Pimmada Boriruksuppakorn, Kitti Cheawwongkul, Mayurin Pongpudpunth, Vichuda Pindum, Thongthong Mokjok', null, 'A successful man at a publishing company tries to rekindle his romance with an ex-girlfriend as those around him also search for love amidst conflict.', 'A successful man at a publishing company tries to rekindle his romance with an ex-girlfriend as those around him also search for love amidst conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pCGtGxRjxY9ZBfoCVh3gLhc5Fy.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:50524'),
  ('791775313517715789', 'PEN15', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Anna Konkle, Sam Zvibleman, Maya Erskine', null, 'Maya Erskine, Anna Konkle, Mutsuko Erskine, Taylor Nichols, Melora Walters, Taj Cross, Dallas Liu', 'TV-MA', 'Middle school as it really happened. Maya Erskine and Anna Konkle star in this adult comedy, playing versions of themselves as thirteen-year-old outcasts in the year 2000, surrounded by actual thirteen-year-olds, where the best day of your life can turn into your worst with the stroke of a gel pen.', 'Middle school as it really happened. Maya Erskine and Anna Konkle star in this adult comedy, playing versions of themselves as thirteen-year-old outcasts in the year 2000, surrounded by actual thirteen-year-olds, where the best day of your life can turn into your worst with the stroke of a gel pen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rbyzSTXnrPHJZ1YEOQDK8gnNm8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85702'),
  ('1135428304606722581', 'Penance', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Kyoko Koizumi, Yu Aoi, Eiko Koike, Sakura Ando, Chizuru Ikewaki, Hazuki Kimura, Erika Omata, Manatsu Kimura', null, 'The murder of a young girl shocks a small Japanese village, and the victim''s mother is distraught when the classmates her daughter was playing with all claim not to remember the identity of the killer. In her anger, she puts a curse on them.', 'The murder of a young girl shocks a small Japanese village, and the victim''s mother is distraught when the classmates her daughter was playing with all claim not to remember the identity of the killer. In her anger, she puts a curse on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13FsRTLEc5t0PwShnFRDKu2C69D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41670'),
  ('498670290420260686', 'Penance', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kate O''Riordan, Ben Morris', 'Kate O''Riordan', 'Diona Doherty, Julie Graham, Tallulah Greive, Art Malik, Nico Mirallegro, Neil Morrissey', 'NR', 'Following the loss of their son, Rosalie and Luke find their marriage under immense strain. Maddie and Rosalie find themselves in the caring hands of Jed, a charming and charismatic young man that they encounter at bereavement counselling who is also suffering under the weight of his own grief. Jed rekindles a hope for the future within the Douglas household. But underneath, a deadly and morally corrupt triangle is taking shape.', 'Following the loss of their son, Rosalie and Luke find their marriage under immense strain. Maddie and Rosalie find themselves in the caring hands of Jed, a charming and charismatic young man that they encounter at bereavement counselling who is also suffering under the weight of his own grief. Jed rekindles a hope for the future within the Douglas household. But underneath, a deadly and morally corrupt triangle is taking shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mN7L6RY07xCvud2POCWaVhzJzF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100543'),
  ('146109952158580522', 'Penelope', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mark Duplass, Mel Eslyn', null, 'Megan Stott', 'TV-MA', 'A restless teenager who questions her place in the world embarks on a soul-searching journey into the remote wilderness of the Pacific Northwest.', 'A restless teenager who questions her place in the world embarks on a soul-searching journey into the remote wilderness of the Pacific Northwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97y29UZBzw4V5G4xMZahOyAzAhq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241773'),
  ('290428828783753138', 'Peng', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yoon So-hee, Choi Won-myeong, Joo Woo-jae, Lee Seung-il, Kim Hyun-jin, Bang Eun-jeong, Baek Soo-hee', null, 'Saying goodbye to her twenties, thirty-year-old Go Sa Ri welcomes this new decade of her life with open arms. Leaving behind the tangled mess of her twenties, Sa Ri is ready to make a fresh start. But walking away from the past is proving more difficult than she ever imagined.', 'Saying goodbye to her twenties, thirty-year-old Go Sa Ri welcomes this new decade of her life with open arms. Leaving behind the tangled mess of her twenties, Sa Ri is ready to make a fresh start. But walking away from the past is proving more difficult than she ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BebJvbDPnjO5wgXTmFztYLYEsK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133753'),
  ('174325551768594577', 'Penguin Town', 2021, 'Documentary, Kids', null, null, 'Patton Oswalt', null, 'In a picturesque South African town, an eclectic group of endangered penguins flock together to find mates, raise families and mix with the locals.', 'In a picturesque South African town, an eclectic group of endangered penguins flock together to find mates, raise families and mix with the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LtKOlUBdk6t3B01gbaR332YI2U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125970'),
  ('94846404558764620', 'Penguindrum', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Subaru Kimura, Ryohei Kimura, Miho Arakawa, Marie Miyake, Akira Ishida, Mamiko Noto, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'A terminally ill girl named Himari Takakura is miraculously saved from death by a strange spirit who resides in a penguin-shaped hat. However, in exchange for extending her life, the spirit tasks Himari''s brothers, Kanba and Shōma, to seek out an elusive item known as the Penguin Drum with assistance from a trio of strange penguins.', 'A terminally ill girl named Himari Takakura is miraculously saved from death by a strange spirit who resides in a penguin-shaped hat. However, in exchange for extending her life, the spirit tasks Himari''s brothers, Kanba and Shōma, to seek out an elusive item known as the Penguin Drum with assistance from a trio of strange penguins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srhPQY8T4sSvTbSC2ofVCy5XlhP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39657'),
  ('1022309216411616569', 'Penn & Teller Tell a Lie', 2011, 'Comedy, Documentary', null, null, 'Penn Jillette, Teller', 'TV-14', 'Penn & Teller bring their unique vision of the world in a new interactive series with a twist. In each episode, Penn & Teller make up to seven outrageous claims. While most of the wildly unbelievable stories are absolutely, positively true - one of them is a BIG FAT LIE.', 'Penn & Teller bring their unique vision of the world in a new interactive series with a twist. In each episode, Penn & Teller make up to seven outrageous claims. While most of the wildly unbelievable stories are absolutely, positively true - one of them is a BIG FAT LIE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4k8kbiNG7zBLmM8XSQPwI0iltr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39102'),
  ('81362588949431419', 'Penn & Teller: Bull!', 2003, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Eric Small', 'Star Price, Jon Hotchkiss, Emma Webster', 'Teller, Penn Jillette', 'TV-MA', 'This daring original series stars postmodern bad boys of magic Penn & Teller as they question many of our culture''s most cherished and widely held beliefs. From the truth about palm readings and TV psychics to the reality behind Feng Shui and Ouija boards, the archly comic masters of misdirection host this eye-opening analysis of the middle-ground between perception and reality.', 'This daring original series stars postmodern bad boys of magic Penn & Teller as they question many of our culture''s most cherished and widely held beliefs. From the truth about palm readings and TV psychics to the reality behind Feng Shui and Ouija boards, the archly comic masters of misdirection host this eye-opening analysis of the middle-ground between perception and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2jEQ2XhsUnCLSyGu6QT4bTtRCO.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:243'),
  ('21580239479854917', 'Penn & Teller: Fool Us', 2011, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Penn Jillette, Teller', 'TV-PG', 'Illusionists Penn & Teller throw down the gauntlet to aspiring magicians to perform their most mystifying trick - and fool Penn and Teller. Penn & Teller have no prior knowledge of either the performers or the planned trick. They sit in the audience just like everyone else, watching every move the guest magicians make. If any illusionist fools the professionals, they win a five star trip to Las Vegas to perform as the opening act in Penn & Teller''s world famous show at the Rio Hotel & Casino.', 'Illusionists Penn & Teller throw down the gauntlet to aspiring magicians to perform their most mystifying trick - and fool Penn and Teller. Penn & Teller have no prior knowledge of either the performers or the planned trick. They sit in the audience just like everyone else, watching every move the guest magicians make. If any illusionist fools the professionals, they win a five star trip to Las Vegas to perform as the opening act in Penn & Teller''s world famous show at the Rio Hotel & Casino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fLyvZZ2yxDhjqc2z6L2iwtW4T3.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:34607'),
  ('435177809745944772', 'Penn & Teller''s Magic & Mystery Tour', 2003, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, 'Penn Jillette, Teller', null, 'Penn & Teller''s Magic and Mystery Tour is a 2003 television documentary miniseries starring Penn & Teller. The program was created by the CBC in association with Channel 4 Film. The show focuses on street magic, and the subjects of each of the three shows are China, India, and Egypt. Unusually for Penn and Teller, Teller speaks in the Egypt episode, even though part of their trademark performance is that Penn does all the speaking.', 'Penn & Teller''s Magic and Mystery Tour is a 2003 television documentary miniseries starring Penn & Teller. The program was created by the CBC in association with Channel 4 Film. The show focuses on street magic, and the subjects of each of the three shows are China, India, and Egypt. Unusually for Penn and Teller, Teller speaks in the Egypt episode, even though part of their trademark performance is that Penn does all the speaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u6h9zfgAmPIBjSfU5Qz4OjZRXE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35239'),
  ('909783894950938249', 'Penn Zero: Part-Time Hero', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jared Bush, Sam Levine', null, 'Thomas Middleditch, Tania Gunadi, Adam Devine, Alfred Molina, Larry Wilmore, Sam Levine, Gary Cole, Lea Thompson', 'TV-Y7', 'Penn Zero is not your average kid - every day, he''s zapped into another dimension with his friends to save the world.', 'Penn Zero is not your average kid - every day, he''s zapped into another dimension with his friends to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCk9Lf8SL4yQqNsphC34NL7rCtL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62486'),
  ('1098046948570320337', 'Pennies from Heaven', 1978, 'Drama', 'Dennis Potter', null, 'Bob Hoskins, Gemma Craven, Cheryl Campbell, Kenneth Colley', null, 'Pennies From Heaven is a 1978 BBC television drama serial written by Dennis Potter. The title is taken from a song of the same name written by Johnny Burke and Arthur Johnston. It was one of several Potter serials to mix the reality of the drama with a dark fantasy content, and the earliest of his works where the characters burst into miming to popular 1930s songs. During the Great Depression, a sheet music salesman seeks to escape his dreary life through popular music and a love affair with an innocent schoolteacher.', 'Pennies From Heaven is a 1978 BBC television drama serial written by Dennis Potter. The title is taken from a song of the same name written by Johnny Burke and Arthur Johnston. It was one of several Potter serials to mix the reality of the drama with a dark fantasy content, and the earliest of his works where the characters burst into miming to popular 1930s songs. During the Great Depression, a sheet music salesman seeks to escape his dreary life through popular music and a love affair with an innocent schoolteacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVufGaAr1NoeaLE9FkgYwVpmIrv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13466'),
  ('610765337602100173', 'Penny Dreadful', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'John Logan', null, 'Eva Green, Josh Hartnett, Timothy Dalton, Harry Treadaway, Reeve Carney, Rory Kinnear, Billie Piper, Patti LuPone', 'TV-MA', 'Some of literature''s most terrifying characters, including Dr. Frankenstein, Dorian Gray, and iconic figures from the novel Dracula are lurking in the darkest corners of Victorian London. Penny Dreadful is a frightening psychological thriller that weaves together these classic horror origin stories into a new adult drama.', 'Some of literature''s most terrifying characters, including Dr. Frankenstein, Dorian Gray, and iconic figures from the novel Dracula are lurking in the darkest corners of Victorian London. Penny Dreadful is a frightening psychological thriller that weaves together these classic horror origin stories into a new adult drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQSdrXBYTbLGHYDIseHkBOPXTgL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:54671'),
  ('764325860870297484', 'Penny Dreadful: City of Angels', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'John Logan', null, 'Natalie Dormer, Daniel Zovatto, Kerry Bishé, Adriana Barraza, Jessica Garza, Michael Gladis, Johnathan Nieves, Rory Kinnear', 'TV-MA', 'Rooted in the conflict between characters connected to the deity Santa Muerte and others allied with the Devil, this saga explores an exciting mix of the supernatural and the combustible reality of 1938 Los Angeles, a time and place deeply infused with Mexican-American folklore and social tension.', 'Rooted in the conflict between characters connected to the deity Santa Muerte and others allied with the Devil, this saga explores an exciting mix of the supernatural and the combustible reality of 1938 Los Angeles, a time and place deeply infused with Mexican-American folklore and social tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8lrENZZBMHTUpXNUlxt81Ks7G2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83685'),
  ('597637759195914603', 'Penny on M.A.R.S.', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Beatrice Valsecchi', 'Fabrizio Lucherini, Beatrice Valsecchi, Giacomo Berdini', 'Olivia-Mai Barrett, Olivia Chan, luke walsh, Ryan Dean, Hanna Hefner, William Kenning, Alton Terry, Ben Richards', null, 'Penny is the daughther of Bakia, the most famous popstar of the hour. With her best friend Camilla,she decides to attend M.A.RS., the most important school of Music and Arts. Here she will find new friends, she will face many challenges and she will keep looking for the father she''s never met.', 'Penny is the daughther of Bakia, the most famous popstar of the hour. With her best friend Camilla,she decides to attend M.A.RS., the most important school of Music and Arts. Here she will find new friends, she will face many challenges and she will keep looking for the father she''s never met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa34y9dNmEULV3UmXyyPY9Q6dRb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86833'),
  ('843643401374139194', 'Pennyworth: The Origin of Batman''s Butler', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bruno Heller', null, 'Jack Bannon, Ben Aldridge, Emma Paetz, Ryan Fletcher, Dorothy Atkinson, Ramon Tikaram, Simon Manyonda, Harriet Slater', 'TV-MA', 'The origin story of Bruce Wayne''s legendary butler, Alfred Pennyworth, a former British SAS soldier who forms a security company in 1960s London and goes to work with young billionaire Thomas Wayne and his wife Martha, before they become Bruce Wayne’s parents.', 'The origin story of Bruce Wayne''s legendary butler, Alfred Pennyworth, a former British SAS soldier who forms a security company in 1960s London and goes to work with young billionaire Thomas Wayne and his wife Martha, before they become Bruce Wayne’s parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEHMfWe7pCWMelEkdrtRvVULopT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79588'),
  ('367291466226790845', 'Penoza', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Diederik Van Rooijen', null, 'Monic Hendrickx, Sigrid ten Napel, Stijn Taverne, Niels Gomperts, Loek Peters, Olga Zuiderhoek, Raymond Thiry, Hajo Bruins', null, 'Carmen, the daughter of a notorious Amsterdam drug lord, reluctantly takes charge of the family''s smuggling business in order to clear her husband''s debts.', 'Carmen, the daughter of a notorious Amsterdam drug lord, reluctantly takes charge of the family''s smuggling business in order to clear her husband''s debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvYTGjftwpcAHBQKXZUh77fMrur.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:36536'),
  ('282387113169447904', 'Pensacola: Wings of Gold', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'William Blinn', null, 'James Brolin, Michael Trucco, Sandra Hess, Bobby Hosea, Felicity Waterman, Barbara Niven, David Quane', null, 'Pensacola: Wings of Gold is a syndicated American action/adventure drama series based at the Naval Air Station Pensacola in Pensacola, Florida.', 'Pensacola: Wings of Gold is a syndicated American action/adventure drama series based at the Naval Air Station Pensacola in Pensacola, Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fdZmNKmvGAFRXYFmWtgUipc0hG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:523'),
  ('135135243177028449', 'Penultimate Instance', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Pavel Priluchnyy, Irina Rozanova, Fyodor Dobronravov, Darya Melnikova, Nikolay Fomenko, Irina Cherichenko, Denis Sinyavskiy, Vasily Kortukov', null, 'Maxim and Valentina work in the Department for the Distribution of Souls — 24 hours before the death of a person, they must determine where he will go — to hell or heaven. And since both are guaranteed paradise under an employment contract, Maxim is trying to earn extra money and sell a place in paradise to oligarchs, and Valentina dreams of returning her husband from hell.', 'Maxim and Valentina work in the Department for the Distribution of Souls — 24 hours before the death of a person, they must determine where he will go — to hell or heaven. And since both are guaranteed paradise under an employment contract, Maxim is trying to earn extra money and sell a place in paradise to oligarchs, and Valentina dreams of returning her husband from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBmYVfn8Tr4PvBR0Q82gR7WE2Sd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:154528'),
  ('763282316561822388', 'People Just Do Nothing', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Allan Mustafa, Hugo Chegwin, Asim Chaudhry', null, 'Allan Mustafa, Hugo Chegwin, Asim Chaudhry, Steve Stamp, Daniel Sylvester Woolford, Lily Brazier, Ruth Bratt', 'TV-MA', 'This mockumentary goes behind the microphone of Kurupt FM - the second most popular pirate radio station in West London, receiving up to eight texts per show and playing the finest in UK garage and drum ''n'' bass. Co-founded by the MC Sniper and DJ Beats in 2002, the station has now built up a following of over a hundred people and has attracted the attention of the BBC who are making a documentary about the lives of those behind Kurupt FM', 'This mockumentary goes behind the microphone of Kurupt FM - the second most popular pirate radio station in West London, receiving up to eight texts per show and playing the finest in UK garage and drum ''n'' bass. Co-founded by the MC Sniper and DJ Beats in 2002, the station has now built up a following of over a hundred people and has attracted the attention of the BBC who are making a documentary about the lives of those behind Kurupt FM', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLUan19OV2aauGmpEU51Y5Ofez.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67468'),
  ('630376409342944630', 'People Like Us', 1999, 'Comedy', null, 'John Morton', 'Chris Langham', null, 'People Like Us was a British radio and TV comedy programme, a spoof on-location documentary written by John Morton, and starring Chris Langham as Roy Mallard, an inept interviewer. Originally a radio show for BBC Radio 4 in three series from 1995 to 1997, it was made into a television series for BBC Two that aired from September 1999 to June 2000.', 'People Like Us was a British radio and TV comedy programme, a spoof on-location documentary written by John Morton, and starring Chris Langham as Roy Mallard, an inept interviewer. Originally a radio show for BBC Radio 4 in three series from 1995 to 1997, it was made into a television series for BBC Two that aired from September 1999 to June 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUG0PPWFOYYFRKK0CYKRmBYs1MP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:908'),
  ('140739574714870349', 'People Magazine Investigates', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Uncover the heart-wrenching true stories behind crimes that transcended headlines and became part of popular culture. Exclusive first hand interviews reveal shocking twists, new evidence, and unexpected resolutions.', 'Uncover the heart-wrenching true stories behind crimes that transcended headlines and became part of popular culture. Exclusive first hand interviews reveal shocking twists, new evidence, and unexpected resolutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CyMU8V6ZdArabPUMHo2K9kjqKn.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:76458'),
  ('577947445598156692', 'People of Earth', 2016, 'Comedy', 'David Jenkins', null, 'Wyatt Cenac, Oscar Nuñez, Ana Gasteyer, Luka Jones, Alice Wetterlund, Michael Cassidy, Tracee Chimo, Brian Huskey', 'TV-MA', 'Skeptical journalist Ozzie Graham investigates a support group for alien abductees to write about the members'' supposed encounters. The more he digs into their oddball claims, the more he realizes there is truth in their stories and possibly even signs that point to his own alien abduction.', 'Skeptical journalist Ozzie Graham investigates a support group for alien abductees to write about the members'' supposed encounters. The more he digs into their oddball claims, the more he realizes there is truth in their stories and possibly even signs that point to his own alien abduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xZoGQAwj0Qq1PVZBdd35gJWxij.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67831'),
  ('408828478411875986', 'People Puzzler', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Leah Remini', 'TV-PG', 'Three lucky contestants put their pop culture knowledge to the test to complete iconic, People Puzzler crosswords. The player with the most points at the end of three rounds wins the game and goes on to play the "Fast Puzzle Round" for an enormous cash prize.', 'Three lucky contestants put their pop culture knowledge to the test to complete iconic, People Puzzler crosswords. The player with the most points at the end of three rounds wins the game and goes on to play the "Fast Puzzle Round" for an enormous cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gELQSCY5KKIGQAmOHbcgcRGNlp5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:117031'),
  ('1128911980539184479', 'People''s Choice Awards', 1975, null, null, null, null, null, 'An American awards show recognizing people in entertainment, voted online by the general public and fans.', 'An American awards show recognizing people in entertainment, voted online by the general public and fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohyiWEGeWUf6JBsgPgtIDKZOJZn.jpg', 49, 'tmdb:tv:37507'),
  ('226505399998725518', 'People''s Justice', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', '张延彬, 范子文', null, 'Yu Hewei, Cecilia Han, Feng Lei, Han Tongsheng, Song Chunli, Cheng Taishen, Wang Haiyan, Wu Gang', null, 'At the commendation meeting of Dong Chuan province''s "Top Ten Figures of the Rule of Law," He Shu Guo who is the director of the Second Prosecution Department suddenly comes face to face with the family members of a death row convict. In order to find out the truth, legal committee secretary Zhang You Cheng appoints Feng Sen as the leader of the prosecution team to investigate the case in depth. Feng Sen tries to do his job yet his unorthodox style of handling cases ignites several disputes. In the process of reopening an old case, layers upon layers of mist are gradually lifted to reveal a harsh truth. Feng Sen works with Luo Xin Ran of the Inspectorate Office as they stick to their professional ethics and refuse to cower in the face of threats, all in the name of maintaining authority of the law.', 'At the commendation meeting of Dong Chuan province''s "Top Ten Figures of the Rule of Law," He Shu Guo who is the director of the Second Prosecution Department suddenly comes face to face with the family members of a death row convict. In order to find out the truth, legal committee secretary Zhang You Cheng appoints Feng Sen as the leader of the prosecution team to investigate the case in depth. Feng Sen tries to do his job yet his unorthodox style of handling cases ignites several disputes. In the process of reopening an old case, layers upon layers of mist are gradually lifted to reveal a harsh truth. Feng Sen works with Luo Xin Ran of the Inspectorate Office as they stick to their professional ethics and refuse to cower in the face of threats, all in the name of maintaining authority of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMVORmUVumwpAv2EbP0K1W6USlB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114619'),
  ('599145432976073196', 'People''s Property', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lv Chao', null, 'Jin Dong, Yan Ni, Huang Zhizhong, Chen Xiao, Qin Lan, Geng Le, Tian Lei, Pan Zhilin', null, 'Zhongfu Group, a large state-owned enterprise with a magnificent history of 80 years in Jingzhou, was in trouble during the transition period, and the existing market changed. Factors, there are also serious corruption issues that cannot be ignored. An unexpected explosion exploded the bizarre disappearance of 500 million funds, gradually exposing all kinds of sharp and complicated contradictions. Senior party and government officials, business executives, all walks of life, the underprivileged groups, all kinds of life-like characters.', 'Zhongfu Group, a large state-owned enterprise with a magnificent history of 80 years in Jingzhou, was in trouble during the transition period, and the existing market changed. Factors, there are also serious corruption issues that cannot be ignored. An unexpected explosion exploded the bizarre disappearance of 500 million funds, gradually exposing all kinds of sharp and complicated contradictions. Senior party and government officials, business executives, all walks of life, the underprivileged groups, all kinds of life-like characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xhskejFoohf9n1dCBukATpnEzu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136891'),
  ('121451011485864695', 'Peppa Pig', 2004, 'Animation, Kids', 'Neville Astley, Mark Baker', null, 'John Sparkes, Amelie Bea Smith, Morwenna Banks, Richard Ridings, Kira Monteith, Alice May, Frances White, David Rintoul', 'TV-Y', 'Peppa Pig is an energetic piggy who lives with Mummy, Daddy, and little brother George. She loves to jump in mud puddles and make loud snorting noises.', 'Peppa Pig is an energetic piggy who lives with Mummy, Daddy, and little brother George. She loves to jump in mud puddles and make loud snorting noises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwKVo3HlsyVNXCzFEkd0xHz3kGi.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:12225'),
  ('702839347741887858', 'Pepper Ann', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Sue Rose', null, 'Kathleen Wilhoite, Danny Cooksey, Clea Lewis, April Winchell', 'TV-Y', 'The quirky adventures of Pepper Ann, a 12-year-old girl trying to get through life with her family and friends.', 'The quirky adventures of Pepper Ann, a 12-year-old girl trying to get through life with her family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/605jNVI63jueuJTKg032F7U7xEj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4568'),
  ('155733505876445397', 'Pepper Chocolate', 2003, 'Soap, Comedy, Drama', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco, Thelma Guedes', 'Mariana Ximenes, Murilo Benício, Priscila Fantin, Elizabeth Savalla, Drica Moraes, Marcello Novaes, Tarcísio Filho, Caco Ciocler', null, 'Ana Francisca is a poor and ugly girl who, after being humiliated by the entire town, becomes a beautiful, stylish and rich woman who wants revenge. During this trajectory, this romantic comedy also shows the true love of Ana Francisca and Danilo that survives throughout the years, the distance and the traps of destiny. They will be part of a love triangle with Olga, a snobbish girl who is going to do anything to steal Danilo from Ana Francisca.', 'Ana Francisca is a poor and ugly girl who, after being humiliated by the entire town, becomes a beautiful, stylish and rich woman who wants revenge. During this trajectory, this romantic comedy also shows the true love of Ana Francisca and Danilo that survives throughout the years, the distance and the traps of destiny. They will be part of a love triangle with Olga, a snobbish girl who is going to do anything to steal Danilo from Ana Francisca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPh5Fo4ptnHrI8Ku0QplHrSoeDe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17674'),
  ('1029171826801457851', 'Pepper Dennis', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gretchen J. Berg, Aaron Harberts', null, 'Rebecca Romijn, Josh Hopkins, Brooke Burns, Lindsay Price, Rider Strong', 'TV-14', 'Pepper Dennis is a reporter hoping to move into the anchor chair. She may or may not have helped her career ambitions by having a one-night stand with the guy who turns out to be her new boss.', 'Pepper Dennis is a reporter hoping to move into the anchor chair. She may or may not have helped her career ambitions by having a one-night stand with the guy who turns out to be her new boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUQWnp3rDclN4oHLJ99iA1voRcw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6765'),
  ('998603456249477943', 'Pepsi, Where''s My Jet?', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'John Leonard, Michael Patti, Todd Hoffman, Brian Swette, Linda Leonard, Jeff Mordos, Michael Davis, Jason Fielders', 'TV-MA', 'When a 20-year-old attempts to win a fighter jet in a Pepsi sweepstakes, he sets the stage for a David versus Goliath court battle for the history books.', 'When a 20-year-old attempts to win a fighter jet in a Pepsi sweepstakes, he sets the stage for a David versus Goliath court battle for the history books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRdZwrdUisIVux3qmW53P4EDynC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213134'),
  ('274357618583669180', 'Per Elisa: An Italian Crime Story', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Giulio Della Monica, Gianmarco Saurino, Giacomo Giorgio, Anna Ferruzzo, Vincent Riotta, Bianca Nappi, Rosa Diletta Rossi, Francesco Acquaroli', null, 'Reconstruction of one of the most shocking crime news events in recent decades: the murders of Elisa Claps and Heather Barnett by Danilo Restivo. The story begins on 12 September 1993 and takes place over a period of about twenty years between Potenza and the English coast of Bournemouth.', 'Reconstruction of one of the most shocking crime news events in recent decades: the murders of Elisa Claps and Heather Barnett by Danilo Restivo. The story begins on 12 September 1993 and takes place over a period of about twenty years between Potenza and the English coast of Bournemouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZcGxKHbKAF0RoVmS7ulpLurbbV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234545'),
  ('193611663911011782', 'Perception', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kenneth Biller, Michael Sussman', null, 'Eric McCormack, Rachael Leigh Cook, Kelly Rowan, Arjay Smith, LeVar Burton, Scott Wolf', 'TV-14', 'Dr. Daniel Pierce, a neuroscientist and professor, is recruited to help the federal government crack difficult cases. His intimate knowledge of human behavior and masterful understanding of the mind give him an extraordinary ability to read people, but his eccentric view of the world and less-than-stellar social skills can often interfere with his work.', 'Dr. Daniel Pierce, a neuroscientist and professor, is recruited to help the federal government crack difficult cases. His intimate knowledge of human behavior and masterful understanding of the mind give him an extraordinary ability to read people, but his eccentric view of the world and less-than-stellar social skills can often interfere with his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5L6MsJVdMDbdGZ4P1lGBunOp0VZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:39957'),
  ('132056867117194147', 'Percy Jackson and the Olympians', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Rick Riordan, Jonathan E. Steinberg', null, 'Walker Scobell, Leah Sava Jeffries, Aryan Simhadri, Charlie Bushnell, Dior Goodjohn, Daniel Diemer', 'TV-PG', 'Percy Jackson is on a dangerous quest. Outrunning monsters and outwitting gods, he must journey across America to return Zeus''s master bolt and stop an all-out war. With the help of his friends Annabeth and Grover, Percy''s journey will lead him closer to the answers he seeks: how to fit into a world where he feels out of place, and who he''s destined to be.', 'Percy Jackson is on a dangerous quest. Outrunning monsters and outwitting gods, he must journey across America to return Zeus''s master bolt and stop an all-out war. With the help of his friends Annabeth and Grover, Percy''s journey will lead him closer to the answers he seeks: how to fit into a world where he feels out of place, and who he''s destined to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40eFcTzZier3DWLqldsP5VHxeoD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:103540'),
  ('24315215469072306', 'Percy tårar', 1996, 'Comedy', null, 'Robert Gustafsson, Andres Lokko, Johan Rheborg', 'Jonas Inde, Robert Gustafsson, Johan Rheborg, Henrik Schyffert', null, 'The loose plot of the series revolves around a number of mostly unrelated storylines which are told in segments in each episode. These segments are flanked by various stand-alone sketches that will sometimes elaborate on minor characters.', 'The loose plot of the series revolves around a number of mostly unrelated storylines which are told in segments in each episode. These segments are flanked by various stand-alone sketches that will sometimes elaborate on minor characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFUogSBsxuxBzj5EeIRKA7AHodB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5294'),
  ('985154645305477409', 'Perdiendo el juicio', 2025, 'Drama', 'Susana López Rubio, Javier Holgado, Jaime Olías', null, 'Elena Rivera, Manuel Baqueiro, Miquel Fernández, Lucía Caraballo, Daniel Ibáñez, Alfonso Lara, Carol Rovira, Dafne Fernández', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioyuupNi55EPjqutl0Kl6KaXZuV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259200'),
  ('1127892953122870116', 'Perdona nuestros pecados', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lucero Suárez', null, 'Oka Giner, Jorge Salinas, Emmanuel Palomares, Erika Buenfil, César Évora Díaz, Sabine Moussier, Marisol del Olmo, Osvaldo de León', null, 'The Quiroga and Montero families live in the town of San Juan, two families of high society, who apparently are united by a friendship of many years. Armando does not agree with the relationship between his daughter Elsa and Andrés, because they are from different social classes. But the relationship between these two families will become a bonfire of betrayal, intrigue, revenge and power.', 'The Quiroga and Montero families live in the town of San Juan, two families of high society, who apparently are united by a friendship of many years. Armando does not agree with the relationship between his daughter Elsa and Andrés, because they are from different social classes. But the relationship between these two families will become a bonfire of betrayal, intrigue, revenge and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AepsNWQiPAZ5kBq9K0BSae9Hp3s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219476'),
  ('870225636940816946', 'Peregrina', null, 'Drama', 'Delia Fiallo', null, null, null, 'Peregrina is a Mexican telenovela. It was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 14 November 2005 through 31 March 2006. The program became an unexpected success, garnering ratings in excess of 30 points. Starring África Zavala and Eduardo Capetillo, tells the story of Peregrina, a young teenager who was given away at birth by her new step mom Victoria Jacqueline Andere.', 'Peregrina is a Mexican telenovela. It was produced by Televisa and broadcast on Canal de las Estrellas in Mexico from 14 November 2005 through 31 March 2006. The program became an unexpected success, garnering ratings in excess of 30 points. Starring África Zavala and Eduardo Capetillo, tells the story of Peregrina, a young teenager who was given away at birth by her new step mom Victoria Jacqueline Andere.', null, 0, 'tmdb:tv:39334'),
  ('215037887903923529', 'Perfect 10 Liners', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'JittiRain', null, 'Kasidet Plookphol, Jiratchapong Srisang, Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Pongsapak Udomphoch, Panachai Sriariyarungruang, Jiruntanin Trairattanayon, Poon Mitpakdee, Natarit Worakornlertsith', null, 'First-year students join the elite ‘Perfect 10 Liners’ mentorship circle, where new bonds, secret crushes, and unexpected love stories unfold.', 'First-year students join the elite ‘Perfect 10 Liners’ mentorship circle, where new bonds, secret crushes, and unexpected love stories unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZmjzDN2f7ZxzMluOTO5aPztI9e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252650'),
  ('494106458879025017', 'Perfect and Casual', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, '刘晗, Han Li', 'Miles Wei, Xu Ruohan, Dai Yunfan, Zhao Luoran, Ma Ge, Sheng Gangshuai, Qi Shenghan, Arthur Ma', null, 'This story revolves around the cold and icy "male god" professor Zhang Sinian and the calm and sunny Yun Shu. After a fractious first meeting, where Yun Shu dressed down the especially finicky Sinian, she was shocked to find out that he was her university lecturer. Through a series of coincidental encounters, the two agreed to engage in a contractual marriage. As the feelings between them grow, how will they keep their relationship from those around them?', 'This story revolves around the cold and icy "male god" professor Zhang Sinian and the calm and sunny Yun Shu. After a fractious first meeting, where Yun Shu dressed down the especially finicky Sinian, she was shocked to find out that he was her university lecturer. Through a series of coincidental encounters, the two agreed to engage in a contractual marriage. As the feelings between them grow, how will they keep their relationship from those around them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSmSUykL0MDd3YUzd8f14Z9utMy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110966'),
  ('379081133268889941', 'Perfect Couple', 2022, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Gao Yuanyuan, Zhang Luyi, David Wang, Wang Zhener, Vivian Wu, Li Naiwen, Yu Entai, Una You', null, 'At 40, successful lawyer Chen Shan struggles to balance her demanding career and strained marriage. As her husband Sun Lei grows distant and a new client challenges her professionally and emotionally, their relationship begins to unravel.', 'At 40, successful lawyer Chen Shan struggles to balance her demanding career and strained marriage. As her husband Sun Lei grows distant and a new client challenges her professionally and emotionally, their relationship begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MWsK3Xl02bh66fxNZVT8XZrj0m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154852'),
  ('57370747621323034', 'Perfect Couples', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Scott Silveri, Jon Pollack', null, 'Kyle Bornheimer, Christine Woods, David Walton, Mary Elizabeth Ellis, Hayes MacArthur, Olivia Munn', 'TV-PG', 'Perfect Couples is an American comedy television series that was originally broadcast by NBC. The half-hour romantic comedy was co-created by Jon Pollack and Scott Silveri and produced by Universal Media Studios. A sneak preview of the series aired on December 20, 2010, and officially premiered on January 20, 2011, as a midseason replacement for the 2010–11 television season. The show was filmed in Los Angeles. On April 14, 2011, the show was replaced in its timeslot with The Paul Reiser Show which was cancelled 11 days later on April 25th after only two episodes. NBC officially canceled Perfect Couples on May 13, 2011.', 'Perfect Couples is an American comedy television series that was originally broadcast by NBC. The half-hour romantic comedy was co-created by Jon Pollack and Scott Silveri and produced by Universal Media Studios. A sneak preview of the series aired on December 20, 2010, and officially premiered on January 20, 2011, as a midseason replacement for the 2010–11 television season. The show was filmed in Los Angeles. On April 14, 2011, the show was replaced in its timeslot with The Paul Reiser Show which was cancelled 11 days later on April 25th after only two episodes. NBC officially canceled Perfect Couples on May 13, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY80mEg9vGfeuH8rkoJalzNQnCs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32700'),
  ('1032544734737214041', 'Perfect Crown', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoo A-in', 'Yoo A-in', 'IU, Byeon Woo-seok, Steve Sanghyun Noh, Gong Seung-yeon, Yoo Su-bin, Lee Jae-won, Chae Seo-an, Cho Seung-yeon', 'TV-PG', 'In a 21st-century constitutional monarchy, a woman who has everything but remains a commoner crosses paths with a prince who, despite his royal lineage, feels powerless—leading to a love that defies social status.', 'In a 21st-century constitutional monarchy, a woman who has everything but remains a commoner crosses paths with a prince who, despite his royal lineage, feels powerless—leading to a love that defies social status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CDHhHZ8lYkpSE3UkFKrqYeeSzz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278573'),
  ('1086721395355719458', 'Perfect Days', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Cláudia Jouvin, Raphael Montes', 'Cláudia Jouvin, Dennison Ramalho, Yuri Costa', 'Julia Dalavia, Jaffar Bambirra, Julianna Gerais, Elzio Vieira, Débora Bloch, Fabiula Nascimento, Teca Pereira, Giovanni Venturini', null, 'Téo, a solitary medical student burdened by the care of his paraplegic mother, becomes infatuated with Clarice, an aspiring screenwriter he meets at a barbecue. When she rejects his advances, he resorts to an extreme measure: drugging and kidnapping her. He forces Clarice—sedated and trapped as his passenger—on a road trip through the very locations she scripted in her screenplay, attempting to awaken her love through repetition and manipulation.', 'Téo, a solitary medical student burdened by the care of his paraplegic mother, becomes infatuated with Clarice, an aspiring screenwriter he meets at a barbecue. When she rejects his advances, he resorts to an extreme measure: drugging and kidnapping her. He forces Clarice—sedated and trapped as his passenger—on a road trip through the very locations she scripted in her screenplay, attempting to awaken her love through repetition and manipulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijRwa5MYYEQgTzg5G2Ym9ZjEHZD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294371'),
  ('94337580279240674', 'Perfect Harmony', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Lesley Wake Webster', null, 'Bradley Whitford, Anna Camp, Rizwan Manji, Tymberlee Hill, Will Greenberg, Geno Segers, Spencer Allport', 'TV-14', 'When former Princeton music professor Arthur Cochran unexpectedly stumbles into choir practice at a small-town church, he finds a group of singers that are out of tune in more ways than one.', 'When former Princeton music professor Arthur Cochran unexpectedly stumbles into choir practice at a small-town church, he finds a group of singers that are out of tune in more ways than one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhs4Wx9KKNK92bGcACGVzK5nd3z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92139'),
  ('617108719640753026', 'Perfect Life', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leticia Dolera', null, 'Leticia Dolera, Celia Freijeiro, Aixa Villagrán, Enric Auquer', 'TV-MA', 'After getting dumped by her long-term boyfriend and pregnant by a one-night stand, María’s meticulous life plan begins to slip into disarray – but her sister Esther and best friend Cristina are determined to see her through.', 'After getting dumped by her long-term boyfriend and pregnant by a one-night stand, María’s meticulous life plan begins to slip into disarray – but her sister Esther and best friend Cristina are determined to see her through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYLDrEedG4pvdYHutcuzN9mjgQo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94734'),
  ('80664130764834390', 'Perfect Love', 2023, 'Soap, Drama', 'Duca Rachid, Júlio Fischer, Elísio Lopes Jr.', 'Elísio Lopes Jr., Júlio Fischer, Duca Rachid', 'Camila Queiroz, Diogo Almeida, Levi Asaf, Mariana Ximenes, Thiago Lacerda, Daniel Rangel, Carmo Dalla Vecchia, Paulo Betti', null, 'A story about love and its different manifestations, told through the little boy Marcelino in search of his biggest dream: to meet his mother. Inspired by a famous book, the plot takes place in the 1940s.', 'A story about love and its different manifestations, told through the little boy Marcelino in search of his biggest dream: to meet his mother. Inspired by a famous book, the plot takes place in the 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0Tb0bs0MBZoq37BpyFExcepbFX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209085'),
  ('588430896630365835', 'Perfect Marriage Revenge', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yi Bam-be, Young', null, 'Jung Yoo-min, Sung Hoon, Jin Ji-hee, Kang Shin-hyo, Oh Seung-yun, Lee Min-young, Jeon No-min, Kim Eung-soo', null, 'Waking from a fatal accident to find herself in the past, Han Yi-joo teams up with Seo Do-guk to take revenge on the family who never loved her.', 'Waking from a fatal accident to find herself in the past, Han Yi-joo teams up with Seo Do-guk to take revenge on the family who never loved her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iqVjyWAfXAFMim0Fi5QS6jUNPq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230524'),
  ('262938145321100763', 'Perfect Match', 2023, 'Reality', 'Chris Coelen', null, 'Nick Lachey', 'TV-MA', 'Couples who prove their compatibility gain the power to make or break other matches in this strategic and seductive dating competition.', 'Couples who prove their compatibility gain the power to make or break other matches in this strategic and seductive dating competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzC8RVSrxyCil0ZVjlbARsjK18E.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:218521'),
  ('283964315326729995', 'Perfect Match', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lu Yuxiao, Wang Xingyue, Ni Hongjie, Liu Xiening, Chen Heyi, Wu Xuanyi, Huang Shengchi, Ke Ying', 'TV-14', 'In the bustling capital of Bianjing during the Northern Song Dynasty, Madam Li moves her family in search of better marriage prospects for her five beautiful but quirky daughters, whose love lives have long been her worry. Each daughter, though famous for her beauty and wit, comes with unique quirks: the eldest, Shou Hua, has no interest in remarrying after early widowhood; the third, Kang Ning, is fierce and headstrong; the fourth, Hao De, is well-meaning but blunt; and the youngest, Le Shan, is spoiled and selective. Challenges abound as they face unexpected setbacks, including a cold reception from the already-married sister they came to visit. As the family reestablishes their business, they navigate a series of humorous and heartwarming misadventures, ultimately finding love and fulfilling their mother’s hopes in this lively tale of family and romance.', 'In the bustling capital of Bianjing during the Northern Song Dynasty, Madam Li moves her family in search of better marriage prospects for her five beautiful but quirky daughters, whose love lives have long been her worry. Each daughter, though famous for her beauty and wit, comes with unique quirks: the eldest, Shou Hua, has no interest in remarrying after early widowhood; the third, Kang Ning, is fierce and headstrong; the fourth, Hao De, is well-meaning but blunt; and the youngest, Le Shan, is spoiled and selective. Challenges abound as they face unexpected setbacks, including a cold reception from the already-married sister they came to visit. As the family reestablishes their business, they navigate a series of humorous and heartwarming misadventures, ultimately finding love and fulfilling their mother’s hopes in this lively tale of family and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbh685TBLEfQKXjYomVEmVztmJ9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254821'),
  ('938565297860297786', 'Perfect Propose', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Takeshi Miyamoto', 'Shunya Kaneko, Kouta Nomura, Jingi Irie, Ayane Kinoshita, Rio Takahashi, Yuta Hayashi, Toshiyuki Kitami, Ryo Iwase', null, 'Hiro, severely overworked, can barely function outside his toxic workplace. When he encounters Kai, a childhood friend he had once promised to marry, he finds he is steadily regaining a sense of purpose - yet Kai''s motives remain unclear.', 'Hiro, severely overworked, can barely function outside his toxic workplace. When he encounters Kai, a childhood friend he had once promised to marry, he finds he is steadily regaining a sense of purpose - yet Kai''s motives remain unclear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0OZpUhwd1e0FvI9dSFxmi9lUYW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241756'),
  ('222409650588826628', 'Perfect Strangers', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Dale McRaven', null, 'Bronson Pinchot, Mark Linn-Baker, Melanie Wilson, Rebeca Arthur, Belita Moreno, Sam Anderson', 'TV-PG', 'The chronicles of the rocky coexistence of midwestern American Larry Appleton and his distant cousin from eastern Mediterranean Europe, Balki Bartokomous.', 'The chronicles of the rocky coexistence of midwestern American Larry Appleton and his distant cousin from eastern Mediterranean Europe, Balki Bartokomous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZ7RomWxcrdMwK63XzVeQGFK6Dy.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1786'),
  ('831304542669874817', 'Perfect Strangers', 2001, 'Drama', 'Stephen Poliakoff', null, 'Matthew Macfadyen, Michael Gambon, Lindsay Duncan, Claire Skinner, Toby Stephens, Jill Baker, Timothy Spall, Anton Lesser', null, 'Daniel Symon comes face to face with his extended family – a cadre of eccentrics, all of whom hiding their own secrets. At a reunion, patriarch Raymond is presented with a copy of the family tree and is enthralled by the complexity of his family ties.', 'Daniel Symon comes face to face with his extended family – a cadre of eccentrics, all of whom hiding their own secrets. At a reunion, patriarch Raymond is presented with a copy of the family tree and is enthralled by the complexity of his family ties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeDYCGOnjUNQSCmwPz43EXFz07t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9163'),
  ('837575814391306012', 'Perfect Wife: The Mysterious Disappearance of Sherri Papini', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sherri Papini', null, 'Keith and Sherri Papini''s seemingly idyllic family life is shattered when Sherri vanishes from their northern California neighborhood, triggering a frenzied search that becomes news around the world.', 'Keith and Sherri Papini''s seemingly idyllic family life is shattered when Sherri vanishes from their northern California neighborhood, triggering a frenzied search that becomes news around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oYlpZ24u0RvSLQK5hlNVcCM9Nm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251100'),
  ('885877223114783271', 'Perfect World', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Chen Dong', null, 'Jinwen Chen, Li Shimeng, Liu Mingyue, Qing Liu, Yue Cu, Li Lanling, Meme Yan, Hu Yajie', 'TV-14', 'Born into a unique world where villages fight to gain power and control, the main character, Shi Hao, is a genius blessed by the heavens born under the poorest of conditions. His clan, however, has a mysterious past. To rise up and become the genius he is meant to be, the clan goes through every effort to aid his cultivation as they battle through fanatical monsters and engage in power struggles with other clans. His journey will bring him through unknown lands until he is able to become a person that can truly shake the world.', 'Born into a unique world where villages fight to gain power and control, the main character, Shi Hao, is a genius blessed by the heavens born under the poorest of conditions. His clan, however, has a mysterious past. To rise up and become the genius he is meant to be, the clan goes through every effort to aid his cultivation as they battle through fanatical monsters and engage in power struggles with other clans. His journey will bring him through unknown lands until he is able to become a person that can truly shake the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qy60bm9admmgpkmcPeW4BvRjjVm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124003'),
