  ('207133974283565659', 'Persons Unknown', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Christopher McQuarrie', null, 'Tina Holmes, Kate Miner, Lola Glaudini, Jason Wiles, Alan Ruck, Gerald Kyd, Kandyse McClure, Chadwick Boseman', 'TV-14', 'A group of strangers must come together to solve the puzzle of their lives.', 'A group of strangers must come together to solve the puzzle of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kp0kGKLo6kPkUakdtzOtWPL5XAI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32817'),
  ('515537131102646502', 'Perversions of Science', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maureen Teefy', 'TV-MA', 'Perversions of Science is a science fiction/horror television series that ran on the cable channel HBO for one season in 1997. It is a spin-off of popular horror series Tales from the Crypt also shown on HBO, and its episodes are based on EC''s Weird Science comic book series. The format of Perversions of Science is very similar to Tales From The Crypt, the show was introduced by a sexualized female robot named Chrome and then an individual episode would start. After the episode was complete, Chrome would conclude Perversions of Science. Most episodes focused on a part of science fiction such as alien invasion or space/time travel. The show featured a mix of established talent and young up-and-comers. "Panic", for instance, starred a young Jason Lee and Jamie Kennedy opposite Harvey Korman. As of 2011 the series has not been released on DVD in the US. However in 2001 it was released in Japan by Pioneer Entertainment where it has since gone out of print subsequently becoming sought after by collectors.', 'Perversions of Science is a science fiction/horror television series that ran on the cable channel HBO for one season in 1997. It is a spin-off of popular horror series Tales from the Crypt also shown on HBO, and its episodes are based on EC''s Weird Science comic book series. The format of Perversions of Science is very similar to Tales From The Crypt, the show was introduced by a sexualized female robot named Chrome and then an individual episode would start. After the episode was complete, Chrome would conclude Perversions of Science. Most episodes focused on a part of science fiction such as alien invasion or space/time travel. The show featured a mix of established talent and young up-and-comers. "Panic", for instance, starred a young Jason Lee and Jamie Kennedy opposite Harvey Korman. As of 2011 the series has not been released on DVD in the US. However in 2001 it was released in Japan by Pioneer Entertainment where it has since gone out of print subsequently becoming sought after by collectors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA4zvjHMICXl5XDpShfemcNSDNv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:322'),
  ('424233498672344636', 'Pervert: Hunting the Strip Search Caller', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sara Mast', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries follows the investigation into a hoax caller who talked managers into strip-searching employees at fast food businesses across the US.', 'This docuseries follows the investigation into a hoax caller who talked managers into strip-searching employees at fast food businesses across the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0hkS7QNAUmhqPqgUu0tUsCL1c0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215117'),
  ('944582263112116688', 'Pesadelo na Cozinha', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Érick Jacquin', 'TV-Y7', 'A Brazilian reality television series in which chef Érick Jacquin is invited by the owners to spend a week with a failing restaurant in an attempt to revive the business.', 'A Brazilian reality television series in which chef Érick Jacquin is invited by the owners to spend a week with a failing restaurant in an attempt to revive the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2lT2aqGce3KlWqlfnQYsmfZ1vq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:69925'),
  ('1143965131729145905', 'Pesci Piccoli: Un'' agenzia, molte idee, poco budget', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Capaldo, Alessandro Grespan', null, 'Ciro Priello, Fabio Balsamo, Aurora Leone, Gianluca Colucci, Martina Tinnirello, Alessia Santalucia, Dino Porzio, Francesca Romana Bergamo', null, 'A small digital agency struggles against the odds while dreaming of something bigger. It finds itself in a tricky situation, between extravagant clients and the challenges of a modest provincial reality.', 'A small digital agency struggles against the odds while dreaming of something bigger. It finds itself in a tricky situation, between extravagant clients and the challenges of a modest provincial reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2toluHSXoBy8ihFAuVg1uBFUkCu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:225226'),
  ('769238594256479685', 'Pest!', 2020, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Maksim Lagashkin, Zoya Berber, Eva Smirnova, Vyacheslav Chepurchenko, Nadezhda Sysoeva, Aleksandr Volokhov, Igor Oznobikhin, Denis Privalov', null, 'The story is about the inhabitants of the fictional town of Hamburg, locked in a castle in quarantine. William, the Messenger who brought the news of the plague, is also locked up in the castle.', 'The story is about the inhabitants of the fictional town of Hamburg, locked in a castle in quarantine. William, the Messenger who brought the news of the plague, is also locked up in the castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qEtmekQXnijDUP6SqzL4xiZaTk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104463'),
  ('764572430758235743', 'Pet', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Keisuke Ueda, Kisho Taniyama, Yuki Ono, Yasuyuki Kase, Shunsuke Sakuya, Koji Yusa, Nobuo Tobita, Mao Ichimichi', 'TV-14', 'The psychic suspense story revolves around people who possess the ability to infiltrate people''s minds and manipulate memories. Their powers have been used in the underworld for covering up incidents, assassinations, and other deeds. These powers can not only destroy other people''s spirits, but also corrupt the users'' own hearts at the same time. The users had to protect their fragile and insecure hearts, as if chained to each other. They are called "pets" out of fear and despising.', 'The psychic suspense story revolves around people who possess the ability to infiltrate people''s minds and manipulate memories. Their powers have been used in the underworld for covering up incidents, assassinations, and other deeds. These powers can not only destroy other people''s spirits, but also corrupt the users'' own hearts at the same time. The users had to protect their fragile and insecure hearts, as if chained to each other. They are called "pets" out of fear and despising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXW7A2FXTvUdtzEtIlPRA6tS9qU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93593'),
  ('960413432652998100', 'Pet Alien', 2005, 'Comedy, Animation, Kids', 'Jeff Muncy', null, 'Charlie Schlatter, Charlie Adler, Jess Harnell, Candi Milo, Bill Fagerbakke', 'TV-Y7', 'As if adolescence weren''t difficult enough, 13-year-old Tommy Cadle must not only find his own place on the planet but also play host and tour guide to a group of feisty aliens who have taken up residence in the lighthouse where he lives.', 'As if adolescence weren''t difficult enough, 13-year-old Tommy Cadle must not only find his own place on the planet but also play host and tour guide to a group of feisty aliens who have taken up residence in the lighthouse where he lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umEj5qWBkJvMi8wawlVJlNbFEjJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1717'),
  ('225473982294475807', 'Pet Shop of Horrors', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Mystery', 'Matsuri Akino', null, 'Toshihiko Seki, Masaya Onosaka, Satsuki Yukino', 'TV-MA', 'Welcome to the most magnificent pet shop in Chinatown! Operated by the shadowy Count D, the shop specializes in rare and hard to come by pets... but with each sale comes a contract. And if that contract is broken, watch out! Detective Orcott has linked many odd and unexplained deaths to Count D''s shop. Will he solve the mystery or fall prey to it?', 'Welcome to the most magnificent pet shop in Chinatown! Operated by the shadowy Count D, the shop specializes in rare and hard to come by pets... but with each sale comes a contract. And if that contract is broken, watch out! Detective Orcott has linked many odd and unexplained deaths to Count D''s shop. Will he solve the mystery or fall prey to it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrGODwtpMjzj8i8VLjKGOdxpUUX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45462'),
  ('760349231805947839', 'Petals of Reincarnation', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery, Animation', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Wakana Maruoka, Ayane Sakura, Haruka Shiraishi, Kaito Ishikawa, Reina Ueda, Marina Inoue, Shugo Nakamura', null, 'Toya Senji is talentless. He''s tried everything but he can''t seem to excel at anything no matter how hard he tries. Then he meets Haito, a Kendo champion and... humanity''s protector? She uses the Stem of Reincarnation to draw on the abilities of her past lives, but it only works when she slits her own throat. And now she wants Toya to join her?!', 'Toya Senji is talentless. He''s tried everything but he can''t seem to excel at anything no matter how hard he tries. Then he meets Haito, a Kendo champion and... humanity''s protector? She uses the Stem of Reincarnation to draw on the abilities of her past lives, but it only works when she slits her own throat. And now she wants Toya to join her?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9gN6vGTBgcjLJMJUnHuM7JTaCe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261780'),
  ('934414556529110529', 'Pete versus Life', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bert Tyler-Moore, George Jeffrie', null, 'Rafe Spall, Reece Ritchie, Scarlett Alice Johnson, Chris Geere, Simon Greenall, Ian Kirkby, Pippa Duffy', null, 'Pete versus Life is a Channel 4 sitcom created by George Jeffrie and Bert Tyler-Moore. It stars Rafe Spall and the first episode was aired on 6 August 2010. It was recommissioned for a second series after averaging 1.6 million viewers and a young demographic during its first run, and series two started airing on 21 October 2011.', 'Pete versus Life is a Channel 4 sitcom created by George Jeffrie and Bert Tyler-Moore. It stars Rafe Spall and the first episode was aired on 6 August 2010. It was recommissioned for a second series after averaging 1.6 million viewers and a young demographic during its first run, and series two started airing on 21 October 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooRm37iwAMdCROLz7mNr5iUysEA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:33405'),
  ('413940932668059959', 'Peter Grill and the Philosopher''s Time', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Yui Ninomiya, Ayana Taketatsu, Hibiku Yamamura, Akari Uehara, Sayaka Senbongi', 'TV-MA', 'Upon winning a fighting tournament and being crowned the world’s strongest warrior, Peter Grill discovers a downside to his newfound fame. Women of all species, from ogres to elves, are scrambling over each other for his seed to ensure they have the strongest babies possible. Poor Peter just wants to settle down with his lovey dovey fiancée, but he’ll have to outmatch, outwit, and outrun a harem of very determined monster girls to do so!', 'Upon winning a fighting tournament and being crowned the world’s strongest warrior, Peter Grill discovers a downside to his newfound fame. Women of all species, from ogres to elves, are scrambling over each other for his seed to ensure they have the strongest babies possible. Poor Peter just wants to settle down with his lovey dovey fiancée, but he’ll have to outmatch, outwit, and outrun a harem of very determined monster girls to do so!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Gf6ugUPhcw0x0GadVByoFtATL6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99080'),
  ('967899706508801552', 'Peter Gunn', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Blake Edwards', 'Blake Edwards', 'Craig Stevens, Lola Albright, Herschel Bernardi, Minerva Urecal', 'TV-PG', 'Peter Gunn is an American private eye television series. Filmed in a film noir atmosphere and featuring Henry Mancini music that could tell you the action with your eyes closed, Peter Gunn worked in style. Known as Pete to his friends and simply as Gunn to his enemies, he did his job in a calm cool way.', 'Peter Gunn is an American private eye television series. Filmed in a film noir atmosphere and featuring Henry Mancini music that could tell you the action with your eyes closed, Peter Gunn worked in style. Known as Pete to his friends and simply as Gunn to his enemies, he did his job in a calm cool way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hE0Un65f1k11GUQTCqk7s0hzokY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10305'),
  ('437667931755391965', 'Peter Kay''s Car Share', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Peter Kay', null, 'Peter Kay, Sian Gibson, Danny Swarsbrick', null, 'John Redmond and Kayleigh Kitson have been thrown together in a company car share scheme, forcing their paths to cross. Each trip brings fresh insight into John and Kayleigh''s lives, with twists and turns in their unlikely relationship.', 'John Redmond and Kayleigh Kitson have been thrown together in a company car share scheme, forcing their paths to cross. Each trip brings fresh insight into John and Kayleigh''s lives, with twists and turns in their unlikely relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvhjwhldWSfslz1CUhDmU3NvZJ5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62557'),
  ('287555641073266366', 'Peter Rabbit', 2013, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'David McCamley', 'Mark Huckerby, Nick Ostler, George Sawyer', 'Harry Henty, Danny Price, Poppy Labrosse, Roger May, Dan Chambers, Sophie Aldred, Gwenfair Vaughan, Joshua Colley', 'TV-Y', 'Nickelodeon brings treasured literary icon Peter Rabbit to life with the new CG-animated preschool series, Peter Rabbit. The series is a fresh re-imagining of the popular Beatrix Potter children’s books based on Peter Rabbit. Peter Rabbit features educational goals that encourage preschoolers to learn problem-solving and interpersonal skills, self-efficacy, resilience, positive re-framing and fostering an interest in and respect for nature.', 'Nickelodeon brings treasured literary icon Peter Rabbit to life with the new CG-animated preschool series, Peter Rabbit. The series is a fresh re-imagining of the popular Beatrix Potter children’s books based on Peter Rabbit. Peter Rabbit features educational goals that encourage preschoolers to learn problem-solving and interpersonal skills, self-efficacy, resilience, positive re-framing and fostering an interest in and respect for nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36MwBWUBwWa61ndbSXGqz7dHYqF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63893'),
  ('795944978651640884', 'Peter the Great: Greater Than Ever', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', null, 'Luis Felipe Salamanca', 'Miguel Varoni, Carlos Torres, Álvaro Bayona, Ana María Trujillo, Melanie Dell’Olmo, Sandra Reyes, Andrea Guzmán, Eduardo Pérez', null, 'After twenty years abroad, Pedro returns to Colombia and once again falls in love with the wrong woman. Fernanda is his son''s boss and future mother-in-law, which puts Junior''s rising career at risk. To protect him, Pedro hides their blood ties from everyone, and works on rebuilding their troubled relationship whilst trying to navigate his love life.', 'After twenty years abroad, Pedro returns to Colombia and once again falls in love with the wrong woman. Fernanda is his son''s boss and future mother-in-law, which puts Junior''s rising career at risk. To protect him, Pedro hides their blood ties from everyone, and works on rebuilding their troubled relationship whilst trying to navigate his love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrDVhW18u5m5iBVvZSmOM6mdLy5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236996'),
  ('334853167737954753', 'Petit Eva: Evangelion@School', 2007, 'Animation', 'Hideaki Anno', null, 'Yuko Miyamura, Megumi Hayashibara, Megumi Ogata, Kotono Mitsuishi', null, 'The series is a parody of Neon Genesis Evangelion, in which the entire cast of the original series are now everyday students going to junior high school together at Tokyo-3. The series features three Rei sisters: one is a child younger than the rest based on Rei 1, the second is based on Rei 2 (the Rei seen for most of the normal series), and the third Rei is actually based on the hyperactive and klutzy Alternate Rei (seen in the alternate-reality dream sequence from the final episode of the original series). Further, Evangelion Unit 01 itself is one of their classmates, but this time as a human-sized robot who acts as something of a class bully. Even the Jet Alone robot is re-imagined as a character on the series.', 'The series is a parody of Neon Genesis Evangelion, in which the entire cast of the original series are now everyday students going to junior high school together at Tokyo-3. The series features three Rei sisters: one is a child younger than the rest based on Rei 1, the second is based on Rei 2 (the Rei seen for most of the normal series), and the third Rei is actually based on the hyperactive and klutzy Alternate Rei (seen in the alternate-reality dream sequence from the final episode of the original series). Further, Evangelion Unit 01 itself is one of their classmates, but this time as a human-sized robot who acts as something of a class bully. Even the Jet Alone robot is re-imagined as a character on the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eK8hiOYwnQTtN9Tw0s2DIjmiR6g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99639'),
  ('996956645139618309', 'Petit SEKAI', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saki Fujita, Asami Shimoda, Yuu Asakawa, Meiko Haigou, Ruriko Noguchi, Karin Isobe, Reina Ueda, Yuki Nakashima', null, 'The first mini-anime series of the smartphone rhythm game "Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku", commonly known as "ProSeka", is now available! Enjoy watching the everyday lives of Leo/need, MORE MORE JUMP!, Vivid BAD SQUAD, Wonderlands×Showtime and 25-ji, Nightcord de.!', 'The first mini-anime series of the smartphone rhythm game "Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku", commonly known as "ProSeka", is now available! Enjoy watching the everyday lives of Leo/need, MORE MORE JUMP!, Vivid BAD SQUAD, Wonderlands×Showtime and 25-ji, Nightcord de.!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it4bJ5g1VozLPAiTGkNoPij5tPN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135149'),
  ('371427824109077705', 'PetitCure ~Precure Fairies~', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'Get all Cure and Relaxed with PetitCure, Precure''s first series featuring "Little Friends."', 'Get all Cure and Relaxed with PetitCure, Precure''s first series featuring "Little Friends."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFOHk8WTmEMvVh2QGL9CuhgGuAn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287971'),
  ('397419774576555302', 'Petite Princess Yucie', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Takami Akai', null, 'Kenji Utsumi, Ayako Kawasumi, Tomohiro Nishimura, Iemasa Kayumi, Tomoko Kaneda, Chiaki Maeda, Yoshito Yasuhara, Yuki Matsuoka', null, 'Yucie, is a 17-year-old who is trapped in a 10-year-old''s body, her and her friends are all designated as Platinum Princess candidates and compete to receive the Eternal Tiara which grants any wish.', 'Yucie, is a 17-year-old who is trapped in a 10-year-old''s body, her and her friends are all designated as Platinum Princess candidates and compete to receive the Eternal Tiara which grants any wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64MGDzxzF7AKrKtIn2seCLX1Jcj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34106'),
  ('506338854450055845', 'Petits Meurtres en famille', 2006, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Agatha Christie, Anne Giafferi, Murielle Magellan', null, 'Robert Hossein, Antoine Duléry, Marius Colucci, Bruno Todeschini, Elsa Zylberstein, Grégori Derangère, Marie Bunel, Mathias Mlekuz', null, 'In 1939, on the eve of the declaration of war, Simon Le Tescou gathered his family together for his 70th birthday. But that same evening, he was brutally murdered in his bedroom. Inspector Larosière, assisted by Emile Lampion, his loyal deputy, quickly discovered that this family''s closets were full of skeletons...', 'In 1939, on the eve of the declaration of war, Simon Le Tescou gathered his family together for his 70th birthday. But that same evening, he was brutally murdered in his bedroom. Inspector Larosière, assisted by Emile Lampion, his loyal deputy, quickly discovered that this family''s closets were full of skeletons...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k1kQhF4eIaAAf1QUncQyuhaWVl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74598'),
  ('1017206541030053110', 'Petra', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Maria Sole Tognazzi', null, 'Andrea Pennacchi, Paola Cortellesi, Antonio Zavatteri', 'NR', 'Genoa. Two failed marriages behind her, free from romantic ties, unconventional, and constantly searching for her place in the world, protagonist Petra Delicato—played by Paola Cortellesi—formerly a lawyer, now an inspector in the Flying Squad. Thanks to her new assignment, which will lead her to face new challenges, she will be able to get back on track, not only professionally. Her frankness, her direct manner, and her biting, witty wit will also shape her relationship with her colleague Monte (Andrea Pennacchi), with whom, despite their numerous personality differences, she will build a solid professional affinity as well as a sincere friendship.', 'Genoa. Two failed marriages behind her, free from romantic ties, unconventional, and constantly searching for her place in the world, protagonist Petra Delicato—played by Paola Cortellesi—formerly a lawyer, now an inspector in the Flying Squad. Thanks to her new assignment, which will lead her to face new challenges, she will be able to get back on track, not only professionally. Her frankness, her direct manner, and her biting, witty wit will also shape her relationship with her colleague Monte (Andrea Pennacchi), with whom, despite their numerous personality differences, she will build a solid professional affinity as well as a sincere friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNU7rb01v2KhimbnS2SdGqSfC9r.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:109456'),
  ('1053441750073510538', 'Petrichor', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Sammon', null, 'Engfa Waraha, Charlotte Austin, Malin Sae-lim, Rina Chatamonchai, Vanessa Herrmann, Naphat Vikairungroj, Athiwad Sanidwong Na Ayoodthayaa, Pruet Nakprad', null, 'Tul''s first field visit after just moving to work was not smooth. To make matters worse, he had to work with Cherran, the forensic doctor in charge of the case. Both of them have very different personalities and attitudes, which made them not get along very well. Not to mention the social pressures they had to face when all the cases were in the public eye, which all affected the cases. However, when there were opportunities for them to work together more often, their relationship started to improve. However, the story was more complicated than expected when one day a murder occurred that was similar to the one that a serial killer had committed 18 years ago. Was this the work of the "Raindrop Killer" or was it a copycat of another killer?', 'Tul''s first field visit after just moving to work was not smooth. To make matters worse, he had to work with Cherran, the forensic doctor in charge of the case. Both of them have very different personalities and attitudes, which made them not get along very well. Not to mention the social pressures they had to face when all the cases were in the public eye, which all affected the cases. However, when there were opportunities for them to work together more often, their relationship started to improve. However, the story was more complicated than expected when one day a murder occurred that was similar to the one that a serial killer had committed 18 years ago. Was this the work of the "Raindrop Killer" or was it a copycat of another killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKkVvz9K546om3dQ3Bt8uKNcyq1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258538'),
  ('746231994704550539', 'Petrocelli', 1974, 'Drama', 'Sidney J. Furie', null, 'Barry Newman, Albert Salmi, David Huddleston, Susan Howard', null, 'Tony Petrocelli is an Italian-American Harvard-educated lawyer who gave up the big money and frenetic pace of major-metropolitan life to practice in a sleepy city in the American Southwest. He and wife Maggie live in a trailer in the country while waiting for their new house to be built, and travel around in a beat-up old pickup truck. For a quiet rural area, Petrocelli seems to have no trouble running into his share of murderers to defend.', 'Tony Petrocelli is an Italian-American Harvard-educated lawyer who gave up the big money and frenetic pace of major-metropolitan life to practice in a sleepy city in the American Southwest. He and wife Maggie live in a trailer in the country while waiting for their new house to be built, and travel around in a beat-up old pickup truck. For a quiet rural area, Petrocelli seems to have no trouble running into his share of murderers to defend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YffWt26OAnYG7aeB1O1Z1QeXBb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11667'),
  ('1081409441057754867', 'Pett Kata Shaw', 2022, 'Mystery', 'Nuhash Humayun', 'Gultekin Khan', null, null, 'Pett Kata Shaw takes the darkest most nefarious Bengali folk tales that survived generations and gives them a modern twist. Our stories and our culture must live on. Ghost stories too.', 'Pett Kata Shaw takes the darkest most nefarious Bengali folk tales that survived generations and gives them a modern twist. Our stories and our culture must live on. Ghost stories too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNQ2bAOiZLJdQoYEFz0wWhOKgZV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197610'),
  ('380093082888541549', 'Petticoat Junction', 1963, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paul Henning', null, 'Mike Minor, Meredith MacRae, Lori Saunders, Edgar Buchanan, Frank Cady, June Lockhart, Linda Henning', 'TV-G', 'The Bradley family are proud owners of the Shady Rest Hotel. Kate and her three young daughters do the job of running the hotel.', 'The Bradley family are proud owners of the Shady Rest Hotel. Kate and her three young daughters do the job of running the hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kTGzz870hmdmQ074CYTdKFRqSm.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3346'),
  ('422841632166521362', 'Peua Mae Pae Bor Daai', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pongsak Chimchroen', null, 'Pathompong Reonchaidee, Nicha Piyavattananon, Zak Chumpae, Hay Chutima, Fon Thanasoonthorn, Preaw Anusara Wantongtak, Kittipol Kesmanee', null, 'Koi is a young woman who has grown up in a rubber tree plantation her entire life, and now has dreams of improving it. Unfortunately, the powerful millionaire who is the plantation''s creditor has plans to seize it for himself, but Koi refuses to allow that to happen. Trin is a young businessman who owns a rubber mattress factory and makes an offer to buy her family''s plantation. Because Koi has no intention of letting anyone take her plantation, the two enter into a rivalry.', 'Koi is a young woman who has grown up in a rubber tree plantation her entire life, and now has dreams of improving it. Unfortunately, the powerful millionaire who is the plantation''s creditor has plans to seize it for himself, but Koi refuses to allow that to happen. Trin is a young businessman who owns a rubber mattress factory and makes an offer to buy her family''s plantation. Because Koi has no intention of letting anyone take her plantation, the two enter into a rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpCCB3ItFhm6yiNDwxBz3dRfV1q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218479'),
  ('701871240218070338', 'Pezzi unici', 2019, 'Drama', 'Cinzia TH Torrini, Fabrizio Lucherini, Donatella Diamanti', null, 'Sergio Castellitto, Lorenzo de Moor, Anna Manuelli', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfWdg2a8a8PhMHOey4tRW6qd2TZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96065'),
  ('1101052853632471527', 'Pfarrer Braun', 2003, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Rainer Poelmeyer', null, 'Ottfried Fischer, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Hansi Jochmann, Peter Heinrich Brix, Gilbert von Sohlern, Antonio Wannek', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8Yb2Em7m4dLPX0ITzrJpVLsWbY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40689'),
  ('738180333662402316', 'Phantasy Star Online 2: Episode Oracle', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Satomi Sato, Hiro Shimono, Megumi Ogata, Takahiro Sakurai, Ryohei Kimura, Yoko Hikasa, Nobuo Tobita', null, 'In the abyss of space, the Oracle fleet continues to explore new planets and confront the dangers of the horrific Falspawn. Recently graduated ARKS Cadet, Ash, is unprepared for the war that he''s now part of, nor the revelations that will come from it.', 'In the abyss of space, the Oracle fleet continues to explore new planets and confront the dangers of the horrific Falspawn. Recently graduated ARKS Cadet, Ash, is unprepared for the war that he''s now part of, nor the revelations that will come from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f89UBSLFrF2HRqmyxSFnhfZQny5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93830'),
  ('118507765054613439', 'Phantasy Star Online 2: The Animation', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hiroki Takahashi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Mao Ichimichi, Rie Murakawa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Marika Kouno, Shouta Aoi', null, 'Itsuki Tachibana is a student of Seiga Academy, a co-ed boarding high school with excellent reputation, located in a suburb outside the city center. On a day of second semester, he was summoned by Rina Izumi, the most esteemed and praised chairperson, to the student council room, without knowing what awaits him.', 'Itsuki Tachibana is a student of Seiga Academy, a co-ed boarding high school with excellent reputation, located in a suburb outside the city center. On a day of second semester, he was summoned by Rina Izumi, the most esteemed and praised chairperson, to the student council room, without knowing what awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvDAs3ajXJdd8IaVMkjrjRhRmKi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65209'),
  ('164108221925654746', 'Phantom 2040', 1994, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lee Falk', null, 'Scott Valentine, Carrie Snodgress, Harlan Ellison, Jeff Bennett, Margot Kidder, Paul Williams, Richard Lynch', 'TV-Y7', 'Phantom 2040 is a French-American animated science fiction television series loosely based on the comic strip hero The Phantom, created by Lee Falk. The central character of the series is said to be the 24th Phantom. The unusual character designs are the work of Peter Chung, creator of Æon Flux. The show debuted in 1994 to rave reviews, though it survived only 35 episodes before it was relegated to weekend repeats in 1996. Along with action sequences, stories focused on intelligent plotting and character development, winning the series praise for its subtle teaching of such values as individuality, freedom, and the volatility of humanity. It also spawned comic books tie-ins and other merchandise. Featured voice actors included Scott Valentine, Margot Kidder, Ron Perlman, and Jeff Bennett, while Mark Hamill, Debbie Harry, Rob Paulsen, and Paul Williams had recurring roles.', 'Phantom 2040 is a French-American animated science fiction television series loosely based on the comic strip hero The Phantom, created by Lee Falk. The central character of the series is said to be the 24th Phantom. The unusual character designs are the work of Peter Chung, creator of Æon Flux. The show debuted in 1994 to rave reviews, though it survived only 35 episodes before it was relegated to weekend repeats in 1996. Along with action sequences, stories focused on intelligent plotting and character development, winning the series praise for its subtle teaching of such values as individuality, freedom, and the volatility of humanity. It also spawned comic books tie-ins and other merchandise. Featured voice actors included Scott Valentine, Margot Kidder, Ron Perlman, and Jeff Bennett, while Mark Hamill, Debbie Harry, Rob Paulsen, and Paul Williams had recurring roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5JzhfWxUAZZZWhcdWNnWjKI1vc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2017'),
  ('965925186272799200', 'Phantom in the Twilight', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Tomokazu Sugita, Daiki Yamashita, Rikiya Koyama, Junichi Suwabe, Yuki Ono', 'TV-PG', 'The reverie of a girl who fights her destiny and the "Shadow Guardians." The stage is modern-day London, in a world where the fears and anxieties of people give birth to inhuman shadows. A foreign student gets embroiled in an outlandish incident as soon as she sets foot on English soil. Seeking help in a city where she knows no one, she wanders into a quaint cafe that has quietly remained open in the dead of night: Cafe Forbidden. It is a place where the guardians of the border between human and shadow gather.', 'The reverie of a girl who fights her destiny and the "Shadow Guardians." The stage is modern-day London, in a world where the fears and anxieties of people give birth to inhuman shadows. A foreign student gets embroiled in an outlandish incident as soon as she sets foot on English soil. Seeking help in a city where she knows no one, she wanders into a quaint cafe that has quietly remained open in the dead of night: Cafe Forbidden. It is a place where the guardians of the border between human and shadow gather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svQgyQM9mnEeQC8KtbNvU6Bhs76.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80561'),
  ('657509327266223920', 'Phantom India', 1969, 'Documentary', null, 'Louis Malle, Guy Bechtel', 'Louis Malle', null, 'Louis Malle called his gorgeous and groundbreaking Phantom India the most personal film of his career. And this extraordinary journey to India, originally shown as a miniseries on European television, is infused with his sense of discovery, as well as occasional outrage, intrigue, and joy.', 'Louis Malle called his gorgeous and groundbreaking Phantom India the most personal film of his career. And this extraordinary journey to India, originally shown as a miniseries on European television, is infused with his sense of discovery, as well as occasional outrage, intrigue, and joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51cptkoGoeqJXi9yJyGfQ9ttPEk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77276'),
  ('530313422775062428', 'Phantom Lawyer', 2026, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Shin Joong-hoon, Kang Chul-kyu', null, 'Yoo Yeon-seok, Esom, Jun Suk-ho, Kim Kyung-nam, Choi Gwang-il, Kim Mi-kyeong, Son Yeo-eun, Jung Seung-kil', null, 'A timid lawyer who suddenly gains the ability to see ghosts teams up with a cold, elite attorney, and together they take on supernatural clients whose unfinished business reveals buried truths.', 'A timid lawyer who suddenly gains the ability to see ghosts teams up with a cold, elite attorney, and together they take on supernatural clients whose unfinished business reveals buried truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3w0uZi4THuRh1JB8gF452mRLq7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281010'),
  ('398869550757099941', 'Phantom of the Idol', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Fumiya Imai, Nao Toyama, Shun Horie, Eri Kitamura, Hitomi Ueda, You Taichi, Manaka Iwami, Show Hayami', 'TV-14', 'Yuya is part of the idol duo ZINGS, but his laziness and disdain for fans puts him in danger of getting blacklisted. That is, until he meets Asahi, the ghost of a former idol who’s eager to stage her own comeback by possessing Yuya''s willing body!', 'Yuya is part of the idol duo ZINGS, but his laziness and disdain for fans puts him in danger of getting blacklisted. That is, until he meets Asahi, the ghost of a former idol who’s eager to stage her own comeback by possessing Yuya''s willing body!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IdfV3itweGwvm8se5ct65qKhie.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139551'),
  ('724633678436547238', 'Phantom Pups', 2022, 'Family', 'Anna McRoberts', null, 'Jett Klyne, Thalia Campbell, Eva Brooke Baker, Evan Marsh, Kelli Ogmundson, Ryan Belleville, Enid-Raye Adams, Evelyn Burke', 'TV-Y', 'A young boy and his family move into a haunted home, where he meets three adorable ghost pups and tries to help them turn back into real dogs.', 'A young boy and his family move into a haunted home, where he meets three adorable ghost pups and tries to help them turn back into real dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqGRszJ2JyXtRTVDmGGyrwM0sJD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210694'),
  ('932707880615175209', 'Phantom Quest Corp.', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Koichi Yamadera, Kazue Ikura, Rica Matsumoto, Naoko Watanabe, Kotono Mitsuishi, Aya Hisakawa, Yusaku Yara', 'TV-14', 'Ayaka Kisaragi is a beautiful woman descended from a long line of Japanese exorcists. However, bored with their traditions, she started her own business, Phantom Quest Corp. Although she is very competent with her skills, Ayaka''s own bad habits often cut into the company''s meager earnings and interfere with paying the various experts whose help she usually depends upon.', 'Ayaka Kisaragi is a beautiful woman descended from a long line of Japanese exorcists. However, bored with their traditions, she started her own business, Phantom Quest Corp. Although she is very competent with her skills, Ayaka''s own bad habits often cut into the company''s meager earnings and interfere with paying the various experts whose help she usually depends upon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkO9PLX8E2ur5RM1ZOk0cz5isIg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44422'),
  ('1061743776351645551', 'Phantom School', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tan, NC.A, Lim Sung-kyun, Kim Seo-yeon, Cha Jae-hoon', null, 'Nestled quietly in the heart of a buzzing community, there sits a school that to any who might pass it by, appears to be quite normal. However, as is often the case, looks can be quite deceiving. Inhabited by several malicious phantoms, this school plays host to more than its dedicated faculty and lively student body.', 'Nestled quietly in the heart of a buzzing community, there sits a school that to any who might pass it by, appears to be quite normal. However, as is often the case, looks can be quite deceiving. Inhabited by several malicious phantoms, this school plays host to more than its dedicated faculty and lively student body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxNFd7xXuLi9xfzK5mbMpcGnsJF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214557'),
  ('344048008240282915', 'Phantom: Requiem for the Phantom', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Miyu Irino, Ayahi Takagaki, Miyuki Sawashiro, Aya Hisakawa, Isshin Chiba, Akeno Watanabe, Tomoyuki Shimura, Ami Koshimizu', null, 'Mafia is rife in America where assassinations are a regular occurrence on the streets. Inferno, a mysterious company, is behind most of these dealings through the use of their near-invincible human weapon, "Phantom." One day, a Japanese tourist accidentally witnesses Phantom''s latest murder. Desperate to escape, the tourist hides in a secluded building. However, Phantom, revealed to be a young woman named Ein, and the leader of Inferno "Scythe Master" captures the tourist and brainwashes him. Given the name "Zwei," this once peaceful tourist is now a puppet of Inferno with no memories. Drawn into a world of lies, deceit, and violence, Zwei must fight to survive, hopefully to one day regain his memories and escape from this world where he is constantly on the brink of death.', 'Mafia is rife in America where assassinations are a regular occurrence on the streets. Inferno, a mysterious company, is behind most of these dealings through the use of their near-invincible human weapon, "Phantom." One day, a Japanese tourist accidentally witnesses Phantom''s latest murder. Desperate to escape, the tourist hides in a secluded building. However, Phantom, revealed to be a young woman named Ein, and the leader of Inferno "Scythe Master" captures the tourist and brainwashes him. Given the name "Zwei," this once peaceful tourist is now a puppet of Inferno with no memories. Drawn into a world of lies, deceit, and violence, Zwei must fight to survive, hopefully to one day regain his memories and escape from this world where he is constantly on the brink of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkA2spPJbtaDvx2qz0rQC5af5HR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22254'),
  ('1064042705543654973', 'Phi', 2017, 'Drama', 'Akilah Azra Kohen', 'Özlem Yücel, Nükhet Bıçakçı', 'Ozan Güven, Serenay Sarıkaya, Mehmet Günsür, Berrak Tüzünataç, Büşra Develi, Osman Sonant, Müjgân Ferhan Şensoy, Hakan Atalay', null, 'Can Manay is a celebrated psychologist, famed for his expertise in his field. A consummate bachelor he beds women but rarely falls in love. And yet, following his first encounter with Duru, he is immediately besotted, to the extent that he buys the house next door to her’s, determined to get closer to her. Until her new neighbour moves in, Duru has lived happily with her musician boyfriend, Deniz. Can’s mind-games ensure that she starts to question their relationship however, though she is not aware of the full extent of Can’s scheming. Meanwhile a cast of characters - Bilge, a student of Can’s; Özge, a journalist working on an exposé of the celebrity psychologist; and of course Deniz - will find their lives changed forever, by Manay’s crazed pursuit of love.', 'Can Manay is a celebrated psychologist, famed for his expertise in his field. A consummate bachelor he beds women but rarely falls in love. And yet, following his first encounter with Duru, he is immediately besotted, to the extent that he buys the house next door to her’s, determined to get closer to her. Until her new neighbour moves in, Duru has lived happily with her musician boyfriend, Deniz. Can’s mind-games ensure that she starts to question their relationship however, though she is not aware of the full extent of Can’s scheming. Meanwhile a cast of characters - Bilge, a student of Can’s; Özge, a journalist working on an exposé of the celebrity psychologist; and of course Deniz - will find their lives changed forever, by Manay’s crazed pursuit of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/som7NMElzXyQf6kw3IQrrPnqAFV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71036'),
  ('672111370045837113', 'Phi Brain: Puzzle of God', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shintaro Asanuma, Kaori Shimizu, Jun Fukuyama, Mamoru Miyano, Daisuke Ono, Satsuki Yukino, Takahiro Sakurai, Kouki Miyata', 'TV-14', 'Phi Brain: Puzzle of God is a 2011 Japanese anime television series produced by Sunrise. The first two series aired on NHK Educational TV between October 2011 and September 2012, with a third season to begin airing in October 2013. The series is directed by Junichi Sato with script supervision by Mayori Sekijima. Hajime Yatate, the collective penname for the creative staff at Sunrise, is credited with the original story. The anime has been licensed in North America by Sentai Filmworks. A manga adaptation by Yoshiki Togawa began serialization in Kadokawa Shoten''s Newtype Ace magazine from November 2011. A PlayStation Portable video game by Arc System Works was released on May 31, 2012.', 'Phi Brain: Puzzle of God is a 2011 Japanese anime television series produced by Sunrise. The first two series aired on NHK Educational TV between October 2011 and September 2012, with a third season to begin airing in October 2013. The series is directed by Junichi Sato with script supervision by Mayori Sekijima. Hajime Yatate, the collective penname for the creative staff at Sunrise, is credited with the original story. The anime has been licensed in North America by Sentai Filmworks. A manga adaptation by Yoshiki Togawa began serialization in Kadokawa Shoten''s Newtype Ace magazine from November 2011. A PlayStation Portable video game by Arc System Works was released on May 31, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvSfAmjKMND6KdSDO4icS3hZSPe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42555'),
  ('820327033096476794', 'Phil of the Future', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Tim Maile, Douglas Tuber', null, 'Raviv Ullman, Amy Bruckner, Aly Michalka, Craig Anton, Lise Simms', 'TV-PG', 'Meet the Diffy family, a futuristic family from the year 2121. When the eccentric dad, Lloyd, rents a time machine for their family vacation, everyone is excited. But then something goes wrong. Their time machine malfunctions and they are thrown out of the space/time continuum in the year 2004.', 'Meet the Diffy family, a futuristic family from the year 2121. When the eccentric dad, Lloyd, rents a time machine for their family vacation, everyone is excited. But then something goes wrong. Their time machine malfunctions and they are thrown out of the space/time continuum in the year 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq3GfvfcWnaI8IgQwocz6mhNkzb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1528'),
  ('466346572791306352', 'Philharmonia', 2019, 'Drama', 'Marine Gacem', null, 'Marie-Sophie Ferdane, Lina El Arabi, Tomer Sisley, Laurent Bateau, François Vincentelli, Charlie Bruneau, Tom Novembre, Guillaume Dolmans', null, 'Hélène Barizet is a gifted conductor with a sulphurous reputation. Named against the advice of management and musicians, she has a season to make her place and save the orchestra. The maestro chooses Selena Riviere, a young virtuoso violinist to help her. But how to transmit when all we want is to break with the past?', 'Hélène Barizet is a gifted conductor with a sulphurous reputation. Named against the advice of management and musicians, she has a season to make her place and save the orchestra. The maestro chooses Selena Riviere, a young virtuoso violinist to help her. But how to transmit when all we want is to break with the past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xV9zp8nhqGHNikueEBShrfwzlba.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85957'),
  ('232845019982833391', 'Philip K. Dick''s Electric Dreams', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Philip K. Dick', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A diverse anthology of ambitious, moving tales inspired by Philip K Dick''s short stories.', 'A diverse anthology of ambitious, moving tales inspired by Philip K Dick''s short stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyaNrGepu4HbkjLFkK6vgua1vgn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70391'),
  ('1147396098559611310', 'Philip Marlowe, Private Eye', 1983, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Powers Boothe', null, 'Philip Marlowe, Private Eye is a British mystery series that aired on ITV in the United Kingdom under the shorter title ''Marlowe, Private Eye'' and on HBO in the United States from April 16, 1983 through June 3, 1986. The series features Powers Boothe as Raymond Chandler''s titular character, and was the first drama produced for HBO.', 'Philip Marlowe, Private Eye is a British mystery series that aired on ITV in the United Kingdom under the shorter title ''Marlowe, Private Eye'' and on HBO in the United States from April 16, 1983 through June 3, 1986. The series features Powers Boothe as Raymond Chandler''s titular character, and was the first drama produced for HBO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3DZX159G1Esl7CGZtABu2ZZnrD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1064'),
  ('640804435915581339', 'Phineas and Ferb', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Dan Povenmire, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh', null, 'Vincent Martella, David Errigo Jr., Ashley French, Caroline Rhea, Dee Bradley Baker, Alyson Stoner, Dan Povenmire, Jeff ''Swampy'' Marsh', 'TV-G', 'Each day, two kindhearted suburban stepbrothers on summer vacation embark on some grand new project, which annoys their controlling sister, Candace, who tries to bust them. Meanwhile, their pet platypus plots against evil Dr. Doofenshmirtz.', 'Each day, two kindhearted suburban stepbrothers on summer vacation embark on some grand new project, which annoys their controlling sister, Candace, who tries to bust them. Meanwhile, their pet platypus plots against evil Dr. Doofenshmirtz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6TidT7be954rrzPPBTIXkSmfXj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1877'),
  ('570557920056881242', 'Phoenix', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alison Nisselle, Tony McDonald', null, 'Sean Scully, Simon Westaway, Peter Cummins, Susie Edmonds, Keith Agius, David Bradshaw, Stuart McCreery, Jennifer Jarman-Walker', null, 'Phoenix is an Australian police drama television series. Phoenix screened as two thirteen-part series on Australian Broadcasting Corporation in 1992 and 1993. The first series of Phoenix in 1992 recounted the investigation of the bombing of the Victorian state police headquarters, loosely based on a real case in the mid-1980s, the Russell Street Bombing. It was aided by extensive research into police techniques and was lauded as one of the most realistic depictions of police investigation techniques, including both surveillance and forensics, as well as having an involving storyline. The series was notable for its dark visual tone and for its no-holds-barred attitude to violence and language. It spawned a second thirteen-part series, Phoenix II, in 1993 as well as a spin-off series, Janus, in 1994 devoted to the machinations of court cases. The series was created and produced by Tony McDonald and Alison Nisselle and screened by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. The ABC have released Series 1 and 2 on DVD as a 4 DVD box set.', 'Phoenix is an Australian police drama television series. Phoenix screened as two thirteen-part series on Australian Broadcasting Corporation in 1992 and 1993. The first series of Phoenix in 1992 recounted the investigation of the bombing of the Victorian state police headquarters, loosely based on a real case in the mid-1980s, the Russell Street Bombing. It was aided by extensive research into police techniques and was lauded as one of the most realistic depictions of police investigation techniques, including both surveillance and forensics, as well as having an involving storyline. The series was notable for its dark visual tone and for its no-holds-barred attitude to violence and language. It spawned a second thirteen-part series, Phoenix II, in 1993 as well as a spin-off series, Janus, in 1994 devoted to the machinations of court cases. The series was created and produced by Tony McDonald and Alison Nisselle and screened by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. The ABC have released Series 1 and 2 on DVD as a 4 DVD box set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKhBq0tax6rW6pBTObP8Wp7Ta8x.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13612'),
  ('977619050462716831', 'Phoenix', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Sakiko Tamagawa, Shinji Ogawa, Keiko Takeshita, Yumi Touma, Yumi Nakatani', null, 'Throughout time, mankind has chased after the dream of immortality. The Phoenix, in the form of a bird of fire, is said to hold the key to eternal life. Great wars are fought in a vain attempt to possess it and, as a result, civilizations rise and fall. Phoenix is a collection of five stories from the past, present and future. Many will perish because of their desires, and they are the lucky ones. True pain comes for those who find immortality and experience the burden of living forever.', 'Throughout time, mankind has chased after the dream of immortality. The Phoenix, in the form of a bird of fire, is said to hold the key to eternal life. Great wars are fought in a vain attempt to possess it and, as a result, civilizations rise and fall. Phoenix is a collection of five stories from the past, present and future. Many will perish because of their desires, and they are the lucky ones. True pain comes for those who find immortality and experience the burden of living forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Yl81wFcrgrRvYz0UAR41AaSXnU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:23674'),
  ('395875070196713629', 'Phoenix Nights', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Peter Kay, Dave Spikey', null, 'Peter Kay, Dave Spikey, Neil Fitzmaurice, Paddy McGuinness, Justin Moorhouse, Archie Kelly, Daniel Kitson, Janice Connolly', null, 'The owner of The Phoenix Club is the wheelchair-bound Brian Potter, who has presided over two clubs in the past: the first (The Aquarius) flooded, the second (The Neptune) burned down. His ambition (with the help of Jerry St Clair) is to see The Phoenix Club become the most popular in Bolton and thus outdo his arch-nemesis, Den Perry, owner of rival club The Banana Grove.', 'The owner of The Phoenix Club is the wheelchair-bound Brian Potter, who has presided over two clubs in the past: the first (The Aquarius) flooded, the second (The Neptune) burned down. His ambition (with the help of Jerry St Clair) is to see The Phoenix Club become the most popular in Bolton and thus outdo his arch-nemesis, Den Perry, owner of rival club The Banana Grove.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZcUdxCsd53o3Npp53wD9hfOZCh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2331'),
  ('439371130879224394', 'Phoenix Rising', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Evan Rachel Wood, Sara Wood, Ira David Wood III, Ira David Wood IV, Illma Gore', 'TV-MA', 'Actress and activist Evan Rachel Wood takes her experience as a survivor of domestic violence and pursues justice, heals generational wounds, and reclaims her story. Almost a decade after escaping a dangerous relationship, Wood co-authors and successfully lobbies for passage of The Phoenix Act, legislation that extends the statute of limitations for domestic violence cases in California.', 'Actress and activist Evan Rachel Wood takes her experience as a survivor of domestic violence and pursues justice, heals generational wounds, and reclaims her story. Almost a decade after escaping a dangerous relationship, Wood co-authors and successfully lobbies for passage of The Phoenix Act, legislation that extends the statute of limitations for domestic violence cases in California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y400KxI6wZiWEHwZBYxyfGU58E7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158320'),
  ('888713620381991008', 'Phoenix: Eden17', 2023, 'Animation', null, null, 'Rie Miyazawa, Honoka Yoshida, Yosuke Kubozuka, Issey Ogata, Ryohei Kimura, Shintaro Asanuma', 'TV-MA', 'In the age of space exploration, Romi and George flee a devastated Earth in search of a new world.', 'In the age of space exploration, Romi and George flee a devastated Earth in search of a new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMhJg3twKFWzOWeUYN8XEQAtGlZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215402'),
  ('367777479437394176', 'PhoneShop', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Phil Bowker', null, 'Tom Bennett, Martin Trenaman, Emma Fryer, Andrew Brooke, Javone Prince', null, 'PhoneShop is a British sitcom that was first broadcast on Channel 4 as a television pilot on 13 November 2009, as part of the channel''s Comedy Showcase season of comedy pilots. It was then followed by a six-episode series that was commissioned on E4 and broadcasting began on 7 October 2010.', 'PhoneShop is a British sitcom that was first broadcast on Channel 4 as a television pilot on 13 November 2009, as part of the channel''s Comedy Showcase season of comedy pilots. It was then followed by a six-episode series that was commissioned on E4 and broadcasting began on 7 October 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceVKwlBehhIAEJYUZJexcoMYVEH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31370'),
  ('681023311072227415', 'Photokano', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Akitoshi Yokoyama', null, 'Kaori Mizuhashi, Hisako Kanemoto, Miyuki Sawashiro, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kanae Itou, Chiwa Saito, Asuka Ohgame, Mai Nakahara', null, 'During Kazuya Maeda''s first year of high school he felt like a nobody, just another forgotten face shuffling through the crowded hallways. Even his best friend from childhood, Nimi, seemed somehow more difficult to approach, since she had matured a little quicker in the unsettling way that girls have a habit of doing. However, this year, things will be different for Kazuya, and part of that change may just be because of the big new chick magnet hanging in front of him: The used digital SLR he just received from his dad! But will just having a camera be enough to make talking to girls a snap? Well, if he stays focused and proves to be good enough at making them look good, it might just be! And since it''s digital, there are no negatives or having to wait for things to develop! Will Kazyuya''s new stock-in-trade click with the most beautiful girls in school, or will his career as a lensman be just a flash in the pan?', 'During Kazuya Maeda''s first year of high school he felt like a nobody, just another forgotten face shuffling through the crowded hallways. Even his best friend from childhood, Nimi, seemed somehow more difficult to approach, since she had matured a little quicker in the unsettling way that girls have a habit of doing. However, this year, things will be different for Kazuya, and part of that change may just be because of the big new chick magnet hanging in front of him: The used digital SLR he just received from his dad! But will just having a camera be enough to make talking to girls a snap? Well, if he stays focused and proves to be good enough at making them look good, it might just be! And since it''s digital, there are no negatives or having to wait for things to develop! Will Kazyuya''s new stock-in-trade click with the most beautiful girls in school, or will his career as a lensman be just a flash in the pan?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8U1WcV6N1uQ0KmN5hTzwpZmXJg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:56081'),
  ('109548175089109725', 'Photon: The Idiot Adventures', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Masaki Kajishima', null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Yui Horie, Kozue Yoshizumi, Koichi Yamadera, Yuri Amano, Yumi Ichihara', 'TV-MA', 'Photon, a young man with a kind heart and superhuman strength, leaves his village on Sandy Planet (a desert world) in search of a runaway friend. During this heroic quest, he is accidentally engaged to a renegade space pilot! Now they''re on the run from the evil emperor of the galaxy and his bumbling henchmen. But even worse than the incompetent bad guys are the disastrous cooking contests, exploding spas and cheer-leading aliens!', 'Photon, a young man with a kind heart and superhuman strength, leaves his village on Sandy Planet (a desert world) in search of a runaway friend. During this heroic quest, he is accidentally engaged to a renegade space pilot! Now they''re on the run from the evil emperor of the galaxy and his bumbling henchmen. But even worse than the incompetent bad guys are the disastrous cooking contests, exploding spas and cheer-leading aliens!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZibCOrGoSCPA7MQ7MGDdj3morh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39383'),
  ('316729114152193555', 'Physical', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Annie Weisman', 'Jackie Li', 'Rose Byrne, Rory Scovel, Dierdre Friel, Paul Sparks', 'TV-MA', 'Sheila Rubin is a quietly tormented housewife in ’80s San Diego. Behind closed doors, she battles extreme personal demons and a vicious inner voice. But things change when she discovers aerobics, sparking a journey toward empowerment and success.', 'Sheila Rubin is a quietly tormented housewife in ’80s San Diego. Behind closed doors, she battles extreme personal demons and a vicious inner voice. But things change when she discovers aerobics, sparking a journey toward empowerment and success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rViN9CbQcR1QB04c2D34m1O6KvX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119181'),
  ('1108790082083314546', 'Physical: 100', 2023, 'Reality', 'Jang Ho-gi', null, null, 'TV-14', 'One hundred contestants in top physical shape compete in a series of grueling challenges to claim the honor — and cash reward — as the last one standing.', 'One hundred contestants in top physical shape compete in a series of grueling challenges to claim the honor — and cash reward — as the last one standing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl9XwsuGGzvbAWlHLTNTFIWcgK6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:210905'),
  ('1082512357774753105', 'Physical: Asia', 2025, 'Reality', 'Jang Ho-gi', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Elite athletes from eight countries battle for national pride. After grueling tests of raw strength and endurance, only one flag can claim victory.', 'Elite athletes from eight countries battle for national pride. After grueling tests of raw strength and endurance, only one flag can claim victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osa3I6CuabnCEpNgFOvFMLLS7yP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293613'),
  ('731093863230995318', 'Physics or Chemistry', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carlos Montero', null, 'Andrea Duro, Javier Calvo, Sandra Blázquez, Adrián Rodríguez, Lucía Ramos, Nasser Saleh, Àlex Batllori, Lorena Mateo', 'NR', 'It tells the stories of a group of teachers and students from a central fictional school in Madrid. Under the gaze of some new teachers, newcomers to the center, we will know the passions, interests, aspirations and dreams of a group of rebellious teenagers who are in their last years of high school.', 'It tells the stories of a group of teachers and students from a central fictional school in Madrid. Under the gaze of some new teachers, newcomers to the center, we will know the passions, interests, aspirations and dreams of a group of rebellious teenagers who are in their last years of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KLAEArPsbnbdNQ1hKjNDbzHbNU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:21631'),
  ('342397111860060415', 'Physics or Chemistry: The Reunion', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Andrea Duro, Maxi Iglesias, Adam Jezierski, Angy Fernández, Javier Calvo, Leonor Martín, Adrián Rodríguez, Sandra Blázquez', null, 'The mini-project starts with a solemn event that unites the hearts of two characters already familiar to the audience of the original. The main characters are happy, but besides them, at that time, the story unfolded in the lives of other characters, each of whom went through adolescence in his own way and faced unexpected difficulties along the way.', 'The mini-project starts with a solemn event that unites the hearts of two characters already familiar to the audience of the original. The main characters are happy, but besides them, at that time, the story unfolded in the lives of other characters, each of whom went through adolescence in his own way and faced unexpected difficulties along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RnlaHLrERrUNo7vIhBAgygfwMD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111494'),
  ('705878613764056335', 'Piano: The Melody of a Young Girl''s Heart', 2002, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Tomoko Kawakami, Mitsuru Miyamoto', 'TV-Y7', 'Miu Nomura is a 14-year-old 8th-grader who has been playing piano since early childhood. She grows up gradually while her friendship, kinship, and love affairs evolve around her, but those relationships inevitably affect her piano performance.', 'Miu Nomura is a 14-year-old 8th-grader who has been playing piano since early childhood. She grows up gradually while her friendship, kinship, and love affairs evolve around her, but those relationships inevitably affect her piano performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1aZ1IaXoa4LgbC2sT8cLd6qKpW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25297'),
