  ('895336867989128744', 'Pili', 1988, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Chris Huang, Vincent Huang', null, null, null, 'Pili is a puppet show from Taiwan. It is made by Pili International Multimedia. The TV series started in 1985, and it still continues today. It is one of the most popular TV shows in Taiwan. Pili puppet show is performed by many kinds of puppets, some of them are cool, some are intelligent, and some are funny. Unlike traditional puppet shows, Pili puppet show uses state-of-the-art animation to help present its fighting art. The delicate design of the appearance and characteristics of each puppet has made Pili puppet show a well-known entertainment in Taiwan.', 'Pili is a puppet show from Taiwan. It is made by Pili International Multimedia. The TV series started in 1985, and it still continues today. It is one of the most popular TV shows in Taiwan. Pili puppet show is performed by many kinds of puppets, some of them are cool, some are intelligent, and some are funny. Unlike traditional puppet shows, Pili puppet show uses state-of-the-art animation to help present its fighting art. The delicate design of the appearance and characteristics of each puppet has made Pili puppet show a well-known entertainment in Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBVfyRYPmKSARRTodsTbwHqgcRA.jpg', 88, 'tmdb:tv:19530'),
  ('880316071633308718', 'Pimp My Ride', 2004, 'Reality', 'Bruce Beresford-Redman, Rick Hurvitz', 'Ari Shofet, Larry Hochberg', 'Xzibit, Beau Boeckmann, Michael Martin, Dave Aragon', null, 'Pimp My Ride is a TV show produced by MTV. Each episode consists of taking one car in poor condition and restoring it, as well as customizing it. The original American version was hosted by rapper Xzibit. Recently, MTV2 has begun airing episodes from Pimp My Ride UK hosted by DJ Tim Westwood, which features cars being customised in the UK, and Pimp My Ride International, featuring cars in central Europe, hosted by hip hop artists Fat Joe and Lil'' Jon, as well as the related CMT series Trick My Truck.', 'Pimp My Ride is a TV show produced by MTV. Each episode consists of taking one car in poor condition and restoring it, as well as customizing it. The original American version was hosted by rapper Xzibit. Recently, MTV2 has begun airing episodes from Pimp My Ride UK hosted by DJ Tim Westwood, which features cars being customised in the UK, and Pimp My Ride International, featuring cars in central Europe, hosted by hip hop artists Fat Joe and Lil'' Jon, as well as the related CMT series Trick My Truck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF0DWjx3MfYRncPGSBoaL41StPe.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1976'),
  ('29644307452868541', 'Pimville', 2026, 'Soap', null, null, 'Gail Mabalane, Matli Mohapeloa, Thapelo Mokoena, Keke Mphuthi, Mondli Makhoba, Michelle Mosalakae, Clementine Mosimane, Fulu Mugovhani', null, 'Pimville is a South African telenovela set in the heart of Soweto which follows the lives of various characters as they navigate complex relationships, secrets and power struggles. From reformed hustlers to strong matriarchs, each character brings their own story to the table. The series shines a light on the pulse of township life where dreams collide with reality, secrets unravel and family bonds are tested.', 'Pimville is a South African telenovela set in the heart of Soweto which follows the lives of various characters as they navigate complex relationships, secrets and power struggles. From reformed hustlers to strong matriarchs, each character brings their own story to the table. The series shines a light on the pulse of township life where dreams collide with reality, secrets unravel and family bonds are tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzd8ib7tnc3npRZPd0mtjWYEA5d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313584'),
  ('987950393227680966', 'Pinches Momias', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'José Miguel Nuñez, Santiago Limón', null, 'Rogério da Cruz, Xiunel González, Daniel Ábrego, Berenice Jonguitud, Vitter Leija, Saak, Laura Wedel, Natalia Solián', null, 'With roots in Mexican history and folklore, it is based on the mummies of Guanajuato, one of the most fascinating collections in the world. The series follows a group of teenagers from Guanajuato, who represent the only hope for their people to survive when the renowned mummies are resurrected during the Cervantino Festival, the busiest week of the year.', 'With roots in Mexican history and folklore, it is based on the mummies of Guanajuato, one of the most fascinating collections in the world. The series follows a group of teenagers from Guanajuato, who represent the only hope for their people to survive when the renowned mummies are resurrected during the Cervantino Festival, the busiest week of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LkqyZQf7GPlpwpIHbdzuVCXOUj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234200'),
  ('677851745767109337', 'Pine Gap', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Felicity Packard, Greg Haddrick', null, 'Parker Sawyers, Jacqueline McKenzie, Steve Toussaint, Tess Haubrich, Stephen Curry, Lewis Fitz-Gerald, Mark Leonard Winter, Sachin Joab', null, 'A team of talented Australian and American intelligence analysts work together to ensure global stability in one of the world''s most important and secretive joint intelligence facilities... Pine Gap. But the relationship between the Australian and American intelligence analysts working at Pine Gap isn’t always rosy.', 'A team of talented Australian and American intelligence analysts work together to ensure global stability in one of the world''s most important and secretive joint intelligence facilities... Pine Gap. But the relationship between the Australian and American intelligence analysts working at Pine Gap isn’t always rosy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVGnKORliwBh2ZEpGfvoclUe1O1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82469'),
  ('655767957378673787', 'Ping Pong Ball', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'You Chea-myung, Kim Ji-soo, Jung Young-ki, Na Hae-ryung, Choi Gwang-il, Seo Dong-gab, Lee Hyun-kyun', null, 'Kim Young Joon is a philosophy major at a university. He confesses his feelings to a female classmate, but she rejects him. He takes her rejection hard. Kim Young Joon then meets a mysterious homeless man, Kim Deuk Hwan who lives under a small bridge. Kim Deuk Hwan has also experienced rejection in love and they develop a friendship.', 'Kim Young Joon is a philosophy major at a university. He confesses his feelings to a female classmate, but she rejects him. He takes her rejection hard. Kim Young Joon then meets a mysterious homeless man, Kim Deuk Hwan who lives under a small bridge. Kim Deuk Hwan has also experienced rejection in love and they develop a friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FHww5p1s9geRLNka6eAHGjzR2r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82423'),
  ('1131033564707469070', 'Ping Pong the Animation', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Fukujuro Katayama, Yousei Bun, Shunsuke Sakuya, Subaru Kimura, Yusaku Yara, Masako Nozawa', 'TV-14', 'Makoto ''Smile'' Tsukimoto and his friend Yutaka ''Peco'' Hoshino have been playing table tennis together since they were kids, but as they enter high school, they find that the game, and how they see it, has changed. Peco, brimming with confidence and energy, wants to be the best in the world, but the reserved Smile has little fighting spirit and doesn''t want to sacrifice others'' happiness just to win, despite his innate talent. As the two grow, and experience the ups and downs of the sport – and life – they try to figure out exactly who they really are and what drives them to play.', 'Makoto ''Smile'' Tsukimoto and his friend Yutaka ''Peco'' Hoshino have been playing table tennis together since they were kids, but as they enter high school, they find that the game, and how they see it, has changed. Peco, brimming with confidence and energy, wants to be the best in the world, but the reserved Smile has little fighting spirit and doesn''t want to sacrifice others'' happiness just to win, despite his innate talent. As the two grow, and experience the ups and downs of the sport – and life – they try to figure out exactly who they really are and what drives them to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frgVn3ww547TVQH8vS2bWKZnEBu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60811'),
  ('822352100352625865', 'Pingu', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Otmar Gutmann, Erika Brueggemann', null, 'Marcello Magni, David Sant', 'TV-Y', 'Playful penguin Pingu lives with his family in Antarctica, where he often finds himself caught up in mischievous high jinks with his pal Robby.', 'Playful penguin Pingu lives with his family in Antarctica, where he often finds himself caught up in mischievous high jinks with his pal Robby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLE7NR3EsEbv2NfG0bLIaOEhGfY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:9262'),
  ('770156749513554141', 'Pink Lie', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kim Hee-chul, Lee Sun-bin, Go Wook, Han Na-yeon, RALRAL', null, 'Young men and women move into the Pink House, each carrying one lie about themselves, be it their occupation, age, or academic background. Whirlwinds of emotions break out in the face of unraveling truth. Identities reveal as the relationships walk the tight rope between love and reality.', 'Young men and women move into the Pink House, each carrying one lie about themselves, be it their occupation, age, or academic background. Whirlwinds of emotions break out in the face of unraveling truth. Identities reveal as the relationships walk the tight rope between love and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmLj39flUKMfS2s4ScOWZuMytjY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210229'),
  ('979396537259517547', 'Pink Panther and Pals', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Blake Edwards, David H. DePatie', null, 'Kel Mitchell, Eddie Garvar, Alex Nussbaum, John Over, Jeannie Elias, Bob Spang', 'TV-Y7', 'A teenage version of the iconic character shares adventures with old friends and some new cartoon pals.', 'A teenage version of the iconic character shares adventures with old friends and some new cartoon pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apVqDRuxv6f5ma2sb6IhIHWOKwv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5559'),
  ('211630019250032570', 'Pink Panther and Sons', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Frank Welker, B.J. Ward, Jeannie Elias, Sherry Lynn, Sonny Melendrez, Gregg Berger', 'NR', 'Pink Panther and Sons is an American animated Pink Panther television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and MGM/UA Television. The series was originally broadcast on NBC from 1984 to 1985 and moved to ABC in 1986. The original Pink Panther cartoons were produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises, is in the TV animation industry, but in 1981, the studio was sold to Marvel Comics and renamed Marvel Productions. David DePatie and Friz Freleng served as producers for the series.', 'Pink Panther and Sons is an American animated Pink Panther television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions and MGM/UA Television. The series was originally broadcast on NBC from 1984 to 1985 and moved to ABC in 1986. The original Pink Panther cartoons were produced by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises, is in the TV animation industry, but in 1981, the studio was sold to Marvel Comics and renamed Marvel Productions. David DePatie and Friz Freleng served as producers for the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B2WKgIY1uNov3zLAgSeNIk5G0W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12479'),
  ('881485570809033452', 'Pinky and the Brain', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Rob Paulsen, Maurice LaMarche', 'TV-Y7', 'Pinky and Brain are genetically enhanced laboratory mice who reside in a cage in the Acme Labs research facility. Brain is self-centered and scheming; Pinky is good-natured but feebleminded. In each episode, Brain devises a new plan to take over the world, which ultimately ends in failure, usually due to Pinky''s idiocy, the impossibility of Brain''s plan, Brain''s own arrogance, or just circumstances beyond their control.', 'Pinky and Brain are genetically enhanced laboratory mice who reside in a cage in the Acme Labs research facility. Brain is self-centered and scheming; Pinky is good-natured but feebleminded. In each episode, Brain devises a new plan to take over the world, which ultimately ends in failure, usually due to Pinky''s idiocy, the impossibility of Brain''s plan, Brain''s own arrogance, or just circumstances beyond their control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69Hrbgi2qcy8xjcwad94VNHpXLI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2228'),
  ('293741860051438799', 'Pinky Malinky', 2019, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Chris Garbutt, Rikke Asbjoern', null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Pinky Malinky sees the bright side of everything, including being born a hot dog. With his BFFs in tow, this little wiener takes a bite out of life.', 'Pinky Malinky sees the bright side of everything, including being born a hot dog. With his BFFs in tow, this little wiener takes a bite out of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXGRafqFfyja23kqY4jpZtWQPLZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:76705'),
  ('131561125743819623', 'Pinky, Elmyra & The Brain', 1998, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Tom Ruegger', null, 'Cree Summer, Maurice LaMarche, Rob Paulsen, Nancy Cartwright', 'TV-Y7', 'The popular animated characters Pinky and the Brain continue to concoct schemes to rule the world while hiding out in the suburbs where they live with Elmyra, a hyperactive tot of Tiny Toon Adventures fame.', 'The popular animated characters Pinky and the Brain continue to concoct schemes to rule the world while hiding out in the suburbs where they live with Elmyra, a hyperactive tot of Tiny Toon Adventures fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B0DN2ri7klVzbKuP8VVSGpCgMx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4190'),
  ('454626705831429444', 'Pino & Shinoby', 2026, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, null, '“Shinoby” and an Italian boy “Pino” make all kinds of discoveries through everyday adventures! Travel back and forth between Japan and Italy with them, and learn about the cultural differences in food, sports, arts, games, and more from both countries!', '“Shinoby” and an Italian boy “Pino” make all kinds of discoveries through everyday adventures! Travel back and forth between Japan and Italy with them, and learn about the cultural differences in food, sports, arts, games, and more from both countries!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5h98NHd3nwUS9K8LiVGUPQEelfi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318460'),
  ('217709644309959278', 'Pinocchio', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Jo Soo-won', null, 'Park Shin-hye, Lee Jong-suk, Kim Young-kwang, Lee Yu-bi, Jin Kyung, Lee Pil-mo, Min Sung-wook, Yoon Kyun-sang', 'TV-14', 'In-ha and Ha-myeong become reporters for different reasons: one aspires to follow in her mother''s footsteps and the other seeks to do honest news.', 'In-ha and Ha-myeong become reporters for different reasons: one aspires to follow in her mother''s footsteps and the other seeks to do honest news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i97YOqvylMMkiNzi4l5yyEVbYQi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61611'),
  ('132775700126257400', 'Pinocchio: The Series', 1972, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', null, 'Jinzo Toriumi', 'Hiroko Maruyama, Minoru Yada, Masako Ikeda, Akira Kamiya, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Junpei Takiguchi, Keiko Tomochika, Kohei Miyauchi', 'NR', 'Mokku of the Oak Tree, also known as Mokku Woody the Oak Tree, or Saban''s Adventures of Pinocchio in the United States, is a 52 episode anime series by Tatsunoko Productions first aired on Fuji Television in 1972. The story is based on the novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Italian author Carlo Collodi. Unlike the more cheerful lighter tones of the Disney Version and Nippon Animation''s version Piccolino no Bōken, this series has a distinctly sadistic darker theme and portrays the main character, Pinocchio, as suffering from constant physical and psychological abuse and freak accidents.', 'Mokku of the Oak Tree, also known as Mokku Woody the Oak Tree, or Saban''s Adventures of Pinocchio in the United States, is a 52 episode anime series by Tatsunoko Productions first aired on Fuji Television in 1972. The story is based on the novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Italian author Carlo Collodi. Unlike the more cheerful lighter tones of the Disney Version and Nippon Animation''s version Piccolino no Bōken, this series has a distinctly sadistic darker theme and portrays the main character, Pinocchio, as suffering from constant physical and psychological abuse and freak accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMFhoKUmC4hdrSjNpgBwXfsS8fz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11520'),
  ('594386135538526461', 'Pinoy Big Brother', 2005, 'Reality', 'John de Mol', null, null, null, 'The Philippine adaptation of the reality game show "Big Brother" features Filipino housemates live together, share their stories and build meaningful relationships as they do tasks and challenges supervised by Big Brother. Every week a nomination is done, and the public decides who gets evicted and eventually become the Big Winner of the program.', 'The Philippine adaptation of the reality game show "Big Brother" features Filipino housemates live together, share their stories and build meaningful relationships as they do tasks and challenges supervised by Big Brother. Every week a nomination is done, and the public decides who gets evicted and eventually become the Big Winner of the program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUva0cs2SOjoxFPpwINbpevzoax.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:8892'),
  ('977605532092488665', 'Pioneer One', 2010, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Drama', 'Josh Bernhard', 'Josh Bernhard, Bracey Smith', 'Alexandra Blatt, Laura Graham, James Rich, Einar Gunn, Jack Haley', 'NR', 'A Cold War relic returns amid fears of terrorism but turns out to be a forgotten Soviet space mission. What it brings back will have implications for the entire world.', 'A Cold War relic returns amid fears of terrorism but turns out to be a forgotten Soviet space mission. What it brings back will have implications for the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p53wbsukyhJ8TieisoeU1zZr9iA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33050'),
  ('426131518697349228', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids', 'Astrid Lindgren, Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Inger Nilsson, Maria Persson, Pär Sundberg, Margot Trooger, Gun Arvidsson, Hans Clarin, Gösta Prüzelius, Paul Esser', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of Pippi Longstocking, an eccentric, super-strong, redheaded moppet and her best friends Tommy and Annika.', 'The adventures of Pippi Longstocking, an eccentric, super-strong, redheaded moppet and her best friends Tommy and Annika.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCMX9FK7fD6BncwsTFBhGAVvgTA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3714'),
  ('976307855172559434', 'Pippi Longstocking', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Astrid Lindgren', null, 'Melissa Altro', 'TV-Y7', 'With tons of optimism, and strength to match, fun-loving 9-year-old Pippi Longstocking resides at rustic Villa Villekulla with her pet monkey and horse, sailing into adventures with her friends Tommy and Annika. Based on the books by Astrid Lindgren.', 'With tons of optimism, and strength to match, fun-loving 9-year-old Pippi Longstocking resides at rustic Villa Villekulla with her pet monkey and horse, sailing into adventures with her friends Tommy and Annika. Based on the books by Astrid Lindgren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9IWLJzhcxsAzjK7rOOXnUbKTZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10748'),
  ('910449237083855672', 'Piquantes !', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Nicole Ferroni', null, 'Nicole Ferroni, Thaïs Vauquières, Laura Domenge, Christine Berrou, Antonia de Rendinger, Farah, Elise Larnicol, Marion Séclin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBfT4AjxIByqNnXuSWRc8jzwceb.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:234372'),
  ('788312706297859335', 'Pirate Family', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', 'Fabrice Parme, Yves Coulon, Béatrice Marthouret', null, 'Laura Préjean, Patrick Préjean, Laurence Crouzet, Arthur Pestel, Serge Thiriet, Patrice Melennec, Christian Pelissier, Denise Roland', 'NR', 'Life as a Captain of a pirate ship is healthy and invigorating : looting other ships, searching for treasures... Things are a bit complicated, however, for our Captain Mac Bernik, who also leads up a family. It''s up to him to deal with his wife and kids, his neighbours, the supermarket, his mother in law, his crocodile, the children''s teacher... A hilarious sitcom with a mix of piracy.', 'Life as a Captain of a pirate ship is healthy and invigorating : looting other ships, searching for treasures... Things are a bit complicated, however, for our Captain Mac Bernik, who also leads up a family. It''s up to him to deal with his wife and kids, his neighbours, the supermarket, his mother in law, his crocodile, the children''s teacher... A hilarious sitcom with a mix of piracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7izYBNMra45JSWZ9ctNmiX6JKZx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74540'),
  ('858207640694097764', 'Pirate Gold of Adak Island', 2022, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Dr M Jackson, Brian Weed, Jay Toomoth, Burke Mitchell, Thom Spitler, Jeff Wilburn', 'TV-14', 'Will this expert team unearth legendary pirate treasure? Follow the hunt for buried gold amid the harsh Alaskan wilderness in this documentary series.', 'Will this expert team unearth legendary pirate treasure? Follow the hunt for buried gold amid the harsh Alaskan wilderness in this documentary series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaq3mnifkknC8cGA7I65W3bTmu0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204416'),
  ('374558078428635035', 'Pirate Treasure of the Knights Templar', 2015, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Lost treasure is the foundation of legends and lore, and the greatest lost treasure of all belonged to the Knights Templar. Now, from the medieval fortified cities of Europe to the holy lands of the Middle East and from a secret pirate island in the Indian ocean to America’s first great cities, renowned underwater explorer Barry Clifford and historian Scott Wolter are unearthing new evidence in an attempt to find hidden links between two of history’s most legendary sects, separated by 500 years: the medieval Knights Templar and 17th century pirates. What they learn may very well alter the course of history and lead them to treasure that’s been buried for centuries.', 'Lost treasure is the foundation of legends and lore, and the greatest lost treasure of all belonged to the Knights Templar. Now, from the medieval fortified cities of Europe to the holy lands of the Middle East and from a secret pirate island in the Indian ocean to America’s first great cities, renowned underwater explorer Barry Clifford and historian Scott Wolter are unearthing new evidence in an attempt to find hidden links between two of history’s most legendary sects, separated by 500 years: the medieval Knights Templar and 17th century pirates. What they learn may very well alter the course of history and lead them to treasure that’s been buried for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpYkVFoReeuYcOLityEe9jGvK3w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68160'),
  ('762861593405000651', 'Piste noire', 2023, 'Crime', null, 'Jennifer Have', 'Constance Labbé, Thibault de Montalembert, Hélène Seuzaret, Pierre-Yves Bon, Déborah Krey, Solène Rigot, Christiane Millet, Christian Rauth', null, 'In the Alps, a caravan burns, enclosing a seasonal worker in its flames. Emilie Karras, a young gendarme from Lyon, originally from Les Clairies, leads the investigation, forced to collaborate with Major Servoz, a disillusioned local gendarme.', 'In the Alps, a caravan burns, enclosing a seasonal worker in its flames. Emilie Karras, a young gendarme from Lyon, originally from Les Clairies, leads the investigation, forced to collaborate with Major Servoz, a disillusioned local gendarme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzta29OwfQHMQHF8VQWieo5Nixb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218656'),
  ('520815494920947016', 'Pistol', 2022, 'Drama', 'Craig Pearce', null, 'Toby Wallace, Anson Boon, Christian Lees, Sydney Chandler, Talulah Riley, Maisie Williams, Emma Appleton, Thomas Brodie-Sangster', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a band of spotty, noisy, working-class kids with “no future,” who shook the boring, corrupt Establishment to its core, threatened to bring down the government and changed music and culture forever.', 'The story of a band of spotty, noisy, working-class kids with “no future,” who shook the boring, corrupt Establishment to its core, threatened to bring down the government and changed music and culture forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHswJ2FXpN9jJIqNlxgc5ZooFb4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132159'),
  ('399040952302070095', 'Pistorius', 2018, 'Documentary', null, 'Sean Richard, Matteo Bini, Vaughan Sivell', 'Oscar Pistorius', null, 'A four-part documentary about the South African Paralympic and Olympic sprinter Oscar Pistorius, who shot and killed his girlfriend in the early hours of Valentine''s Day 2013. The story of a man and a nation both born to great disadvantage, the film follows the challenges, hopes and triumphs of both and the demise of their dreams under the glare of the world media.', 'A four-part documentary about the South African Paralympic and Olympic sprinter Oscar Pistorius, who shot and killed his girlfriend in the early hours of Valentine''s Day 2013. The story of a man and a nation both born to great disadvantage, the film follows the challenges, hopes and triumphs of both and the demise of their dreams under the glare of the world media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1low6vu0n8jFlN5ggbmVTDlUoe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82132'),
  ('667821495710885665', 'Pistvakt', 1998, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Lennart Jähkel, Jacob Nordenson, Tomas Norström, Barbro Oborg, Pierre Lindstedt', null, 'Pistvakt was a Swedish television series, produced and aired by SVT subdepartment SVT Drama. It is based on a play by Pistolteatern. It was followed by the film Pistvakt.', 'Pistvakt was a Swedish television series, produced and aired by SVT subdepartment SVT Drama. It is based on a play by Pistolteatern. It was followed by the film Pistvakt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTXQKi7Ft0WO1SSt2cUWdyakkvM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:21713'),
  ('483080371266317207', 'Pit Babe', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', '_alittlebitch', 'Kanokphan Ornrattanasakul, Issaraporn Kuntisuk', 'Naret Promphaopun, Krittin Kitjaruwannakul, Supanut Lourhaphanich, Obrnithi Leelavetchabutr, Atthanin Thaninphanuwiwat, Asre Wattanayakul, Thanapon Aiemkumchai, Hemmawich Kwanamphaiphan', null, 'Babe, a race car driver with unmatched talent, falls for newcomer Charlie, but hidden secrets threaten their passionate romance and racing dreams.', 'Babe, a race car driver with unmatched talent, falls for newcomer Charlie, but hidden secrets threaten their passionate romance and racing dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuLSkVlXXf3OpTwoUWN5c9ubLVC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235199'),
  ('671251035931688090', 'Pit Bulls and Parolees', 2009, 'Documentary, Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Tia Torres', 'TV-PG', 'Follow Tia Torres, founder of Villalobos Rescue Center, and her family as they rehabilitate both felons and ill-reputed pit bulls who come together to rescue one another from their dim pasts, and bring new meaning to life.', 'Follow Tia Torres, founder of Villalobos Rescue Center, and her family as they rehabilitate both felons and ill-reputed pit bulls who come together to rescue one another from their dim pasts, and bring new meaning to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrgRiVK3GH0jxQLmUXrWIjFA9Jc.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:31537'),
  ('26245942647734529', 'Pita Ten', 2002, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Kugimiya, Mitsuki Saiga, Yumi Touma, Yukana, Motoko Kumai, Sakura Nogawa', 'TV-PG', 'Kotarou starts out as pretty much your usual kid although he lives alone with his father, which forces him to take over some of the chores at home, such as cooking and cleaning. But what starts out as a usual morning changes drastically as he opens his front door to be confronted by a girl named Misha dressed in a voluminous dress and a tendency to shout rather than speak. Kotarou attempts to escape, but this new next-door neighbour is quite persistent... this is the beginning of Misha''s stalking of Kotarou. Even though she is a Junior High School student she has chosen Kotarou as her victim and hounds him all day long.', 'Kotarou starts out as pretty much your usual kid although he lives alone with his father, which forces him to take over some of the chores at home, such as cooking and cleaning. But what starts out as a usual morning changes drastically as he opens his front door to be confronted by a girl named Misha dressed in a voluminous dress and a tendency to shout rather than speak. Kotarou attempts to escape, but this new next-door neighbour is quite persistent... this is the beginning of Misha''s stalking of Kotarou. Even though she is a Junior High School student she has chosen Kotarou as her victim and hounds him all day long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQXU29cif6ZCIYCvDlSXUdPUZjp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27952'),
  ('452413019260096561', 'Pitbull', 2005, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Patryk Vega', 'Marcin Dorociński, Andrzej Grabowski, Paweł Królikowski, Roma Gąsiorowska, Michał Kula, Weronika Rosati, Michał Żurawski', null, 'The dark world of crime: murders, racketeering, drugs, kidnappings. There are no rules here. Working in this world makes cops cynical and ruthless. There is a fine line between them and criminals - will any of them cross it? The main characters are officers from the Department for Counteracting Criminal Terror and Homicides. The action of the series is an extension of the threads that appear in the feature film. It presents in a realistic way the brutal and dark world of crime that officers encounter on a daily basis. They''re not just tracking down murderers. They fight racketeering, kidnapping, drug trafficking while struggling with their own day to day life and problems.', 'The dark world of crime: murders, racketeering, drugs, kidnappings. There are no rules here. Working in this world makes cops cynical and ruthless. There is a fine line between them and criminals - will any of them cross it? The main characters are officers from the Department for Counteracting Criminal Terror and Homicides. The action of the series is an extension of the threads that appear in the feature film. It presents in a realistic way the brutal and dark world of crime that officers encounter on a daily basis. They''re not just tracking down murderers. They fight racketeering, kidnapping, drug trafficking while struggling with their own day to day life and problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU0kLyAfdqynoYicwGuqXNkFewR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:37337'),
  ('362450630095743547', 'Pitch', 2016, 'Drama', 'Dan Fogelman, Rick Singer', null, 'Kylie Bunbury, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Ali Larter, Mo McRae, Meagan Holder, Mark Consuelos, Tim Jo, Dan Lauria', 'TV-14', 'The dramatic and inspirational story of a young pitcher who becomes the first woman to play Major League Baseball.', 'The dramatic and inspirational story of a young pitcher who becomes the first woman to play Major League Baseball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTK0N1qLBWzwxuG0DH3cdYXghIT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67147'),
  ('1087350712096644211', 'Pitch Perfect: Bumper in Berlin', 2022, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Adam Devine, Sarah Hyland, Flula Borg, Lera Abova, Jameela Jamil', 'TV-MA', 'Several years after we last saw him in “Pitch Perfect,” Bumper Allen moves to Germany to revive his music career when one of his songs becomes big in Berlin.', 'Several years after we last saw him in “Pitch Perfect,” Bumper Allen moves to Germany to revive his music career when one of his songs becomes big in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baM8owP74DXapHOc8awfZ5aw98z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156332'),
  ('763247516185925420', 'Pivoting', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Liz Astrof', null, 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Eliza Coupe, Maggie Q, Tommy Dewey, JT Neal, Marcello Julian Reyes', null, 'In a small, middle-class town in Long Island, NY, three women – and close-knit childhood friends – cope with the death of the fourth member of their group. When faced with the reality that life is short, these women pivot, and alter their current paths, by way of a series of impulsive, ill-advised and self-indulgent decisions. These pivots will strengthen their bond and prove it’s never too late to screw up your life in the pursuit of happiness.', 'In a small, middle-class town in Long Island, NY, three women – and close-knit childhood friends – cope with the death of the fourth member of their group. When faced with the reality that life is short, these women pivot, and alter their current paths, by way of a series of impulsive, ill-advised and self-indulgent decisions. These pivots will strengthen their bond and prove it’s never too late to screw up your life in the pursuit of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQXja8mUGddQMfIpOOA0doLNdGu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129501'),
  ('63843571619486564', 'Pixar in Real Life', 2019, 'Reality, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Erika J. Wood, Micaela Toomey, Erika Degraff, Zihan Zhao, Stephanie Linas, David Greenberg, Curtis Retherford', 'TV-G', 'This live action series brings iconic characters and moments from Pixar films into the real world. Filmed on location in and around New York City, the series surprises and delights real people in real locations when they least expect it.', 'This live action series brings iconic characters and moments from Pixar films into the real world. Filmed on location in and around New York City, the series surprises and delights real people in real locations when they least expect it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgKwNs66dsEt3e0D7wJLmAxxgnz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95029'),
  ('87373313864618581', 'Pixar Popcorn', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Grab a quick snack of Pixar with this collection of mini shorts starring your favorite characters.', 'Grab a quick snack of Pixar with this collection of mini shorts starring your favorite characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRpwcEKPvsj0WKbhrowQbyy4bIg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114505'),
  ('3939452774550717', 'Pixie and Dixie and Mr. Jinks', 1958, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Don Messick', 'TV-G', 'Pixie & Dixie and Mr. Jinks is a Hanna-Barbera cartoon that featured as a regular segment of the television series The Huckleberry Hound Show from 1958 to 1961.', 'Pixie & Dixie and Mr. Jinks is a Hanna-Barbera cartoon that featured as a regular segment of the television series The Huckleberry Hound Show from 1958 to 1961.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZumU878KJndWedQICQAKz6kCf4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:21471'),
  ('998025681405475391', 'PJ Masks', 2015, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Olivier Dumont', null, 'Addison Holley, Benjamin Hum, Evan O''Donnell', 'TV-Y', 'Connor, Greg and Amaya are normal kids by day, but at night they activate their bracelets, which link into their pajamas and give them fantastic super powers, turning them into their alternate identities: the PJ Masks! The team consists of Catboy (Connor), Gekko (Greg) and Owlette (Amaya). Together, they go on adventures, solve mysteries, and learn valuable lessons. Watch the first six seasons of PJ Masks now on Disney+!', 'Connor, Greg and Amaya are normal kids by day, but at night they activate their bracelets, which link into their pajamas and give them fantastic super powers, turning them into their alternate identities: the PJ Masks! The team consists of Catboy (Connor), Gekko (Greg) and Owlette (Amaya). Together, they go on adventures, solve mysteries, and learn valuable lessons. Watch the first six seasons of PJ Masks now on Disney+!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sl4flhzM3uJAxfgQ9ibfEGbmn5I.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:65417'),
  ('51487462619405050', 'PJ Masks: Music Videos', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'TV-Y', 'When the city sleeps, Connor, Amaya and Greg’s pajamas magically transform and the kids become superheroes – here comes Catboy, Owlette and Gekko! Watch out nighttime baddies – the PJ Masks are on their way, into the night to save the day!', 'When the city sleeps, Connor, Amaya and Greg’s pajamas magically transform and the kids become superheroes – here comes Catboy, Owlette and Gekko! Watch out nighttime baddies – the PJ Masks are on their way, into the night to save the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Y7IoWs4OqqgdwcABxdglNfGjz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:196362'),
  ('12820169098891951', 'PJ Masks: Power Heroes', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Olivier Dumont', null, 'Addison Holley, Kai Harris, Rain Janjua', 'TV-Y', 'Connor, Greg and Amaya are normal kids by day, but at night they activate their bracelets, which link into their pajamas and give them fantastic super powers, turning them into their alternate identities: the PJ Masks! The team consists of Catboy (Connor), Gekko (Greg) and Owlette (Amaya). Together, they go on adventures, solve mysteries, and learn valuable lessons. Watch the first six seasons of PJ Masks now on Disney+!', 'Connor, Greg and Amaya are normal kids by day, but at night they activate their bracelets, which link into their pajamas and give them fantastic super powers, turning them into their alternate identities: the PJ Masks! The team consists of Catboy (Connor), Gekko (Greg) and Owlette (Amaya). Together, they go on adventures, solve mysteries, and learn valuable lessons. Watch the first six seasons of PJ Masks now on Disney+!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce1dYgNIREapWRf8yNUhC08hh6g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224022'),
  ('859946081856653693', 'Place of Execution', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Juliet Stevenson, Lee Ingleby, Philip Jackson, Greg Wise, Tony Maudsley, Elizabeth Day, Danny Tennant, Poppy Goodburn', null, 'On a freezing December night in 1963, 13-year-old Alison Carter took her dog for a walk and was never seen again. As the entire country watched, newly-promoted Detective Inspector George Bennett turned up enough evidence to see his suspect hanged and was hailed a hero by the people of Scardale. More than four decades later, the lingering cloud left by the missing body of Alison Carter compels controversial filmmaker Catherine Heathcote to turn her camera to Bennett.', 'On a freezing December night in 1963, 13-year-old Alison Carter took her dog for a walk and was never seen again. As the entire country watched, newly-promoted Detective Inspector George Bennett turned up enough evidence to see his suspect hanged and was hailed a hero by the people of Scardale. More than four decades later, the lingering cloud left by the missing body of Alison Carter compels controversial filmmaker Catherine Heathcote to turn her camera to Bennett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utED7JscFnkgcPsCsJwkNikvqAT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27275'),
  ('97434023168793535', 'Place to Place', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Rumi Okubo, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Kaori Fukuhara, Hitomi Nabatame, Shintaro Asanuma', 'TV-14', 'Tsumiki Miniwa, a small girl who packs a punch, is in love with her best friend, tall and easygoing Io Otonashi. The only problem is that she can''t bring herself to come out and say it. And, despite the fact that he can otherwise read her like a book, Io doesn''t seem to be able to pick up the obvious clues—even with all of their friends teasing that there''s no one better suited for each other. Acchi Kocchi follows Tsumiki and her circle of friends as they go through their day-to-day lives. Between Mayoi the electronics nerd, Sakaki the good-natured prankster, and the nosebleed-prone Hime, Tsumiki''s friends will never let her live down her crush. But only time will tell if Tsumiki will gain the courage to finally say how she truly feels.', 'Tsumiki Miniwa, a small girl who packs a punch, is in love with her best friend, tall and easygoing Io Otonashi. The only problem is that she can''t bring herself to come out and say it. And, despite the fact that he can otherwise read her like a book, Io doesn''t seem to be able to pick up the obvious clues—even with all of their friends teasing that there''s no one better suited for each other. Acchi Kocchi follows Tsumiki and her circle of friends as they go through their day-to-day lives. Between Mayoi the electronics nerd, Sakaki the good-natured prankster, and the nosebleed-prone Hime, Tsumiki''s friends will never let her live down her crush. But only time will tell if Tsumiki will gain the courage to finally say how she truly feels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khQtphhJLSzkRvf4kNiLzi70yTg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63712'),
  ('767673840800432209', 'Plain Love', 1995, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Kwan Hoi-San, Wilson Ai Wai, Ga-Bo Tsui, Leung Bo-Ching, Lily Ng Lai-Chu', null, 'Liu Yacai (played by Zhou Haimei) was sold to the four sons of the landlord Guan Xueru (played by Guan Haishan) as a daughter-in-law. She was bullied in the Guan family. Fortunately, she met Guan Tianyin (played by Zhang Zhaohui), the second son of the Guan family. However, due to fate, it is difficult to realize the dream of mandarin ducks.', 'Liu Yacai (played by Zhou Haimei) was sold to the four sons of the landlord Guan Xueru (played by Guan Haishan) as a daughter-in-law. She was bullied in the Guan family. Fortunately, she met Guan Tianyin (played by Zhang Zhaohui), the second son of the Guan family. However, due to fate, it is difficult to realize the dream of mandarin ducks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0ZvyqKND28NLifNifn8JpzKuFa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96199'),
  ('989355698393024019', 'Plan B', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jean-François Asselin, Jacques Drolet', null, 'Carolina Bartczak, Arnold Pinnock, Arianna Shannon, Jaeden Noel', null, 'Plan B offers clients the chance to travel back in time to change the past, but each alteration has unintended consequences, revealing the complexity and limitations of personal agency.', 'Plan B offers clients the chance to travel back in time to change the past, but each alteration has unintended consequences, revealing the complexity and limitations of personal agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jP81t2WwpQVLZ8dqPJSPvH0r79z.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:212055'),
  ('14184577449121312', 'Planet America', null, 'News, Comedy', null, null, 'John Barron, Chas Licciardello', null, 'The Chaser''s Chas Licciardello and the ABC''s John Barron set out to discover the real America - its politics and its people - with US and Australian experts coming along for the ride.', 'The Chaser''s Chas Licciardello and the ABC''s John Barron set out to discover the real America - its politics and its people - with US and Australian experts coming along for the ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfjHMhpSpdmJW5txgQtfyLhbVpI.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:88439'),
  ('623056219499331286', 'Planet Dinosaur', 2011, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Phil Dobree, Nigel Paterson', 'Tom Brass, Nigel Paterson', 'John Hurt', 'TV-PG', 'The stories of the biggest, deadliest and weirdest creatures ever to walk the Earth, using the latest fossil evidence and immersive computer graphics.', 'The stories of the biggest, deadliest and weirdest creatures ever to walk the Earth, using the latest fossil evidence and immersive computer graphics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UdvhQvy7Y1jZLTZmO3OZtZarcN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40517'),
  ('637303351479446352', 'Planet Earth', 2006, 'Documentary', null, 'Gary Parker', 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'David Attenborough celebrates the amazing variety of the natural world in this epic documentary series, filmed over four years across 64 different countries.', 'David Attenborough celebrates the amazing variety of the natural world in this epic documentary series, filmed over four years across 64 different countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNcNxUtZ520d5de5s78onoiSiwQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1044'),
  ('225448836724502818', 'Planet Earth II', 2016, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'David Attenborough presents a documentary series exploring how animals meet the challenges of surviving in the most iconic habitats on earth.', 'David Attenborough presents a documentary series exploring how animals meet the challenges of surviving in the most iconic habitats on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUKomxy50suT4MyxjYfOJDkZUq3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68595'),
  ('277150030021255536', 'Planet Earth III', 2023, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'Journeying to the far reaches of our planet, this eight part series follows some of the world''s most amazing species, telling extraordinary stories that are dramatic, thrilling, funny and sometimes heart-breaking, but always full of hope.', 'Journeying to the far reaches of our planet, this eight part series follows some of the world''s most amazing species, telling extraordinary stories that are dramatic, thrilling, funny and sometimes heart-breaking, but always full of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNwJPvA0SaFGKLW2oExiHFNDpNs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116156'),
  ('629099062554727733', 'Planet of the Apes', 1974, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Anthony Wilson', null, 'Roddy McDowall, Ron Harper, James Naughton, Mark Lenard, Booth Colman', null, 'Two astronauts and a sympathetic chimp friend are fugitives in a future Earth dominated by a civilization of humanoid apes. Based on the 1968 Planet of the Apes film and its sequels, which were inspired by the novel of the same name by Pierre Boulle.', 'Two astronauts and a sympathetic chimp friend are fugitives in a future Earth dominated by a civilization of humanoid apes. Based on the 1968 Planet of the Apes film and its sequels, which were inspired by the novel of the same name by Pierre Boulle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxo5Vrd0oXgm9ZCz4r7Q3L8veWg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19'),
  ('64512686658195442', 'Planet Sex with Cara Delevingne', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Simon Andreae, Cara Delevingne', null, 'Cara Delevingne', 'TV-MA', 'On this immersive journey, Cara Delevingne puts her mind and body on the line in search of answers regarding human sexuality, its joys, mysteries, and constantly changing nature. In every episode, she shares her own personal experiences. Uniquely unfiltered and authentic, there''s no limit on how far Cara''s willing to go to explore what makes us all human.', 'On this immersive journey, Cara Delevingne puts her mind and body on the line in search of answers regarding human sexuality, its joys, mysteries, and constantly changing nature. In every episode, she shares her own personal experiences. Uniquely unfiltered and authentic, there''s no limit on how far Cara''s willing to go to explore what makes us all human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WRIKOCg9KSJv4W6rQ196ZWUggM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208550'),
  ('785709937962992503', 'Planet Sheen', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Steve Oedekerk, Keith Alcorn', null, 'Jeffrey Garcia, Rob Paulsen, Jeff Bennett, Candi Milo, Fred Tatasciore, Thomas Lennon, Bob Joles, Soleil Moon Frye', 'TV-Y7', 'Jimmy Neutron''s goofy pal, Sheen Estevez accidentally gets himself sent to another planet, millions of light-years from Earth.', 'Jimmy Neutron''s goofy pal, Sheen Estevez accidentally gets himself sent to another planet, millions of light-years from Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27A7tRW34HFdWLVfbBxcwsDuNc8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18848'),
  ('974238587958429573', 'Planet With', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Satoshi Mizukami', null, 'Atsushi Abe, Sayaka Harada, Shiori Izawa, Saori Goto, Yuuichirou Umehara, Hitomi Ohwada, Mai Fuchigami, Shinsuke Sugawara', 'TV-14', 'Sōya Kuroi has dreams of people with superpowers fighting a massive dragon in the sky, but his real life is almost as weird. He''s had amnesia for about two weeks and been taken in by a maid and an anthropomorphic cat. When a UFO in the shape of a stuffed bear approaches Sorimasaka City and other metros around the world, he''s startled to see seven rainbow-sparkling heroes zoom out to confront it – just like in his dream. Even weirder, the maid wants him to leave his shelter to confront these heroes and take the source of their power.', 'Sōya Kuroi has dreams of people with superpowers fighting a massive dragon in the sky, but his real life is almost as weird. He''s had amnesia for about two weeks and been taken in by a maid and an anthropomorphic cat. When a UFO in the shape of a stuffed bear approaches Sorimasaka City and other metros around the world, he''s startled to see seven rainbow-sparkling heroes zoom out to confront it – just like in his dream. Even weirder, the maid wants him to leave his shelter to confront these heroes and take the source of their power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OogZKfGrU50Q9JlOh7vhwUrHxc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79288'),
  ('669907843665729374', 'Planetarian: The Reverie of a Little Planet', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keiko Suzuki, Daisuke Ono', null, 'It is thirty years after the failure of the Space Colonization Program. Humanity is nearly extinct. A perpetual and deadly Rain falls on the Earth. Men known as "Junkers" plunder goods and artifacts from the ruins of civilization. One such Junker sneaks alone into the most dangerous of all ruins—a "Sarcophagus City." In the center of this dead city, he discovers a pre-War planetarium. And as he enters he is greeted by Hoshino Yumemi, a companion robot. Without a single shred of doubt, she assumes he is the first customer she''s had in 30 years. She attempts to show him the stars at once, but the planetarium projector is broken. Unable to make heads or tails of her conversation, he ends up agreeing to try and repair the projector...', 'It is thirty years after the failure of the Space Colonization Program. Humanity is nearly extinct. A perpetual and deadly Rain falls on the Earth. Men known as "Junkers" plunder goods and artifacts from the ruins of civilization. One such Junker sneaks alone into the most dangerous of all ruins—a "Sarcophagus City." In the center of this dead city, he discovers a pre-War planetarium. And as he enters he is greeted by Hoshino Yumemi, a companion robot. Without a single shred of doubt, she assumes he is the first customer she''s had in 30 years. She attempts to show him the stars at once, but the planetarium projector is broken. Unable to make heads or tails of her conversation, he ends up agreeing to try and repair the projector...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XIwicpQCDqj44uyomlxJe017MI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67078'),
  ('620329266630170104', 'Planetes', 2003, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazunari Tanaka, Satsuki Yukino, Takehito Koyasu, Ai Orikasa, Tetsuo Goto, Yoshihiro Okada', 'TV-14', 'In the year 2075, mankind has reached a point where journeying between Earth, the moon and the space stations is part of daily life. However, the progression of technology in space has also resulted in the problem of the space debris, which can cause excessive and even catastrophic damage to spacecrafts and equipment.', 'In the year 2075, mankind has reached a point where journeying between Earth, the moon and the space stations is part of daily life. However, the progression of technology in space has also resulted in the problem of the space debris, which can cause excessive and even catastrophic damage to spacecrafts and equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9L1iJl6lziuTFOP3pZGW6BxajXk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34102'),
  ('31749979067502321', 'Plastic Elder Sister', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mari Kanou, Yumi Uchiyama, Marina Inoue', null, 'Iroe Genma is a high school student often referred to as the "Elder Sister" despite her short height. She is the president of the school Model Club, which is dedicated to building plastic models of various things such as cars, boats, and robots. With her two classmates, Hazuki "Okappa" Okamoto and Makina "Makimaki" Sakamaki, the small group are often sidetracked.', 'Iroe Genma is a high school student often referred to as the "Elder Sister" despite her short height. She is the president of the school Model Club, which is dedicated to building plastic models of various things such as cars, boats, and robots. With her two classmates, Hazuki "Okappa" Okamoto and Makina "Makimaki" Sakamaki, the small group are often sidetracked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH9JBLZzvhFXjYFSoiPWowiIZc9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54310'),
  ('803475927482908543', 'Plastic Memories', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yasuaki Takumi, Sora Amamiya, Chinatsu Akasaki, Sayuri Yahagi, Megumi Toyoguchi, Satoshi Hino, Aimi, Sumire Uesaka', 'TV-14', 'After failing his college entrance exams, 18 year-old Tsukasa Mizugaki is offered a position at the renowned SAI Corporation, known for its production and management of Giftia, androids that possess human emotions. Tsukasa’s position is in the terminal service department where the main job is to recover Giftias that are close to their expiration, a graveyard department in every sense. To make matters worse, Tsukasa is ordered to work with Isla, a female Giftia who is never given any responsibility other than serving tea to co-workers.', 'After failing his college entrance exams, 18 year-old Tsukasa Mizugaki is offered a position at the renowned SAI Corporation, known for its production and management of Giftia, androids that possess human emotions. Tsukasa’s position is in the terminal service department where the main job is to recover Giftias that are close to their expiration, a graveyard department in every sense. To make matters worse, Tsukasa is ordered to work with Isla, a female Giftia who is never given any responsibility other than serving tea to co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixu4MpRInmmW9HX3HKr0AOUim7B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62450'),
  ('940714002368011050', 'Platane', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Hafid F. Benamar, Éric Judor', null, 'Éric Judor, Hafid F. Benamar, Arnaud Henriet, Jean-Baptiste Shelmerdine, Romain Berger, Toinette Laquière, Jean-Michel Martial, Susanne Schmidt', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7l4l3zBhxUEZGZsVofGKEQF01a.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61375'),
  ('279967910578977951', 'Platform 7', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Louise Doughty', null, 'Jasmine Jobson, Toby Regbo, Yaamin Chowdhury, Sacha Parkinson, Reece Ritchie, Tábata Cerezo, Rhiannon Clements, Phil Davis', null, 'Lisa, after witnessing a cataclysmic event on Platform 7 of a railway station, finds her own fragmented memory jogged to reveal a connection between her own life and that of the event she has just witnessed.', 'Lisa, after witnessing a cataclysmic event on Platform 7 of a railway station, finds her own fragmented memory jogged to reveal a connection between her own life and that of the event she has just witnessed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSz5nrTrHBsbdVJJgYMB1tJ5nkv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237232'),
  ('317850737918167552', 'Platinum End', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Yui Ogura, Mao Ichimichi, Natsuki Hanae, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Ai Kayano, Kaito Ishikawa, Kikuko Inoue', 'TV-14', 'As his classmates celebrate their middle school graduation, troubled Mirai is mired in darkness. But his battle is just beginning when he receives some salvation from above in the form of an angel. Now Mirai is pitted against 12 other chosen humans in a battle in which the winner becomes the next god of the world. Mirai has an angel in his corner, but he may need to become a devil to survive.', 'As his classmates celebrate their middle school graduation, troubled Mirai is mired in darkness. But his battle is just beginning when he receives some salvation from above in the form of an angel. Now Mirai is pitted against 12 other chosen humans in a battle in which the winner becomes the next god of the world. Mirai has an angel in his corner, but he may need to become a devil to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxL3ZYeS1GYORKGHG9FI0l6QXQF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114892'),
  ('838682098629561302', 'Platinumhugen Ordian', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Yui Horie, Haruna Ikezawa, Michiko Neya, Houko Kuwashima, Atsuko Enomoto, Shinji Kawada, Hideo Ishikawa', null, 'Platinumhugen Ordian is a Japanese anime series. Directed by Masami Ōbari, the 24 episodes were broadcast on WOWOW between April 4, 2000 and September 19, 2000.', 'Platinumhugen Ordian is a Japanese anime series. Directed by Masami Ōbari, the 24 episodes were broadcast on WOWOW between April 4, 2000 and September 19, 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAQeNeO2C42vljqlAlZgFcqvvDg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34200'),
  ('824920111035895537', 'Platonic', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Nicholas Stoller, Francesca Delbanco', 'Noah Findling', 'Rose Byrne, Seth Rogen, Luke Macfarlane, Carla Gallo', 'TV-MA', 'A platonic pair of former best friends approaching midlife reconnect after a long rift. The duo’s friendship becomes more consuming—and destabilizes their lives in a hilarious way.', 'A platonic pair of former best friends approaching midlife reconnect after a long rift. The duo’s friendship becomes more consuming—and destabilizes their lives in a hilarious way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7G8wB9CG82nITeFwRFIRSk0sQJs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112211'),
  ('861357819599664832', 'Platonic', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Onur Bilgetay, Gupse Özay', 'Onur Bilgetay, Gupse Özay', 'Gupse Özay, Öykü Karayel, Kerem Bürsin, Mehmet Özgür, Uğur Demirpehlivan, Ülkü Duru, Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk, Ali İpin', null, 'When a suave stranger with a hidden agenda checks into the Blue Moon Hotel, chaos and raunchy romance ensnare the two unhinged sisters who work there.', 'When a suave stranger with a hidden agenda checks into the Blue Moon Hotel, chaos and raunchy romance ensnare the two unhinged sisters who work there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dj8A4dX6oC7DFD2RWLqvMLMPVQ3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278011'),
  ('353307633717339133', 'Play for Today', 1970, 'Drama', null, 'Colin Welland', null, null, 'Play for Today is a British television anthology drama series, produced by the BBC and transmitted on BBC1 from 1970 to 1984. During the run, more than three hundred programmes, featuring original television plays, and adaptations of stage plays and novels, were transmitted. The individual episodes were between fifty and a hundred minutes in duration.', 'Play for Today is a British television anthology drama series, produced by the BBC and transmitted on BBC1 from 1970 to 1984. During the run, more than three hundred programmes, featuring original television plays, and adaptations of stage plays and novels, were transmitted. The individual episodes were between fifty and a hundred minutes in duration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIgjKkazKMhqQjytljsofAEsp3q.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:13654'),
  ('827551068400780094', 'Play It Again, Dick', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Rob Thomas', null, 'Ryan Hansen, Kyle Gallner, Kristen Bell, Enrico Colantoni, Rose McIver, Robert Buckley', null, 'Play It Again, Dick is a digital series that follows Ryan Hansen as he tries to get a Dick Casablancas show off the ground.', 'Play It Again, Dick is a digital series that follows Ryan Hansen as he tries to get a Dick Casablancas show off the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ce0R1aYMDJz0uhRyVBtMbKus5DX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61326'),
  ('486477753114338346', 'Play It Cool, Guys', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Koki Uchiyama, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shoya Chiba, Satomi Sato, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Taku Yashiro, Kengo Takanashi', 'TV-14', 'Despite their distinctive personalities, Souma Shiki, Hayate Ichikura, Shun Futami, and Takayuki Mima all have one thing in common: though naturally clumsy, the four disguise their embarrassment from tiny slip-ups by maintaining a composed demeanor. However, it is actually the guys'' airheaded natures that makes the girls'' hearts throb. No matter what happens in their daily lives, the boys do their best not to lose their cool!', 'Despite their distinctive personalities, Souma Shiki, Hayate Ichikura, Shun Futami, and Takayuki Mima all have one thing in common: though naturally clumsy, the four disguise their embarrassment from tiny slip-ups by maintaining a composed demeanor. However, it is actually the guys'' airheaded natures that makes the girls'' hearts throb. No matter what happens in their daily lives, the boys do their best not to lose their cool!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGLSnIgtvLyZByQLBGMtNt1rSRQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198170'),
  ('754230053502689635', 'Play Park', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Narilya Gulmongkolpech, Duangkaew Piyaoui, Dandao Yamapai, Pongsapat Kankam, Natthanit Praditthan, Alina Dohling, Sittan Suphakiengkai, Krit Sukramongkol', null, 'An unexpected romance that blossoms in the colorful setting of an amusement park between Lilin, a heir to a powerful family business, and Ing Ing, the diligent amusement park manager.', 'An unexpected romance that blossoms in the colorful setting of an amusement park between Lilin, a heir to a powerful family business, and Ing Ing, the diligent amusement park manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge5wHhO5wumJ3oEECV8v6c7IwVU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295351'),
  ('804516011817354381', 'Playboyy', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Narongdet Rungarun, Thakrit Chaiwut, Palat Chayutnitiroj, KaowOat Supasin Singhapan, Chat Wasutha Phromchainun, Jack Jaktrin Giacomo Piazza, Pharunrit Sarutsitphon, Boat Pakorn Tochuensakul', null, 'Three friends dive into the dark side of the sex industry to find a missing person, facing their own fears and desires along the way.', 'Three friends dive into the dark side of the sex industry to find a missing person, facing their own fears and desires along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ewd3BLkE5MshNFxDFAdmDYvXkS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231260'),
  ('840020523673428348', 'Playdate with Winnie the Pooh', 2023, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Leon Chen, Gracen Newton, Callum Vinson, Dylan Alvarado, Arwen Monzon-Sanders, Emma Zavaleta, Madelyn Skylar Taketa', null, 'Follow a young Pooh Bear as he enjoys playdates with his friends. Set in the exciting outdoors of the Hundred Acre Wood, these musical shorts emphasize collaborative play and the joy of spending time with others.', 'Follow a young Pooh Bear as he enjoys playdates with his friends. Set in the exciting outdoors of the Hundred Acre Wood, these musical shorts emphasize collaborative play and the joy of spending time with others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwm8tbIZiXAujYdU2PS5QaSiShX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:228674'),
  ('268301960237911894', 'Player', 2018, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, '최슬기, 박상문', 'Song Seung-heon, Jang Gyu-ri, Oh Yeon-seo, Im Seul-ong, Tae Won-seok, Hong Jong-hyun, Lee Si-eon', null, 'The story about the revenge of four talented individuals in their respective fields who create an elite team to solve crimes.', 'The story about the revenge of four talented individuals in their respective fields who create an elite team to solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z5GNHh4J0AC1W8TyIwV8Xnby61.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82032'),
  ('344898699465614979', 'Players', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dan Perrault, Tony Yacenda', null, 'Misha Brooks, Da''Jour Jones, Ely Henry, Holly Chou, Alexa Mansour, Stephen Schneider, Youngbin Chung, Luke Tennie', 'TV-MA', 'A pro League of Legends esports team pursues their first championship after years of close calls and heartache. To win it all, they will need their prodigy, a 17-year-old rookie, and their 27-year-old veteran to put their egos aside and work together.', 'A pro League of Legends esports team pursues their first championship after years of close calls and heartache. To win it all, they will need their prodigy, a 17-year-old rookie, and their 27-year-old veteran to put their egos aside and work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0YH9RlBidJNsSnPmRsV4AqK2m4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132178'),
  ('410042888186484443', 'Playhouse', 1974, 'Drama', 'Sarah Pia Anderson', null, null, null, 'A one-hour anthology television series of one-off contemporary and classic dramas produced by the BBC.', 'A one-hour anthology television series of one-off contemporary and classic dramas produced by the BBC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hkYEnIuKZRSIwvVhWAKgIFv0UJ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:30504'),
  ('6468108608597483', 'Playhouse 90', 1956, 'Drama', 'Hubbell Robinson, Frank Stanton', null, null, null, 'Playhouse 90 is an American television anthology series that was telecast on CBS from 1956 to 1960 for a total of 133 episodes. It originated from CBS Television City in Los Angeles, California. Since live anthology drama series of the mid-1950s were usually hour-long shows, the title highlighted the network''s intention to present something unusual, a weekly series of hour-and-a-half dramas rather than 60-minute plays. Playhouse 90 began as a pitch by Frank Stanton—the formidable, forward-thinking right-hand man to CBS chairman William S. Paley—during a brainstorming session for program ideas. The project was ultimately developed by Hubbell Robinson, a CBS vice president who received no screen credit on Playhouse 90 but is often described as its creator.', 'Playhouse 90 is an American television anthology series that was telecast on CBS from 1956 to 1960 for a total of 133 episodes. It originated from CBS Television City in Los Angeles, California. Since live anthology drama series of the mid-1950s were usually hour-long shows, the title highlighted the network''s intention to present something unusual, a weekly series of hour-and-a-half dramas rather than 60-minute plays. Playhouse 90 began as a pitch by Frank Stanton—the formidable, forward-thinking right-hand man to CBS chairman William S. Paley—during a brainstorming session for program ideas. The project was ultimately developed by Hubbell Robinson, a CBS vice president who received no screen credit on Playhouse 90 but is often described as its creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6srGbszH8amK1JiJRS2YzRcoDVw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:11168'),
  ('129720284367076200', 'Playing Go', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Fang Yuan, Gao Nini, Dai Yue', 'Wang Baoqiang, Chen Minghao, Chen Yongsheng, Wang Zhi, Li Naiwen, Li Meng, Wu Tianqi, Li Ruotian', null, 'Cui Ye is an ordinary Go teacher whose life spirals into chaos after an accidental entanglement in a crime. As he gradually descends into illegality, his police officer brother, Cui Wei, relentlessly pursues him.', 'Cui Ye is an ordinary Go teacher whose life spirals into chaos after an accidental entanglement in a crime. As he gradually descends into illegality, his police officer brother, Cui Wei, relentlessly pursues him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igL5DY9phS0MoBQOjZxyys2Agrl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258490'),
  ('764644826875712967', 'Playing Gracie Darling', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Miranda Nation', 'Anya Beyersdorf, Miranda Nation', 'Kristina Bogic, Morgana O''Reilly, Rudi Dharmalingam, Chloe Brink, Saiesha Sundaralingam, Ariel Donoghue, Celia Pacquola, Annie Maynard', 'TV-MA', 'When Joni was 14, her best friend Gracie Darling disappeared during a séance. Some 27 years on, the local kids in a small town get their kicks with a game of ''Playing Gracie Darling'' – but the seemingly innocent game turns sinister when another girl disappears. Joni, by then a child psychologist, returns to the town and partners with a police sergeant Jay to uncover the truth, while Gracie''s sister Ruth faces a mother''s worst nightmare when her own daughter vanishes under hauntingly similar circumstances.', 'When Joni was 14, her best friend Gracie Darling disappeared during a séance. Some 27 years on, the local kids in a small town get their kicks with a game of ''Playing Gracie Darling'' – but the seemingly innocent game turns sinister when another girl disappears. Joni, by then a child psychologist, returns to the town and partners with a police sergeant Jay to uncover the truth, while Gracie''s sister Ruth faces a mother''s worst nightmare when her own daughter vanishes under hauntingly similar circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UWdkbSUd1d1GB28IyIKDbftzhM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271823'),
  ('699432020692428218', 'Playing House', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jessica St. Clair, Lennon Parham', null, 'Lennon Parham, Jessica St. Clair, Keegan-Michael Key', 'TV-14', 'A single-camera buddy comedy about what happens when two best friends come back together, just when they need each other most. Inspired by the ultra-close friendship between the series'' creators and stars, "Playing House" centers on mother to-be Maggie who asks her single and career-driven best friend Emma to return home from her job overseas to attend her baby shower, having no idea what’s truly in store.', 'A single-camera buddy comedy about what happens when two best friends come back together, just when they need each other most. Inspired by the ultra-close friendship between the series'' creators and stars, "Playing House" centers on mother to-be Maggie who asks her single and career-driven best friend Emma to return home from her job overseas to attend her baby shower, having no idea what’s truly in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhOOP0C3Llab2eWYbSOdLPtpXYh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61762'),
  ('1148047774603555152', 'Playing Nice', 2025, 'Drama', 'Grace Ofori-Attah', null, 'James Norton, Niamh Algar, James McArdle, Jessica Brown Findlay', null, 'Set against a sweeping Cornish landscape, two couples discover that their toddlers were switched at birth in a hospital mix-up, and face a horrifying dilemma: do they keep the sons they have raised and loved, or reclaim their biological child?', 'Set against a sweeping Cornish landscape, two couples discover that their toddlers were switched at birth in a hospital mix-up, and face a horrifying dilemma: do they keep the sons they have raised and loved, or reclaim their biological child?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JvX91JibvTEE2v4PfNaBKQuGyr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242706'),
  ('774565283606483241', 'Playing with Fire', 2019, 'Drama', 'Julia Montejo, José Luis Acosta', null, 'Yuri Vargas, Jason Day, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, Carlos Ponce, Laura Perico, Alejandro Aguilar, Tony Plana, Marcelo Serrado', 'TV-14', 'Three prosperous women -- including a mother and her daughter -- fall for a seductive man in Colombia''s Coffee Triangle.', 'Three prosperous women -- including a mother and her daughter -- fall for a seductive man in Colombia''s Coffee Triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Hm4tQAP1V80QqgJDAD2SKhDGeW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86151'),
  ('533433600875497338', 'Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf', 2005, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Leo Huang', null, 'Qing Zu, Deng Yuting, Ying Liang, Hongyun Liu, Yanzi Yan, Quansheng Gao, Lin Zhang, Na Zhao', null, 'Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf is a Chinese animated television series which was created by Huang Weiming, Lin Yuting and Luo Yinggeng, and produced by Creative Power Entertaining. The show is about a group of goats living on the Green Pasture, Qing Qing Grasslands/Plains, and the story revolving around a clumsy wolf who wants to eat them. Toon Express Group owns the copyrights of the characters.', 'Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf is a Chinese animated television series which was created by Huang Weiming, Lin Yuting and Luo Yinggeng, and produced by Creative Power Entertaining. The show is about a group of goats living on the Green Pasture, Qing Qing Grasslands/Plains, and the story revolving around a clumsy wolf who wants to eat them. Toon Express Group owns the copyrights of the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TEX73koX9NroUA9lVwFDMTZtaC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6732'),
  ('301810358545666562', 'Please Be My Family', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zheng Qiuhong, Xie Binbin, Zhu Yuanbing, Sheng Huizi, Jin Chong, Yang Xueer', null, 'Qi Sile strives to secure a project to pay for her daughter’s surgery while pursuing Maolin’s boss, Song Haoyu. When he discovers a connection between his son and her daughter, he proposes to her, hoping to create a complete family for the children, leading them into an uncertain future together.', 'Qi Sile strives to secure a project to pay for her daughter’s surgery while pursuing Maolin’s boss, Song Haoyu. When he discovers a connection between his son and her daughter, he proposes to her, hoping to create a complete family for the children, leading them into an uncertain future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgLg3su8nVmvq39SGaN5xflJsYJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227149'),
  ('829318261116585412', 'Please Come Back, Mister', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rain, Oh Yeon-seo, Kim In-kwon, Kim Soo-ro, Lee Min-jung, Lee Hanee, Choi Won-young, Yoon Park', null, 'After being literally worked to death, one man comes back to life while possessing a handsome man for a limited time.', 'After being literally worked to death, one man comes back to life while possessing a handsome man for a limited time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebmVNHZrFgiIjq8bpB8fUzYfrav.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65412'),
  ('784161237872352606', 'Please Don''t Date Him', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Song Ha-yoon, Lee Jun-young, Yoon Bo-mi, Gong Min-jeung, Joo Woo-jae, Nam Min-woo, Kim Gi-ri, Lee Si-hoon', null, 'Seo Ji Sung is a programmer of the AI smart home appliance development team. One day, she accidentally develops an AI program called Cho Sang Shin, which will identify trashy humans, and she uses it to save people who are in difficult relationships. Jung Kook Hee is a firefighter who doesn''t use social media. He is the one and only person that Cho Sang Shin is unable to analyze.', 'Seo Ji Sung is a programmer of the AI smart home appliance development team. One day, she accidentally develops an AI program called Cho Sang Shin, which will identify trashy humans, and she uses it to save people who are in difficult relationships. Jung Kook Hee is a firefighter who doesn''t use social media. He is the one and only person that Cho Sang Shin is unable to analyze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP0ioyDyG1U5P2Bs2ZTc7FNlUIp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112568'),
  ('972418950821704209', 'Please Feel At Ease Mr. Ling', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chun Feng Yi Du', 'Dai Qi, Yan Wen', 'Zhao Lusi, Liu Te, Zhang Yan, Daisy Li, Jacky Zhou, Qi Peixin, He Peng, Liu Yinjun', null, 'A story of how the ''rabbit'' brings home a ''big bad wolf'' follows a young woman named Gu An Xin who chances upon the hotshot executive Ling Yue after he encountered an accident. Gu An Xin picked up a man. At first, she thought he was stupid, but after a few days of interaction, he proves himself to be a genius. As it turns out, Ling Yue got into an accident after being caught in the ugly fight for succession of a powerful conglomerate.', 'A story of how the ''rabbit'' brings home a ''big bad wolf'' follows a young woman named Gu An Xin who chances upon the hotshot executive Ling Yue after he encountered an accident. Gu An Xin picked up a man. At first, she thought he was stupid, but after a few days of interaction, he proves himself to be a genius. As it turns out, Ling Yue got into an accident after being caught in the ugly fight for succession of a powerful conglomerate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYquBAJqfHuHdPQ1w2YhISXPb9E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117549'),
  ('558311156584062923', 'Please Give Me a Pair of Wings', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Aaron Yan, Ju Jingyi, Han Dong, Zhang Yuxi, Wang Yan, Merxat, Yuen Wah, Zhu Shengyi', null, 'Lin Jiuge, wrongfully imprisoned for a crime she didn’t commit, teams up with detective Long Tianyu to uncover the truth. Alongside this, she and her friend Leng Nianzi strive to establish an all-girls school to empower women in their town, facing strong opposition from those who want to stop them.', 'Lin Jiuge, wrongfully imprisoned for a crime she didn’t commit, teams up with detective Long Tianyu to uncover the truth. Alongside this, she and her friend Leng Nianzi strive to establish an all-girls school to empower women in their town, facing strong opposition from those who want to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4h107k9WNpyNKNNmf2qdIvvh2E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92203'),
  ('133057806885372245', 'Please Hold On To My Character', 2026, 'Drama', '路锦程', '丁艺, 藤浪浪', 'Liu Haoqun, Li Peiyang', null, 'A journey of soul swapping opens up two different lives. From confrontation to camaraderie, from misunderstanding to understanding, what kind of emotional journey did they experience?', 'A journey of soul swapping opens up two different lives. From confrontation to camaraderie, from misunderstanding to understanding, what kind of emotional journey did they experience?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m86Ss3XQzjyGHbuoTPKuZWEMPY3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317389'),
  ('330723614839223949', 'Please Like Me', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Josh Thomas', 'Josh Thomas', 'Josh Thomas, Hannah Gadsby', 'TV-MA', 'After breaking up with his girlfriend, Josh comes to the realization that he is homosexual. With the support of his now ex girlfriend Claire, and his best friend and house mate Tom, Josh must help his mother with her battle with depression and the rest of his family embrace his new found lifestyle.', 'After breaking up with his girlfriend, Josh comes to the realization that he is homosexual. With the support of his now ex girlfriend Claire, and his best friend and house mate Tom, Josh must help his mother with her battle with depression and the rest of his family embrace his new found lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgzpboEMxpHVI3Isy5lZOCP2e6X.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61350'),
  ('1034923492427703910', 'PLEASE LOVE ME!', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Kyoko Fukada, Dean Fujioka, Shohei Miura, Maho Nonami, Takehiko Ono, Mimura', null, 'Michiko is 30 years old. She keeps looking for a job after her previous employer went bankrupt, but she is unable to find work. Michiko still supports her younger boyfriend and her savings are almost gone. Then, Michiko meets her ex-boss, Ayumu. She was scared of Ayumu when they worked together. Ayumu now runs a tea room which his grandmother ran. Michiko decides to work part-time at Ayumu''s tea room. There, she encounters various troubles everyday. Ayumu helps Michiko, which allows her to see a different side of him that she never noticed before.', 'Michiko is 30 years old. She keeps looking for a job after her previous employer went bankrupt, but she is unable to find work. Michiko still supports her younger boyfriend and her savings are almost gone. Then, Michiko meets her ex-boss, Ayumu. She was scared of Ayumu when they worked together. Ayumu now runs a tea room which his grandmother ran. Michiko decides to work part-time at Ayumu''s tea room. There, she encounters various troubles everyday. Ayumu helps Michiko, which allows her to see a different side of him that she never noticed before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29FNiR9HqnrHgq5g2sfwIdQSsHU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65379'),
  ('975071684592686787', 'Please Put Them On, Takamine-san', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yurika Kubo, Daisuke Kasuya, Sumire Uesaka, Miyu Tomita', 'TV-MA', 'Student council president Takane Takamine is a popular star student. On the other hand, Koushi Shirota doesn''t have many friends. That all changes when Koushi accidentally discovers Takane''s ability to go back in time and alter past actions just by changing her lingerie. After some pestering, Koushi agrees to help Takane and be her closet, by having spare lingerie on hand.', 'Student council president Takane Takamine is a popular star student. On the other hand, Koushi Shirota doesn''t have many friends. That all changes when Koushi accidentally discovers Takane''s ability to go back in time and alter past actions just by changing her lingerie. After some pestering, Koushi agrees to help Takane and be her closet, by having spare lingerie on hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN5yLKKW89XomkKE9hFEjsaww3s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276880'),
  ('353350157587991031', 'Please Save My Earth', 1993, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Saki Hiwatari', null, 'Yuri Shiratori, Yumi Touma, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Ryotaro Okiayu, Nozomu Sasaki, Yasunori Matsumoto, Naoko Matsui, Yoshino Takamori', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZFH8GWUJQBg19x9vHi1Qz51pER.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65967'),
  ('1015773681040949177', 'Please Sir!', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Bob Larbey, John Esmonde', null, 'Richard Davies, Erik Chitty, Joan Sanderson, Deryck Guyler, Noel Howlett', null, 'A hapless but caring teacher tries to control his class of unruly kids. The teacher sees much good and potential in his pupils, much to the dismay of his fellow teachers who have lost hope in these kids.', 'A hapless but caring teacher tries to control his class of unruly kids. The teacher sees much good and potential in his pupils, much to the dismay of his fellow teachers who have lost hope in these kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLQiy3Xz1FJlIQKNOFDNiSCFXY4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10005'),
  ('1041058504386961229', 'Please Take My Brother Away', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Sora Amamiya, Kensho Ono, Natsuki Hanae', 'TV-PG', 'What''s your brother like? To Miao, her brother Fen is someone who would tease her and make her explode 100 times a day; not a peaceful day as the two are fighting every single minute. However, when troubles come, Fen will become a caring, loving brother who protects his little sister at all cost.', 'What''s your brother like? To Miao, her brother Fen is someone who would tease her and make her explode 100 times a day; not a peaceful day as the two are fighting every single minute. However, when troubles come, Fen will become a caring, loving brother who protects his little sister at all cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCBGfrrCMu3axBk2UgCuEBAFrPn.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:70972'),
  ('299826145647432491', 'Please Teacher!', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kikuko Inoue, Soichiro Hoshi, Ayako Kawasumi, Mitsuo Iwata, Sayaka Ohara, Yumi Takada, Satomi Korogi, Tomoko Kaneda', 'TV-14', 'Kusanagi Kei, a high-school student living with his aunt and uncle, has an encounter with a female alien. This alien is revealed to be a new teacher at his school. Later, he is forced to marry this alien to preserve her secrets. From there, various romantically-inclined problems crop up repeatedly.', 'Kusanagi Kei, a high-school student living with his aunt and uncle, has an encounter with a female alien. This alien is revealed to be a new teacher at his school. Later, he is forced to marry this alien to preserve her secrets. From there, various romantically-inclined problems crop up repeatedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ih1gZLPeeeQXRWeFwv7mD7MRE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19780'),
  ('566780749636089637', 'Please Tell Me! Galko-chan', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Azumi Waki, Miyu Tomita, Minami Takahashi, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-14', 'Three high school girls with different perspectives discuss the kinds of secrets you can''t tell boys.', 'Three high school girls with different perspectives discuss the kinds of secrets you can''t tell boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g77GQPzn1dhMzxJbSTvcMIL62oG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66504'),
  ('622938360320282542', 'Please Twins!', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Daisuke Namikawa, Mai Nakahara, Ai Shimizu, Michiko Neya, Kenichi Suzumura, Hiroaki Miura, Kikuko Inoue, Ryoko Shintani', null, 'Maiku Kamishiro grew up in an orphanage with no history of his family or of his past. Left with only a childhood picture of himself and another person in front of a house, he believes that the other person in the picture is his long lost twin sister. Upon discovering his old home, two young girls show up on his doorstep one day both claiming to be his long lost sister.', 'Maiku Kamishiro grew up in an orphanage with no history of his family or of his past. Left with only a childhood picture of himself and another person in front of a house, he believes that the other person in the picture is his long lost twin sister. Upon discovering his old home, two young girls show up on his doorstep one day both claiming to be his long lost sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fHIwmRU1GnvlZrp1z0gVLsltyk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20177'),
  ('735967457339304566', 'Plebs', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Sam Leifer, Tom Basden', null, 'Tom Rosenthal, Ryan Sampson, Tom Basden, Karl Theobald, Jon Pointing', 'TV-14', 'Sitcom about three desperate young men from the suburbs who try to get laid, hold down jobs and climb the social ladder in the big city - which just happens to be ancient Rome.', 'Sitcom about three desperate young men from the suburbs who try to get laid, hold down jobs and climb the social ladder in the big city - which just happens to be ancient Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ip8wfdDPhvps9lASCX94MMOSjil.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46973'),
  ('89703773745545949', 'Plunderer', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Ari Ozawa, Yoshiki Nakajima, Aoi Ichikawa, Shizuka Itoh, Rina Honnizumi', 'TV-14', 'In a post-apocalyptic world dominated by the so-called "Numbers," each human will have their identity branded with their own "Count," which could define any number related to their life. May it be one''s walked distance or amount of compliments given to them by others, this Count could lead them to the abyss when it has dropped to zero. In the year 305 of the Alcian calendar, Hina has inherited a mission from her Mother, whose Count has depreciated to zero, to search for the Legendary Red Baron. In her adventure, she meets a half-masked swordsman named Licht who tries to hide his identity, as he is known as a degenerate for having an incredibly low Count.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world dominated by the so-called "Numbers," each human will have their identity branded with their own "Count," which could define any number related to their life. May it be one''s walked distance or amount of compliments given to them by others, this Count could lead them to the abyss when it has dropped to zero. In the year 305 of the Alcian calendar, Hina has inherited a mission from her Mother, whose Count has depreciated to zero, to search for the Legendary Red Baron. In her adventure, she meets a half-masked swordsman named Licht who tries to hide his identity, as he is known as a degenerate for having an incredibly low Count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0XboGeodpGlj33QUtjPMMwrMkN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93149'),
  ('770263487378309377', 'Pluribus', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Vince Gilligan', 'Claudia Azurmendi', 'Rhea Seehorn, Karolina Wydra, Carlos-Manuel Vesga', 'TV-MA', 'The most miserable person on Earth must save the world from happiness.', 'The most miserable person on Earth must save the world from happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7Nga7Q9IGFWs5OEduY2gGFxnX3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225171'),
  ('687797258945731935', 'Plus & Minus', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chiang Ping Chen', null, 'Shih Chengxuan, Max Lin, Matt Lee, Zheng Qi-lei, Flora Gu, Boris Wang, Shara Lin, Ai Yu Fan', null, 'Childhood friends turned attorneys, Fu Li Gong and Zheng Ze Shou, explore newfound feelings, while X and Jian Ying Ze’s romance faces its own challenges.', 'Childhood friends turned attorneys, Fu Li Gong and Zheng Ze Shou, explore newfound feelings, while X and Jian Ying Ze’s romance faces its own challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XJrQXcZef7ko5i33tWFj0ISK0m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195192'),
  ('758902680475450390', 'Plus belle la vie', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Magaly Richard-Serrano, Bénedicte Achard, Georges Desmouceaux', null, 'Michel Cordes, Laurent Kerusoré, Éléonore Sarrazin, Cécilia Hornus, Rebecca Hampton, Anne Décis, Serge Dupire, Sylvie Flepp', 'NR', 'The daily lives of the inhabitants of "le Mistral", an imaginary neighbourhood in the Mediterranean port city of Marseille, where wealthy families cross paths with the less than rich.', 'The daily lives of the inhabitants of "le Mistral", an imaginary neighbourhood in the Mediterranean port city of Marseille, where wealthy families cross paths with the less than rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmU8HlTDn87xmRqXagcL2swDr8I.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:8590'),
