  ('220471448675162962', 'Plus-Sized Elf', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayasa Ito, Takahide Ishii', 'TV-MA', 'Naoe, a massage therapist, is about to head home for the day when he’s saddled with a rather strange patient. This lovely lady has emerald eyes, pointy ears, and grew up in the forest–everything about her screams “elf,” except for one thing: her bodacious body. It turns out she left her world but loves junk food in this one, and now her obsession has caught up with her. Can Naoe help this lovable elf girl lose the weight–and keep it off?', 'Naoe, a massage therapist, is about to head home for the day when he’s saddled with a rather strange patient. This lovely lady has emerald eyes, pointy ears, and grew up in the forest–everything about her screams “elf,” except for one thing: her bodacious body. It turns out she left her world but loves junk food in this one, and now her obsession has caught up with her. Can Naoe help this lovable elf girl lose the weight–and keep it off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAsfnNQmo8apz4tDDgnjXAirudB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243743'),
  ('765013259257302314', 'Pluto', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Tipnaree Weerawatnodom, Rachanun Mahawan, Rutricha Phapakithi, Ploynira Hiruntaveesin, Preeyaphat Lawsuwansiri, Thinnaphan Tantui, Sivakorn Lertchuchot, Weerayut Chansook', null, 'After a successful twin falls into a coma following a wedding-night accident, her overlooked sister must pose as her to break up with the lover she secretly left behind—only to discover the woman is blind and unaware of the truth.', 'After a successful twin falls into a coma following a wedding-night accident, her overlooked sister must pose as her to break up with the lover she secretly left behind—only to discover the woman is blind and unaware of the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4umoWmqGjVIMyAQYLL64lJcLoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237330'),
