  ('102690212755135947', 'Pobre Pablo', 2000, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Perez, Adriana Suarez', null, 'Roberto Cano, Carolina Acevedo, Alejandro Martinez, Valentina Rendón', null, 'Pablo, the bodyguard of a wealthy family, who lives with his mother and two siblings posing as a millionaire to win the heart of a rich young woman who lives in Miami, committed to Federico Villegas de la Concha. Cindy, a mechanical daughter of a neighbor of the Guerrero family, is in love with Paul and makes it impossible for Paul to fall in love with her.', 'Pablo, the bodyguard of a wealthy family, who lives with his mother and two siblings posing as a millionaire to win the heart of a rich young woman who lives in Miami, committed to Federico Villegas de la Concha. Cindy, a mechanical daughter of a neighbor of the Guerrero family, is in love with Paul and makes it impossible for Paul to fall in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcY2XMdiuKZCn7KTX5SZDRO666I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130737'),
  ('228173477274860865', 'Poco''s Udon World', 2016, 'Animation', null, null, 'Shiho Kokido, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'On a visit to his hometown, Souta Tawara meets a strange child who loves udon and frogs... and has ears and a tail?! Although ordinary at first glance, it turns out that this little tyke is actually a tanuki in a human disguise! So begins the tale of a gentle, warm, and slightly weird family in Kagawa prefecture, better known as "Udon Prefecture," where time passes at a less hurried pace than in the big city...', 'On a visit to his hometown, Souta Tawara meets a strange child who loves udon and frogs... and has ears and a tail?! Although ordinary at first glance, it turns out that this little tyke is actually a tanuki in a human disguise! So begins the tale of a gentle, warm, and slightly weird family in Kagawa prefecture, better known as "Udon Prefecture," where time passes at a less hurried pace than in the big city...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0cSmqxhEwwf7QO2lkU3hvVUpQO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68224'),
