  ('393162049157179443', 'Pôr do Sol', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Henrique Cardoso Dias, Rui Melo, Manuel Pureza', 'Rui Melo, Roberto Pereira, Henrique Cardoso Dias', 'Gabriela Barros, Diogo Amaral, Marco Delgado, Sofia Sá da Bandeira, Rui Melo, Manuel Cavaco, Noémia Costa, Rodrigo Saraiva', null, 'Love, passion, mystery, betrayal makes the days of the Pôr do Sol estate. The Bourbon de Linhaça family owns the Pôr do Sol estate, but not everything is rosy...', 'Love, passion, mystery, betrayal makes the days of the Pôr do Sol estate. The Bourbon de Linhaça family owns the Pôr do Sol estate, but not everything is rosy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIZltxNjYCutvEBF2cUszGEpuKD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:130350'),
  ('187158788432499079', 'Por ella soy Eva', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elkim Ospina, Rosy Ocampo, Juan Carlos Troncoso', 'Juan Carlos Troncoso', 'Lucero, Jaime Camil, Helena Rojo, Patricia Navidad, Mariana Seoane, Marcelo Córdoba, Leticia Perdigón, Jesús Ochoa', 'TV-PG', 'Por Ella Soy Eva is a Mexican soap opera produced by Rosy Ocampo for Televisa based on the Colombian soap opera En los tacones de Eva. Jaime Camil and Lucero starred as main protagonists, while Mariana Seoane and Marcelo Córdoba starred as the main antagonists. "The Best Telenovela of the Year 2013."', 'Por Ella Soy Eva is a Mexican soap opera produced by Rosy Ocampo for Televisa based on the Colombian soap opera En los tacones de Eva. Jaime Camil and Lucero starred as main protagonists, while Mariana Seoane and Marcelo Córdoba starred as the main antagonists. "The Best Telenovela of the Year 2013."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vERzXYHkNxQaHhenEgeO77D1Bmw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42350'),
