  ('585054202170301895', 'Promise of Wizard', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Atsushi Tamaru, Takashi Kondo, Daichi Kanbara, Yuusuke Nagano, Hiroki Takahashi, Chihiro Suzuki, Takuma Terashima', 'TV-14', 'On a moonlit night, Akira Masaki finds herself in a magical world where wizards and humans coexist. Every year, they must face an enormous, deadly moon that attacks the planet. Their only hope lies with the Wizards of the Sage, appointed to fight the supernatural threat. But Akira soon discovers she wasn''t summoned by chance—she was chosen to lead them in battle.', 'On a moonlit night, Akira Masaki finds herself in a magical world where wizards and humans coexist. Every year, they must face an enormous, deadly moon that attacks the planet. Their only hope lies with the Wizards of the Sage, appointed to fight the supernatural threat. But Akira soon discovers she wasn''t summoned by chance—she was chosen to lead them in battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXJwmUem4yKekiUmt7VJEmxCGML.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258578'),
  ('351456092159117939', 'Promised Land', 1996, 'Drama', 'Martha Williamson', null, 'Gerald McRaney, Wendy Phillips, Austin O''Brien, Sarah Schaub, Eddie Karr, Celeste Holm', null, 'Promised Land is an American drama series which aired on CBS from 1996 to 1999. It is a spin-off from another series, Touched by an Angel.', 'Promised Land is an American drama series which aired on CBS from 1996 to 1999. It is a spin-off from another series, Touched by an Angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcONgPhxtXJjA5pQjhU5Ih5FlTb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9929'),
