  ('852295805186430337', 'Prop Culture', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Dan Lanigan', 'TV-PG', 'Film historian and prop collector Dan Lanigan reunites iconic Disney movie props with the filmmakers, actors, and crew who created and used them in some of Disney’s most beloved films. Throughout this journey, Dan will recover lost artifacts, visit private collections, and help restore pieces from the Walt Disney Archives to their original glory.', 'Film historian and prop collector Dan Lanigan reunites iconic Disney movie props with the filmmakers, actors, and crew who created and used them in some of Disney’s most beloved films. Throughout this journey, Dan will recover lost artifacts, visit private collections, and help restore pieces from the Walt Disney Archives to their original glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43wuBG4B1HGB4B8Z9MnVNiLwawR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101699'),
  ('962122373506777694', 'Property Brothers', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Drew Scott, Jonathan Silver Scott', 'TV-14', 'Brothers Jonathan and Drew Scott help home buyers to purchase renovation projects.', 'Brothers Jonathan and Drew Scott help home buyers to purchase renovation projects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccggWzKxSao1VNaVFJNLkZG96Fb.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:35058'),
  ('1024518073737270735', 'Property Brothers: Buying and Selling', 2012, 'Reality', 'Michael Sheehan', null, 'Jonathan Silver Scott, Drew Scott', 'TV-G', 'Reality series where Jonathan and Drew help homeowners take their next step up the property ladder. Featuring two pivotal real estate moments, double the stress, and twice the manpower, first Jon renovates the family''s home for a successful sale, while Drew hunts down the best options for the family''s next property and oversees the selling and buying.', 'Reality series where Jonathan and Drew help homeowners take their next step up the property ladder. Featuring two pivotal real estate moments, double the stress, and twice the manpower, first Jon renovates the family''s home for a successful sale, while Drew hunts down the best options for the family''s next property and oversees the selling and buying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UM6vFhrUGRjCbjgqyoV8y6a1Ka.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:67392'),
  ('82357504197364330', 'Property Brothers: Forever Home', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Drew Scott, Jonathan Silver Scott', 'TV-G', 'Drew and Jonathan Scott are on a mission to help couples transform their houses into forever homes where they can put down roots and happily spend their lives. But before that can happen, they need Drew and Jonathan to unlock the full potential of their house and renovate it into the home of their dreams.', 'Drew and Jonathan Scott are on a mission to help couples transform their houses into forever homes where they can put down roots and happily spend their lives. But before that can happen, they need Drew and Jonathan to unlock the full potential of their house and renovate it into the home of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0LRq69y1p0aO7UR0YjDs8U1Pee.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:89724'),
  ('578439136125003129', 'Property Brothers: Under Pressure', 2026, 'Family', null, null, 'Jonathan Silver Scott, Drew Scott', null, 'In today''s fierce housing market, Jonathan and Drew take on the stress as they guide those facing the biggest purchases of their lives. And with every twist along the way, they help confront the high-pressure decisions that come with chasing their dreams.', 'In today''s fierce housing market, Jonathan and Drew take on the stress as they guide those facing the biggest purchases of their lives. And with every twist along the way, they help confront the high-pressure decisions that come with chasing their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/403ZemLUzVFwohlsX5AbiyBPZDy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316727'),
  ('562339940209001730', 'Prophet Joseph', 2009, 'Drama', 'Farajollah Salahshoor, Jamal Shoorje', null, 'Mostafa Zamani, Katayoun Riahi, Mahmoud Pakniat, Amir Hossein Modarres, Rahim Norouzi, Jahanbakhsh Soltani, Parvaneh Massoumi, Jafar Dehghan', null, 'This story basically follows the most important happenings in Prophet Josephs life, from the view of muslims. The most important happenings are: 1. his travel to egypt 2. his rise and growing up in Egypt 3. his life problems when his "owner" Zuleikha falls in love with him and wants him to return the love to him. 4. his stay in prison, and how he reforms the prisoners. 5. his return by the side of the Pharao. 6. his uprising to the side of the pharao as his advisor. 7. his brothers coming to egypt, and how he decides to make them regret their mistakes so they can receive forgivness, and peace. 8. his reunion with his family after more than 20 years.', 'This story basically follows the most important happenings in Prophet Josephs life, from the view of muslims. The most important happenings are: 1. his travel to egypt 2. his rise and growing up in Egypt 3. his life problems when his "owner" Zuleikha falls in love with him and wants him to return the love to him. 4. his stay in prison, and how he reforms the prisoners. 5. his return by the side of the Pharao. 6. his uprising to the side of the pharao as his advisor. 7. his brothers coming to egypt, and how he decides to make them regret their mistakes so they can receive forgivness, and peace. 8. his reunion with his family after more than 20 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7nsyR0I53gM6P1Inxl438UnqS7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70802'),
  ('324774200564032327', 'Prophets of Science Fiction', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Declan Whitebloom', 'Simon Brown, Thomas Quinn, Kevin Tavolaro', 'Paul Darrow, Ridley Scott, Jonathan Adams', null, 'The series covers the life and work of leading science fiction authors of the last couple of centuries. It depicts how they predicted and, accordingly, influenced the development of scientific advancements by inspiring many readers to assist in transforming those futuristic visions into everyday reality.', 'The series covers the life and work of leading science fiction authors of the last couple of centuries. It depicts how they predicted and, accordingly, influenced the development of scientific advancements by inspiring many readers to assist in transforming those futuristic visions into everyday reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yDOU1JryREO7xzWVERcRfRIrU1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58708'),
  ('132777838653937062', 'Prosecution Elite', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Tong Dawei, Una You, Gao Xin, Luo Haiqiong, Lei Han, Feng Lei, Chen Zihan', null, 'An Ni, a prosecutor of the Jiangcheng Procuratorate, was assigned by Chief Prosecutor Xu Ailin to handle the case investigating a missing college student who jumped off into a lake. She started with Zhao Jikai, the General Manager of Huiquan Games, and found connection between him and overseas organizations that promote bullying, leading to the arrest of the crime perpetrators. While Huiquan Games’ stocks price plummeted, Yin Huiquan donates to Jiangxiao Academy which would in turn corrupt minors in the guise of charity. The student Li Xiaowen and other victims come forward, publicly denouncing the unorthodox means of Jiangxiao Academy to control youngsters. An Ni presents solid evidences in the court, leading to the academy’s shut down and punishment of those who were involved. Yan Qin, who took over the Huiquan Games, misappropriated the funds to invest in the development of a copper mine. However, this investment venture was a Ponzi scheme by an online financial fraud gang.', 'An Ni, a prosecutor of the Jiangcheng Procuratorate, was assigned by Chief Prosecutor Xu Ailin to handle the case investigating a missing college student who jumped off into a lake. She started with Zhao Jikai, the General Manager of Huiquan Games, and found connection between him and overseas organizations that promote bullying, leading to the arrest of the crime perpetrators. While Huiquan Games’ stocks price plummeted, Yin Huiquan donates to Jiangxiao Academy which would in turn corrupt minors in the guise of charity. The student Li Xiaowen and other victims come forward, publicly denouncing the unorthodox means of Jiangxiao Academy to control youngsters. An Ni presents solid evidences in the court, leading to the academy’s shut down and punishment of those who were involved. Yan Qin, who took over the Huiquan Games, misappropriated the funds to invest in the development of a copper mine. However, this investment venture was a Ponzi scheme by an online financial fraud gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmgoZEyUVjYbvQCS6EWaen2no2Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155754'),
  ('678878911189046496', 'Prosecutor Princess', 2010, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kim So-yeon, Park Si-hoo, Han Jung-soo, Choi Song-hyun, Min Young-won, Sunwoo Jae-duk, Samuel Kang, Choi Sung-ho', null, 'Ma Hye Ri is a woman with an excellent memory and ability to focus, which allowed her to pass the bar exam with ease. Despite her talents, she is more interested in being fashionable and dislikes hard work, so she is far from being an ideal prosecutor and has doubts about her suitability for her job. Through her conflicts with senior colleagues and struggles with difficult cases, however, Hye Ri gradually matures into a brilliant prosecutor with a sense of duty and justice.', 'Ma Hye Ri is a woman with an excellent memory and ability to focus, which allowed her to pass the bar exam with ease. Despite her talents, she is more interested in being fashionable and dislikes hard work, so she is far from being an ideal prosecutor and has doubts about her suitability for her job. Through her conflicts with senior colleagues and struggles with difficult cases, however, Hye Ri gradually matures into a brilliant prosecutor with a sense of duty and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dE1IML0dc278FDelf9dG35rMQRD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32614'),
  ('893904864825154786', 'Protect the Boss', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Son Jeong-hyeon', 'Kwon Ki-young', 'Choi Kang-hee, Ji Sung, HERO Jaejoong, Kim Ha-kyoon, Jang Ah-young, Park Young-kyu, Wang Ji-hye, Cha Hwa-yeon', null, 'No Eun Seol finally gets a job as a secretary at a law firm after struggling with unemployment, only to fall in love with her boss, Cha Ji Heon, the immature youngest son of a chaebol family.', 'No Eun Seol finally gets a job as a secretary at a law firm after struggling with unemployment, only to fall in love with her boss, Cha Ji Heon, the immature youngest son of a chaebol family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7W94CYV3nIY4ZGEAkBp5F4ND5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40043'),
  ('868889481898176111', 'Protection', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kris Mrksa', null, 'Siobhan Finneran, Andrew Knott, Alec Newman, Barry Ward, Katherine Kelly, David Hayman, Jodie Price, Nadine Marshall', null, 'Follows a witness protection officer who finds herself at the center of a breach; compromised by an extramarital romance with a coworker; but resolute in her resolve to fight back and unearth the real cause of corruption within her unit.', 'Follows a witness protection officer who finds herself at the center of a breach; compromised by an extramarital romance with a coworker; but resolute in her resolve to fight back and unearth the real cause of corruption within her unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plKvTWv4lczZUsKcVvxnPAn3had.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263236'),
  ('603818662763907709', 'Protocol: Rain', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Sora Amamiya, Inori Minase, Momo Asakura, Ryohei Kimura, Tomokazu Sugita, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kaede Hondo', 'TV-14', 'Shun Tokinoya is a high school sophomore who works at the FOX ONE e-sports cafe. He gives up his passion for gaming after losing his father in an accident. Upon hearing the cafe is in debt, Shun puts his guilt aside and assembles a team to compete in the Xaxxerion Championship. Together they face stiff competition to win the prize money. Watch Shun and his friends band together in epic battles!', 'Shun Tokinoya is a high school sophomore who works at the FOX ONE e-sports cafe. He gives up his passion for gaming after losing his father in an accident. Upon hearing the cafe is in debt, Shun puts his guilt aside and assembles a team to compete in the Xaxxerion Championship. Together they face stiff competition to win the prize money. Watch Shun and his friends band together in epic battles!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owYdO4nDxx1Uwo5O8QQGy08zstl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230288'),
  ('942273279689139483', 'Proud', 2018, 'Drama', 'José Caltagirone, Niels Rahou, Philippe Faucon', 'Niels Rahou, José Caltagirone, Philippe Faucon', 'Frédéric Pierrot, Stanislas Nordey', null, '"Fiertés" retraces the fight for the rights of sexual minorities in France through the intimate story of three generations and three destinies of men.', '"Fiertés" retraces the fight for the rights of sexual minorities in France through the intimate story of three generations and three destinies of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mboCeamn55vdeOEXZOJdruqHp94.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79176'),
  ('836409867576282319', 'Prova Prova Sa Sa', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Frank Matano, Maria Di Biase, Aurora Leone, Edoardo Ferrario, Maccio Capatonda, Francesco Pannofino, Francesco Mandelli, Lucia Ocone', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hE7n5YwspHX2KnmX9tZLjylRs7h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213752'),
  ('84989220643393721', 'Proven Innocent', 2019, 'Drama', 'David Elliot', null, 'Rachelle Lefevre, Russell Hornsby, Kelsey Grammer, Vincent Kartheiser, Riley Smith, Nikki M. James, Clare O''Connor, Krystel McNeil', 'TV-14', 'Madeline Scott, a fierce and uncompromising lawyer with a hunger for justice, runs an underdog criminal defense firm. There is no one who understands the power of setting an innocent person free more than Madeline. At age 18, she was wrongfully convicted, along with her brother, in a sensational murder case. Madeline defends others as she fights to maintain her innocence and searches for the real killer in her own case.', 'Madeline Scott, a fierce and uncompromising lawyer with a hunger for justice, runs an underdog criminal defense firm. There is no one who understands the power of setting an innocent person free more than Madeline. At age 18, she was wrongfully convicted, along with her brother, in a sensational murder case. Madeline defends others as she fights to maintain her innocence and searches for the real killer in her own case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8XdIcxRlvCITIW5zy2NZ6Ms8qV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81942'),
  ('945004586980162209', 'Providence', 1999, 'Drama', 'John Masius', null, 'Melina Kanakaredes, Seth Peterson, Concetta Tomei, Paula Cale, Mike Farrell', null, 'Providence is an American television drama series.', 'Providence is an American television drama series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owtXGigAp8xFaEwdelHwCdU2WK9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1638'),
  ('802506159726932026', 'Providence Falls', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Siobhan Devine', null, 'Katie Stevens, Lachlan Quarmby, Evan Roderick, Felicia Simone', null, 'In 1844 Ireland, thief Liam falls for aristocrat Cora. When their love disrupts destiny, angels send him to present-day Oregon to ensure Cora marries another man. As her police partner, Liam struggles with his enduring feelings.', 'In 1844 Ireland, thief Liam falls for aristocrat Cora. When their love disrupts destiny, angels send him to present-day Oregon to ensure Cora marries another man. As her police partner, Liam struggles with his enduring feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wD2ZqawYZ9aySPZrQP9ds7laUyw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:297638'),
  ('541946373351910204', 'Pseudo Harem', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Saori Hayami, Junichi Suwabe, Koji Yusa, Maria Abo', null, 'Eiji Kitahama joins the drama club with dreams of having a harem like the ones from his favorite manga. Rin Nanakura, an underclassman, finds herself crushing hard on Eiji, and tries on different personas in his presence to win him over. No matter how she acts, one thing is certain—her feelings for Eiji continue to grow stronger. Will she ever be able to tell him the truth and be herself?', 'Eiji Kitahama joins the drama club with dreams of having a harem like the ones from his favorite manga. Rin Nanakura, an underclassman, finds herself crushing hard on Eiji, and tries on different personas in his presence to win him over. No matter how she acts, one thing is certain—her feelings for Eiji continue to grow stronger. Will she ever be able to tell him the truth and be herself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B6MvhEdbEU4Y4UHETYkUDRhu9x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224753'),
  ('423199295230569560', 'Psi', 2014, 'Drama', 'Contardo Calligaris', null, 'Emílio de Mello, Liliana Castro, Lourinelson Vladmir, Marcello Airoldi, Raul Barreto', 'TV-MA', 'A drama with comic touches telling the story of Carlo Antonini, a psychoanalyst who is pathologic and very interventionist, both inside and outside the office.', 'A drama with comic touches telling the story of Carlo Antonini, a psychoanalyst who is pathologic and very interventionist, both inside and outside the office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n42HZJSb1WlgxmP9eh5NECJKAw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67405'),
  ('57328197679641784', 'Psi Factor: Chronicles of the Paranormal', 1996, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Christopher Chacon, Peter Aykroyd', null, 'Matt Frewer, Barclay Hope, Colin Fox, Dan Aykroyd, Nancy Anne Sakovich, Soo Garay, Joanne Vannicola, Peter Blais', null, 'Psi Factor: Chronicles of the Paranormal is a Canadian science fiction television series that surrounds a scientific team that deals with all manner of paranormal phenomena around the world; from alien abductions to possessions. The organization depicted in the series is loosely inspired by a real-life scientific organization. While locations in the series took place worldwide, the series was primarily filmed in and around Toronto, Ontario, Canada, and aired 88 episodes over four seasons from 1996 to 2000.', 'Psi Factor: Chronicles of the Paranormal is a Canadian science fiction television series that surrounds a scientific team that deals with all manner of paranormal phenomena around the world; from alien abductions to possessions. The organization depicted in the series is loosely inspired by a real-life scientific organization. While locations in the series took place worldwide, the series was primarily filmed in and around Toronto, Ontario, Canada, and aired 88 episodes over four seasons from 1996 to 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x50gAb47tkzWtaWQnk7zMPlyjAn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:9922'),
  ('20952163154611725', 'Psych', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Steve Franks', null, 'James Roday Rodriguez, Dulé Hill, Timothy Omundson, Maggie Lawson, Kirsten Nelson, Corbin Bernsen', 'TV-PG', 'Thanks to his police officer father''s efforts, Shawn Spencer spent his childhood developing a keen eye for detail (and a lasting dislike of his dad). Years later, Shawn''s frequent tips to the police lead to him being falsely accused of a crime he solved. Now, Shawn has no choice but to use his abilities to perpetuate his cover story: psychic crime-solving powers, all the while dragging his best friend, his dad, and the police along for the ride.', 'Thanks to his police officer father''s efforts, Shawn Spencer spent his childhood developing a keen eye for detail (and a lasting dislike of his dad). Years later, Shawn''s frequent tips to the police lead to him being falsely accused of a crime he solved. Now, Shawn has no choice but to use his abilities to perpetuate his cover story: psychic crime-solving powers, all the while dragging his best friend, his dad, and the police along for the ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDI15gTVbtW5Sbv5QenqecRxWKJ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1447'),
  ('197337709343906976', 'Psychic Princess', 2018, 'Animation', null, null, 'Sone Wakana, Lu Lifeng, Xing Chao, 唐策, kinsen, Guo Haoran, Fan Xinyuan, Yun Hezhui', null, 'Qian Yunxi, the oldest daughter of the prime minister was born with a special ability. Because of this she was deemed ''abnormal'' and was raised at Mt. Lin Yun. Upon turning 16, she took her younger sister''s place to marry into the royal family of Ye. Rumors say Ye Youming is strange, cold and cruel. Just how will Qian Yunxi''s fate play out? (Source: Baka-Updates Manga)', 'Qian Yunxi, the oldest daughter of the prime minister was born with a special ability. Because of this she was deemed ''abnormal'' and was raised at Mt. Lin Yun. Upon turning 16, she took her younger sister''s place to marry into the royal family of Ye. Rumors say Ye Youming is strange, cold and cruel. Just how will Qian Yunxi''s fate play out? (Source: Baka-Updates Manga)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtZClfDpfgSgeoOg0eLhxoGvmNE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84737'),
  ('774345206885405587', 'Psychic Squad', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Takashi Shiina', null, 'Aya Hirano, Ayumi Fujimura, Eri Nakao, Masumi Asano, Koji Yusa, Rie Kugimiya, Haruka Tomatsu, Hiroshi Yanaka', 'TV-14', 'They''re cute, adorable and three of the most powerful Espers the world has ever seen: Kaoru, the brash psychokinetic who can move objects with her mind; Shiho, the sarcastic and dark natured psychometric able to pick thoughts from people''s minds and read the pasts of inanimate objects like a book; and Aoi, the most collected and rational of the three, who has the ability to teleport herself and the others at will. So what to do with these potential psychic monsters in the making? Enter B.A.B.E.L., the Base of Backing ESP Laboratory, where hopefully "The Children" and others like them can become part of the answer to an increasing wave of psychic evolution. It''s a win-win solution... Unless you''re Koichi Minamoto, the overworked young man stuck with the unenviable task of field commanding a team of three pre-teen girls!', 'They''re cute, adorable and three of the most powerful Espers the world has ever seen: Kaoru, the brash psychokinetic who can move objects with her mind; Shiho, the sarcastic and dark natured psychometric able to pick thoughts from people''s minds and read the pasts of inanimate objects like a book; and Aoi, the most collected and rational of the three, who has the ability to teleport herself and the others at will. So what to do with these potential psychic monsters in the making? Enter B.A.B.E.L., the Base of Backing ESP Laboratory, where hopefully "The Children" and others like them can become part of the answer to an increasing wave of psychic evolution. It''s a win-win solution... Unless you''re Koichi Minamoto, the overworked young man stuck with the unenviable task of field commanding a team of three pre-teen girls!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2ryqDd8FAmthlA2TocoMUr2ok1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42926'),
  ('504106858002977633', 'Psycho', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alexey Kiselev', null, 'Konstantin Bogomolov, Elena Lyadova, Igor Vernik, Kseniya Rappoport, Marina Aleksandrova, Anna Chipovskaya, Aleksandr Gorchilin, Evgeniya Gromova', null, 'It is not easy to make an appointment with the in-demand 40-year-old Moscow psychotherapist Oleg. To his clients, he seems to be a successful and independent family man, while passions are raging inside him, he himself needs qualified help from a specialist, and his wife went missing a little over a year ago.', 'It is not easy to make an appointment with the in-demand 40-year-old Moscow psychotherapist Oleg. To his clients, he seems to be a successful and independent family man, while passions are raging inside him, he himself needs qualified help from a specialist, and his wife went missing a little over a year ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cv1zj0aRZ1Q4buaEryM99KsAKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100426'),
  ('598672303021474427', 'Psycho Doctor', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yutaka Takenouchi, Michiko Hada, Natsuko Akiyama, Mikako Ichikawa, Masahiko Nishimura', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYLgvVDG3fRYLOUwPHQT8TY0tI5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104389'),
  ('1098930799911601884', 'Psycho-Pass', 2012, 'Animation, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Kana Hanazawa, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomokazu Seki, Takahiro Sakurai, Ayane Sakura, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'TV-MA', 'In the year 2113, people are given brain scans to determine how likely they are to commit a crime. Those who fail are apprehended, or even killed.', 'In the year 2113, people are given brain scans to determine how likely they are to commit a crime. Those who fail are apprehended, or even killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWnP6qTcc4imPJ9ZHaXlPQlcYnB.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43865'),
  ('229275342984541604', 'Psychobitches', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Dyson', null, 'Rebecca Front', null, 'Psychobitches is a British sketch comedy programme created by Jeremy Dyson for Sky One Arts. Rebecca Front stars as The Therapist, who holds sessions with famous historical and spiritual women, exploring their psychological issues via anachronistic humour, with such individuals like Mary Magdalene, Bonnie Parker, and Lucille Ball appearing in contemporary settings. Blending historical figures with modern comedy, it features a cast of well-known British talent in a variety of roles as the iconic women.', 'Psychobitches is a British sketch comedy programme created by Jeremy Dyson for Sky One Arts. Rebecca Front stars as The Therapist, who holds sessions with famous historical and spiritual women, exploring their psychological issues via anachronistic humour, with such individuals like Mary Magdalene, Bonnie Parker, and Lucille Ball appearing in contemporary settings. Blending historical figures with modern comedy, it features a cast of well-known British talent in a variety of roles as the iconic women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2XB512MHui6tayT8yKxjcBRwsj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112865'),
  ('1010859701589460905', 'Psychopath Diary', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Kim Hwan-chae, Ryoo Yong-Jae', 'Ryu Yong-jae', 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Jung In-sun, Park Sung-hoon, Lee Han-wi, Hwang Hyo-eun, Lee Min-ji, Choi Tae-hwan, Han Soo-hyun', null, 'The story of a man named Yook Dong-sik who coincidentally witnesses a murder and picks up the killer''s diary. While fleeing the scene, he gets into a car accident causes him to lose his memory. Due to the diary in his possession, he mistakenly believes that he is a psychopathic serial killer.', 'The story of a man named Yook Dong-sik who coincidentally witnesses a murder and picks up the killer''s diary. While fleeing the scene, he gets into a car accident causes him to lose his memory. Due to the diary in his possession, he mistakenly believes that he is a psychopathic serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGmNWy80ILs8wLTDLjnwtOieNw4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94680'),
  ('373586848923000626', 'Psychoville', 2009, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Steve Pemberton, Reece Shearsmith', 'Reece Shearsmith, Steve Pemberton', 'Reece Shearsmith, Steve Pemberton, Imelda Staunton, Mark Bonnar, Daniel Ings', 'TV-MA', 'Five strangers receive blackmail notes from an anonymous source, leading them on a dark and surreal journey as their lives unravel, featuring bizarre characters like a man-child, a one-handed clown, and a blind millionaire.', 'Five strangers receive blackmail notes from an anonymous source, leading them on a dark and surreal journey as their lives unravel, featuring bizarre characters like a man-child, a one-handed clown, and a blind millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGAdkXpbangnl2FoKdZQvJRkU0R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17420'),
  ('473912107153000664', 'Pubertat', 2025, 'Drama', 'Leticia Dolera', null, 'Leticia Dolera, Betsy Túrnez, Xavi Sáez, Carla Quílez, Alexandra Russo, David Vert, Biel Duran, Anna Alarcón', null, 'The harmony of a community is shattered by an allegation of sexual assault on social media that points to three teenagers as the main suspects.', 'The harmony of a community is shattered by an allegation of sexual assault on social media that points to three teenagers as the main suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vi81epkafeDT8B7glhuD9OisFP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258962'),
  ('171317890698537478', 'Puberty Blues', 2012, 'Drama', 'John Edwards, Imogen Banks', null, 'Claudia Karvan, Jeremy Lindsay Taylor, Ashleigh Cummings, Ed Oxenbould, Susie Porter, Dan Wyllie, Brenna Harding, Susan Prior', null, 'Based on Kathy Lette and Gabrielle Carey''s iconic novel, Puberty Blues tells the story of two girls, Debbie and Sue, of innocence lost and experience gained against the backdrop of Australia in the 1970s.', 'Based on Kathy Lette and Gabrielle Carey''s iconic novel, Puberty Blues tells the story of two girls, Debbie and Sue, of innocence lost and experience gained against the backdrop of Australia in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pltlaggxNXq5JmW7pzPYeN0ElM8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45043'),
  ('883804745014475643', 'Public Defender', 1954, 'Drama', 'Mort R. Lewis, Sam Shayon', null, 'Reed Hadley', 'NR', 'The Public Defender is a half-hour 69-episode television dramatic series starring Reed Hadley as Bart Matthews, an attorney for the indigent. The series aired on CBS from March 11, 1954 to June 23, 1955, a season and a half.', 'The Public Defender is a half-hour 69-episode television dramatic series starring Reed Hadley as Bart Matthews, an attorney for the indigent. The series aired on CBS from March 11, 1954 to June 23, 1955, a season and a half.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1UJWIOhM9iBriECHlzO7F33Krm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:23048'),
  ('828376757421432984', 'Public Disorder', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Carlo Bonini, Filippo Gravino', null, 'Marco Giallini, Adriano Giannini, Valentina Bellè, Pierluigi Gigante, Fabrizio Nardi, Donatella Finocchiaro, Federico Mainardi, Daniele Natali', 'TV-MA', 'Following the fateful aftermath of a demonstration, tensions rise within a riot squad that struggles to separate work from personal life.', 'Following the fateful aftermath of a demonstration, tensions rise within a riot squad that struggles to separate work from personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1suRG7qNQMlmItysPVlzFmawmCf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278877'),
  ('251393433939617602', 'Public Enemy', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Antoine Bours, Christopher Yates, Gilles de Voghel', null, 'Stéphanie Blanchoud, Angelo Bison, Philippe Jeusette, Jean-Jacques Rausin, Clément Manuel, Pauline Étienne, Noa Staes', 'TV-MA', 'Freed after 20 years in prison, the child killer Guy Beranger found refuge with the monks in Vielsart, a small village in Belgian''s Ardennes. He is placed under the protection of a young Federal Police''s inspector, Chloé Muller. A little while after his release, a little girl disappears.', 'Freed after 20 years in prison, the child killer Guy Beranger found refuge with the monks in Vielsart, a small village in Belgian''s Ardennes. He is placed under the protection of a young Federal Police''s inspector, Chloé Muller. A little while after his release, a little girl disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YMVU8i5EUDZtB8OVj43qUllMkb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:66384'),
  ('930819601667722529', 'Public Eye', 1965, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roger Marshall, Anthony Marriott', null, 'Alfred Burke', null, 'Public Eye is a British television drama broadcast from 1965 to 1975 on ITV1. Produced by ABC Television for three series, and Thames Television for a further four, the programme follows the investigations and cases handled by the unglamourous enquiry agent Frank Marker.', 'Public Eye is a British television drama broadcast from 1965 to 1975 on ITV1. Produced by ABC Television for three series, and Thames Television for a further four, the programme follows the investigations and cases handled by the unglamourous enquiry agent Frank Marker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvrvhulvIQUrOQzzXy5gWauUWi7.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:12475'),
  ('3355577006367860', 'Public Morals', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Burns', null, 'Edward Burns, Michael Rapaport, Katrina Bowden, Cormac Cullinane, Austin Stowell, Lyndon Smith, Wass Stevens, Keith Nobbs', null, 'Set in the early 1960''s in New York City''s Public Morals Division, where cops walk the line between morality and criminality as the temptations that come from dealing with all kinds of vice can get the better of them.', 'Set in the early 1960''s in New York City''s Public Morals Division, where cops walk the line between morality and criminality as the temptations that come from dealing with all kinds of vice can get the better of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sogCeR7biHJcp4AFoVt0mWCOCcY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63464'),
  ('321969398063851138', 'Pucca', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Calvin Kim, Boo Kyoung Kim', null, 'Michael Dobson, Dave ''Squatch'' Ward, Richard Newman, Tabitha St. Germain, Brian Dobson, Dale Wilson, Chantal Strand, Brian Drummond', 'TV-Y7', '"Pucca" is a TV series based on a Flash animation series published by Vooz Character Systems. It follows the trails and exploits of a South Korean girl named Pucca who is insanely in love with a prideful ninja named Garu. Meanwhile, Garu and Pucca help their town of Sooga Village out when evil ninjas attack, as well as diffuse a lot of the absurd situations that frequently plague the town. This show could best be described as a cleaned-up version of South Park meets Looney Tunes meets Naruto. There is some very subtly hidden adult humor; but most of the adult jokes would not go noticed by small children, who are the primary audience.', '"Pucca" is a TV series based on a Flash animation series published by Vooz Character Systems. It follows the trails and exploits of a South Korean girl named Pucca who is insanely in love with a prideful ninja named Garu. Meanwhile, Garu and Pucca help their town of Sooga Village out when evil ninjas attack, as well as diffuse a lot of the absurd situations that frequently plague the town. This show could best be described as a cleaned-up version of South Park meets Looney Tunes meets Naruto. There is some very subtly hidden adult humor; but most of the adult jokes would not go noticed by small children, who are the primary audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQjSUOEQTrCqDoBiEYIrNlajCD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6782'),
  ('916466559787858795', 'Puchimas!: Petit Idolm@ster', 2013, 'Animation', null, null, 'Chiaki Takahashi, Akiko Hasegawa, Juri Takita, Eriko Nakamura, Asami Imai, Azumi Asakura, Mayako Nigo, Naomi Wakabayashi', null, 'Workers at a production studio adopt some teeny creatures and the office gets very lively.', 'Workers at a production studio adopt some teeny creatures and the office gets very lively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1PiN0kFFW7Fs0gn69PQKA5Gmfq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124054'),
  ('338770237468403906', 'Puck', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Kwang-soo, Sohn Su-hyun, Jo Yoon-woo, Kwak Dong-yeon, Lee Si-won, Kang Ki-young, Seol Jung-hwan, Jung Hae-kyun', null, 'Due to his ex-wife’s debt, Joon-Man (Lee Kwang-Soo) had no choice but to work for a gang boss. Even though he has a warm personality, he works as a loan shark. To get debt from an ice hockey coach, Joon-Man joins the ice hockey team.', 'Due to his ex-wife’s debt, Joon-Man (Lee Kwang-Soo) had no choice but to work for a gang boss. Even though he has a warm personality, he works as a loan shark. To get debt from an ice hockey coach, Joon-Man joins the ice hockey team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64xAaAIlIYaMiVffYIHAdwvXeUy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65354'),
  ('806739870373104857', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Chiwa Saito, Eri Kitamura, Ai Nonaka, Emiri Kato', 'TV-14', 'She has a loving family and best friends, laughs and cries from time to time... Madoka Kaname, an eighth grader of Mitakihara middle school, is one of those who lives such a life. One day, she had a very magical encounter. She doesn''t know if it happened by chance or by fate yet. This is a fateful encounter that can change her destiny. This is a beginning of the new story of the magical witch girls.', 'She has a loving family and best friends, laughs and cries from time to time... Madoka Kaname, an eighth grader of Mitakihara middle school, is one of those who lives such a life. One day, she had a very magical encounter. She doesn''t know if it happened by chance or by fate yet. This is a fateful encounter that can change her destiny. This is a beginning of the new story of the magical witch girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Leopb4OB9j9FkP5JNHRZZlPPdg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39218'),
  ('552300759221357302', 'Puerta 7', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Martin Zimmerman', null, 'Dolores Fonzi, Esteban Lamothe, Carlos Belloso, Juan Gil Navarro, Daniel Aráoz, Antonio Grimau, Ignacio Quesada, Daniel Valenzuela', 'TV-MA', 'A determined woman works to rid an Argentine soccer club of the violent crime and corruption surrounding its intense fanbase.', 'A determined woman works to rid an Argentine soccer club of the violent crime and corruption surrounding its intense fanbase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLQkRwxwKJqbnJZG3vh0UcyYVxj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99633'),
  ('401464391313494511', 'Puffgeschichten', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 0, 'tmdb:tv:319365'),
  ('755719353313524004', 'Pui Pui Molcar', 2021, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'The setting is a world where people drive sentient vehicles that are hybrids between guinea pigs and cars – "Molcars"! Molcars have round eyes, big soft butts, and short arms and legs as they trot along. They run around with a silly look on their face, and even when you''re stuck in traffic, you can be put at ease just by gazing at the guinea pig butt in front of you! Even if they cause a bit of trouble, it''s easy to forgive them because they''re so cute and fluffy! This is an animation focusing on various situations unique to cars, full of satisfaction, friendship, adventure, crazy action, and tons of guinea pigs!', 'The setting is a world where people drive sentient vehicles that are hybrids between guinea pigs and cars – "Molcars"! Molcars have round eyes, big soft butts, and short arms and legs as they trot along. They run around with a silly look on their face, and even when you''re stuck in traffic, you can be put at ease just by gazing at the guinea pig butt in front of you! Even if they cause a bit of trouble, it''s easy to forgive them because they''re so cute and fluffy! This is an animation focusing on various situations unique to cars, full of satisfaction, friendship, adventure, crazy action, and tons of guinea pigs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twIb0T5no8v8t8KIt143L8FKPvQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:117166'),
  ('278958705101949668', 'Pulang Araw', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics, Family', 'Suzette Doctolero', null, 'Alden Richards, Sanya Lopez, Barbie Forteza, David Licauco, Dennis Trillo, Angelu de Leon, Epy Quizon, Rochelle Pangilinan', null, 'Red Sun is a family drama that tells stories of courage, sacrifice, and hardships that every Filipino family has. These stories were inspired by the tales of the unsung heroes who defied the odds of World War II and the Japanese occupation of the Philippines.', 'Red Sun is a family drama that tells stories of courage, sacrifice, and hardships that every Filipino family has. These stories were inspired by the tales of the unsung heroes who defied the odds of World War II and the Japanese occupation of the Philippines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zbaRzgieKiHYkTGztQUzrAYbgb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242931'),
  ('735684084038709456', 'Pulling', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Dennis Kelly', 'Dennis Kelly, Sharon Horgan', 'Sharon Horgan, Tanya Franks, Rebekah Staton, Cavan Clerkin', null, 'Donna narrowly escapes making a huge mistake by marrying Karl and instead opts for moving in with her friends Karen and Louise in South London. The three girls learn about life and love in this funny and modern comedy.', 'Donna narrowly escapes making a huge mistake by marrying Karl and instead opts for moving in with her friends Karen and Louise in South London. The three girls learn about life and love in this funny and modern comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ifJGXGlKv6amOjiE8Tq32jz4Ym.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:16295'),
  ('473788659086527523', 'Pulse', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kris Wyld, Mel Hill, Michael Miller', null, 'Claire van der Boom, Andrea Demetriades, Arka Das, Pallavi Sharda, Blessing Mokgohloa, Susie Porter, Dalip Sondhi, Penny Cook', 'TV-MA', 'When successful high-flier Frankie Bell is brought crashing to earth by chronic kidney failure she targets an alternate future. Eight years on she is in her second year as a practicing doctor starting her first day in a Renal rotation. Driven to use her second chance to save others, Frankie must confront an ailing health system, and face her toughest challenge - learning to let go.', 'When successful high-flier Frankie Bell is brought crashing to earth by chronic kidney failure she targets an alternate future. Eight years on she is in her second year as a practicing doctor starting her first day in a Renal rotation. Driven to use her second chance to save others, Frankie must confront an ailing health system, and face her toughest challenge - learning to let go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apFmO4sqH5IaC5VwLQMehdNdBkx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72380'),
  ('858675024187364224', 'PULSE', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zoe Robyn', null, 'Willa Fitzgerald, Colin Woodell, Jack Bannon, Jessie T. Usher, Jessy Yates, Chelsea Muirhead', 'TV-MA', 'A group of ER residents navigate medical crises and personal drama amid a divisive allegation at their Miami hospital.', 'A group of ER residents navigate medical crises and personal drama amid a divisive allegation at their Miami hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGKTDr8ruc4IHGsEZ8wSQZpy2eN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247784'),
  ('543934060826545992', 'Pump Up the Healthy Love', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Jun Su', 'Kim Ji-soo', 'Lee Jun-young, Jung Eun-ji, Lee Mi-do, Lee Da-eun, Park Seong-yeon, Lee Seung-woo, Hong Yun-hwa, Jung Wook-jin', null, 'Do Hyeon-joong, a health-obsessed gym manager, helps his members transform their lives while balancing the struggles of self-employment, and forms a passionate connection with Lee Mi-ran, a travel agency manager who loves food.', 'Do Hyeon-joong, a health-obsessed gym manager, helps his members transform their lives while balancing the struggles of self-employment, and forms a passionate connection with Lee Mi-ran, a travel agency manager who loves food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzGKRiBSPVd5RsEhMB0GGWYd654.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260555'),
  ('1031980817448833317', 'Pumpkin Scissors', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Ryotaro Iwanaga', null, 'Kenta Miyake, Shizuka Itoh, Cho, Chihiro Suzuki, Kohsuke Toriumi, Kana Ueda, Kazuki Ogawa, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'Pumpkin Scissors is a manga created and authored by Ryotaro Iwanaga. Originally serialized in Magazine GREAT in 2002 it was later moved to Monthly Shonen Magazine in October 2006. The manga has been licensed by Del Rey. An anime adaptation of Pumpkin Scissors has been released, produced by Gonzo and AIC, which began airing on October 2, 2006 across several Japanese television stations and ended with the 24th episode on March 19, 2007. The series was originally licensed to the North American market by ADV Films for $780,000. In 2008 it became one of over thirty titles transferred from ADV Films to FUNimation, the main distributor of anime in the English speaking world.', 'Pumpkin Scissors is a manga created and authored by Ryotaro Iwanaga. Originally serialized in Magazine GREAT in 2002 it was later moved to Monthly Shonen Magazine in October 2006. The manga has been licensed by Del Rey. An anime adaptation of Pumpkin Scissors has been released, produced by Gonzo and AIC, which began airing on October 2, 2006 across several Japanese television stations and ended with the 24th episode on March 19, 2007. The series was originally licensed to the North American market by ADV Films for $780,000. In 2008 it became one of over thirty titles transferred from ADV Films to FUNimation, the main distributor of anime in the English speaking world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56MIZgVKGDMo25NNuVspQmDrF0D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31712'),
  ('806656784576028517', 'Punch', 2014, 'Drama', 'Park Kyung-soo', 'Park Kyung-soo', 'Kim A-joong, Kim Rae-won, Cho Jae-hyun, Seo Ji-hye, On Ju-wan, Kim Ji-young, Lee Han-wi, Song Ok-suk', null, 'When Park Jung-hwan, the chief of the anti-corruption investigation team for the Supreme Prosecutors'' Office, learns that he has a malignant brain tumor that gives him only 6 months to live, he decides to throw his final punch at the criminal world before he says farewell to life.', 'When Park Jung-hwan, the chief of the anti-corruption investigation team for the Supreme Prosecutors'' Office, learns that he has a malignant brain tumor that gives him only 6 months to live, he decides to throw his final punch at the criminal world before he says farewell to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5SpOFTF1EmQ4B6DCYfgPSUzUB5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61799'),
  ('854249504620028029', 'Punch Line', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marina Inoue, Sora Amamiya, Minako Kotobuki, Rie Kugimiya, Haruka Tomatsu, Yu-ri Yoshida, Yui Shoji, Mariko Honda', 'TV-14', 'High schooler Yūta Iridatsu has experienced “astral projection” i.e. his spirit has been separated from his body. He woke up in a mansion named Koraikan and met a cat spirit named Chiranosuke, who told him “You must find the Sacred Tome of Koraikan in order to return to your physical body.” While searching through corridors of Koraikan, Yūta bumped into underpants of its female residents, and doing so would, eh, create some big trouble for planet Earth.', 'High schooler Yūta Iridatsu has experienced “astral projection” i.e. his spirit has been separated from his body. He woke up in a mansion named Koraikan and met a cat spirit named Chiranosuke, who told him “You must find the Sacred Tome of Koraikan in order to return to your physical body.” While searching through corridors of Koraikan, Yūta bumped into underpants of its female residents, and doing so would, eh, create some big trouble for planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj2Gx45z3pdcn6JBnVDGdMHW0PP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62484'),
  ('230426701354129014', 'Punch-Drunk Woman', 2026, 'Crime', null, null, null, null, 'A strict female correctional officer’s disciplined life unravels when she encounters an inmate who is connected to her deepest secret.', 'A strict female correctional officer’s disciplined life unravels when she encounters an inmate who is connected to her deepest secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkd2QWkO93qK9pJs4XkUIy0NdT3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:305812'),
  ('1124719249340912162', 'Puni Puni Poemy', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Shinichi Watanabe, Satomi Korogi, Aya Hisakawa, Tomoko Kawakami, Kotono Mitsuishi, Omi Minami, Atsuko Enomoto', 'TV-MA', 'When evil aliens kill Poemi Watanabe’s parents, she doesn’t get mad, she gets even… but first she moves in with the seven crazy Aasu sisters, discovers the magic power of dead fish, develops a serious crush on a local octopus, experiences the bizarre and varied wonders and joys of fighting terrorists, S&M, giant robots and becoming a super hero… all while pursuing her REAL ambition of becoming a professional voice actress!', 'When evil aliens kill Poemi Watanabe’s parents, she doesn’t get mad, she gets even… but first she moves in with the seven crazy Aasu sisters, discovers the magic power of dead fish, develops a serious crush on a local octopus, experiences the bizarre and varied wonders and joys of fighting terrorists, S&M, giant robots and becoming a super hero… all while pursuing her REAL ambition of becoming a professional voice actress!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mesYCdvW0damFh38lYcD34T0BWW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34688'),
  ('233709985581962537', 'Puniru Is a Kawaii Slime', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Sasahara, Shuichiro Umeda', 'TV-14', 'The slime created by the boy Kotarou can transform into a super beautiful girl! Kotarou is constantly getting pushed around by Puniru''s freewheeling antics. It''s a joyful and exciting life every day!', 'The slime created by the boy Kotarou can transform into a super beautiful girl! Kotarou is constantly getting pushed around by Puniru''s freewheeling antics. It''s a joyful and exciting life every day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaUlTqv4OWyTmi0Z80g9XQ5LFbE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241811'),
  ('622499346091634720', 'Punk', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Featuring original interviews with America’s punk pioneers and the U.K.’s most notorious bands, alongside a seamless blend of rare and unseen photos, gritty archival film and video, a crackling soundtrack of punk hits and misses, this documentary series explores the music, the fashion, the art and the DIY attitude of a subculture of self-described misfits and outcasts.', 'Featuring original interviews with America’s punk pioneers and the U.K.’s most notorious bands, alongside a seamless blend of rare and unseen photos, gritty archival film and video, a crackling soundtrack of punk hits and misses, this documentary series explores the music, the fashion, the art and the DIY attitude of a subculture of self-described misfits and outcasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXeHnCQUnjQ5QmfUwkruvSGImis.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84929'),
  ('7540374331137398', 'Punk''d', 2003, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Jason Goldberg, Ashton Kutcher', null, 'Andrew Santino, Daryl J. Johnson', 'TV-14', 'What happens when the biggest stars in the world get too high on the Hollywood hog? When their bank accounts start swelling bigger than their heads? Master prankster Ashton Kutcher is there to punk ''em down to earth.', 'What happens when the biggest stars in the world get too high on the Hollywood hog? When their bank accounts start swelling bigger than their heads? Master prankster Ashton Kutcher is there to punk ''em down to earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqcaFHnnJU1nIbUikN3cpm9Mjn9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2396'),
  ('222606967062846676', 'PUNKS△TRIANGLE', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuho Okita', null, 'Ryota Nagano, Yasunari Fujibayashi, Rinta, Louis Kurihara, Akiko Hinagata, Masaki Himekomatsu, Goshu Suzuki, Kiyotake Nakamura', null, 'A young designer dreams of creating a look for his favorite model and finally gets his chance–unless his class partner screws things up!', 'A young designer dreams of creating a look for his favorite model and finally gets his chance–unless his class partner screws things up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rF6JSTmWTzrLtywrVGQozw8S63y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299282'),
  ('537358591811429926', 'Punky Brewster', 1984, 'Comedy, Kids', 'David W. Duclon', null, 'Soleil Moon Frye, George Gaynes, Cherie Johnson, Susie Garrett, Ami Foster', 'TV-G', 'An abandoned waif and her dog are taken in by a cranky apartment manager who becomes her guardian in this family-friendly sitcom.', 'An abandoned waif and her dog are taken in by a cranky apartment manager who becomes her guardian in this family-friendly sitcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZVmXNThTccZ4rKUfe1C1QZDwTe.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2553'),
