  ('827709009325004069', 'Queen', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Árni Ólafur Ásgeirsson, Kacper Wysocki', 'Andrzej Seweryn, Maria Peszek, Julia Chętnicka, Antoni Porowski, Henryk Niebudek', null, 'After a decades-long absence, a renowned Parisian tailor and drag queen returns to his hometown in Poland to make amends with his daughter.', 'After a decades-long absence, a renowned Parisian tailor and drag queen returns to his hometown in Poland to make amends with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gHRAmchK9cnAb1BR80yObV1gWT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130950'),
  ('176235975230826140', 'Queen Charlotte: A Bridgerton Story', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shonda Rhimes', null, 'India Ria Amarteifio, Corey Mylchreest, Golda Rosheuvel, Arsema Thomas, Adjoa Andoh, Michelle Fairley, Ruth Gemmell, Sam Clemmett', 'TV-MA', 'Young Queen Charlotte''s marriage to King George of England sparks an epic love story and transforms high society in this "Bridgerton" universe prequel.', 'Young Queen Charlotte''s marriage to King George of England sparks an epic love story and transforms high society in this "Bridgerton" universe prequel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR7btjpvOugivUYSoEsD2iAOYsJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196454'),
  ('309194140334417530', 'Queen Cleopatra', 2023, 'Documentary, Drama', null, null, 'Jada Pinkett Smith, Adele James, Craig Russell, John Partridge, Andira Crichlow, Kaysha Woollery, Laya Lewis', 'TV-14', 'As Egypt''s last pharaoh, Cleopatra fights to protect her throne, family and legacy in this docuseries featuring reenactments and expert interviews.', 'As Egypt''s last pharaoh, Cleopatra fights to protect her throne, family and legacy in this docuseries featuring reenactments and expert interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9j0u72TrqdVEFDTj7uG5KOFwbSg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224387'),
  ('1101043610410313149', 'Queen For Seven Days', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Choi Jin-young', 'Park Min-young, Yeon Woo-jin, Lee Dong-gun, Jang Hyun-sung, Kang Shin-il, Son Eun-seo, Song Ji-in, Kim Jung-young', 'NR', 'In the Joseon period, a noblewoman from a powerful clan marries the Crown Prince but is deposed after only seven days as queen when he becomes king.', 'In the Joseon period, a noblewoman from a powerful clan marries the Crown Prince but is deposed after only seven days as queen when he becomes king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S4RzpajATNmKbI76IDDUJNJdsH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71748'),
  ('9587655206489418', 'Queen In Hyun''s Man', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yoo In-na, Ji Hyun-woo, Kim Jin-woo, Ga Deuk-Hi, Jo Dal-hwan, Choi Woo-ri, Jin Ye-sol, Kim Hae-in', null, 'Kim Boong Do is a scholar who had supported the reinstatement of Queen In Hyun when Jang heebin''s schemes resulted in her being deposed and replaced as King Sukjong''s queen consort. He travels 300 years into the future of modern Seoul and meets Choi Hee Jin, a no-name actress who is expecting a career renaissance through her role as Queen In Hyun in a TV drama.', 'Kim Boong Do is a scholar who had supported the reinstatement of Queen In Hyun when Jang heebin''s schemes resulted in her being deposed and replaced as King Sukjong''s queen consort. He travels 300 years into the future of modern Seoul and meets Choi Hee Jin, a no-name actress who is expecting a career renaissance through her role as Queen In Hyun in a TV drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3561NUqbxh9LNNyFjARtugQ5x2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44964'),
  ('1021090179072655370', 'Queen Mantis', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Byun Young-joo', null, 'Ko Hyun-jung, Jang Dong-yoon, Cho Seong-ha, Lee El, Kim Bo-ra, Lee Hwang-eui, Kim Min-ho, Kim Tae-jeong', null, 'Cha Su-yeol, a police officer who has long despised his mother, the notorious ''Mantis'' serial killer, must reluctantly turn to her for help when a copycat killer emerges.', 'Cha Su-yeol, a police officer who has long despised his mother, the notorious ''Mantis'' serial killer, must reluctantly turn to her for help when a copycat killer emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WWGI3LOzufVJavMdy6BAIInMPY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243248'),
  ('137430532963555246', 'Queen Millennia', 1981, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Leiji Matsumoto', null, 'Keiko Han, Keiko Toda, Toru Furuya, Ichiro Nagai, Kenichi Ogata, Toshio Furukawa, Taeko Nakanishi, Kazuyo Aoki', null, 'The planet LaMetal begins a war of conquest with the Earth, and the only one who can defend the world from this threat is the Queen Millennia, a former princess of LaMetal who has made Earth her home.', 'The planet LaMetal begins a war of conquest with the Earth, and the only one who can defend the world from this threat is the Queen Millennia, a former princess of LaMetal who has made Earth her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tf2Je0XAPs9Q7GRVqDjpjj0Ln5b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34839'),
  ('616632165032630121', 'Queen of Divorce', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jeong Hee-seon', 'Jeong Hee-seon', 'Lee Ji-ah, Oh Min-suk, Kang Ki-young, Kim Sun-young, Lee Tae-gu, Lee Doo-seok, Seo Hye-won, Park Sun-im', null, 'Korea’s most skilled divorce solver and an eccentric lawyer who provides solutions for troubled marriages, punishing unfaithful spouses in the process.', 'Korea’s most skilled divorce solver and an eccentric lawyer who provides solutions for troubled marriages, punishing unfaithful spouses in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UF0D8B7CcRipl3BbQhUmuHrpJZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222425'),
  ('179453059820230901', 'Queen of Fucking Everything', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Tiina Lymi', 'Tiina Lymi', 'Laura Malmivaara, Katja Küttner, Kristo Salminen, Joonas Heikkinen, Miro Lopperi, Minna Haapkylä, Kari Heiskanen, Juho Milonoff', null, 'A successful real estate agent wakes up one day to find out that her husband is gone, leaving her with millions in debt. In order to survive and maintain her lifestyle, Linda must become the queen of the criminal world.', 'A successful real estate agent wakes up one day to find out that her husband is gone, leaving her with millions in debt. In order to survive and maintain her lifestyle, Linda must become the queen of the criminal world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbdlYbbvwNfcvSVYnAWiHf5iJm0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280860'),
  ('1146029556982625848', 'Queen of Hearts', 2014, 'Soap', 'Marcela Citterio', null, 'Paola Nuñez, Eugenio Siller, Juan Soler, Catherine Siachoque, Laura Flores, Gabriel Coronel, Carlos Ferro, Wanda D''Isidoro', null, 'Reina Ortiz will suffer an accident that will cause her to forget the last eight years of her life, in which she became the wife of tycoon Victor de Rosas, Clara''s mother and the owner of the most famous bridal atelier in Las Vegas. She doesn’t even remember the happiest moment of her life; when she fell in love with Nicolas Nuñez. Now Reina, who feels she doesn’t belong to this world of luxury and power, will strive to discover her own truth. Meanwhile, Nicolas is working for the secret service under a new identity as Javier Bolivar, is seeking revenge after Estefania Perez made him believe Reina and Victor were responsible for his unjust imprisonment. Entangled in secrets, tricks and deceptions in a double life of gamble under the framework of gold and precious stones trafficking, Nicolas and Reina will fight for the only thing they cannot leave to chance, their love.', 'Reina Ortiz will suffer an accident that will cause her to forget the last eight years of her life, in which she became the wife of tycoon Victor de Rosas, Clara''s mother and the owner of the most famous bridal atelier in Las Vegas. She doesn’t even remember the happiest moment of her life; when she fell in love with Nicolas Nuñez. Now Reina, who feels she doesn’t belong to this world of luxury and power, will strive to discover her own truth. Meanwhile, Nicolas is working for the secret service under a new identity as Javier Bolivar, is seeking revenge after Estefania Perez made him believe Reina and Victor were responsible for his unjust imprisonment. Entangled in secrets, tricks and deceptions in a double life of gamble under the framework of gold and precious stones trafficking, Nicolas and Reina will fight for the only thing they cannot leave to chance, their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xdC1a8pSCKdacd2ijVZzhP1a1E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47699'),
  ('310472523368799912', 'Queen of Hearts', 2025, null, null, null, null, null, 'At Rosewood Academy, a prestigious elite school where power is everything, Andrea Riley — a brilliant but underprivileged scholarship student — enters with one goal: uncover the truth behind her sister''s mysterious disappearance. But Rosewood plays by its own rules, governed by a dangerous card game that controls the social hierarchy. When Andrea is unexpectedly chosen as the new Queen of Hearts, she becomes entangled with Nathaniel Sinclair, the ruthless and magnetic King of Hearts. What starts as a strategic move quickly turns into a battle of secrets, power, and forbidden attraction. As Andrea navigates twisted mind games, hidden agendas, and a haunting past, she must decide: play the game and lose herself — or destroy it before it destroys her. A dark romance filled with suspense, betrayal, and high-stakes drama — where every card turned reveals a deeper lie.', 'At Rosewood Academy, a prestigious elite school where power is everything, Andrea Riley — a brilliant but underprivileged scholarship student — enters with one goal: uncover the truth behind her sister''s mysterious disappearance. But Rosewood plays by its own rules, governed by a dangerous card game that controls the social hierarchy. When Andrea is unexpectedly chosen as the new Queen of Hearts, she becomes entangled with Nathaniel Sinclair, the ruthless and magnetic King of Hearts. What starts as a strategic move quickly turns into a battle of secrets, power, and forbidden attraction. As Andrea navigates twisted mind games, hidden agendas, and a haunting past, she must decide: play the game and lose herself — or destroy it before it destroys her. A dark romance filled with suspense, betrayal, and high-stakes drama — where every card turned reveals a deeper lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BETtpwzHivnYxAb37SRr01YxVk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302700'),
  ('564139653972373514', 'Queen of Jhansi', 2009, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Abhimanyu Singh', null, 'Ulka Gupta, Kratika Sengar, Sameer Dharmadhikari, Ravindra Mankani, Amit Pachori, Siddharth Vasudev, Shailesh Dattar, Amit Pachori', 'NR', 'Ek Veer Stree Ki Kahaani... Jhansi Ki Rani is an Indian historical drama based on the life of Lakshmi Bai, the Rani of Jhansi, one of the leading figures of the Indian Rebellion of 1857. The series was directed by Jitendra Srivastava and written by Rajesh Saksham, Ila Dutta Bedi, Malavika Asthana and Mairaj Zaidi. It premiered on 18 August 2009 on Zee TV with Ulka Gupta playing Queen Lakshmi Bai. On 8 June 2010 the story moved on several years and Kratika Sengar portrayed the Queen from there on. The show''s last episode went to air on 19 June 2011.', 'Ek Veer Stree Ki Kahaani... Jhansi Ki Rani is an Indian historical drama based on the life of Lakshmi Bai, the Rani of Jhansi, one of the leading figures of the Indian Rebellion of 1857. The series was directed by Jitendra Srivastava and written by Rajesh Saksham, Ila Dutta Bedi, Malavika Asthana and Mairaj Zaidi. It premiered on 18 August 2009 on Zee TV with Ulka Gupta playing Queen Lakshmi Bai. On 8 June 2010 the story moved on several years and Kratika Sengar portrayed the Queen from there on. The show''s last episode went to air on 19 June 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGwG9SCElFVNZuvktL7RHNDRHoT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18654'),
  ('527655996706845480', 'Queen of Masks', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Kim Seon-a, Oh Yoon-ah, Shin Eun-jung, Yu Seon, Oh Ji-ho, Lee Jung-jin, Shin Ji-hoon, Lee Yeon-doo', null, 'The war of jealousy and desire of four friends, one of them became a murderer due to lies of the others 10 years ago and appeared in front of the three successful friends.', 'The war of jealousy and desire of four friends, one of them became a murderer due to lies of the others 10 years ago and appeared in front of the three successful friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fGwBIZpxRiqqVKDoQQveFqLJWt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215815'),
  ('286809564599529949', 'Queen of Mystery', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Lee Sung-min', 'Choi Kang-hee, Kwon Sang-woo, Oh Min-suk, Lee Da-hee, Kim Hyun-sook, Kim Tae-woo, Park Byung-eun, Kim Won-hae', 'NR', 'Yoo Seol-Ok liked mystery novels and wanted to become a detective, but she gave up her dream after marrying. Now, she is a housewife with a husband who works as a prosecutor. She meets Ha Wan-Seung. He is a passionate detective and they decide to collaborate to solve cases.', 'Yoo Seol-Ok liked mystery novels and wanted to become a detective, but she gave up her dream after marrying. Now, she is a housewife with a husband who works as a prosecutor. She meets Ha Wan-Seung. He is a passionate detective and they decide to collaborate to solve cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKso3ijkzh0OZT5IO5cFPu8E3A7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70957'),
  ('1051672201071198514', 'Queen of Oz', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Tate, Borga Dorter', null, 'Catherine Tate, Rob Collins, Niky Wardley, Jenna Owen, William McKenna, Robert Coleby, Anthony Brandon Wong, Rachel Gordon', null, 'Princess Georgiana is the black sheep of a fictional British Royal Family. A PR disaster, she''s spent her spoilt, party-girl life plastered over the tabloids. On the back of her latest scandal her mother, the Queen, makes the unprecedented move of abdicating her Australian throne in favour of her daughter. It is hoped that giving her some real responsibility will finally be the making of her – and if it isn''t, at least shipping her off keeps her 10,000 miles away from London.', 'Princess Georgiana is the black sheep of a fictional British Royal Family. A PR disaster, she''s spent her spoilt, party-girl life plastered over the tabloids. On the back of her latest scandal her mother, the Queen, makes the unprecedented move of abdicating her Australian throne in favour of her daughter. It is hoped that giving her some real responsibility will finally be the making of her – and if it isn''t, at least shipping her off keeps her 10,000 miles away from London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ2i4TZs26Y1HQXUEY0GWAZTCf4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208935'),
  ('80588260823492063', 'Queen of Tears', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Ji-eun, Jang Young-woo, Kim Hee-won', null, 'Kim Soo-hyun, Kim Ji-won, Park Sung-hoon, Kwak Dong-yeon, Lee Ju-bin, Kim Kap-soo, Na Young-hee, Kim Jung-nan', null, 'The queen of department stores and the prince of supermarkets weather a marital crisis—until love miraculously begins to bloom again.', 'The queen of department stores and the prince of supermarkets weather a marital crisis—until love miraculously begins to bloom again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZXLZ3KYL3IVvsSHBZaHjcNQzNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215720'),
  ('987506236580660368', 'Queen of the Ring', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Kim A‑jeong', 'Kim Seul-gi, Ahn Hyo-seop, Yoon So-hee, Hwang Jeong-min, Jeon No-min, Kim Min-young, Choi Tae-hwan, Lee Yeon-su', null, 'Nan Hee is an ugly girl and this has influenced her to become mean. One day, she receives a ring which holds a family secret. Se Gun is handsome, but he has a cold-blooded personality. Due to the magic of the ring, he declares Nan Hee as his ideal woman with a beautiful appearance.', 'Nan Hee is an ugly girl and this has influenced her to become mean. One day, she receives a ring which holds a family secret. Se Gun is handsome, but he has a cold-blooded personality. Due to the magic of the ring, he declares Nan Hee as his ideal woman with a beautiful appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Fh0F9tlq1ly788RnZRPoreAhSY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70669'),
  ('554050250676899071', 'Queen of the South', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'M.A. Fortin, Joshua John Miller', null, 'Alice Braga, Hemky Madera, Peter Gadiot, Jamie Hector, Ryan O''Nan', 'TV-MA', 'Teresa flees Mexico after her drug-runner boyfriend is murdered. Settling in Dallas, she looks to become the country''s reigning drug smuggler and to avenge her lover''s murder.', 'Teresa flees Mexico after her drug-runner boyfriend is murdered. Settling in Dallas, she looks to become the country''s reigning drug smuggler and to avenge her lover''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzdC5EHkkKJE6OPVdh6gT1pR1c9.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66676'),
  ('367948844818070083', 'Queen of the Universe', 2021, 'Reality', 'RuPaul, Fenton Bailey, Randy Barbato', null, 'Graham Norton, Michelle Visage, Vanessa Williams, Trixie Mattel, Mel B', 'TV-MA', 'Eurovision-like singing competition featuring drag queens from around the world who compete to be crowned the Ultimate Queen of the Universe', 'Eurovision-like singing competition featuring drag queens from around the world who compete to be crowned the Ultimate Queen of the Universe', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaXjnxkmYAKjkZSNJJIpfCQxnhp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:130048'),
  ('730255549392711858', 'Queen Sono', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Kagiso Lediga', null, 'Pearl Thusi, Vuyo Dabula, Sechaba Morojele, Chi Mhende', 'TV-MA', 'A highly trained South African spy must face changing relationships in her personal life while taking on her most dangerous mission yet.', 'A highly trained South African spy must face changing relationships in her personal life while taking on her most dangerous mission yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCq56uFGe16RrrEl9D9lKjzdAnE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96676'),
  ('394539708236092711', 'Queen Stars Brazil', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Pabllo Vittar, Luísa Sonza, Tiago Abravanel, Vanessa da Mata, Diego Timbó, Diego Martins', 'TV-14', 'Pabllo Vittar and Luísa Sonza lead the fight for the crown of pop music in a competition where lip-sync queens unleash their own voices to win a place in Brazil''s most talented drag queen musical trio.', 'Pabllo Vittar and Luísa Sonza lead the fight for the crown of pop music in a competition where lip-sync queens unleash their own voices to win a place in Brazil''s most talented drag queen musical trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCvaXV2cXEr4dBmhssfAQBBhLdX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152451'),
  ('944187053942292758', 'Queen Sugar', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ava DuVernay', null, 'Rutina Wesley, Dawn-Lyen Gardner, Kofi Siriboe, Nicholas L. Ashe, Dondré Whitfield, Omar J. Dorsey, Greg Vaughan, Tina Lifford', 'TV-14', 'Two sisters, Nova Bordelon and Charley Bordelon, with her teenage son Micah moves to the heart of Louisiana to claim an inheritance from her recently departed father - an 800-acre sugarcane farm.', 'Two sisters, Nova Bordelon and Charley Bordelon, with her teenage son Micah moves to the heart of Louisiana to claim an inheritance from her recently departed father - an 800-acre sugarcane farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5FtHPzooqBHsjEV7KAmQhFvd7w.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:67679'),
  ('403850379005943804', 'Queen Woo', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Jeon Jong-seo, Kim Moo-yul, Ji Chang-wook, Jeong Yu-mi, Lee Soo-hyuk, Park Ji-hwan, Song Jae-rim, Kang Young-suk', null, 'Upon the announcement of the king''s death in Goguryeo, a fierce battle ensues among tribes. Queen Woo, who immediately becomes the target of princes and five tribes vying for the throne, struggles to crown a new king within 24 hours. Will Queen Woo be able to transcend the constraints of gender and era to carve out her own destiny?', 'Upon the announcement of the king''s death in Goguryeo, a fierce battle ensues among tribes. Queen Woo, who immediately becomes the target of princes and five tribes vying for the throne, struggles to crown a new king within 24 hours. Will Queen Woo be able to transcend the constraints of gender and era to carve out her own destiny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlV5cSDQ7LMVCCHxoS6OgzjyWK5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224732'),
  ('699883985514006603', 'Queen: Love and War', 2019, 'Drama', null, '최수미', 'Jin Se-yeon, Kim Min-gue, Lee Yul-eum, Do Sang-woo, Son Byung-ho, Lee Si-eon, Seo Kyung-hwa, Jeon Soo-yeon', null, 'It tells the story of the cutthroat competition around the selection of the new queen, who is the only person in the kingdom who can have power without being related to the royal family.', 'It tells the story of the cutthroat competition around the selection of the new queen, who is the only person in the kingdom who can have power without being related to the royal family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eVpYaLdFperkEV7LHlapQlN3Wu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95109'),
  ('551567577138954661', 'Queen''s Blade', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Atsuko Tanaka, Aya Hirano, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ayako Kawasumi, Kanae Itou, Eri Kitamura, Hitomi Nabatame', 'TV-MA', 'Every few years, beautiful female warriors from across the land compete in the Queen''s Blade Tournament to become the ruler of the land. It''s a series that loves violence as much as it hates clothes and complicated plots.', 'Every few years, beautiful female warriors from across the land compete in the Queen''s Blade Tournament to become the ruler of the land. It''s a series that loves violence as much as it hates clothes and complicated plots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtJYpBrN2mOCjSZSTJm1GVogUh8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45502'),
  ('1055776111901884127', 'Queendom', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Taeyeon, Lee Yong-jin, Hyolyn, Min Young, Yu Jeong, Eun Ji, Lee Yuna, Eunha', null, 'A musical battle between 6 trending girl group acts, in order to "determine the real number one" when all 6 release their songs at the same time.', 'A musical battle between 6 trending girl group acts, in order to "determine the real number one" when all 6 release their songs at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8zn50A7P7CqCFT3a1Q18u3Uwve.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91678'),
  ('863318858439942994', 'Queendom', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Salmon', null, 'Nattawadee Pipobpornchai, Tarradee Watancharoen, Mashannoad Suvalmas, Chermawee Suwanpanuchoke, Pimolrat Pisolyabutr, Jiraphat Sodjam, Chinnawat Phattharathanachot, Supoj Janjareonborn', null, 'Enemies since school up to entering the entertainment industry, Rey and Print meet again when they land roles in a highly anticipated series. One week before filming''s to begin, however, something strange happens: their souls switch bodies. Chaos ensues. Most importantly, though, their feelings towards one another begin to shift as they embody one another.', 'Enemies since school up to entering the entertainment industry, Rey and Print meet again when they land roles in a highly anticipated series. One week before filming''s to begin, however, something strange happens: their souls switch bodies. Chaos ensues. Most importantly, though, their feelings towards one another begin to shift as they embody one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmowBj65IY7kJ3Dc6esUEzqnJnf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283353'),
  ('881909862677453098', 'Queenie', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Candice Carty-Williams', null, 'Dionne Brown, Bellah, Samuel Adewunmi, Llewella Gideon', null, 'Queenie Jenkins is a 25-year-old Jamaican British woman living in south London, straddling two cultures and slotting neatly into neither. After a messy breakup with her long-term boyfriend, Queenie seeks comfort in all the wrong places and begins to realize she has to face the past head-on before she can rebuild.', 'Queenie Jenkins is a 25-year-old Jamaican British woman living in south London, straddling two cultures and slotting neatly into neither. After a messy breakup with her long-term boyfriend, Queenie seeks comfort in all the wrong places and begins to realize she has to face the past head-on before she can rebuild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50Sz8X7qRo6CQjnQ77vk40ZJyy5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226633'),
  ('625049130119201908', 'Queenmaker', 2023, 'Drama', 'Oh Jin-seok, Moon Ji Young', null, 'Kim Hee-ae, Moon So-ri, Ryu Soo-young, Seo Yi-sook, Ok Ja-yeon, Kim Sae-byuk, Kang Sung-Wook, Lee Kyung-young', 'TV-MA', 'After a tragic accident, a powerful fixer uses her skills to transform a civil rights lawyer into the next mayor — and take down her former employer.', 'After a tragic accident, a powerful fixer uses her skills to transform a civil rights lawyer into the next mayor — and take down her former employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PLY6WSRgBKMY9Wc7npJA5f28lc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139280'),
  ('280731751830510177', 'Queens', 2021, 'Soap, Drama', 'Zahir McGhee', null, 'Brandy Norwood, Eve, Naturi Naughton, Nadine Velazquez, Pepi Sonuga, Taylor Selé, Ethan Levy', 'TV-14', 'Estranged and out-of-touch, four women in their 40s reunite for a chance to recapture their fame and regain the swagger they had as the Nasty Bitches—their ‘90s group that made them legends in the hip-hop world.', 'Estranged and out-of-touch, four women in their 40s reunite for a chance to recapture their fame and regain the swagger they had as the Nasty Bitches—their ‘90s group that made them legends in the hip-hop world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3yylKGhD02XlPq16ekGLRkOOMu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127390'),
  ('634186437809326929', 'Queens of Mystery', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Julian Unthank', null, 'Florence Hall, Julie Graham, Sarah Woodward, Siobhan Redmond, Andrew Leung, Rebecca Grant, Martin Trenaman, Michael Elcock', null, 'Matilda Stone is a perennially single female detective whose three aunts are well-known crime writers that help her solve whodunit style murders as well as set her up on blind dates.', 'Matilda Stone is a perennially single female detective whose three aunts are well-known crime writers that help her solve whodunit style murders as well as set her up on blind dates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCgHxa3jdCGbHpyEImotLBUGQr5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82139'),
  ('598469036825434843', 'Queer as Folk', 1999, 'Drama', 'Russell T Davies', null, 'Aidan Gillen, Craig Kelly, Charlie Hunnam, Esther Hall, Denise Black, Andy Devine, Alison Burrows, Caroline O''Neill', 'TV-MA', 'Stuart Jones has got it all. He''s rich, drop-dead gorgeous and always the centre of attention. He can be forgiven the arrogance because he''s pretty close to perfection. His best mate Vince Tyler is funny, adorable and definitely a babe but, unlike his friend, has zero confidence in himself. Since time began, Vince has carried a torch for Stuart but his love remains firmly unrequited. They''re both 29, hitting Canal Street every night, stalwarts of the scene but just starting to wonder where else their lives may be going. Then along comes Nathan Maloney. Young, wild and coming out with a vengeance, he crowbars his way into their world and once he arrives, nothing is ever the same again.', 'Stuart Jones has got it all. He''s rich, drop-dead gorgeous and always the centre of attention. He can be forgiven the arrogance because he''s pretty close to perfection. His best mate Vince Tyler is funny, adorable and definitely a babe but, unlike his friend, has zero confidence in himself. Since time began, Vince has carried a torch for Stuart but his love remains firmly unrequited. They''re both 29, hitting Canal Street every night, stalwarts of the scene but just starting to wonder where else their lives may be going. Then along comes Nathan Maloney. Young, wild and coming out with a vengeance, he crowbars his way into their world and once he arrives, nothing is ever the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15A6uzdd7hnBJ6bm1OBX7TP38yT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2388'),
  ('508777106986449822', 'Queer as Folk', 2022, 'Drama', 'Stephen Dunn', 'Brontez Purnell', 'Devin Way, Fin Argus, Jesse James Keitel, CG, Johnny Sibilly, Ryan O''Connell', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of a diverse group of friends in New Orleans are transformed in the aftermath of a tragedy.', 'The lives of a diverse group of friends in New Orleans are transformed in the aftermath of a tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofLgNhfsLstalbEEdqGN2sWdOJG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134967'),
  ('685676551131742721', 'Queer As Folk', 2000, 'Drama', 'Daniel Lipman, Ron Cowen', null, 'Gale Harold, Randy Harrison, Hal Sparks, Peter Paige, Scott Lowell, Sharon Gless, Alec McClure, Thea Gill', 'TV-MA', 'Brash humor and genuine emotion make up this original series revolving around the lives, loves, ambitions, careers and friendships of a group of gay men and women living on Liberty Avenue in contemporary Pittsburgh, PA. The show offers an unapologetic look at modern, urban gay and lesbian lives while addressing the most critical health and political issues affecting the community. Sometimes racy, sometimes sensitive and always straight to the heart.', 'Brash humor and genuine emotion make up this original series revolving around the lives, loves, ambitions, careers and friendships of a group of gay men and women living on Liberty Avenue in contemporary Pittsburgh, PA. The show offers an unapologetic look at modern, urban gay and lesbian lives while addressing the most critical health and political issues affecting the community. Sometimes racy, sometimes sensitive and always straight to the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmhL30PonbrrpEOQH5OdyUguyMg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2902'),
  ('956651675007987550', 'Queer Eye', 2018, 'Reality', 'David Collins', null, 'Antoni Porowski, Tan France, Karamo Brown, Jonathan Van Ness, Jeremiah Brent', 'TV-14', 'An all-new “Fab Five” advise men on fashion, grooming, food, culture and design in this modern reboot of the Emmy Award-winning reality series.', 'An all-new “Fab Five” advise men on fashion, grooming, food, culture and design in this modern reboot of the Emmy Award-winning reality series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyuQwYNTkiPpyqiA9XAZuToZRhN.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:76922'),
  ('666508066714079804', 'Queer Eye for the Straight Guy', 2003, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Kyan Douglas, Ted Allen, Jai Rodriguez, Thom Filicia, Carson Kressley', null, 'You never know what the Fab Five will do - or say - next as they travel across the US and deconstruct a straight guy''s life, giving him a fabulous new wardrobe, personal grooming tips, a signature recipe or two, some good-looking furniture, personal relating skills and a brand-new attitude.', 'You never know what the Fab Five will do - or say - next as they travel across the US and deconstruct a straight guy''s life, giving him a fabulous new wardrobe, personal grooming tips, a signature recipe or two, some good-looking furniture, personal relating skills and a brand-new attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMD0wzkjnCpPtRT2NOx0o01kH2d.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1506'),
  ('352848278372356238', 'Queer Eye: Brazil', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Fred Nicácio, Rica Benozzati, Luca Scarpelli, Yohan Nicolas, Guto Requena', null, 'Brazil’s Fab Five use their knowledge of well-being, style, grooming, design and culture to transform everyday heroes’ lives in this uplifting series.', 'Brazil’s Fab Five use their knowledge of well-being, style, grooming, design and culture to transform everyday heroes’ lives in this uplifting series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sV33lOikNhNnUWt49rdN4whmy7f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156658'),
  ('306498889766230682', 'Queer Eye: We''re in Japan!', 2019, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Tan France, Jonathan Van Ness, Antoni Porowski, Bobby Berk, Karamo Brown, Kiko Mizuhara', null, 'The Fab Five touch down in Tokyo to spread the joy, explore the culture, and help four Japanese men and women find the confidence to be themselves.', 'The Fab Five touch down in Tokyo to spread the joy, explore the culture, and help four Japanese men and women find the confidence to be themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PFq8lqBUqDiQPYakYsfKnugVKU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95074'),
  ('707242456737516938', 'Queer for Fear: The History of Queer Horror', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Fuller', 'Tom Maroney, Tara Anaïse', 'Carmen Maria Machado, Kimberly Peirce, Briana Venskus, Emily St. James, Alonso Duralde, Renée Bever, Justin Simien, Harry Benshoff', null, 'A four-part documentary telling the story of LGBTQIA+ horror and the relationship between queer audiences and horror, and the queer horror community as a whole.', 'A four-part documentary telling the story of LGBTQIA+ horror and the relationship between queer audiences and horror, and the queer horror community as a whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cSmbV0FJpvtOzlavyON3g9B1gQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209027'),
  ('215185169746971573', 'Queer You Are', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bob Pop', null, 'Gabriel Sánchez, Carlos González, Candela Peña, Carlos Bardem, Miguel Rellán, Alba Flores, Bob Pop', null, 'It shows the life trajectory of a gay village boy in search of his own identity.', 'It shows the life trajectory of a gay village boy in search of his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrwuSZYBpqSubmAFAU37LTry6Df.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124429'),
  ('570400379549820598', 'Queers.', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Alan Cumming, Ben Whishaw, Gemma Whelan, Russell Tovey, Ian Gelder', null, 'A series of eight monologues set in the same pub over many years of gay history in response to the 50th anniversary of the Sexual Offences Act.', 'A series of eight monologues set in the same pub over many years of gay history in response to the 50th anniversary of the Sexual Offences Act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seEIpOKIfeyLPqfs6QQleOfR0jZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73263'),
  ('25128980821605511', 'Quelle époque !', 2022, 'Talk', 'Léa Salamé, Régis Lamanna-Rodat', null, 'Léa Salamé, Hugo Clément, Paul de Saint Sernin, Guillaume de Saint Sernin', null, 'Talk show hosted by Léa Salamé, featuring incisive, funny, and surprising personalities debating current events in culture, society, politics, and the media. The set is designed as an arena where artists, polemicists, intellectuals, politicians, top athletes, and powerful figures come together. Permanent guest Christophe Dechavanne can intervene at any time during the show. Comedian Philippe Caverivière is also present with a segment dedicated to the political week and another devoted to celebrity news and social media.', 'Talk show hosted by Léa Salamé, featuring incisive, funny, and surprising personalities debating current events in culture, society, politics, and the media. The set is designed as an arena where artists, polemicists, intellectuals, politicians, top athletes, and powerful figures come together. Permanent guest Christophe Dechavanne can intervene at any time during the show. Comedian Philippe Caverivière is also present with a segment dedicated to the political week and another devoted to celebrity news and social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yM0l3ziIIii8fnvePMxXUe6FM1i.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:210931'),
