  ('692535115226596513', 'Quicksand', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lisa Farzaneh, Per-Olav Sørensen', null, 'Hanna Ardéhn, Felix Sandman, David Dencik, Rebecka Hemse, Anna Björk, Reuben Sallmander, Helena af Sandeberg, Maria Sundbom', 'TV-MA', 'After a tragedy at a school sends shock waves through a wealthy Stockholm suburb, a seemingly well-adjusted teen finds herself on trial for murder.', 'After a tragedy at a school sends shock waves through a wealthy Stockholm suburb, a seemingly well-adjusted teen finds herself on trial for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyktLijhV8QY65cAqGIir2PjOc5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86621'),
  ('663400797304638843', 'Quiero Amarte', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Martha Carrillo, Cristina Garcia', 'Jaime García Estrada, Orlando Merino', 'Karyme Lozano, Cristián de la Fuente, Diana Bracho, Flavio Medina, Alejandra Barros, Adriana Louvier, José Elías Moreno, Mauricio Abularach', 'TV-14', 'Karyme Lozano, Cristian de la Fuente and Adriana Louvier will star as the protagonists, while Diana Bracho, Flavio Medina and Salvador Zerboni will star as the antagonists, and with the stellar participations of Alejandra Barros, José Elías Moreno and Olivia Bucio.', 'Karyme Lozano, Cristian de la Fuente and Adriana Louvier will star as the protagonists, while Diana Bracho, Flavio Medina and Salvador Zerboni will star as the antagonists, and with the stellar participations of Alejandra Barros, José Elías Moreno and Olivia Bucio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seh2CX0WeAe7norKvTRgOrPmF0U.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:59184'),
  ('151465545371638341', 'Quiet on Set: The Dark Side of Kids TV', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Discover the untold story of the toxic and abusive environment inside ''90s kids'' TV. Hear harrowing accounts from former child stars and crew who probe the balance of power in the industry and reveal an era that inflicted lasting wounds still felt today.', 'Discover the untold story of the toxic and abusive environment inside ''90s kids'' TV. Hear harrowing accounts from former child stars and crew who probe the balance of power in the industry and reveal an era that inflicted lasting wounds still felt today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTQD87qAuebJRuc5U5lO2dA4q9s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245902'),
  ('438895500828739838', 'Quiet Please!', 2025, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Park Jun-won, Min Seung-woo, Lim Hyuk', null, 'One month into living on his own, Yi-hyuk was hoping for an exciting, dramatic start to his independent life—but not this kind of drama. What he doesn’t expect is to be tormented by the thunderous noise coming from the apartment next door. Determined to put an end to it, he confronts his neighbor—only to make things infinitely worse when he accidentally punches him in the face.Yi-hyuk tries everything—from childish pranks to petty power plays—but his neighbor just won’t budge. He even pleads on his knees to make the noise stop. Just when it seems the feud will never end, they finally manage to call an uneasy truce.And somewhere along the way, Yi-hyuk realizes he might be falling for the very person who once drove him up the wall.', 'One month into living on his own, Yi-hyuk was hoping for an exciting, dramatic start to his independent life—but not this kind of drama. What he doesn’t expect is to be tormented by the thunderous noise coming from the apartment next door. Determined to put an end to it, he confronts his neighbor—only to make things infinitely worse when he accidentally punches him in the face.Yi-hyuk tries everything—from childish pranks to petty power plays—but his neighbor just won’t budge. He even pleads on his knees to make the noise stop. Just when it seems the feud will never end, they finally manage to call an uneasy truce.And somewhere along the way, Yi-hyuk realizes he might be falling for the very person who once drove him up the wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esJcpCfHRTtjOvbCc1YzQJndUkh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299989'),
  ('271559582093102356', 'Quinceañera', 1987, 'Soap, Drama', 'René Muñoz', 'René Muñoz', 'Adela Noriega, Ernesto Laguardia, Thalia, Rafael Rojas, Sebastian Ligarde, Blanca Sánchez, Jorge Lavat, Julieta Egurrola', 'NR', 'Quinceañera, is a Mexican telenovela, produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 1987, starring Adela Noriega and Thalía. Quinceañera was the first telenovela to talk about substance abuse, date rape and gangs, and is considered to be the first telenovela made for teenagers. Quinceañera was named by the Associated Press as one of the ten most influential telenovelas ever to air in Latin America, and Univision tlnovelas viewers named it one of their all-time favorite Mexican telenovelas. In 2010, Quinceañera was placed #7 on the People en Español''s "20 Best Telenovelas" list, and in 2012, Terra named it as one of the fifty best telenovelas of all-time.', 'Quinceañera, is a Mexican telenovela, produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 1987, starring Adela Noriega and Thalía. Quinceañera was the first telenovela to talk about substance abuse, date rape and gangs, and is considered to be the first telenovela made for teenagers. Quinceañera was named by the Associated Press as one of the ten most influential telenovelas ever to air in Latin America, and Univision tlnovelas viewers named it one of their all-time favorite Mexican telenovelas. In 2010, Quinceañera was placed #7 on the People en Español''s "20 Best Telenovelas" list, and in 2012, Terra named it as one of the fifty best telenovelas of all-time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odQgI6tPmsoRWz46ktIULK0LdEi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12976'),
  ('606971026528842763', 'Quincy, M.E.', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Jack Klugman, Robert Ito, Val Bisoglio, John S. Ragin, Garry Walberg, Joseph Roman', 'TV-PG', 'Los Angeles County medical examiner Quincy routinely engages in police investigations.', 'Los Angeles County medical examiner Quincy routinely engages in police investigations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0bsxZqhE5fhRjaX2LKu8GuKccE.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2179'),
  ('256092328133293868', 'Quirke', 2014, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Gabriel Byrne, Nick Dunning, Brian Gleeson, Aisling Franciosi, Stanley Townsend, Michael Gambon', null, 'Quirke is the chief pathologist in the Dublin city morgue – a charismatic loner whose job takes him into fascinating places as he investigates sudden deaths in 1950s Dublin. His pleasures in life are raw and deep, a drink, a smoke, good food, a woman: With one woman in particular – his adoptive brother''s wife Sarah and the forbidden love that has shaped and dominated Quirke''s life.', 'Quirke is the chief pathologist in the Dublin city morgue – a charismatic loner whose job takes him into fascinating places as he investigates sudden deaths in 1950s Dublin. His pleasures in life are raw and deep, a drink, a smoke, good food, a woman: With one woman in particular – his adoptive brother''s wife Sarah and the forbidden love that has shaped and dominated Quirke''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trJ35jkeQHYCnSbD6BLbVeIdacg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61874'),
  ('1075205840859834025', 'Quiz', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Matthew Macfadyen, Sian Clifford, Mark Bonnar, Helen McCrory, Michael Sheen, Aisling Bea, Elliot Levey, Risteard Cooper', null, 'The story of Charles Ingram, a former British army major who caused a major scandal in the early 2000s after being caught cheating his way to winning £1 million on the game show Who Wants To Be A Millionaire? Ingram, his wife Diana and an accomplice, Tecwen Whittock, who was sitting in the audience, initially pulled off the on-screen heist before being caught and standing trial.', 'The story of Charles Ingram, a former British army major who caused a major scandal in the early 2000s after being caught cheating his way to winning £1 million on the game show Who Wants To Be A Millionaire? Ingram, his wife Diana and an accomplice, Tecwen Whittock, who was sitting in the audience, initially pulled off the on-screen heist before being caught and standing trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCHBUpRwtRpGuIRy0bMGSc5Xd1I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101543'),
  ('517282655161191002', 'Quiz Me Quick', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bart De Pauw', 'Jonas Geirnaert, Bart De Pauw', 'Wietse Tanghe, Dirk van Dijck, Jos Verbist, Tom Audenaert, Pieter Piron, Liesa Naert, Tine Embrechts, Clara Cleymans', null, 'The story of five underdogs, meeting by chance during a quiz in a local pub. They get the idea of taking part in the "Superprestige", the most important quiz. The selection procedure turns out to be difficult, requiring more than just knowledge. There''s even more at stake than the five had in mind. "Quiz Me Quick" follows their successes as well as their failures', 'The story of five underdogs, meeting by chance during a quiz in a local pub. They get the idea of taking part in the "Superprestige", the most important quiz. The selection procedure turns out to be difficult, requiring more than just knowledge. There''s even more at stake than the five had in mind. "Quiz Me Quick" follows their successes as well as their failures', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cON3HANh5cWRqgbJ1IDPBkl0bdW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62025'),
