  ('91272205664618887', 'Relic Hunter', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Gil Grant', null, 'Tia Carrere, Tanja Reichert, Christien Anholt', 'TV-14', 'Sydney Fox is a professor and globe-trotting "relic hunter" who looks for ancient artifacts to return to museums and/or the descendants of the original owner. She is aided by her linguistic assistant Nigel and occasionally by her somewhat air-headed secretary Claudia. She often ends up battling rival hunters seeking out artifacts for the money.', 'Sydney Fox is a professor and globe-trotting "relic hunter" who looks for ancient artifacts to return to museums and/or the descendants of the original owner. She is aided by her linguistic assistant Nigel and occasionally by her somewhat air-headed secretary Claudia. She often ends up battling rival hunters seeking out artifacts for the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t04oqIsBlRnxKOWhBL6SlEQowZ5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2855'),
  ('46428980491518849', 'ReLIFE', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Ai Kayano, Ryohei Kimura, Haruka Tomatsu, Reina Ueda, Yuma Uchida', 'TV-PG', 'Arata Kaizaki (27) quit the job he landed after graduation in only three months. His life did not go well after that. Now his parents are threatening to stop sending money, and want him to come back to the country. He has no friend or girlfriend to share his troubles with...as he hits rock bottom a strange man named Ryou Yoake appears. He invites Arata to join a societal rehabilitation program for NEETs called ReLife. This program uses a mysterious drug to make him look younger, and sends him back to high school for a year...', 'Arata Kaizaki (27) quit the job he landed after graduation in only three months. His life did not go well after that. Now his parents are threatening to stop sending money, and want him to come back to the country. He has no friend or girlfriend to share his troubles with...as he hits rock bottom a strange man named Ryou Yoake appears. He invites Arata to join a societal rehabilitation program for NEETs called ReLife. This program uses a mysterious drug to make him look younger, and sends him back to high school for a year...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRK64bB8hMsuZZnitebPyKqOR5d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66941'),
  ('162219938811987387', 'Rellik', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Williams, Harry Williams', null, 'Richard Dormer, Jodi Balfour, Kieran Bew, Lærke Winther, Shannon Tarbet, Reece Ritchie, Ray Stevenson, Paterson Joseph', null, 'A serial killer thriller told in reverse, unravelling the truth behind a series of murders as DCI Gabriel Markham hunts down a brutal killer.', 'A serial killer thriller told in reverse, unravelling the truth behind a series of murders as DCI Gabriel Markham hunts down a brutal killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trsaHyd2kg7ZIZKrNaINQx9m1AG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73689'),
  ('384211626103939626', 'Remake Our Life!', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Masahiro Ito, Aoi Koga, Aimi, Nao Toyama, Haruki Ishiya', 'TV-14', 'Hashiba Kyouya is a 28-year-old game developer. With his company going bankrupt, and him losing his job, he returns to his hometown. Looking at the success of creators of his age, he finds himself regretting his life decisions as he lay distressed on his bed. As Kyouya wakes up, he discovers that he has traveled ten years back to the time before he entered college. Will he be able to finally make things right?', 'Hashiba Kyouya is a 28-year-old game developer. With his company going bankrupt, and him losing his job, he returns to his hometown. Looking at the success of creators of his age, he finds himself regretting his life decisions as he lay distressed on his bed. As Kyouya wakes up, he discovers that he has traveled ten years back to the time before he entered college. Will he be able to finally make things right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GgHByKZ4JivLszOrMP1bgJ5kx4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113687'),
  ('546726374179341548', 'Remarriage & Desires', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee Geun-young', 'Lee Geun-young', 'Kim Hee-seon, Lee Hyun-wook, Jung Yoo-jin, Park Hoon, Cha Ji-yeon, Kim Yoon-seo, Kim Sa-Kwon, Kim So-ra', null, 'Through an exclusive matchmaking agency, women strive to marry a desirable bachelor and into the highest echelon of society.', 'Through an exclusive matchmaking agency, women strive to marry a desirable bachelor and into the highest echelon of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqABG0jPug0NoFpCcJYAtrRdIk3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133775'),
  ('200659269956651494', 'Rematch', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yan England, André Gulluni, Bruno Nahon', 'André Gulluni, Yan England', 'Christian Cooke, Orion Lee, Sarah Bolger, Trine Dyrholm, Aidan Quinn, Tom Austen, Luke Pasqualino, Molly Harris', null, '1997. Garry Kasparov, the greatest chess player of all time, faces Deep Blue, IBM''s supercomputer. Two brains, face to face; one man against an empire; a battle of humans against machines that forever changed the perception of artificial intelligence.', '1997. Garry Kasparov, the greatest chess player of all time, faces Deep Blue, IBM''s supercomputer. Two brains, face to face; one man against an empire; a battle of humans against machines that forever changed the perception of artificial intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr4cxKXYqfTh5ohPc3G25recMtS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217606'),
  ('547926301523037844', 'Remedy', 2014, 'Drama', 'Greg Spottiswood', null, 'Enrico Colantoni, Sarah Allen, Sara Canning, Dillon Casey, Genelle Williams, Patrick McKenna, Niall Matter, Brendan Gall', null, 'Griffin Conner, a med-school dropout having left in a haze of disgrace, is forced to return to Bethune General Hospital as its newest orderly and work alongside his family.', 'Griffin Conner, a med-school dropout having left in a haze of disgrace, is forced to return to Bethune General Hospital as its newest orderly and work alongside his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOLtmCrX4TYx5QJCwAbI1hMlqeA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62073'),
  ('70428144167020230', 'Remember', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Yoo Seung-ho, Park Min-young, Park Sung-woong, Namkoong Min, Jung Hye-sung, Han Jin-hee, Lee Si-eon, Jun Kwang-ryul', null, 'A genius lawyer, who suffers from Hyperthymetic syndrome, bets all in to save his father.', 'A genius lawyer, who suffers from Hyperthymetic syndrome, bets all in to save his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fczKc9Oy4xvGii1mTDezoecn1Yt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64487'),
  ('501845725638995874', 'Remember Darling', 2006, 'Drama, War & Politics, Family', 'Şebnem Çıtak, Nilgün Öneş', 'Nilgün Öneş, Şebnem Çıtak', 'Cansel Elçin, Beren Saat, Okan Yalabık, Avni Yalçın, Engin Şenkan, Lale Mansur, Ayda Aksel, Laçin Ceylan', null, 'A love story at the end of 1950''s in Turkey, Istanbul. In the political era of Turkey in that years, two young people from opposite families fall in love. Their families don''t allow them to marry. They face lots of obstacles for years.', 'A love story at the end of 1950''s in Turkey, Istanbul. In the political era of Turkey in that years, two young people from opposite families fall in love. Their families don''t allow them to marry. They face lots of obstacles for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4Q7Ki1I4i8hBvo7XrS8zXkvik7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15604'),
  ('677667894914808454', 'Remember Me', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Gwyneth Hughes', 'Gwyneth Hughes', 'Michael Palin, Jodie Comer, Mark Addy, Mina Anwar, Mayuri Boonham, Julia Sawalha, Tony Pitts, Eileen Davies', null, 'Tom Parfitt fakes an injury in order to escape from his monotonous lifestyle and head to a care center. However, upon his arrival, the staff experiences several strange instances, including a murder.', 'Tom Parfitt fakes an injury in order to escape from his monotonous lifestyle and head to a care center. However, upon his arrival, the staff experiences several strange instances, including a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YH1gywyt5mGOcM6ar7cgOqKRH2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61635'),
  ('872754708509380952', 'Remember WENN', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Rupert Holmes', null, 'Tom Beckett, Carolee Carmello, George Hall, Margaret Hall, Melinda Mullins, Christopher Murney, Amanda Naughton, Hugh O''Gorman', null, 'The personal and professional lives of the staff of fictional Pittsburgh radio station WENN in the early 1940s, before and during World War II.', 'The personal and professional lives of the staff of fictional Pittsburgh radio station WENN in the early 1940s, before and during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pr7ifHvrwud9CF5cgyQtBjzIBi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:10479'),
  ('1104476586165450166', 'Remembers…', 2022, 'Documentary, Talk', null, null, null, null, 'What are the secrets of our favourite TV shows? Famous names from both sides of the camera reflect on making some of the most popular and influential programmes of all time.', 'What are the secrets of our favourite TV shows? Famous names from both sides of the camera reflect on making some of the most popular and influential programmes of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SKGw4Zp1K7tzjlyybJCUthHk1P.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:302115'),
  ('24161352962100356', 'Reminder', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Özgür Önurme', 'Ahmet Vatan', 'Hande Erçel, Barış Arduç, Begüm Akkaya, Başak Gümülcinelioğlu, Feyyaz Şerifoğlu, Melis Minkari, Sezin Akbaşoğulları, Fatih Al', null, 'Deniz, a reliable, famous architect, and Güneş, a phenomenal editor, who decided to separate six months ago while on their way to a wedding, are swept into a journey that will change their lives with a message that arrives on their phones on the evening of the day they met by chance. This new adventure will make them discover the missing pieces of their old relationship and remind them of love.', 'Deniz, a reliable, famous architect, and Güneş, a phenomenal editor, who decided to separate six months ago while on their way to a wedding, are swept into a journey that will change their lives with a message that arrives on their phones on the evening of the day they met by chance. This new adventure will make them discover the missing pieces of their old relationship and remind them of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lce2rcSk4vn5qRNktkayCFGDHQE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292516'),
  ('89853639660950337', 'Reminders', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Chonlathorn Kongyingyong , Nawat Phumphothingam, Phiravich Attachitsataporn, Tanapon Sukumpantanasan, Suppapong Udomkaewkanjana, Rathavit Kijworalak, Itthipat Thanit, Pongtiwat Tangwancharoen', null, 'The story revisits Noh and Phun who are now much older and in the university. Son and Pin are in a relationship and dealing with issues of jealousy, self-confidence, and trust. While Wish and Two are a couple starting out in their relationship.', 'The story revisits Noh and Phun who are now much older and in the university. Son and Pin are in a relationship and dealing with issues of jealousy, self-confidence, and trust. While Wish and Two are a couple starting out in their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sCNY373Hb6vxDpPSerHRwIUWZv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88762'),
  ('453220861579408997', 'Remington Steele', 1982, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Robert Butler, Michael Gleason', null, 'Pierce Brosnan, Stephanie Zimbalist, Doris Roberts', 'TV-PG', 'Laura Holt, a licensed private detective, opens a detective agency but finds that potential clients refuse to hire a woman, however qualified. To solve the problem, Laura invents a fictitious male superior whom she names Remington Steele. Through a series of events that unfold in the first episode, "License to Steele," a former thief and con man, whose real name is never revealed, assumes the identity of Remington Steele. Behind the scenes, Laura remains firmly in charge.', 'Laura Holt, a licensed private detective, opens a detective agency but finds that potential clients refuse to hire a woman, however qualified. To solve the problem, Laura invents a fictitious male superior whom she names Remington Steele. Through a series of events that unfold in the first episode, "License to Steele," a former thief and con man, whose real name is never revealed, assumes the identity of Remington Steele. Behind the scenes, Laura remains firmly in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UGDVrdwavyU0WIddhZf4eov6yv.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:589'),
  ('92644192159728440', 'Remy, Nobody''s Girl', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Mitsuko Horie, Chie Sato, Fubito Yamano, Yumi Touma, Eiko Yamada, Hiro Yuuki, Junko Shimakata, Kae Araki', null, 'Remy, a cheerful and tender-hearted girl, lives with her mother in a French country town. One day her father returns to the town after a long period working away from home in a city. Her father tells Remy that she isn’t their real daughter, and Remy is almost sold to an evil slave trader. It is Vitaris, a strolling entertainer, who helps Remy. Vitaris discovers her talent for singing and decides to take her in with his troupe. Remy starts her journey with Vitaris and his troupe animals such as the monkey Georicoule and the dogs Capi, Dolce, and Zelbino.', 'Remy, a cheerful and tender-hearted girl, lives with her mother in a French country town. One day her father returns to the town after a long period working away from home in a city. Her father tells Remy that she isn’t their real daughter, and Remy is almost sold to an evil slave trader. It is Vitaris, a strolling entertainer, who helps Remy. Vitaris discovers her talent for singing and decides to take her in with his troupe. Remy starts her journey with Vitaris and his troupe animals such as the monkey Georicoule and the dogs Capi, Dolce, and Zelbino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dklxmOaS4hS2J3YPevzqTaD3Fye.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44742'),
  ('546822751257896211', 'Ren & Stimpy Adult Party Cartoon', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'John Kricfalusi', null, 'Eric Bauza, John Kricfalusi', 'TV-MA', 'John Kricfalusi, the creator of the original Ren & Stimpy Show, is back at the helm with new adventures of Ren Höek and Stimpson J. Cat (Stimpy) in Ren & Stimpy Adult Party Cartoon, with the emphasis toward adults instead of children. These half-hour long episodes feature the duo in new situations. The original humor that made Ren & Stimpy a success is back, like flatulence jokes and gross-out gags, combined now with adult themes and situations. - Written by Zoomzoom Moonchild', 'John Kricfalusi, the creator of the original Ren & Stimpy Show, is back at the helm with new adventures of Ren Höek and Stimpson J. Cat (Stimpy) in Ren & Stimpy Adult Party Cartoon, with the emphasis toward adults instead of children. These half-hour long episodes feature the duo in new situations. The original humor that made Ren & Stimpy a success is back, like flatulence jokes and gross-out gags, combined now with adult themes and situations. - Written by Zoomzoom Moonchild', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lw6wyQi1rbwWwkrRpS3kNUVJmE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71708'),
  ('1004423078453834267', 'Ren Arisugawa Is Actually a Girl', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Yuki Nishiyama, Amai Miruku, Natsue Sasamoto, Noel Kanzaki, Miho Hayashi, Konbu Ariake', null, 'Kyohei’s only brush with fame is being the cousin of Japan’s hottest male celebrity, Ren Arisugawa. They haven’t spoken in years until Ren suddenly shows up at Kyohei’s rundown apartment out of the blue! But when Kyohei accidentally discovers Ren’s biggest secret… everything changes. Ren may be the picture of cool confidence on stage, but off-camera, "he" is actually a she and surprisingly adorable?!', 'Kyohei’s only brush with fame is being the cousin of Japan’s hottest male celebrity, Ren Arisugawa. They haven’t spoken in years until Ren suddenly shows up at Kyohei’s rundown apartment out of the blue! But when Kyohei accidentally discovers Ren’s biggest secret… everything changes. Ren may be the picture of cool confidence on stage, but off-camera, "he" is actually a she and surprisingly adorable?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9d3D1U9bdzV4vCHvr2PkdCW92z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287973'),
  ('761614112896036370', 'Ren Faire', 2024, 'Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jeffrey Baldwin, Darla Smith, George Coulam, Louie Migliaccio', 'TV-14', 'When the ailing king of America''s largest renaissance festival declares his retirement, an epic power struggle ensues between an actor, a former elephant trainer, and a kettle-corn kingpin to claim his throne.', 'When the ailing king of America''s largest renaissance festival declares his retirement, an epic power struggle ensues between an actor, a former elephant trainer, and a kettle-corn kingpin to claim his throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FmskgCiConpCzLnj38UEqumb5W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245929'),
  ('509136998259618871', 'Ren: The Girl with the Mark', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Kate Madison, Christopher Dane', null, null, null, 'Ren is the tale of a young woman who, after a strange encounter in the woods, is marked by an ancient spirit. Cast out from her small village, she is forced to leave behind the family she has spent her whole life protecting and journey across the land to find the real meaning behind the mark she bears.', 'Ren is the tale of a young woman who, after a strange encounter in the woods, is marked by an ancient spirit. Cast out from her small village, she is forced to leave behind the family she has spent her whole life protecting and journey across the land to find the real meaning behind the mark she bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuydftZulU75JMSQsDwtOcSetiO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:221405'),
  ('1084201817295065497', 'Rendez-vous in an Unknown Land', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Frédéric Lopez', null, null, 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCc5O5dEiLWLe41JoVGqJicoRS9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60591'),
  ('931805335186899905', 'Renegade', 1992, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Lorenzo Lamas, Branscombe Richmond, Stephen J. Cannell, Don LaFontaine', 'TV-14', 'Framed for murder, Detective Reno Raines becomes a fugitive bounty hunter who fights crime while trying to clear his name. His troubles began after he testified about police corruption, leading Lt. Donald Dixon to set him up.', 'Framed for murder, Detective Reno Raines becomes a fugitive bounty hunter who fights crime while trying to clear his name. His troubles began after he testified about police corruption, leading Lt. Donald Dixon to set him up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ESXaOpVv2EsORITmUz9z26hqC8.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:600'),
  ('706567095032219733', 'Renegade Immortal', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ergen', null, 'Shi Zekun, Zhang Huilin, Chang Wentao, Liu Sicen, Bai Xuecen, Wang Jinger, Qiao Su', 'TV-14', 'It tells the story of Wang Lin, an ordinary young man in the countryside, who is moved by his heart and cultivates against immortality. His pursuit is not only for longevity, but also for getting rid of the ants behind it. He firmly believed in human beings and entered the path of cultivation with mediocre qualifications. After experiencing ups and downs, with his wise mind, he gradually reached the pinnacle and became famous in the cultivation world with his own strength.', 'It tells the story of Wang Lin, an ordinary young man in the countryside, who is moved by his heart and cultivates against immortality. His pursuit is not only for longevity, but also for getting rid of the ants behind it. He firmly believed in human beings and entered the path of cultivation with mediocre qualifications. After experiencing ups and downs, with his wise mind, he gradually reached the pinnacle and became famous in the cultivation world with his own strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AVM12M6UunFmX0bSmP2o4N5Bnt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223911'),
  ('945898876176911804', 'Renegade Nell', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sally Wainwright', null, 'Louisa Harland, Frank Dillane, Alice Kremelberg, Enyi Okoronkwo, Bo Bragason, Florence Keen, Nick Mohammed, Adrian Lester', 'TV-14', 'England, 1705: Framed for murder and on the run with her sisters, Nell Jackson turns her hand to highway robbery to survive. Aided by her superpowered sidekick, a plucky little sprite called Billy Blind, Nell realizes that fate has put her on the wrong side of the law for a reason. A reason much bigger than she could have ever imagined: to defeat a magical plot against the Queen of England.', 'England, 1705: Framed for murder and on the run with her sisters, Nell Jackson turns her hand to highway robbery to survive. Aided by her superpowered sidekick, a plucky little sprite called Billy Blind, Nell realizes that fate has put her on the wrong side of the law for a reason. A reason much bigger than she could have ever imagined: to defeat a magical plot against the Queen of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hCiCJiG3uBqZhn2PmxLW2N3QUC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157569'),
  ('683476532620548682', 'Renegaded Archangel', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'José Júnior', null, 'Marcelo Mello Jr., Erika Januza, Álamo Facó, Flávio Bauraqui, Leonardo Brício, Rita Guedes, Léa Garcia, Tatsu Carvalho', null, 'Mikhael is a sergeant in charge of BOPE, always on dangerous missions in Rio de Janeiro. But after getting involved in a controversial operation that culminated to a slaughter, he is transferred to a police unit at the state countryside.', 'Mikhael is a sergeant in charge of BOPE, always on dangerous missions in Rio de Janeiro. But after getting involved in a controversial operation that culminated to a slaughter, he is transferred to a police unit at the state countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7gsnKeSQsyNYO7QrW5xedd3QTe.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99125'),
  ('672287811420925678', 'Rennervations', 2023, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Jeremy Renner, Rory Millikin, Corey Wardleig, Rob ''Bender'' Park, Roxy Bonilla, Justin Self, Merri Oswald', 'TV-PG', 'This four-part series embraces Jeremy Renner''s lifelong passion for giving back to communities around the world by reimagining unique purpose-built vehicles to meet a community’s needs.', 'This four-part series embraces Jeremy Renner''s lifelong passion for giving back to communities around the world by reimagining unique purpose-built vehicles to meet a community’s needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZtmwqjAi0rtgXIjbMmH1vcQWlD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157212'),
  ('90771935715900795', 'Reno 911!', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Lennon, Kerri Kenney, Robert Ben Garant', 'Robert Ben Garant', 'Thomas Lennon, Cedric Yarbrough, Kerri Kenney, Robert Ben Garant, Niecy Nash, Joe Lo Truglio, Ian Roberts', 'TV-14', 'This partially unscripted comedy brings viewers into the squad car as incompetent officers swing into action, answering 911 calls about everything from speeding violations and prostitution to staking out a drug den. Within each episode, viewers catch a "fly on the wall" glimpse of the cops'' often politically incorrect opinions, ranging from their personal feelings to professional critiques of their colleagues.', 'This partially unscripted comedy brings viewers into the squad car as incompetent officers swing into action, answering 911 calls about everything from speeding violations and prostitution to staking out a drug den. Within each episode, viewers catch a "fly on the wall" glimpse of the cops'' often politically incorrect opinions, ranging from their personal feelings to professional critiques of their colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phkCW1Hdoijl5i15H7KnnnBhaNL.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2187'),
  ('173281380389719471', 'Renovation Aloha', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kamohai Kalama, Tristyn Kalama', null, 'Follow husband-and-wife team Kamohai and Tristyn Kalama as they take on house-flipping projects across the island of Oahu, Hawaii, the most restrictive and difficult flipping location in the country.', 'Follow husband-and-wife team Kamohai and Tristyn Kalama as they take on house-flipping projects across the island of Oahu, Hawaii, the most restrictive and difficult flipping location in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPhLUAdYdgSoKMqq5KICLt9ttbc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:246922'),
  ('522015501465272504', 'Renovation Resort', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Scott McGillivray', null, 'Scott McGillivray enlists builder and longtime "frenemy" Bryan Baeumler to help get his recently purchased, total wreck of a lakeside resort into shape. Although they won''t be getting their hands dirty this time, instead, they''re calling in four expert contractor/design duos who will battle it out against each other as they bring this forgotten fishing resort back to life in a frenzied, fun, action-packed competition series. Each of these super-skilled teams will design and renovate one of four waterfront cabins in just six weeks, attempting to transform them into gorgeous one-of-a-kind vacation rentals ready to receive flocks of guests.', 'Scott McGillivray enlists builder and longtime "frenemy" Bryan Baeumler to help get his recently purchased, total wreck of a lakeside resort into shape. Although they won''t be getting their hands dirty this time, instead, they''re calling in four expert contractor/design duos who will battle it out against each other as they bring this forgotten fishing resort back to life in a frenzied, fun, action-packed competition series. Each of these super-skilled teams will design and renovate one of four waterfront cabins in just six weeks, attempting to transform them into gorgeous one-of-a-kind vacation rentals ready to receive flocks of guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLgNLEGgO3GCHaKNiY55waHdybb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:221748'),
  ('999328282053415228', 'Renoveringsdrömmar', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Anders Öfvergård', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nORIjOxWthUrvRcsrKK0RCOfWLN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:245678'),
  ('202943016109702239', 'Rent-a-Girlfriend', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shun Horie, Sora Amamiya, Aoi Yuuki, Nao Toyama, Rie Takahashi, Yu Serizawa, Yukari Nozawa, Sayuri Sadaoka', 'TV-14', 'Kinoshita Kazuya is a 20-year-old failure of a college student. He managed to kiss his girlfriend once, but was dumped after a month. Completely spiteful, Kazuya uses a certain method to date a girl. He goes to their meeting place and a beautiful girl brushing her long, black hair behind her ear was there, smiling at him. Her name was Mizuhara Chizuru. Something real is born after just a single rental! A reckless rom-com filled with love and excitement is about to begin!', 'Kinoshita Kazuya is a 20-year-old failure of a college student. He managed to kiss his girlfriend once, but was dumped after a month. Completely spiteful, Kazuya uses a certain method to date a girl. He goes to their meeting place and a beautiful girl brushing her long, black hair behind her ear was there, smiling at him. Her name was Mizuhara Chizuru. Something real is born after just a single rental! A reckless rom-com filled with love and excitement is about to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZpDPUNtVw6UdJoStvVlRZ62yAi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96316'),
  ('1039727551087530680', 'Renta Congelada', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pedro Ortiz de Pinedo', null, 'Rodrigo Murray, Juan Diego Covarrubias, Adriana Montes de Oca, Violeta Isfel, Roxana Castellanos, Harold Azuara', 'TV-14', 'Two marriages, one young and one mature, are forced to live in the same house for five years after being victims of a real estate fraud. The owner of the house, an elderly woman with Alzheimer, rented the property to both couples at a ridiculous price. Everyone believes they have found the ideal home ... Young people to start their lives and mature to live in the home that only in dreams could have had in their youth. When each of them learned that the other marriage would necessarily share the space with them, they decide to make each other''s lives impossible to force the other to leave the house. From sharing the refrigerator, to sitting at the same table will turn into a war of the field. Walking in underwear around the house or leaving the socks worn on the stairs will be the daily life of four people who must take on the biggest challenge of their lives, living in the same space with perfect strangers for five years.', 'Two marriages, one young and one mature, are forced to live in the same house for five years after being victims of a real estate fraud. The owner of the house, an elderly woman with Alzheimer, rented the property to both couples at a ridiculous price. Everyone believes they have found the ideal home ... Young people to start their lives and mature to live in the home that only in dreams could have had in their youth. When each of them learned that the other marriage would necessarily share the space with them, they decide to make each other''s lives impossible to force the other to leave the house. From sharing the refrigerator, to sitting at the same table will turn into a war of the field. Walking in underwear around the house or leaving the socks worn on the stairs will be the daily life of four people who must take on the biggest challenge of their lives, living in the same space with perfect strangers for five years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfVeTW9GmodUW2rbHHoheDCFCTj.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:77973'),
  ('800775440780556223', 'Reopen My Journals', 2025, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Li Yunrui, Huangyang Tiantian, Ni Hongjie, Yang Haoyu, Chen Heyi, Zhang Xinyi, Huang Yi, Chen Fangtong', null, '15-year-old Qian Jiayue enters a prestigious high school and faces academic challenges while navigating friendships and family dynamics. As she bonds with her new friend Chen Mo, both girls grow through their shared experiences. Meanwhile, their families grapple with life changes and generational conflicts, but the warmth of family and community support remains unchanged.', '15-year-old Qian Jiayue enters a prestigious high school and faces academic challenges while navigating friendships and family dynamics. As she bonds with her new friend Chen Mo, both girls grow through their shared experiences. Meanwhile, their families grapple with life changes and generational conflicts, but the warmth of family and community support remains unchanged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvX4P29ddg7GXQRUbifKn9D8U6q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263139'),
  ('507849549960049389', 'Replacing Chef Chico', 2023, 'Drama', 'Antoinette Jadaone', 'Antoinette Jadaone', 'Alessandra de Rossi, Piolo Pascual, Sam Milby, Joel Saracho, Yesh Anne Burce, Angie Castrence, Paulo Angeles, DMs Boongaling', 'TV-MA', 'When a head chef falls into a coma, it''s up to his devoted sous-chef to keep their Filipino fine dining restaurant from closing down.', 'When a head chef falls into a coma, it''s up to his devoted sous-chef to keep their Filipino fine dining restaurant from closing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Znp7P2ptjSiG04Lsvrx7D8ZqzG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221913'),
  ('169503801046476040', 'Replica: Revenge of the Ex-Wife', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Reina Triendl, Mayu Miyamoto, Ryo Kimura, Kento Senga, Hirona Yamazaki, Robin Furuya, Shono Hayama, Yui Yokoyama', null, 'A bullied woman vows vengeance after her husband cheats with her childhood tormentor. Reborn as a new identity through drastic transformations—even her dominant hand—she infiltrates their lives to orchestrate a brutal, calculated revenge, reigniting a toxic cycle of betrayal.', 'A bullied woman vows vengeance after her husband cheats with her childhood tormentor. Reborn as a new identity through drastic transformations—even her dominant hand—she infiltrates their lives to orchestrate a brutal, calculated revenge, reigniting a toxic cycle of betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBaFKhB3CVAXaZr9iIoSIDbBlFC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294567'),
  ('573329604254787786', 'Reply 1988', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Shin Won-ho, Lee Woo-jung', 'Kim Song-hee', 'Lee Hye-ri, Ryu Jun-yeol, Park Bo-gum, Go Kyung-pyo, Lee Dong-hwi, Ryu Hye-young, Choi Seong-won, Ahn Jae-hong', 'TV-14', 'Take a nostalgic trip back to the late 1980s through the lives of five families and their five teenage kids living in a small neighbourhood in Seoul.', 'Take a nostalgic trip back to the late 1980s through the lives of five families and their five teenage kids living in a small neighbourhood in Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3xQJlQRff4k5IMEY55l4iKaKl3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64010'),
  ('854655249250135584', 'Reply 1994', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Shin Won-ho, Lee Woo-jung', null, 'Go Ara, Jung Woo, Yoo Yeon-seok, Kim Sung-kyun, Son Ho-jun, Cha Sun-woo, Min Do-hee, Sung Dong-il', 'TV-14', 'In 1994, college students were crazy about college basketball, and Korea''s hip-hop artists; with students from various countryside areas attending college in Seoul, they mingle together for true friendship, love and lots of fun at a boarding house.', 'In 1994, college students were crazy about college basketball, and Korea''s hip-hop artists; with students from various countryside areas attending college in Seoul, they mingle together for true friendship, love and lots of fun at a boarding house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRroNKSFyetJc5gLN2M7w9FoKuE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58761'),
  ('1096337123878294988', 'Reply 1997', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shin Won-ho, Lee Woo-jung, Lee Sun-Hye', null, 'Jung Eun-ji, Seo In-guk, Eun Ji-won, Lee Ho-won, Shin So-yul, Lee Si-eon, Sung Dong-il, Lee Il-hwa', 'NR', 'As a teen, Shi Won was obsessed with a boy band. Now 33 years old, Shi Won and her friends are reviving their memories as their school reunion nears.', 'As a teen, Shi Won was obsessed with a boy band. Now 33 years old, Shi Won and her friends are reviving their memories as their school reunion nears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onW5VNmzZuDYmkSeFhtSibt0rRq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46553'),
  ('1095656921249798807', 'Report', 1998, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:315746'),
  ('876433454144160609', 'Reporters', 2015, 'Drama', 'Goldie Behl', null, 'Rajeev Khandelwal, Kritika Kamra, Anvita Bhargava, Bikramjeet Kanwarpal, Sunny Hinduja, Shivangi Verma, Alam Khan, Alefia Kapadia', null, 'Two ambitious journalists, Kabir and Ananya, work together at the KKN channel and eventually fall in love. However, when people plot to separate them, they have to overcome obstacles to stay together. It is the story of two people finding love in a complex and cut throat world of journalism … where there is no right or wrong way of looking at news AND life. Will Ananya and Kabir’s love survive when they find themselves on opposite sides of the debate on ethics? Passion for news brought them together. Will their ambitions tear them apart?', 'Two ambitious journalists, Kabir and Ananya, work together at the KKN channel and eventually fall in love. However, when people plot to separate them, they have to overcome obstacles to stay together. It is the story of two people finding love in a complex and cut throat world of journalism … where there is no right or wrong way of looking at news AND life. Will Ananya and Kabir’s love survive when they find themselves on opposite sides of the debate on ethics? Passion for news brought them together. Will their ambitions tear them apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ5AAD2RFKlR27SiwD2oTVIo9H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302431'),
  ('891399805118217301', 'Represent', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, François Uzan', null, 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Vimala Pons', 'TV-MA', 'An idealistic educator is inadvertently thrust into the French presidential race.', 'An idealistic educator is inadvertently thrust into the French presidential race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QqFilEkKSPiU2QsWShTjSf5wgM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:194899'),
  ('1074168626329970161', 'Reprisal', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Josh Corbin', null, 'Abigail Spencer, Rodrigo Santoro, Rhys Wakefield, Madison Davenport, Craig Tate, David Dastmalchian, Mena Massoud, Wavyy Jonez', 'TV-MA', 'A hyper-noir story that follows a relentless femme fatale who, after being left for dead, sets out to take revenge against her brother and his bombastic gang of gear-heads.', 'A hyper-noir story that follows a relentless femme fatale who, after being left for dead, sets out to take revenge against her brother and his bombastic gang of gear-heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwNZ6FRhJkw1u4LyFQFZGi12tt4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89314'),
  ('454192482703681172', 'Republic of Doyle', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Allan Hawco', null, 'Allan Hawco, Sean McGinley, Lynda Boyd, Krystin Pellerin, Mark O''Brien, Marthe Bernard, Bob Cole', 'TV-14', 'Jake Doyle and his ex-cop father, Malachy, run a Newfoundland detective agency. Their rugged seaside town never lacks for intriguing cases, and the Doyles don''t always land on the right side of the law.', 'Jake Doyle and his ex-cop father, Malachy, run a Newfoundland detective agency. Their rugged seaside town never lacks for intriguing cases, and the Doyles don''t always land on the right side of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6ixXBiyOrsn0nrZ7zPG6dtqAHw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:31389'),
  ('99235341421379753', 'Requiem', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Kris Mrksa', null, 'Lydia Wilson, Joel Fry, Joanna Scanlan, Brendan Coyle, Claire Rushbrook, Tara Fitzgerald, Clare Calbraith, Sian Reese-Williams', 'TV-MA', 'In 1994, a toddler disappeared from a small Welsh village, never to be seen again. 23 years later, in London, the mother of rising cello star Matilda Gray commits suicide, without apparent reason. Among her possessions, Matilda discovers tantalising evidence, linking her mother to the Welsh girl''s disappearance all those years ago.', 'In 1994, a toddler disappeared from a small Welsh village, never to be seen again. 23 years later, in London, the mother of rising cello star Matilda Gray commits suicide, without apparent reason. Among her possessions, Matilda discovers tantalising evidence, linking her mother to the Welsh girl''s disappearance all those years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahEpW6eJIc5CT3GECpXDG477aC4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76819'),
  ('329827714754128931', 'Requiem from the Darkness', 2003, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryusei Nakao, Sanae Kobayashi, Norio Wakamoto, Toshihiko Seki, Hiroshi Otake, Natsuhiko Kyogoku', 'TV-14', 'Momosuke is a young man with a dream: to travel Japan and collect one hundred stories. He journeys from place to place, searching for tales of the paranormal and bizarre, hoping to collect tales to publish in his book. However, the calm of Momosuke''s life soon is shattered by a chance meeting with three sinister beings: Mataichi the priest, Nagamimi the bird-caller, and the beautiful Ogin. Soon, Momosuke learns that there might be more to his newfound comrades than first meets the eye...', 'Momosuke is a young man with a dream: to travel Japan and collect one hundred stories. He journeys from place to place, searching for tales of the paranormal and bizarre, hoping to collect tales to publish in his book. However, the calm of Momosuke''s life soon is shattered by a chance meeting with three sinister beings: Mataichi the priest, Nagamimi the bird-caller, and the beautiful Ogin. Soon, Momosuke learns that there might be more to his newfound comrades than first meets the eye...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzHAq3IzCnzzjZrj42DnbbIpeG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34709'),
  ('1043215687776632103', 'Requiem of the Rose King', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Mitsuki Saiga, Hikaru Midorikawa, Show Hayami, Kohsuke Toriumi, Yasuaki Takumi, Satoshi Mikami, Satoshi Hino, Sayaka Ohara', 'TV-14', 'The crown of England has been hotly contested throughout history, and in the Middle Ages, a series of great civil wars became known as the War of the Roses. Claiming a right to the throne, the Duke of York seeks to unseat King Henry VI and his heir in order to become king himself.', 'The crown of England has been hotly contested throughout history, and in the Middle Ages, a series of great civil wars became known as the War of the Roses. Claiming a right to the throne, the Duke of York seeks to unseat King Henry VI and his heir in order to become king himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhoveJefmxPbQFSPJ1xTzp8qvpd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109934'),
  ('614426485801398488', 'Rescue 911', 1989, 'Drama, Documentary', null, 'Paula Deats, Jean O''Neill', 'William Shatner', 'TV-PG', 'Rescue 911 is an informational reality-based television series that premiered on April 18, 1989 and ended on August 27, 1996. The series was hosted by William Shatner and featured reenactments of emergency situations that often involved calls to 911. Though never intended as a teaching tool, various viewers used the knowledge they obtained watching the show. Two specials, titled "100 Lives Saved" and "200 Lives Saved," were dedicated to viewers who had written to CBS with their stories on how the knowledge they obtained watching the show allowed them to save the life of someone else. At least 350 lives have been saved as a result of what viewers learned from watching it. The show''s popularity coincided with the widespread adoption of the 911 emergency system, replacing standalone police and fire numbers that would vary from municipality to municipality. The number is now universally understood in the United States and Canada to be the number dialed for emergency assistance nationwide.', 'Rescue 911 is an informational reality-based television series that premiered on April 18, 1989 and ended on August 27, 1996. The series was hosted by William Shatner and featured reenactments of emergency situations that often involved calls to 911. Though never intended as a teaching tool, various viewers used the knowledge they obtained watching the show. Two specials, titled "100 Lives Saved" and "200 Lives Saved," were dedicated to viewers who had written to CBS with their stories on how the knowledge they obtained watching the show allowed them to save the life of someone else. At least 350 lives have been saved as a result of what viewers learned from watching it. The show''s popularity coincided with the widespread adoption of the 911 emergency system, replacing standalone police and fire numbers that would vary from municipality to municipality. The number is now universally understood in the United States and Canada to be the number dialed for emergency assistance nationwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cm3d7XZqwGnNEu9UI5pkLLPz1W.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:10477'),
  ('922900139035813327', 'Rescue Me', 2004, 'Drama', 'Peter Tolan, Denis Leary', null, 'Denis Leary, Adam Ferrara, Andrea Roth, John Scurti, Daniel Sunjata, Michael Lombardi, Steven Pasquale, Larenz Tate', 'TV-MA', 'The aftermath of 9/11 has left the firefighters of the NYFD traumatized, and no one more so than Tommy Gavin. Recently separated from his wife and their three kids, Tommy drifts between sorrow and anger as he tries to shake the recurring nightmares of his fallen comrades, especially his late cousin, Jimmy Keefe. Working alongside veterans like Lt. “Lou” Shea, Franco Rivera and Sean Garrity, and rookie Mike Lombardi, Tommy battles alcohol and drugs as he struggles to remain first and foremost a New York City firefighter.', 'The aftermath of 9/11 has left the firefighters of the NYFD traumatized, and no one more so than Tommy Gavin. Recently separated from his wife and their three kids, Tommy drifts between sorrow and anger as he tries to shake the recurring nightmares of his fallen comrades, especially his late cousin, Jimmy Keefe. Working alongside veterans like Lt. “Lou” Shea, Franco Rivera and Sean Garrity, and rookie Mike Lombardi, Tommy battles alcohol and drugs as he struggles to remain first and foremost a New York City firefighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnOwOb82chSJkQEZ9pd6jf2ZrEX.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4344'),
  ('332277989822029629', 'Rescue: HI-Surf', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Matt Kester', null, 'Robbie Magasiva, Arielle Kebbel, Adam Demos, Kekoa Kekumano, Zoe Cipres, Alex Aiono', 'TV-14', 'Follow the dedicated, heroic, and adrenaline-seeking lifeguards of the North Shore of O''ahu as they save people''s lives in the difficult and often life-threatening conditions of Hawaii''s Seven Mile Miracle.', 'Follow the dedicated, heroic, and adrenaline-seeking lifeguards of the North Shore of O''ahu as they save people''s lives in the difficult and often life-threatening conditions of Hawaii''s Seven Mile Miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSJzFmxU2kG3qU9fLkEJFiQQHPS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227854'),
  ('100869717377338476', 'Rescue: Special Ops', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sarah Smith, Julie McGauran', null, 'Daniel Amalm, Gigi Edgley, Katherine Hicks, Les Hill, Andrew Lees, Peter Phelps, Libby Tanner', null, 'Rescue: Special Ops is an Australian television drama series that first screened on the Nine Network in 2009. Filmed in and around Sydney, the program is produced by Southern Star Group with the assistance of Screen Australia and the New South Wales Government. This drama series focuses on a team of experienced professional paramedics who specialise in rescue operations. It premiered on Sunday 2 August 2009, and the season finale of the first season aired on Sunday 25 October. A second season screened from 28 June 2010. The third and final season consisting of 22 episodes screened from 30 May 2011. The Nine Network has confirmed it will not be renewing Rescue Special Ops for a fourth season.', 'Rescue: Special Ops is an Australian television drama series that first screened on the Nine Network in 2009. Filmed in and around Sydney, the program is produced by Southern Star Group with the assistance of Screen Australia and the New South Wales Government. This drama series focuses on a team of experienced professional paramedics who specialise in rescue operations. It premiered on Sunday 2 August 2009, and the season finale of the first season aired on Sunday 25 October. A second season screened from 28 June 2010. The third and final season consisting of 22 episodes screened from 30 May 2011. The Nine Network has confirmed it will not be renewing Rescue Special Ops for a fourth season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doqymbPdJNLpkkEOhvlRALidJGb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:21592'),
  ('330195499054509836', 'Research Unit', 2006, 'Crime', 'Steven Bawol, Dominique Lancelot', null, 'Xavier Deluc', null, 'The Section de recherches is a special unit of the Gendarmerie nationale, responsible for the most complex cases. In Bordeaux (from 2006 to 2013) and then in Nice (since 2014), child abductions, disappearances, heinous or sexual crimes are the daily lot of the investigators in this research unit. In the search for witnesses, the team is authorised to extend its investigations beyond France''s borders.', 'The Section de recherches is a special unit of the Gendarmerie nationale, responsible for the most complex cases. In Bordeaux (from 2006 to 2013) and then in Nice (since 2014), child abductions, disappearances, heinous or sexual crimes are the daily lot of the investigators in this research unit. In the search for witnesses, the team is authorised to extend its investigations beyond France''s borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gClAGMFp5J2vzs8CDbCBMQzk02v.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:65438'),
  ('136102924356722207', 'Reservation Dogs', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Taika Waititi, Sterlin Harjo', null, 'Devery Jacobs, D''Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai, Lane Factor, Paulina Alexis', 'TV-MA', 'Four Indigenous teenagers in rural Oklahoma steal, rob and save in order to get to the exotic, mysterious and faraway land of California.', 'Four Indigenous teenagers in rural Oklahoma steal, rob and save in order to get to the exotic, mysterious and faraway land of California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6hqwD5oQRGgNrZKN71BQYxteC1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95215'),
  ('1028774428330125747', 'Reset', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Huang Kai Wen, Passsee Mu', 'Zhao Jinmai, Bai Jingting, Liu Yijun, Liu Tao, Huang Jue, Liu Dan, Fan Shuaiqi, Song Jiateng', null, 'The lives of a college student and a video game designer are kept being reset after an explosion on a bus. During each reset, they have to work together to find out what the reason for the explosion is. Will these two be able to save themselves and their fellow passengers? Will they be able to close the time-loop?', 'The lives of a college student and a video game designer are kept being reset after an explosion on a bus. During each reset, they have to work together to find out what the reason for the explosion is. Will these two be able to save themselves and their fellow passengers? Will they be able to close the time-loop?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceAOKLPjGUbCOYtxXK7pQfpVVwb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155441'),
  ('878209113036059531', 'Reset', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Crystaljade', null, 'Ponlawit Ketprapakorn, Tadsapon Wiwitawan, Thanawat Uthaikitwanit, Chalongrat Nobsamrong, Tanatat Kunaneksin, Worawat Boonchuen, Thakrit Chaiwut, Christopher Tyler Chindapol', null, 'Killed by betrayal on the night of his greatest triumph, an actor wakes 25 years earlier—ready to rewrite his fate and crush rivals who ruined him.', 'Killed by betrayal on the night of his greatest triumph, an actor wakes 25 years earlier—ready to rewrite his fate and crush rivals who ruined him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4jNDqi6kNoNzG8aNGqg5PjzlXo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279345'),
  ('628724787888609190', 'Resident Advisors', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Alex Jenkins Reid, Taylor Jenkins Reid, Natalia Anderson', null, 'Ryan Hansen, Jamie Chung, Andrew Bachelor, Juliette Goglia, Alison Rich, Graham Rogers, Daryl Sabara', 'TV-14', 'Resident Advisors is an outrageous comedy set in the most hormonally-overloaded, sexually active, out-of-control workplace in the world: a college dorm. The show follows a group of resident assistants as they navigate sex, drugs, and midterms.', 'Resident Advisors is an outrageous comedy set in the most hormonally-overloaded, sexually active, out-of-control workplace in the world: a college dorm. The show follows a group of resident assistants as they navigate sex, drugs, and midterms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55XW1s5f9Wj7OqpKd3Ep28VBXcE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62321'),
  ('957558974845349452', 'Resident Alien', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Sheridan', null, 'Alan Tudyk, Sara Tomko, Corey Reynolds, Alice Wetterlund, Levi Fiehler, Elizabeth Bowen, Meredith Garretson, Judah Prehn', 'TV-14', 'Crash-landed alien Harry takes on the identity of a small-town Colorado doctor. Arriving with a secret mission, he starts off living a simple life…but things get a bit rocky when he’s roped into solving a local murder and realizes he needs to assimilate into his new world. As he does, he begins to wrestle with the moral dilemma of his mission and asking the big life questions like: “Are human beings worth saving?” and “Why do they fold their pizza before eating it?”', 'Crash-landed alien Harry takes on the identity of a small-town Colorado doctor. Arriving with a secret mission, he starts off living a simple life…but things get a bit rocky when he’s roped into solving a local murder and realizes he needs to assimilate into his new world. As he does, he begins to wrestle with the moral dilemma of his mission and asking the big life questions like: “Are human beings worth saving?” and “Why do they fold their pizza before eating it?”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5van3ktOTqWr5lcixh5aR8NlqqW.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:96580'),
  ('783857417659046231', 'Resident Evil', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Andrew Dabb', null, 'Ella Balinska, Tamara Smart, Siena Agudong, Adeline Rudolph, Paola Nuñez, Lance Reddick, Lea Vivier', 'TV-MA', 'Nearly three decades after the discovery of the T-virus, an outbreak reveals the Umbrella Corporation''s dark secrets. Based on the horror franchise.', 'Nearly three decades after the discovery of the T-virus, an outbreak reveals the Umbrella Corporation''s dark secrets. Based on the horror franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmLvn4w4HMdxobPkjmIqrhJiXDO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108296'),
  ('518568423766395852', 'RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nick Apostolides, Stephanie Panisello, Jona Xiao, Ray Chase, Brad Venable, Doug Stone', 'TV-MA', 'Years after the horrors of Raccoon City, Leon and Claire find themselves consumed by a dark conspiracy when a viral attack ravages the White House.', 'Years after the horrors of Raccoon City, Leon and Claire find themselves consumed by a dark conspiracy when a viral attack ravages the White House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWwTjKER5a8LRUGHrw86VU0gUy1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110642'),
  ('746584083157493987', 'Resident Playbook', 2025, 'Drama', 'Shin Won-ho, Lee Woo-jung', 'Kim Song-hee', 'Go Youn-jung, Shin Sia, Kang You-seok, Han Ye-ji, Jung Jun-won, Lee Bong-ryeon, Lee Chang-hoon, Son Ji-yoon', null, 'First-year OBGYN residents at Yulje Medical Center navigate the chaos of their work and personal lives, all in their quest to become exceptional doctors.', 'First-year OBGYN residents at Yulje Medical Center navigate the chaos of their work and personal lives, all in their quest to become exceptional doctors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB5Tu1Rzq6guKsMhV59aszN9c0a.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235355'),
  ('211698524061120395', 'Residue', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Harrison', 'Alex Garcia Lopez', 'Natalia Tena, Iwan Rheon, Jamie Draven, Danny Webb, Franz Drameh, Adrian Schiller, Eleanor Matsuura, Richenda Carey', 'TV-MA', 'The government cover-up of the causes behind a massive explosion in a futuristic UK metropolis spur photo journalist Jennifer Preston on to search for the truth and in the process blow open a paranormal phenomenon haunting the city.', 'The government cover-up of the causes behind a massive explosion in a futuristic UK metropolis spur photo journalist Jennifer Preston on to search for the truth and in the process blow open a paranormal phenomenon haunting the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wGU9pJbzZdygZizEGOl9TwAP8w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66373'),
  ('818797020079211405', 'Resistance', 2019, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Colin Teevan', 'Colin Teevan', 'Brian Gleeson, Simone Kirby, Natasha O''Keeffe, David Wilmot, Craig Parkinson, Paul Ritter, Stanley Townsend, Michael Ford-FitzGerald', 'TV-MA', 'This follow up to the Rebellion miniseries unfolds at the height of what became known as Ireland''s War of Independence, and follows the lives of those caught up in the vicissitudes of history.', 'This follow up to the Rebellion miniseries unfolds at the height of what became known as Ireland''s War of Independence, and follows the lives of those caught up in the vicissitudes of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S1og2VNZ70cVaLCE0ykTh5AOqB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86128'),
  ('1030665956905220122', 'Resort', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vijay Kumar', null, 'Vijay Kumar, Thalaivasal Vijay, Amar Keerthy, Pranika/Abeneya, Dharshna Sripal, Sai Dhanyaa, Giri Dwarakish, Lallu Prasath', null, 'A debt-ridden room service boy rises to challenge a ruthless kitchen at a luxurious beachside haven.', 'A debt-ridden room service boy rises to challenge a ruthless kitchen at a luxurious beachside haven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97eNYDXNMcnl1X1iXzUJqEw4A5w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315038'),
  ('929192131481452322', 'Respect', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ercan Mehmet Erdem', 'Ercan Mehmet Erdem', 'Nejat İşler, Miray Daner, Boran Kuzum, Erkan Can, Sarp Akkaya, Damla Sönmez, Rojda Demirer, Tansu Biçer', null, 'The protagonist of the story, Ercüment Çözer rebels against disrespect and rudeness that we tend to avoid, ignore and eventually forget. Ercüment Çözer is a sociopath obsessed with the idea of respect. However, this time, he is not alone on his obsessive journey. The young lovers Helen and Savas, who have just stepped foot into the real world, find themselves in the middle of difficult situations after being mistreated by a group of people and end up being responsible for a chain of murders that take place in Istanbul. The concept of disrespect instantly turns into a social and mediatic struggle between the two generations. As for the mediatic follow up, Turkey’s most famous morning show host, Hasret will undertake it, however, nobody knows that she is also about to take part in this journey on another level. By getting to the core of this obsession, we will be witnessing the reflection it has on society.', 'The protagonist of the story, Ercüment Çözer rebels against disrespect and rudeness that we tend to avoid, ignore and eventually forget. Ercüment Çözer is a sociopath obsessed with the idea of respect. However, this time, he is not alone on his obsessive journey. The young lovers Helen and Savas, who have just stepped foot into the real world, find themselves in the middle of difficult situations after being mistreated by a group of people and end up being responsible for a chain of murders that take place in Istanbul. The concept of disrespect instantly turns into a social and mediatic struggle between the two generations. As for the mediatic follow up, Turkey’s most famous morning show host, Hasret will undertake it, however, nobody knows that she is also about to take part in this journey on another level. By getting to the core of this obsession, we will be witnessing the reflection it has on society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh3xwYiW0lcFdbdkNK2YpZnBdsv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:112167'),
