  ('279853863209275648', 'Restaurant to Another World', 2017, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Junichi Suwabe, Tomokazu Sugita, Hochu Otsuka, Kiyono Yasuno, Saori Onishi', 'TV-14', 'There is a certain restaurant in the first basement level of a multi-tenant building in one corner of a shopping street near the office district. The historical restaurant, marked by a sign with a picture of a cat, is called "Western Cuisine Nekoya." This restaurant looks completely normal through the week, but on Saturdays, it opens in secret exclusively to some very unique guests. During these hours, doors in various areas of a parallel world open to allow customers of many different races and cultures into the restaurant.', 'There is a certain restaurant in the first basement level of a multi-tenant building in one corner of a shopping street near the office district. The historical restaurant, marked by a sign with a picture of a cat, is called "Western Cuisine Nekoya." This restaurant looks completely normal through the week, but on Saturdays, it opens in secret exclusively to some very unique guests. During these hours, doors in various areas of a parallel world open to allow customers of many different races and cultures into the restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3Um55vfwHDPxvo6jmOr1zDLbDz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72425'),
  ('893658795063418337', 'Restaurant: Impossible', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Robert Irvine', 'TV-G', 'Chef Robert Irvine tries to turn around restaurants across America that are facing an impending demise if things don''t improve. With a $10,000 budget and two days to work, Irvine uses his creativity and resourcefulness to turn the eatery''s fortunes around.', 'Chef Robert Irvine tries to turn around restaurants across America that are facing an impending demise if things don''t improve. With a $10,000 budget and two days to work, Irvine uses his creativity and resourcefulness to turn the eatery''s fortunes around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5lCbuk4obBqUtlx1969wSD0qNh.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:35358'),
