  ('587330765767570778', 'Return of the Written Off', 1978, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Dragan Marković', null, 'Pavle Vuisić, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Vojislav Brajović, Zlata Petković, Aleksandar Berček, Stevo Žigon', null, 'In Summer of 1944 Prle and Tihi, young yet veteran resistance fighters, together with Joca, old and moody radio-operator, are sent by Partisans to Belgrade, the Yugoslav capital still under Nazi occupation. As victorious Partisan forces approach, Prle, Tihi and Joca must continue their underground work in order to prepare the city for liberation.', 'In Summer of 1944 Prle and Tihi, young yet veteran resistance fighters, together with Joca, old and moody radio-operator, are sent by Partisans to Belgrade, the Yugoslav capital still under Nazi occupation. As victorious Partisan forces approach, Prle, Tihi and Joca must continue their underground work in order to prepare the city for liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgj8XT0NUKbPivcAhmR5c4T26wc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86484'),
  ('757964534504440768', 'Return of Ultraman', 1971, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Jiro Dan, Nobuo Tsukamoto, Jun Negami, Mika Katsuragi, Shunsuke Ikeda, Wataru Mitsui, Kazuko Iwasaki, Susumu Fujita', null, 'In a fight between two giant monsters named Takkong and Zazahn, young race car driver Hideki Go is killed while trying to rescue a little boy and a dog from the falling rubble. His valiant sacrifice is noted by everyone, even his friends and the new defense force MAT, but an unseen being also takes notice. Looking over Go is the "New Ultraman", who is so touched by Go''s actions that he decides to combine his life force with that of Hideki, thus bringing him back to life. Hideki Go then joins the MAT and fights alongside them and Ultraman against monsters and alien invaders.', 'In a fight between two giant monsters named Takkong and Zazahn, young race car driver Hideki Go is killed while trying to rescue a little boy and a dog from the falling rubble. His valiant sacrifice is noted by everyone, even his friends and the new defense force MAT, but an unseen being also takes notice. Looking over Go is the "New Ultraman", who is so touched by Go''s actions that he decides to combine his life force with that of Hideki, thus bringing him back to life. Hideki Go then joins the MAT and fights alongside them and Ultraman against monsters and alien invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBSiT35A9W3Kv0RFxxVPbc7Z9fk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4580'),
  ('923999907900439561', 'Return to Amish', 2014, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Jeremiah Raber, Sabrina High, Carmela Mendez Raber, Ada Byler, Maureen Byler, Rosanna Miller, Danny Byler, Fanny Schmucker', 'TV-14', 'The "Breaking Amish" cast are reunited in Pennsylvania, where Abe, Jeremiah, Rebecca and Sabrina are living, though Kate resides in New York City.', 'The "Breaking Amish" cast are reunited in Pennsylvania, where Abe, Jeremiah, Rebecca and Sabrina are living, though Kate resides in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCj0hRGdKSIbR7BCoMQTGDUzEx6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:64989'),
  ('416283189852838363', 'Return to Eden', 1983, 'Drama', 'Michael Laurence', 'Michael Laurence', 'Rebecca Gilling, James Smillie, Daniel Abineri, Peta Toppano, Megan Williams, Peter Cousens, Nicki Paull, Wendy Playfair', null, 'Stephanie Harper is rich but insecure 40 year old heiress with two failed marriages behind her. Stephanie believes that she has found true love with tennis pro Greg Marsden, but after the wedding, Greg promptly begins an affair with Stephanie’s best friend Jilly Stewart. Whilst on their honeymoon, Greg pushes Stephanie into a crocodile-infested swamp, and he and Jilly watch as she is apparently mauled to death. However, Stephanie miraculously survives and goes to an island clinic where she meets Dr. Dan Marshall, a brilliant plastic surgeon who uses his talents to repair her face and body. Using her new identity and fortune, she plots her revenge on Greg and Jilly and aims to take back what is rightfully hers.', 'Stephanie Harper is rich but insecure 40 year old heiress with two failed marriages behind her. Stephanie believes that she has found true love with tennis pro Greg Marsden, but after the wedding, Greg promptly begins an affair with Stephanie’s best friend Jilly Stewart. Whilst on their honeymoon, Greg pushes Stephanie into a crocodile-infested swamp, and he and Jilly watch as she is apparently mauled to death. However, Stephanie miraculously survives and goes to an island clinic where she meets Dr. Dan Marshall, a brilliant plastic surgeon who uses his talents to repair her face and body. Using her new identity and fortune, she plots her revenge on Greg and Jilly and aims to take back what is rightfully hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5tRlIwUgV5SRQLiM105D3hfegf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:727'),
  ('489050152116367962', 'Return to Lonesome Dove', 1993, 'Drama, Western', null, 'John Wilder', 'Jon Voight, Barbara Hershey, Rick Schroder, William Petersen, Oliver Reed, Dennis Haysbert, Reese Witherspoon, Timothy Scott', 'TV-14', 'After returning the body of Gus McCrae to Lonesome Dove, Woodrow Call takes on the challenge of driving a herd of wild mustangs 2500 miles north to the Hat Creek Ranch in Montana. But tragedy, triumph, despair and deceit will greet him before he ever gets there.', 'After returning the body of Gus McCrae to Lonesome Dove, Woodrow Call takes on the challenge of driving a herd of wild mustangs 2500 miles north to the Hat Creek Ranch in Montana. But tragedy, triumph, despair and deceit will greet him before he ever gets there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuCU3QJqtCXVfd1okAptVOU221.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5742'),
  ('401515691595857531', 'Return to Paradise', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Mattessi, Robert Thorogood, James Hall', null, 'Anna Samson, Lloyd Griffith, Tai Hara, Catherine McClements, Celia Ireland, Aaron L. McGrath', null, 'DI Mackenzie Clarke is forced to leave London under a cloud of suspicion and return to the last place she ever wanted to be, her hometown of Dolphin Cove, Australia where her tenacity and work ethic helps her solve murder mysteries.', 'DI Mackenzie Clarke is forced to leave London under a cloud of suspicion and return to the last place she ever wanted to be, her hometown of Dolphin Cove, Australia where her tenacity and work ethic helps her solve murder mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Hx7H3MndGK4c4joXKeEW9GIeqs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:244978'),
  ('742682336730911745', 'Return to the Planet of the Apes', 1975, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Friz Freleng, David H. DePatie, Pierre Boulle', null, 'Austin Stoker, Philippa Harris, Henry Corden, Richard Blackburn, Edwin Mills, Claudette Nevins, Tom Williams', 'TV-G', 'While on a mission, three astronauts in their spaceship get caught in a time vortex. They return to Earth in the year 3979 A.D. and discover that intelligent apes are now the highest form of life.', 'While on a mission, three astronauts in their spaceship get caught in a time vortex. They return to Earth in the year 3979 A.D. and discover that intelligent apes are now the highest form of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBNoK9xCFSwsiVEBsJ9v2Kn3ViM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12443'),
