  ('9718609976502479', 'Reunion: The Sound of the Providence', 2020, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, 'Deng Yue, Nan Ji Yue, Fei Dawei', 'Zhu Yilong, Mao Xiaotong, Hu Jun, Baron Chen, Huang Junjie, Chen Minghao, Maggie Huang', null, 'Ten years after their last mission, the famed tomb raiders Wu Xie, Wang Pang Zi, and Zhang Qi Ling have moved on, believing their days of adventure are behind them. Wu Xie, battling a lung illness, receives a mysterious text from his adventurous uncle that prompts him to reunite with his friends. Together, they uncover a perilous world filled with supernatural threats and scheming villains, posing an existential danger to humanity.', 'Ten years after their last mission, the famed tomb raiders Wu Xie, Wang Pang Zi, and Zhang Qi Ling have moved on, believing their days of adventure are behind them. Wu Xie, battling a lung illness, receives a mysterious text from his adventurous uncle that prompts him to reunite with his friends. Together, they uncover a perilous world filled with supernatural threats and scheming villains, posing an existential danger to humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0eijnpfbPFbv1Xoxkn034oH4pu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105962'),
  ('818995089765925462', 'Reunited Apart', 2020, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'Josh Gad reunites the cast and crews of various classic movies, and discusses the the films in hilarious yet heartfelt conversations.', 'Josh Gad reunites the cast and crews of various classic movies, and discusses the the films in hilarious yet heartfelt conversations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1o2EkmtYw8hMFeebobxppmDUDy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113445'),
  ('513704034374936238', 'Reunited Worlds', 2017, 'Drama', 'Baek Su-chan', 'Lee Hee-myung', 'Yeo Jin-goo, Lee Yeon-hee, Ahn Jae-hyun, Lee Si-eon, Kim Jin-woo, Kwak Dong-yeon, Kim Ga-eun, Park Jin-joo', null, 'Although born in the same year, two childhood friends end up being 13 years apart because they have aged surprisingly at different places (worlds) for some strange reason. Now Eom Hyeon Soo is a 31-year-old woman but Sung Hae Sung is still a 18-year-old boy. Cha Won Yooung is a chef also interested in Eom Hyeon Soo.', 'Although born in the same year, two childhood friends end up being 13 years apart because they have aged surprisingly at different places (worlds) for some strange reason. Now Eom Hyeon Soo is a 31-year-old woman but Sung Hae Sung is still a 18-year-old boy. Cha Won Yooung is a chef also interested in Eom Hyeon Soo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxLilCdazLeEaxAXz1nZBdXLbxF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72549'),
