  ('261006249663220121', 'Revenge', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mike Kelley', null, 'Emily VanCamp, Madeleine Stowe, Nick Wechsler, Gabriel Mann, Karine Vanasse, James Tupper, Elena Satine, Brian Hallisay', 'TV-14', 'When Emily Thorne moves to the Hamptons, everyone wonders about the new girl, but she knows everything about them, including what they did to her family. Years ago, they took everything from her. Now, one by one, she''s going to make them pay.', 'When Emily Thorne moves to the Hamptons, everyone wonders about the new girl, but she knows everything about them, including what they did to her family. Years ago, they took everything from her. Now, one by one, she''s going to make them pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx7XytRgg1F03NN5BoK8jx3Cyft.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39358'),
  ('179073222707608851', 'Revenge Body With Khloe Kardashian', 2017, 'Reality', 'Khloé Kardashian', null, 'Khloé Kardashian', 'TV-14', 'By gaining confidence and control over their lives, maybe even for the first time, Khloé Kardashian and a team of Hollywood''s best trainers and glam squads help two individuals per episode re-create themselves.', 'By gaining confidence and control over their lives, maybe even for the first time, Khloé Kardashian and a team of Hollywood''s best trainers and glam squads help two individuals per episode re-create themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sUkBqHKCsj63waPWsqTBE0UlVU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69604'),
  ('1072622367830127628', 'Revenge of Others', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Lee Hee-myung', 'Shin Ye-eun, Lomon, Seo Ji-hoon, Chae Sang-woo, Lee Soo-min, Chung Su-bin, Kim Joo-ryoung, Wooyeon', 'TV-MA', 'A boy falls to his death at school, but Ok Chan-mi does not believe that her twin brother, Park Won-seok, committed suicide. Chan-mi transfers to her brother''s school, Yongtan High, and meets Ji Soo-heon, who witnessed her brother''s death. A "hero," who avenges bullied students, appears at Yongtan High. Chan-mi speculates that it may be connected to her brother and starts looking for this hero.', 'A boy falls to his death at school, but Ok Chan-mi does not believe that her twin brother, Park Won-seok, committed suicide. Chan-mi transfers to her brother''s school, Yongtan High, and meets Ji Soo-heon, who witnessed her brother''s death. A "hero," who avenges bullied students, appears at Yongtan High. Chan-mi speculates that it may be connected to her brother and starts looking for this hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccej6D8J81DDJWqhP7OG6PA6xcl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208336'),
  ('378109010223999405', 'Revenge of the False Bride', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Han Donglin, Zhang Wanying, Wang Zining, Wang Jianing, Yang Qianya, Wang Yubo, Chen Jie, Lu Yuwen', null, 'Li Muhe, an orphan driven by revenge, returns under the identity of Shen Nian and enters a strategic marriage with young marshal Lu Yueting. As she navigates complex family and political schemes, Lu Yueting becomes both her protector and ally. However, the reappearance of a former comrade raises suspicions about his past, complicating their relationship. Amid growing external threats and internal conspiracies, Li Muhe must confront her past and decide between vengeance and love.', 'Li Muhe, an orphan driven by revenge, returns under the identity of Shen Nian and enters a strategic marriage with young marshal Lu Yueting. As she navigates complex family and political schemes, Lu Yueting becomes both her protector and ally. However, the reappearance of a former comrade raises suspicions about his past, complicating their relationship. Amid growing external threats and internal conspiracies, Li Muhe must confront her past and decide between vengeance and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fi0STAsqeOHEccAP1OUHJQ6aSWv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318892'),
  ('911543274980310975', 'Revenged Love', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Chai Jidan, Gong Yu Shi', 'Chai Jidan', 'Zi Yu, Tian Xuning, Liu Xuancheng, Zhan Xuan, Liu Jun, Wang Shuo, Sun Qianyu', null, 'After Wu Suo-wei''s girlfriend dumps him, he decides to get revenge by seducing her new boyfriend, Chi Cheng! It started as a game, but falling in love was never part of the plan.', 'After Wu Suo-wei''s girlfriend dumps him, he decides to get revenge by seducing her new boyfriend, Chi Cheng! It started as a game, but falling in love was never part of the plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5KWzpPAi4JC42GGrVWDFL6G2gY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292035'),
  ('118793826800587556', 'Revenger', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Jun Kasama, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Hisako Kanemoto, Shota Hayama, Takehito Koyasu, Akio Otsuka, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'TV-MA', 'As master assassin Usui Yuen looks into a series of assassinations made on the grand samurai clan, the Satsuma, he encounters Kurima Raizo, member and survivor of one of the attacks. Together, they discover the true nature of these murders is bigger than over stolen resources. As they get closer to the truth, will they come out alive to exact revenge?', 'As master assassin Usui Yuen looks into a series of assassinations made on the grand samurai clan, the Satsuma, he encounters Kurima Raizo, member and survivor of one of the attacks. Together, they discover the true nature of these murders is bigger than over stolen resources. As they get closer to the truth, will they come out alive to exact revenge?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvtmguMWDFThuiRpjfIp4QC37yG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211297'),
  ('151960751924569669', 'Reverie', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Mickey Fisher', null, 'Sarah Shahi, Dennis Haysbert, Sendhil Ramamurthy, Jessica Lu, Kathryn Morris', 'TV-14', 'A former detective specializing in human behavior is brought in when the launch of an advanced virtual reality program has dangerous and unintended consequences.', 'A former detective specializing in human behavior is brought in when the launch of an advanced virtual reality program has dangerous and unintended consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNwsswTgAX1dd9sb61pb5rYGfUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71716'),
  ('98093065008193330', 'Reverse', 2017, 'Mystery', null, 'Yukako Shimizu, Satoko Okudera', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Erika Toda, Yuta Tamamori, Teppei Koike, Takahiro Miura, Hayato Ichihara, Mugi Kadowaki, YOU', null, 'Kazuhisa Fukase graduated from a prestigious university, but he leads a boring life. His only strength is making delicious coffee. Whenever he makes coffee, he is reminded of his friend Yoshiki Hirosawa. He was friends with Yoshiki Hirosawa back in their university days, but Yoshiki Hirosawa died on a snowboarding trip 10 years ago. One day, he meets Mihoko Ochi at a coffee shop. He is strongly attracted to her. Kazuhisa Fukase goes to a professor’s retirement celebration at a university. There, he meets Kosuke Asai who went snowboarding with Yoshiki Hirosawa on that fateful trip. Journalist Toshio Ogasawara also appears there. He has been investigating Yoshiki Hirosawa''s death.', 'Kazuhisa Fukase graduated from a prestigious university, but he leads a boring life. His only strength is making delicious coffee. Whenever he makes coffee, he is reminded of his friend Yoshiki Hirosawa. He was friends with Yoshiki Hirosawa back in their university days, but Yoshiki Hirosawa died on a snowboarding trip 10 years ago. One day, he meets Mihoko Ochi at a coffee shop. He is strongly attracted to her. Kazuhisa Fukase goes to a professor’s retirement celebration at a university. There, he meets Kosuke Asai who went snowboarding with Yoshiki Hirosawa on that fateful trip. Journalist Toshio Ogasawara also appears there. He has been investigating Yoshiki Hirosawa''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzVHmbWD5MI8cXHtpMoy7E42NQ4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70901'),
  ('563336957747339297', 'Reverse', 2026, 'Mystery, Drama', '임건중', '임건중', 'Seo Ji-hye, Go Soo, Kim Jae-kyung, Ku Sung-hwan, Shim Hyung-tak, Lee Hyun-kyoung, Min Kim', null, 'After spending 15 years consumed by revenge, a woman loses all her memories in a sudden accident, and as she searches for her past, she’s drawn toward a dangerous truth she never expected.', 'After spending 15 years consumed by revenge, a woman loses all her memories in a sudden accident, and as she searches for her past, she’s drawn toward a dangerous truth she never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bUi3PJb5LzjvSc2l91ybX1MyyT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284000'),
  ('211515252265373443', 'Reverse 4 You', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Zezeho', null, 'Methakarn Anektanasuwan, Gulasatree Michalsky, Natnicha Polsombat, Thitinan Rattanathitinan, Moniejaya Tanaryan, Jirapat Rakkapoomphan, Apasra Lertprasert, Chotika Prapasjetsada', null, 'One sister foretells the future, and the other controls time. When a promised love seems doomed to tragedy, the pair sets out to change fate itself.', 'One sister foretells the future, and the other controls time. When a promised love seems doomed to tragedy, the pair sets out to change fate itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHeQhPlwuWfIxzJowyLBJo1qC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216937'),
  ('88729271583564287', 'Reverse with Me', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nattamon Chokejindachai, Pitchatorn Santinatornkul, Natruja Chutiwansopon, Jennis Oprasert, Kanteera Wadcharathadsanakul, Isarapa Thawatpakdee, Tanakorn Tiyanont, Talay Sanguandikul', null, 'Karan and Kliao Khluen, two souls bound by a love nurtured within the realm of dreams. Traveling back in time, they seek to mend the fractures of the past. Yet, altering the past unleashed unforeseen consequences, some beyond the reach of even time itself.', 'Karan and Kliao Khluen, two souls bound by a love nurtured within the realm of dreams. Traveling back in time, they seek to mend the fractures of the past. Yet, altering the past unleashed unforeseen consequences, some beyond the reach of even time itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idu4BADOJei6SXQsBOf1M0P0u0s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262707'),
  ('139517661592333466', 'RevEvolution', 2011, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Qing Zu, 陆双, Ran Zhao, Yuebin Ju, 邓红, Quansheng Gao, Tuan Li', null, 'An animated series produced by Guangzhou Blue Arc Culture Communication Co. It is directed by Wang Wei. Now has produced two animation and a live-action web series.', 'An animated series produced by Guangzhou Blue Arc Culture Communication Co. It is directed by Wang Wei. Now has produced two animation and a live-action web series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RUymVvJKBT2Lt1HtICxrPSJVc3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104609'),
  ('12850958875679874', 'Review', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Andy Daly', null, 'Andy Daly, Megan Stevenson, Jessica St. Clair, James Urbaniak, Tara Karsian, H. Michael Croner, Kaden Gibson', 'TV-14', 'A review of a movie, or a restaurant, or a car—or whatever else that typically falls under a critic''s domain—is all well and good, and can even be helpful at times. But how can one find out about myriad other experiences that are never tackled in reviews? Enter Forrest MacNeil, a critic who goes beyond overviews of life''s more-common subjects—way beyond—to satisfy the curiosity of others: The adrenaline rush of stealing; the danger of drug addiction; the delight of sleeping with a celebrity. MacNeil tries anything suggested by viewers of his TV show, then presents a 1-to-5-star review. But his unwavering commitment to experiencing intense adventures means he must deal with the unintended consequences of such a goal.', 'A review of a movie, or a restaurant, or a car—or whatever else that typically falls under a critic''s domain—is all well and good, and can even be helpful at times. But how can one find out about myriad other experiences that are never tackled in reviews? Enter Forrest MacNeil, a critic who goes beyond overviews of life''s more-common subjects—way beyond—to satisfy the curiosity of others: The adrenaline rush of stealing; the danger of drug addiction; the delight of sleeping with a celebrity. MacNeil tries anything suggested by viewers of his TV show, then presents a 1-to-5-star review. But his unwavering commitment to experiencing intense adventures means he must deal with the unintended consequences of such a goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igseZf0ClaW0kzqnAIORuXjNxkR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62611'),
  ('717539158566351028', 'revisions', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Mikako Komatsu, Rie Takahashi, Manaka Iwami, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yoko Hikasa, Takahiro Sakurai, Soma Saito', 'TV-14', 'When Shibuya time-warps to 2388, high schooler Daisuke and his friends are conscripted by AHRV agent Milo to fight the hostile cyborg race, revisions.', 'When Shibuya time-warps to 2388, high schooler Daisuke and his friends are conscripted by AHRV agent Milo to fight the hostile cyborg race, revisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iN1ht9ZP9qEsbkpYPwI2OGK4bb6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83105'),
  ('850756279383970530', 'Revival', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Aaron B. Koontz, Luke Boyce', null, 'Melanie Scrofano, Romy Weltman, David James Elliott, Andy McQueen', 'TV-14', 'On one miraculous day in rural Wisconsin, the recently deceased suddenly rise from their graves. But this is no zombie story, as the ''revived'' appear and act just like they once were. When local officer and single mother Dana Cypress is unexpectedly thrown into the center of a brutal murder mystery of her own, she''s left to make sense of the chaos amidst a town gripped by fear and confusion where everyone, alive or undead, is a suspect.', 'On one miraculous day in rural Wisconsin, the recently deceased suddenly rise from their graves. But this is no zombie story, as the ''revived'' appear and act just like they once were. When local officer and single mother Dana Cypress is unexpectedly thrown into the center of a brutal murder mystery of her own, she''s left to make sense of the chaos amidst a town gripped by fear and confusion where everyone, alive or undead, is a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf2u02mLodDN2ujMSfLFDkPVFac.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254013'),
  ('823411102423527303', 'Revolution', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Eric Kripke', null, 'Billy Burke, Tracy Spiridakos, Giancarlo Esposito, Zak Orth, David Lyons, J. D. Pardo, Stephen Collins, Elizabeth Mitchell', 'TV-14', 'One day, electricity just stopped working and the world was suddenly thrust back into the dark ages. Now, 15 years later, a young woman''s life is dramatically changed when a local militia arrives and kills her father, who mysteriously—and unbeknownst to her—had something to do with the blackout. An unlikely group sets out off on a daring journey to find answers about the past in the hopes of reclaiming the future.', 'One day, electricity just stopped working and the world was suddenly thrust back into the dark ages. Now, 15 years later, a young woman''s life is dramatically changed when a local militia arrives and kills her father, who mysteriously—and unbeknownst to her—had something to do with the blackout. An unlikely group sets out off on a daring journey to find answers about the past in the hopes of reclaiming the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNyg4V6kuDstSSxk6Q9GgaBn4B8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1410'),
  ('839005533695087338', 'Revolutionary Girl Utena', 1997, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tomoko Kawakami, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Takehito Koyasu, Takeshi Kusao, Kotono Mitsuishi, Aya Hisakawa, Yuri Shiratori, Jurota Kosugi', 'TV-14', '"Never lose that strength or nobility, even when you grow up." When Utena was just a child and in the depths of sorrow, she found salvation in those words. They were the words of a prince, who bestowed upon her both a ring and the promise that it would lead her to him again. She never forgot the encounter. Now a teenager, Utena attends the prestigious Ohtori Academy; however, her strong sense of chivalry soon places her at odds with the student council and thrusts her into a series of mysterious and dangerous duels against its members.', '"Never lose that strength or nobility, even when you grow up." When Utena was just a child and in the depths of sorrow, she found salvation in those words. They were the words of a prince, who bestowed upon her both a ring and the promise that it would lead her to him again. She never forgot the encounter. Now a teenager, Utena attends the prestigious Ohtori Academy; however, her strong sense of chivalry soon places her at odds with the student council and thrusts her into a series of mysterious and dangerous duels against its members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riqymWBPqKmWpIvS3lVDYjZhwQ5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1042'),
  ('987756337919902267', 'Revolutionary Love', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Joo Hyun, Lim Hye-min', 'Choi Si-won, Kang So-ra, Gong Myoung, Lee Jae-yoon, Seo Yi-an, Choi Jae-sung, Kyeon Mi-ri, Lee Han-wi', 'TV-MA', 'Byun Hyuk is the younger son of a rich conglomerate family who was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. The lack of difficulties in life contributed to the carefree and hopelessly positive mindset of his. One day, he meets a girl who is everything that he is not. This drama is a depiction of youth where they learn about love and friendship.', 'Byun Hyuk is the younger son of a rich conglomerate family who was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. The lack of difficulties in life contributed to the carefree and hopelessly positive mindset of his. One day, he meets a girl who is everything that he is not. This drama is a depiction of youth where they learn about love and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIe4h9F5X7oF0gOTgjBS0C1leSo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74075'),
  ('732645931363221226', 'Revue Starlight', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Momoyo Koyama, Suzuko Mimori, Maho Tomita, Hinata Sato, Haruki Iwata, Aina Aiba, Moeka Koizumi, Teru Ikuta', null, 'Starlight is a play loved throughout the world. Karen and Hikari make a promise with each other when they''re young that one day they''ll stand on that stage together. Time passes, and now the girls are 16 years old. Karen is very enthusiastic about the lessons she takes every day, holding her promise close to her heart. Hikari has transferred schools and is now away from Karen. But the cogs of fate turn, and the two are destined to meet again. The girls and other Stage Girls will compete in a mysterious audition process to gain acceptance into the revue.', 'Starlight is a play loved throughout the world. Karen and Hikari make a promise with each other when they''re young that one day they''ll stand on that stage together. Time passes, and now the girls are 16 years old. Karen is very enthusiastic about the lessons she takes every day, holding her promise close to her heart. Hikari has transferred schools and is now away from Karen. But the cogs of fate turn, and the two are destined to meet again. The girls and other Stage Girls will compete in a mysterious audition process to gain acceptance into the revue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej9E3DCMIMS46CgM8P28CcBHTsI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80834'),
  ('1004284875338453021', 'Rewrite', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Takashi Aoshima, Takayo Ikami, Tatsuya Takahashi', 'Masakazu Morita, Eri Kitamura, Chiwa Saito, Kana Hanazawa, Risa Asaki, Katsuyuki Konishi, Junichi Yanagita, Saya Shinomiya', 'TV-PG', 'Green City Kazamatsuri is a city built on the ideal of a harmonious relationship between civilization and environment.. However, the peaceful Kazamatsuri will soon be faced with its annual commotion, the Harvest Festa at the turn of the year. It''s an event that is much like a massive school festival, and Tennoji Kotaro decides to head out to research topics for his articles. It''s an easy decision for him, because the town is filled with rumors about unidentified creature sightings and various other occult occurrences. At the same time, strange things start happening to Kotaro himself.', 'Green City Kazamatsuri is a city built on the ideal of a harmonious relationship between civilization and environment.. However, the peaceful Kazamatsuri will soon be faced with its annual commotion, the Harvest Festa at the turn of the year. It''s an event that is much like a massive school festival, and Tennoji Kotaro decides to head out to research topics for his articles. It''s an easy decision for him, because the town is filled with rumors about unidentified creature sightings and various other occult occurrences. At the same time, strange things start happening to Kotaro himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyiLtuHFiehUASS5HEDJvUivLIG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66101'),
  ('521401522819189769', 'Reyes de la noche', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Adolfo Valor, Cristóbal Garrido', null, 'Javier Gutiérrez, Miki Esparbé, Itsaso Arana, Alberto San Juan, Chiqui Fernández, Sonia Almarcha, Cristóbal Suárez, Óscar de la Fuente', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pOmIKpaUfOrhpB572KXJgJ0fz0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123277'),
  ('1071952053496697196', 'Reyka', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Rohan Dickson', 'Rohan Dickson', 'Kim Suzanne Engelbrecht, Iain Glen, Anna-Mart van der Merwe, Rashaan Stackling, Gerald Steyn, Samkelo Ndlovu, Lemogang Tsipa, Nokuthula Ledwaba', 'TV-MA', 'In 1994 South Africa, the daughter of a multiracial couple is kidnapped. She escapes and as an adult becomes a detective. Continuing to deal with her past trauma, Reyka Gama uses her skills to raise her child and solve mysteries that have challenged others.', 'In 1994 South Africa, the daughter of a multiracial couple is kidnapped. She escapes and as an adult becomes a detective. Continuing to deal with her past trauma, Reyka Gama uses her skills to raise her child and solve mysteries that have challenged others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1aNw7x7YrXxyG1aPmXKGTuo0rJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:132629'),
  ('401414650480942844', 'Reykjavik 112', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yrsa Sigurðardóttir', 'Óttar M. Norðfjörd, Björg Magnúsdóttir, Snorri Thorisson', 'Kolbeinn Arnbjörnsson, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Vivian Ólafsdóttir, Anna Gunndís Guðmundsdóttir, Valdís Brynja Finnsdóttir, Mikael Kaaber, Ebba Katrín Finnsdóttir, Valur Freyr Einarsson', null, 'A woman is brutally murdered in front of her young daughter, the sole witness to the crime. The challenging case is assigned to Detective Huldar, who must unravel a web of perplexing clues while dealing with a traumatized child who has been rendered mute. To help unlock the girl''s memories, Huldar seeks the expertise of a child psychologist-only to discover it''s Freyja, a woman he recently had an awkward date with. Forced to collaborate, Freyja and Huldar must race against time to stop a killer who strikes again and remains perilously close.', 'A woman is brutally murdered in front of her young daughter, the sole witness to the crime. The challenging case is assigned to Detective Huldar, who must unravel a web of perplexing clues while dealing with a traumatized child who has been rendered mute. To help unlock the girl''s memories, Huldar seeks the expertise of a child psychologist-only to discover it''s Freyja, a woman he recently had an awkward date with. Forced to collaborate, Freyja and Huldar must race against time to stop a killer who strikes again and remains perilously close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9iZPJx3tsaVyaqABvKEvHTPreR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:293118'),
  ('469044066397359459', 'RFDS: Royal Flying Doctor Service', 2021, 'Drama', 'Imogen Banks, Ian Meadows, Mark Fennessy', null, 'Emma Hamilton, Stephen Peacocke, Rob Collins, Justine Clarke, Ash Ricardo, Jack Scott, Sofia Nolan, Rodney Afif', 'TV-14', 'Based in Australia’s red heart, the modern-day heroes of the Royal Flying Doctor Service navigate private lives as turbulent and profound as the heart stopping emergencies they attend. This series captures the beauty and brutality of Australia’s vast centre where the doctors, nurses, pilots and support staff of the RFDS negotiate the unique challenges of emergency retrievals across some of the most inhospitable places in the country.', 'Based in Australia’s red heart, the modern-day heroes of the Royal Flying Doctor Service navigate private lives as turbulent and profound as the heart stopping emergencies they attend. This series captures the beauty and brutality of Australia’s vast centre where the doctors, nurses, pilots and support staff of the RFDS negotiate the unique challenges of emergency retrievals across some of the most inhospitable places in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFrIkxTASkznhAHtaGlEkkALfDO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:130677'),
  ('813483742115550653', 'Rhoda', 1974, 'Comedy', 'James L. Brooks, Allan Burns', 'Carroll Moore, David Davis, Norman Barasch', 'Valerie Harper, Julie Kavner, Kenneth McMillan, Wil Albert, Lorenzo Music', 'TV-G', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nVSlqyqtlXuTiEYjku7fzWYav5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:645'),
  ('178881886952251081', 'Rhythm + Flow', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'DJ Khaled, Latto, Ludacris', 'TV-MA', 'In this music competition show, judges Tip “T.I.” Harris, Cardi B and Chance the Rapper hit the streets to find the next rap superstar.', 'In this music competition show, judges Tip “T.I.” Harris, Cardi B and Chance the Rapper hit the streets to find the next rap superstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOdwfKIJUjc0DFHYrcvwJbVwzVC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83996'),
