  ('1107172904249288239', 'Rhythm + Flow Italy', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Fabrizio Tarducci, Rose Villain, Emanuele Palumbo', 'TV-MA', 'In this music competition show, Fabri Fibra, Geolier and Rose Villain hit the streets of Rome, Naples and Milan to find the next Italian rap superstar.', 'In this music competition show, Fabri Fibra, Geolier and Rose Villain hit the streets of Rome, Naples and Milan to find the next Italian rap superstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcL1RX12xlFydhSiOI9PgY29Zl3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243202'),
  ('1104346989851608736', 'RI:SE', 2002, null, null, null, 'Mark Durden-Smith, Kate Lawler, Liz Bonnin, Sue Perkins, Mel Giedroyc, Colin Murray, Helen Chamberlain, Kirsty Gallacher', null, 'RI:SE is a breakfast television show made by Princess Productions in collaboration with BSkyB for Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. It was scheduled to replace The Big Breakfast after declining ratings. It launched on 29 April 2002. The programme was broadcast between 06:55 and 09:00 in the morning - nationally in the UK.', 'RI:SE is a breakfast television show made by Princess Productions in collaboration with BSkyB for Channel 4 in the United Kingdom. It was scheduled to replace The Big Breakfast after declining ratings. It launched on 29 April 2002. The programme was broadcast between 06:55 and 09:00 in the morning - nationally in the UK.', null, 2, 'tmdb:tv:2484'),
  ('1148632716118675410', 'Rich Man, Poor Man', 1976, 'Drama, Soap', 'Irwin Shaw', null, 'Peter Strauss, Nick Nolte, Susan Blakely, Ed Asner, Dorothy McGuire, Bill Bixby, Ray Milland, Robert Reed', null, 'Based on the best-selling 1969 novel by Irwin Shaw, the series follows the divergent career courses of the impoverished German American Jordache brothers.', 'Based on the best-selling 1969 novel by Irwin Shaw, the series follows the divergent career courses of the impoverished German American Jordache brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LmpOZ8JVzHEgHGLi3opMWsqOdt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14733'),
  ('805766718969911755', 'Rich Man, Poor Woman', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Arata Iura, Satomi Ishihara, Saki Aibu, Yōsuke Asari, Yasuhi Nakamura, Aiku Maikawa, Kiyohiko Ueki', null, 'Hyuga began his career with a website he built out of interest. Later, he developed an IT company and became a billionaire while Makoto encountered a lot of hardships in job hunting. Their personalities were radically different. Even though they faced a lot of conflicts ever since they first met, they were gradually attracted by each other and went through a lot of things together.', 'Hyuga began his career with a website he built out of interest. Later, he developed an IT company and became a billionaire while Makoto encountered a lot of hardships in job hunting. Their personalities were radically different. Even though they faced a lot of conflicts ever since they first met, they were gradually attracted by each other and went through a lot of things together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1zmTsNAHVg4XVTgLevuFyPH0HE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45938'),
  ('1075302347113394838', 'Rich Man, Poor Woman', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Hwang Jo-yoon, Park Jeong-ye', 'Suho, Ha Yeon-soo, Oh Chang-seok, Park Sung-hoon, Kim Ye-won, Yoon Da-young, Lee Jae-jin, Kim Min-ji', null, 'A man who can’t distinguish faces meets a woman who is unforgettable. Lee Yoo Chan is the founder and CEO of the IT company Next One, which has become the most desirable place to work. He suffers from a condition where he can’t recognize faces, and this makes him very guarded and mistrustful of most people. Kim Bo Ra is the pride of her hometown on Jeju Island who came to Seoul to attend college. With her imminent graduation, her dream is to work for Next One. When Bo Ra meets Yoo Chan, will both their lives change in unexpected ways?', 'A man who can’t distinguish faces meets a woman who is unforgettable. Lee Yoo Chan is the founder and CEO of the IT company Next One, which has become the most desirable place to work. He suffers from a condition where he can’t recognize faces, and this makes him very guarded and mistrustful of most people. Kim Bo Ra is the pride of her hometown on Jeju Island who came to Seoul to attend college. With her imminent graduation, her dream is to work for Next One. When Bo Ra meets Yoo Chan, will both their lives change in unexpected ways?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77PP7SfgONe8AgdTHXg3nHwExQo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79064'),
  ('692742553249071170', 'Richard & Judy', 2001, 'Talk', 'Judy Finnigan, Richard Madeley', null, 'Richard Madeley, Judy Finnigan', null, 'Richard &amp; Judy was a British chat show presented by the married couple Richard Madeley and Judy Finnigan. The show originally aired on Channel 4, from 2001 to 2008, but later moved to digital channel, Watch, in October 2008. The programme featured a number of celebrities and a book club. Its final episode aired in July 2009 due to low ratings.', 'Richard &amp; Judy was a British chat show presented by the married couple Richard Madeley and Judy Finnigan. The show originally aired on Channel 4, from 2001 to 2008, but later moved to digital channel, Watch, in October 2008. The programme featured a number of celebrities and a book club. Its final episode aired in July 2009 due to low ratings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGBCP2UOeZhX0GijSI8NZX6xxXt.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:4027'),
  ('793271120235819802', 'Richard Hammond''s Big', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Richard Hammond', null, 'Richard Hammond embarks on a global adventure to explore the world’s biggest structures and machines and discover how engineers build, maintain and use them.', 'Richard Hammond embarks on a global adventure to explore the world’s biggest structures and machines and discover how engineers build, maintain and use them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xMgDP7lkeetMvXejdyIbEqXbUF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97979'),
  ('49427771123773981', 'Richard Hammond''s Invisible Worlds', 2010, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Richard Hammond', 'NR', 'Using state-of-the-art technologies, Richard Hammond goes beyond the limits of the naked eye and explores the hidden secrets of the invisible world around us.', 'Using state-of-the-art technologies, Richard Hammond goes beyond the limits of the naked eye and explores the hidden secrets of the invisible world around us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFIvw2vd14tMwrzxrnefBNS60n8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33973'),
  ('726356562987695652', 'Richard Hammond''s Workshop', 2021, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Richard Hammond, Anthony Greenhouse', null, 'Richard Hammond trades his jet-setting lifestyle for a long-standing dream to set up a classic car restoration workshop close to his home in Herefordshire. With the help of skilled craftsmen, he navigates the ups and downs of building a new business.', 'Richard Hammond trades his jet-setting lifestyle for a long-standing dream to set up a classic car restoration workshop close to his home in Herefordshire. With the help of skilled craftsmen, he navigates the ups and downs of building a new business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBuKrhOa6m3GTvvSNuOFPP2IlBQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:136638'),
