  ('590424254968519463', 'Riddle Story of Devil', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ayaka Suwa, Hisako Kanemoto, Yoshino Nanjo, Azumi Asakura, Mami Uchida, Sachika Misawa', 'TV-14', 'The "Class Black," 10th Grade of Myōjō Academy is composed of 12 assassins disguised as students and one target: Haru Ichinose. Fully aware of being the prey, Ichinose vows to survive assassination attempts and graduate from the school alive. One of the assassins, Tokaku Azuma, has started building up feelings for Ichinose and switched side to become her protector. Together they have to face the onslaught from their classmates of 11 assassins.', 'The "Class Black," 10th Grade of Myōjō Academy is composed of 12 assassins disguised as students and one target: Haru Ichinose. Fully aware of being the prey, Ichinose vows to survive assassination attempts and graduate from the school alive. One of the assassins, Tokaku Azuma, has started building up feelings for Ichinose and switched side to become her protector. Together they have to face the onslaught from their classmates of 11 assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfmsXihfuUodPTB4lirJtTcYkKN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60845'),
  ('1083367256989005464', 'Ride', 2016, 'Family, Action & Adventure, Drama, Documentary', 'Jill Girling, Lori Mather-Welch', null, 'Alana Boden, Rameet Rauli, Kendra Leigh Timmins, Oliver Dench, Jonny Gray, Natalie Lisinska, Manuel Pacific, Sara Botsford', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of Katherine '' Kit'' Bridges who relocates to England when her father joins the faculty at Covington Academy, an elite equestrian boarding school.', 'The adventures of Katherine '' Kit'' Bridges who relocates to England when her father joins the faculty at Covington Academy, an elite equestrian boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cewmFMFZ3Pejumn5onEIWHHhZhI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69867'),
  ('185763856868664440', 'Ride', 2023, 'Drama, Western', 'Sherri Cooper-Landsman', null, 'Nancy Travis, Tiera Skovbye, Beau Mirchoff, Sara Alicia Garcia, Jake Foy, Tyler Jacob Moore', null, 'Follows the lives of the Murrays as they struggle to keep their beloved ranch afloat.', 'Follows the lives of the Murrays as they struggle to keep their beloved ranch afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1wyw44AXs8Sw3lRVHPuowk3xsd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211562'),
  ('342166218165872613', 'Ride Back', 2009, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Romi Park, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Toyoguchi, Megumi Matsumoto', null, 'After ex-dancer Rin trades her stage career for college life, she forms an unusual connection with a robotic RideBack motorcycle—Fuego. As a tyrannical new government oppresses the population and crushes civil liberties, Rin may have no choice but to gun Fuego’s engines and speed directly into the heart of the fight for freedom.', 'After ex-dancer Rin trades her stage career for college life, she forms an unusual connection with a robotic RideBack motorcycle—Fuego. As a tyrannical new government oppresses the population and crushes civil liberties, Rin may have no choice but to gun Fuego’s engines and speed directly into the heart of the fight for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3xPlnsN8nP9VGaHfOK8jVSDOxw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30987'),
  ('415095074635072308', 'Ride the Wind', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Stephanie Siao, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Christine Fan, Li Xiaoran, Zhao Ziqi, Jill Hsu, Wen Zhengrong, 乌兰图雅', null, 'A chinese variety show which features 30 female celebrities all over 30 years old who must compete to debut in a seven-member girlsband.', 'A chinese variety show which features 30 female celebrities all over 30 years old who must compete to debut in a seven-member girlsband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3ZzkYM26UZ536SzQIhIcswtdGO.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:104716'),
  ('1118211898802818072', 'Ride the Wind 2025', 2025, 'Reality', '任洋', null, 'Xie Na, Qi Sijun', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61DJMqFUFX6222ctnzuQEJLYdUT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:286995'),
  ('848631574024487773', 'Ride Upon the Storm', 2017, 'Drama', 'Adam Price', 'Andreas Garfield, Poul Berg, Karina Dam', 'Lars Mikkelsen, Ann Eleonora Jørgensen, Simon Sears, Morten Hee Andersen, Fanny Louise Bernth, Joen Højerslev, Camilla Lau, Maj-Britt Mathiesen', 'TV-MA', 'The story centers on a family of priests: Johannes, Elisabeth and their sons August and Christian. Johannes is God-like to his sons - he gives, loves, and punishes. His favoritism for August and his disappointment with Christian forces both into making desperate choices in order to either gain his love or break free from him.', 'The story centers on a family of priests: Johannes, Elisabeth and their sons August and Christian. Johannes is God-like to his sons - he gives, loves, and punishes. His favoritism for August and his disappointment with Christian forces both into making desperate choices in order to either gain his love or break free from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eqZPWEZCD4lkRgw2KMQlL13LnM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74145'),
  ('273669100036155031', 'Ride with Norman Reedus', 2016, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Norman Reedus', 'TV-14', 'The Walking Dead star and motorcycle enthusiast Norman Reedus hits the open road to explore local biker culture and celebrate the best and brightest collectors, mechanics and craftsmen around the country. Each episode features Reedus and a riding companion – a fellow actor, musician, friend or local chopper fanatic – as they journey to custom bike shops, tattoo parlors, collector’s warehouses, or a roadside smokehouse… with plenty of time for unplanned detours and tire changes.', 'The Walking Dead star and motorcycle enthusiast Norman Reedus hits the open road to explore local biker culture and celebrate the best and brightest collectors, mechanics and craftsmen around the country. Each episode features Reedus and a riding companion – a fellow actor, musician, friend or local chopper fanatic – as they journey to custom bike shops, tattoo parlors, collector’s warehouses, or a roadside smokehouse… with plenty of time for unplanned detours and tire changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQyDwNVO88PK2l8rQLaGR2mW6od.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:66402'),
  ('1117900957626985861', 'Ridiculousness', 2011, 'Comedy, Talk, Reality', 'Rob Dyrdek', null, 'Rob Dyrdek, Chanel West Coast, Sterling ''Steelo'' Brim', 'TV-14', 'Rob Dyrdek takes the funniest amateur internet videos and builds them into an episode of edgy, funny, and most importantly, timeless television.', 'Rob Dyrdek takes the funniest amateur internet videos and builds them into an episode of edgy, funny, and most importantly, timeless television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rJdcHQrE4stnZTEAP0m4gnlVQi.jpg', 50, 'tmdb:tv:38657'),
  ('406280207782026568', 'Riding in Darkness', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Ulf Kvensler', 'Jonas Karlsson, Hanna Ardéhn, Malin Persson, Saga Samuelsson, Amanda Jansson', null, 'This is a survival thriller, based on true events. Three women with different connections to one man need to find a way to get out of the monster''s grip. Will they be believed or can he manipulate the surroundings once again.', 'This is a survival thriller, based on true events. Three women with different connections to one man need to find a way to get out of the monster''s grip. Will they be believed or can he manipulate the surroundings once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSJxtsUv9mw8dfKtYuQCSeRFdHF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213328'),
  ('72442307562469783', 'Ridley', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Paul Matthew Thompson, Jonathan Fisher', null, 'Adrian Dunbar, Bronagh Waugh, Terence Maynard, George Bukhari, Julie Graham, Georgie Glen, Bhavna Limbachia, Tareq Al-Jeddal', null, 'Retired Detective Inspector Alex Ridley is lured back into service as a consultant detective when his former protégée, Carol Farman, needs help cracking a complex murder case.', 'Retired Detective Inspector Alex Ridley is lured back into service as a consultant detective when his former protégée, Carol Farman, needs help cracking a complex murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdvihv6BhxYDWquoQbZctlVSBwS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:132306'),
