  ('578316614338402856', 'Riverdale', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa', null, 'KJ Apa, Lili Reinhart, Camila Mendes, Cole Sprouse, Madelaine Petsch, Casey Cott, Drew Ray Tanner, Vanessa Morgan', 'TV-14', 'Set in the present, the series offers a bold, subversive take on Archie, Betty, Veronica and their friends, exploring the surreality of small-town life, the darkness and weirdness bubbling beneath Riverdale’s wholesome facade.', 'Set in the present, the series offers a bold, subversive take on Archie, Betty, Veronica and their friends, exploring the surreality of small-town life, the darkness and weirdness bubbling beneath Riverdale’s wholesome facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8mmn9thQ5dBk2qbv6BCqGUXWK3.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:69050'),
  ('633595644053280680', 'Rivers of Fate', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Bráulio Mantovani, Fernando Garrido', 'Stephanie Degreas', 'Domithila Catete, Lucas Galvino, Marleyda Soto, Bruno Goya, Claudio Jaborandy, Ricardo Teodoro, Welket Bungué, Wesley Guimarães', null, 'When a teen is kidnapped by a sex trafficking ring, a river pirate and a fierce mother embark on separate quests to find her — until their paths cross.', 'When a teen is kidnapped by a sex trafficking ring, a river pirate and a fierce mother embark on separate quests to find her — until their paths cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2heNhOUKqZDeUNPuxX2R4YJuSky.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258897'),
  ('968366593086867202', 'Riverside Code at Qingming Festival', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Bai Baihe, Zhang Songwen, Zhou Yiwei, Hou Yansong, Zhang Yao, Xia Meng, Lin Jiachuan, Shi An', null, 'During the Northern Song Dynasty, the Zhao family—comprising Zhao Buyou, his wife Wen Yue, and their three children—lives in Bianliang''s Que''er Alley. Zhao Buyou, a lowly clerk, seeks a simple life, while Wen Yue is focused on improving their living conditions. Despite frequent disagreements, the family remains close. An unexpected event thrusts them into a significant case, leading them on a journey of personal growth and discovery, while uncovering deeper truths and protecting their community.', 'During the Northern Song Dynasty, the Zhao family—comprising Zhao Buyou, his wife Wen Yue, and their three children—lives in Bianliang''s Que''er Alley. Zhao Buyou, a lowly clerk, seeks a simple life, while Wen Yue is focused on improving their living conditions. Despite frequent disagreements, the family remains close. An unexpected event thrusts them into a significant case, leading them on a journey of personal growth and discovery, while uncovering deeper truths and protecting their community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UIrFvk4JSjVCon6YoSO3jHyUkn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252904'),
  ('146587252285679719', 'Riviera', 2017, 'Drama', 'Neil Jordan', null, 'Julia Stiles, Rupert Graves, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Synnøve Macody Lund, Gabriel Corrado', 'TV-MA', 'After newlywed Georgina''s billionaire husband Constantine is killed in a yacht explosion, she is shocked to discover the fortune and lifestyle he maintained was surrounded by violence, lies and murder. She soon must step out of her comfort zone to protect the family...and herself.', 'After newlywed Georgina''s billionaire husband Constantine is killed in a yacht explosion, she is shocked to discover the fortune and lifestyle he maintained was surrounded by violence, lies and murder. She soon must step out of her comfort zone to protect the family...and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBNwUFHjo4BgKU7thgrlwbWut3z.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70496'),
  ('229069995034556713', 'Rizzoli & Isles', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Janet Tamaro', null, 'Angie Harmon, Sasha Alexander, Jordan Bridges, Bruce McGill, Lorraine Bracco, Idara Victor, Adam Sinclair', 'TV-14', 'Perhaps their strikingly different personalities make the relationship between detective Jane Rizzoli and medical examiner Maura Isles so effective. Jane, the only female cop in Boston''s homicide division, is tough, relentless and rarely lets her guard down, while the impeccably dressed Maura displays a sometimes icy temperament — she is, after all, more comfortable among the dead than the living. Together, the best friends have forged a quirky and supportive relationship; they drop the protective shield in each other''s company, and combine their expertise to solve Boston''s most complex cases.', 'Perhaps their strikingly different personalities make the relationship between detective Jane Rizzoli and medical examiner Maura Isles so effective. Jane, the only female cop in Boston''s homicide division, is tough, relentless and rarely lets her guard down, while the impeccably dressed Maura displays a sometimes icy temperament — she is, after all, more comfortable among the dead than the living. Together, the best friends have forged a quirky and supportive relationship; they drop the protective shield in each other''s company, and combine their expertise to solve Boston''s most complex cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuCNyr4XVQ4MZWiNjVS6DypE988.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:32895'),
  ('200244460557049393', 'Ro-Kyu-Bu!', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yui Ogura, Shizuka Itoh, Rina Hidaka, Minami Tsuda, Risa Taneda, Yuki Kaji, Aya Suzaki, Misaki Kuno', null, 'When high schooler Subaru''s basketball team is disbanded for a year, his aunt talks him into coaching an elementary school girls'' team.', 'When high schooler Subaru''s basketball team is disbanded for a year, his aunt talks him into coaching an elementary school girls'' team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTjtpplRsx4dCA89RBTtsH1io5o.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45953'),
  ('367601342068526248', 'Road Home', 2023, 'Drama', 'Mobao Feibao', null, 'Jing Boran, Tan Songyun, Zhang Bojia, Li Mincheng, Zhang Qiaoer, Zhang Enshuo, Wang Hao, Liang Tian', null, 'Lu Yanchen and Gui Xiao were each other''s first love but separated after graduation. Years later, they meet again and realize that the sparks are still between them.', 'Lu Yanchen and Gui Xiao were each other''s first love but separated after graduation. Years later, they meet again and realize that the sparks are still between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NmLByu3hHyV5xQIxr4ARxBMkVI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214478'),
  ('475504909136874450', 'Road Rules', 1995, 'Reality', 'Mary-Ellis Bunim, Jonathan Murray', null, 'Veronica Portillo, Adam Larson, Shane Landrum, Abram Boise, Kina Dean, Susie Meister, Dan Walsh, Derek McCray', null, '"Road Rules" documents the lives of five to six strangers as a mysterious voice sends them across various regions of the world, tackling a series of adventures. If they can successfully make it to the end of the adventure, they will receive a handsome reward.', '"Road Rules" documents the lives of five to six strangers as a mysterious voice sends them across various regions of the world, tackling a series of adventures. If they can successfully make it to the end of the adventure, they will receive a handsome reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJkKmeGNQLxOpvrm8ZZbDqCpWjc.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:2729'),
  ('184625488625673940', 'Road to Avonlea', 1990, 'Drama, Family', 'Fiona McHugh', null, 'Sarah Polley, Jackie Burroughs, Mag Ruffman, Lally Cadeau, Gema Zamprogna, Cedric Smith, Zachary Bennett, Patricia Hamilton', 'TV-PG', 'In the fictional small town of Avonlea, Prince Edward Island, in the early 20th century, 10-year-old Montreal heiress Sara Stanley is sent by her wealthy father to live with her two maiden aunts, Hetty and Olivia King, to be near her late mother''s side of the family.', 'In the fictional small town of Avonlea, Prince Edward Island, in the early 20th century, 10-year-old Montreal heiress Sara Stanley is sent by her wealthy father to live with her two maiden aunts, Hetty and Olivia King, to be near her late mother''s side of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2392PwVEfsMOMgYD5q0KaRWbjhP.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:10860'),
  ('39046937388196442', 'Road to Destiny', 2016, 'Drama, Soap', 'Mariela Romero', 'María Antonieta Gutiérrez, Mariela Romero, Anthony Arrieche Gutiérrez', 'Paulina Goto, Horacio Pancheri, Jorge Aravena, René Strickler, Eugenia Cauduro, Ana Patricia Rojo, Lisette Morelos, Gustavo Rojo', 'TV-14', 'Luisa Fernanda Pérez, a beautiful, 18-year-old student, has two passions: mastering the violin and gardening, a skill she learned from her father, Pedro, the former groundskeeper of the wealthy Altamirano family’s estate. A chance encounter with destiny alters her life after she is injured in a car accident caused by Luis (her biological father), a playboy lawyer and falls for his stepson, Carlos, an attractive, young doctor treating her at the local hospital.', 'Luisa Fernanda Pérez, a beautiful, 18-year-old student, has two passions: mastering the violin and gardening, a skill she learned from her father, Pedro, the former groundskeeper of the wealthy Altamirano family’s estate. A chance encounter with destiny alters her life after she is injured in a car accident caused by Luis (her biological father), a playboy lawyer and falls for his stepson, Carlos, an attractive, young doctor treating her at the local hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7z2aDzb9NdGgxAGFKhIo80CvQD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66886'),
