  ('648486563510238958', 'Room at the Top', 2012, 'Drama', null, 'Amanda Coe', 'Matthew McNulty, Tom Brooke, Jenna Coleman, Maxine Peake, Kate O''Flynn, Paul Hilton, Eithne Browne, Zoe Telford', null, 'Joe leaves working-class, industrial Dufton behind him and takes a job as senior audit clerk at the town hall in affluent Warley. He takes lodgings at the poshest part of the town and starts to make his mark on local society.', 'Joe leaves working-class, industrial Dufton behind him and takes a job as senior audit clerk at the town hall in affluent Warley. He takes lodgings at the poshest part of the town and starts to make his mark on local society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acfrOiehNWwgquNWW7lY8D7SaeW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48652'),
  ('1036429485887512074', 'Room Camp', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yumiri Hanamori, Sayuri Hara, Aki Toyosaki', 'TV-PG', 'The Outclub goes on a journey! The Outdoor Activities Club, AKA the Outclub, has 3 members. In the countryside of Yamanashi Prefecture, there''s a high school named Motosu High School. Go even further to one of the school buildings and you''ll find a very laid-back outdoor club that uses one corner of the classroom as their club room.', 'The Outclub goes on a journey! The Outdoor Activities Club, AKA the Outclub, has 3 members. In the countryside of Yamanashi Prefecture, there''s a high school named Motosu High School. Go even further to one of the school buildings and you''ll find a very laid-back outdoor club that uses one corner of the classroom as their club room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMzDCQ6Au3nlc0KrevYeQHFUzyE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95213'),
  ('731965206826893283', 'Room No. 9', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ji Young-soo', 'Jung Sung-hee', 'Kim Hee-seon, Kim Hae-sook, Jung Won-joong, Kim Young-kwang, Im Won-hee, Jeong Seok-yong, Kim Jae-hwa, Oh Dae-hwan', null, 'Eulji Hae-Yi, a lawyer at a big law firm, is a kiss-up to those with power, but looks down upon those who are poor. When she meets death-row convict Jang Hwa-Sa in room 9 in the prison visitation area, their bodies are exchanged.', 'Eulji Hae-Yi, a lawyer at a big law firm, is a kiss-up to those with power, but looks down upon those who are poor. When she meets death-row convict Jang Hwa-Sa in room 9 in the prison visitation area, their bodies are exchanged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jCKwe2AoFpnS2uiftmuCMjjdUb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82714'),
  ('613063496294173641', 'Room of Guilty Pleasure', 2025, 'Animation', null, null, 'Amai Miruku, Chiyoki Remon, Natsue Sasamoto, Yuki Nishiyama', 'TV-MA', 'This overworked and underpaid teacher, Mr. Sasaki, has his whole life turned upside down when he stumbles upon the "Guilty Hole." He thinks it''s a dream when he sees the student''s shoe lockers have been transformed into selection panels... seeing one that catches his eye, he joking picks her... When she appears in his classroom in the middle of the night, throwing insults at him, but her eyes seem to linger on him, tinged with embarassment. "I''ll finish this quickly so... Don''t hold back, ok...?" Thus begins a forbidden relationship... Welcome to the Guilty Hole, where anything is allowed--', 'This overworked and underpaid teacher, Mr. Sasaki, has his whole life turned upside down when he stumbles upon the "Guilty Hole." He thinks it''s a dream when he sees the student''s shoe lockers have been transformed into selection panels... seeing one that catches his eye, he joking picks her... When she appears in his classroom in the middle of the night, throwing insults at him, but her eyes seem to linger on him, tinged with embarassment. "I''ll finish this quickly so... Don''t hold back, ok...?" Thus begins a forbidden relationship... Welcome to the Guilty Hole, where anything is allowed--', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHBVXipaleawbvr9ESBj8vv9gth.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288577'),
  ('66433446186636120', 'Roommates of Poongduck 304', 2022, 'Drama', 'No Ga-jung', 'No Ga-jung', 'Kim Jiwoong, Yoon Seo-bin, Kang Woo-jung, Holland, Seo Dong-oh, Yu Ji-Hoo', null, 'When Ho-jun receives an ultimatum to move out and become a successful team leader, he must rent from feisty Jae-yoon, who owns a villa. But when a twist of fate transfers Jae-yoon to Ho-jun''s team, he becomes his unwilling employee.', 'When Ho-jun receives an ultimatum to move out and become a successful team leader, he must rent from feisty Jae-yoon, who owns a villa. But when a twist of fate transfers Jae-yoon to Ho-jun''s team, he becomes his unwilling employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZDGTbtLvMS8oGxdFupuLOLhkp4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210674'),
  ('202205887928444177', 'Rooster', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Bill Lawrence, Matt Tarses', null, 'Steve Carell, Danielle Deadwyler, Phil Dunster, John C. McGinley, Lauren Tsai, Charly Clive', 'TV-MA', 'On a college campus, an author navigates a complicated relationship with his daughter.', 'On a college campus, an author navigates a complicated relationship with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aikvD4Nu7N6ekbrXNua8vJlO8JU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254953'),
  ('178473899189471733', 'Rooster Fighter', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kenta Miyake, Mariko Honda, Hikaru Tono', 'TV-MA', 'Keiji is more than just an ordinary rooster—he''s humanity''s greatest defender! His opponents may be ten stories tall, but nothing is bigger than his stout heart and his fearsome battle cry—Kokekokko!', 'Keiji is more than just an ordinary rooster—he''s humanity''s greatest defender! His opponents may be ten stories tall, but nothing is bigger than his stout heart and his fearsome battle cry—Kokekokko!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCtbr0sIdaKZjhQH3Wr7hW6A1IU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259819'),
  ('961535906492156523', 'RoOT - Route of OddTaxi -', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuumi Kawai, Ryota Bando, Daisuke Kuroda, Rio Teramoto, Atsuko Fukuda, Mary Sara, Reno Nakamura, Momoko Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'The hardened veteran detective Rena and bright-eyed rookie Sato take on a menial investigation. The job goes well until a thug named Dobu steals their evidence. Disheartened, they take a job looking into the life of a taxi driver named Odokawa in hopes of redeeming themselves. They wind up in the middle of a missing girl case, with gangsters, aspiring students, and surprises around every corner.', 'The hardened veteran detective Rena and bright-eyed rookie Sato take on a menial investigation. The job goes well until a thug named Dobu steals their evidence. Disheartened, they take a job looking into the life of a taxi driver named Odokawa in hopes of redeeming themselves. They wind up in the middle of a missing girl case, with gangsters, aspiring students, and surprises around every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejsmb7qlrTvGvBr0Yx21Kb4sDmI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242378'),
  ('40660143983127434', 'Roots', 1977, 'Drama', 'Alex Haley', 'Alex Haley', null, 'NR', 'The epic tale of celebrated Pulitzer-prize winning author Alex Haley''s ancestors as portrayed in the acclaimed twelve hour mini-series Roots, was first told in his 1976 bestseller Roots: The Saga of an American Family. The docu-drama covers a period of history that begins in mid-1700s Gambia, West Africa and concludes during post-Civil War United States, over 100 years later. This 1977 miniseries eventually won 9 Emmy awards, a Golden Globe award, and a Peabody award, and still stands as the most watched miniseries in U.S. history.', 'The epic tale of celebrated Pulitzer-prize winning author Alex Haley''s ancestors as portrayed in the acclaimed twelve hour mini-series Roots, was first told in his 1976 bestseller Roots: The Saga of an American Family. The docu-drama covers a period of history that begins in mid-1700s Gambia, West Africa and concludes during post-Civil War United States, over 100 years later. This 1977 miniseries eventually won 9 Emmy awards, a Golden Globe award, and a Peabody award, and still stands as the most watched miniseries in U.S. history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enNlryvjiyPLhIZNgAmzVrHGiMG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13555'),
  ('1081598870733839509', 'Roots', 2016, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Malachi Kirby, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Forest Whitaker, Laurence Fishburne, Babs Olusanmokun', 'TV-MA', 'An adaptation of Alex Haley''s "Roots", chronicling the history of an African slave, Kunta Kinte sold to America and his descendants.', 'An adaptation of Alex Haley''s "Roots", chronicling the history of an African slave, Kunta Kinte sold to America and his descendants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBYRp5pL1FPEfMpfDgfM1Fo4oCS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66606'),
  ('484735122763139919', 'Roots: The Next Generations', 1979, 'Drama', 'Alex Haley', 'Alex Haley', null, 'TV-14', 'Roots: The Next Generations is a television miniseries, introduced in 1979, continuing, from 1882 to the 1960s, the fictionalized story of the family of Alex Haley and their life in Henning, Lauderdale County, Tennessee, USA. This sequel to the 1977 miniseries is based on the last seven chapters of Haley''s novel entitled Roots: The Saga of an American Family plus additional material by Haley. Roots: The Next Generations was produced with a budget of $16.6 million, nearly three times as large as that of the original.', 'Roots: The Next Generations is a television miniseries, introduced in 1979, continuing, from 1882 to the 1960s, the fictionalized story of the family of Alex Haley and their life in Henning, Lauderdale County, Tennessee, USA. This sequel to the 1977 miniseries is based on the last seven chapters of Haley''s novel entitled Roots: The Saga of an American Family plus additional material by Haley. Roots: The Next Generations was produced with a budget of $16.6 million, nearly three times as large as that of the original.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yALWSK2sf02pHJvRi0QyFAljEx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13436'),
  ('306851254825729614', 'Roppongi Class', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Koji Tokuo', 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Teruyuki Kagawa, Yuko Araki, Yurina Hirate, Ouji Suzuka, Yuma Yamoto, Taichi Saotome, Izumi Inamori', null, 'Miyabe Arata, owner of the Roppongi Nidaime Miyabe bar, fights against those who have absolute power. His goal is to take revenge on Nagaya Holdings, a giant in the Japanese food industry. The owner of the holding companies, as well as his son, had a destructive influence on Miyabe Arata''s life in the past.', 'Miyabe Arata, owner of the Roppongi Nidaime Miyabe bar, fights against those who have absolute power. His goal is to take revenge on Nagaya Holdings, a giant in the Japanese food industry. The owner of the holding companies, as well as his son, had a destructive influence on Miyabe Arata''s life in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/760oHjH2SrfUS1NuhJJcfjQ2OHE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203792'),
  ('775910679380799883', 'Roque Santeiro', 1985, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Dias Gomes, Aguinaldo Silva', 'Marcílio Moraes, Joaquim Assis, Aguinaldo Silva', 'José Wilker, Regina Duarte, Lima Duarte, Paulo Gracindo, Yoná Magalhães, Ary Fontoura, Eloísa Mafalda, Lucinha Lins', null, 'In the tiny poor town of Asa Branca, in the middle of Brazilian Northeast, Roque Santeiro is worshiped as a saint. He was supposedly killed by a bandit, 18 years ago, trying to save the local church. After his disappearance, local leaderships such as landowner Sinhozinho Malta and mayor Florindo, took profit on that to control the humble population. They even make up a widow, Porcina, who should have married Roque secretly before his death. What they don''t expect is that Roque is alive, and he''s back to, allegedly, "save his people". Now Malta, Florindo, Porcina, and others must hold him down and explain the "truth" to their commoners, in a desperate attempt to save their own bottoms. Meanwhile, mysterious facts surround Asa Branca, such as a Werewolf, a film crew who are trying to shoot a movie about Roque''s story, and violent murderers.', 'In the tiny poor town of Asa Branca, in the middle of Brazilian Northeast, Roque Santeiro is worshiped as a saint. He was supposedly killed by a bandit, 18 years ago, trying to save the local church. After his disappearance, local leaderships such as landowner Sinhozinho Malta and mayor Florindo, took profit on that to control the humble population. They even make up a widow, Porcina, who should have married Roque secretly before his death. What they don''t expect is that Roque is alive, and he''s back to, allegedly, "save his people". Now Malta, Florindo, Porcina, and others must hold him down and explain the "truth" to their commoners, in a desperate attempt to save their own bottoms. Meanwhile, mysterious facts surround Asa Branca, such as a Werewolf, a film crew who are trying to shoot a movie about Roque''s story, and violent murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0QfibQWfO4MllM0MVX6THEM5dV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46019'),
  ('653520768452710605', 'Rosa Diamante', 2012, 'Drama, Soap, Mystery', 'Enrique Torres', null, 'Carla Hernández, Mauricio Ochmann, Lupita Ferrer, Claudia Ramírez, Begoña Narváez, Sofía Lama, Tsuria Díaz, Sofía Ruiz', null, 'Rosa is abandoned as a baby at a boarding school along with a payment of 18 white diamonds. Her mother is Rosaura Sotomayor, a distinguished socialite who needs to hide the fruit of her affair. Rosa grows up and befriends Eva Sotomayor, and both girls vow to live as sisters. Their lives change after they meet José Ignacio Altamirano, an attractive, intelligent and conquering man who takes advantage of Eva’s innocence. The rich heiress dies in a mysterious accident, and Rosa decides to take her identity to avenge her dear friend.', 'Rosa is abandoned as a baby at a boarding school along with a payment of 18 white diamonds. Her mother is Rosaura Sotomayor, a distinguished socialite who needs to hide the fruit of her affair. Rosa grows up and befriends Eva Sotomayor, and both girls vow to live as sisters. Their lives change after they meet José Ignacio Altamirano, an attractive, intelligent and conquering man who takes advantage of Eva’s innocence. The rich heiress dies in a mysterious accident, and Rosa decides to take her identity to avenge her dear friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAM5HbC0GN2misCtJcRyQISKQyj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60374'),
  ('707647901878081655', 'Rosa Roth', 1994, 'Crime', null, null, 'Iris Berben, Carmen-Maja Antoni, Gunter Schoß, Jockel Tschiersch, Zacharias Preen', null, 'Rosa Roth is a German television series.', 'Rosa Roth is a German television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAuDws59uB06DyXZ4qNaDUzBlL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41258'),
  ('112524333620234355', 'Rosa Salvaje', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy, Soap', 'Inés Rodena', null, 'Verónica Castro, Guillermo Capetillo, Laura Zapata, Liliana Abud, Magda Guzmán, Irma Lozano, Alejandro Landero, Beatriz Ornelas', 'NR', 'Rosa salvaje is a Mexican telenovela that was broadcast in 1987. It starred the popular Mexican actress Verónica Castro, who played the main character, "Rosa", co-starring with Guillermo Capetillo as her love interest and Laura Zapata as the villain of the story. This telenovela was a huge success in Mexico, Latin America, Bulgaria, Croatia, Serbia, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Russia, Estonia, China the United States, Indonesia and provided the template for numerous other Latin American soap operas in terms of story, plot twists and characters for years to come.', 'Rosa salvaje is a Mexican telenovela that was broadcast in 1987. It starred the popular Mexican actress Verónica Castro, who played the main character, "Rosa", co-starring with Guillermo Capetillo as her love interest and Laura Zapata as the villain of the story. This telenovela was a huge success in Mexico, Latin America, Bulgaria, Croatia, Serbia, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Russia, Estonia, China the United States, Indonesia and provided the template for numerous other Latin American soap operas in terms of story, plot twists and characters for years to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8ykYRp7lrEgHXE7ffcRlnwL99z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12753'),
  ('198348508293694966', 'Rosalinda', 1999, 'Drama, Soap', 'Delia Fiallo', null, 'Thalia, Fernando Carrillo, Lupita Ferrer, Nora Salinas, Angélica María, Laura Zapata, Esther Rinaldi, Adriana Fonseca', 'TV-PG', 'Having to serve a sentence for a murder she did not commit but took the blame for, a woman gives her baby to her sister to be raised without knowing the truth. 20 years later she is freed and try to be once again part of her life. But things get complicated when the daugther, Rosalinda, and Fernando, the son of the man that was killed, become close.', 'Having to serve a sentence for a murder she did not commit but took the blame for, a woman gives her baby to her sister to be raised without knowing the truth. 20 years later she is freed and try to be once again part of her life. But things get complicated when the daugther, Rosalinda, and Fernando, the son of the man that was killed, become close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GqB48FlDbyGpTFuD0tMnZ0JwLi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12656'),
  ('511952178854114645', 'Rosario + Vampire', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Kishio, Nana Mizuki, Misato Fukuen, Kimiko Koyama', 'TV-MA', 'An ordinary high school boy fails to get into any private academy except one — which happens to be populated by supernatural creatures disguised as humans. To survive, he has to pretend that he is one of them and blend in.', 'An ordinary high school boy fails to get into any private academy except one — which happens to be populated by supernatural creatures disguised as humans. To survive, he has to pretend that he is one of them and blend in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbJmT1SjraMZY7BPLLvVMaCm9fl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36983'),
  ('593754691058372884', 'Rosario Tijeras', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Jorge Franco Ramos', null, 'María Fernanda Yepes, Sebastián Martínez, Andres Sandoval, Laura Perico, Juan David Restrepo, Alejandro Aguilar, Adriana Arango, Natalia Jerez', 'TV-MA', 'This is the story of the legendary Rosario Tijeras, the beautiful warrior from a slum who fell in love with Antonio and Emilio, two handsome and wealthy young men. Antonio, a young architect, desperately rushes the dying Rosario Tijeras to a nearby hospital. The beautiful Rosario has been shot four times by a hitman. While he waits for his beloved Rosario to be saved from her wounds, Antonio recalls how Rosario, a beautiful teenager, became the murderer Rosario Tijeras. And how he, a dashing young man, makes her his obsession. The woman of his dreams.', 'This is the story of the legendary Rosario Tijeras, the beautiful warrior from a slum who fell in love with Antonio and Emilio, two handsome and wealthy young men. Antonio, a young architect, desperately rushes the dying Rosario Tijeras to a nearby hospital. The beautiful Rosario has been shot four times by a hitman. While he waits for his beloved Rosario to be saved from her wounds, Antonio recalls how Rosario, a beautiful teenager, became the murderer Rosario Tijeras. And how he, a dashing young man, makes her his obsession. The woman of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13JdedQwxn9hhTM3wFbZL12aFfU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81146'),
