  ('963283370526227368', 'Rose Red', 2002, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Stephen King', 'Stephen King', 'Nancy Travis, Matt Keeslar, Kimberly J. Brown, David Dukes, Judith Ivey, Melanie Lynskey, Matt Ross, Julian Sands', 'TV-PG', 'Dr. Joyce Reardon, a psychology professor, commissions a team of psychics and a gifted autistic girl to find out the truth about an old, supposedly haunted mansion called Rose Red.', 'Dr. Joyce Reardon, a psychology professor, commissions a team of psychics and a gifted autistic girl to find out the truth about an old, supposedly haunted mansion called Rose Red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GvAUv97OhCLKkoK8ksEeWLhsMc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19654'),
  ('678429597497410447', 'Rose War', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yuan Quan, Huang Xiaoming, Dai Xu, Wang Herun, Lu Fangsheng, Wang Zhifei, Zhang Yishang, Sui Junbo', null, 'Gu Nian was a full-time housewife leading a happy life until her husband becomes involved in a criminal case and gets exposed for infidelity.', 'Gu Nian was a full-time housewife leading a happy life until her husband becomes involved in a criminal case and gets exposed for infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/L5svFlPlWGv4JjVAyXlsKJ0N3b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207719'),
  ('500063720384362776', 'Roseanne', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Matt Williams', null, 'Roseanne Barr, John Goodman, Alicia Goranson, Sara Gilbert, Michael Fishman, Laurie Metcalf, Ames McNamara, Jayden Rey', 'TV-PG', 'A working-class family struggles to get by on a limited income in the fictional town of Lanford, Illinois.', 'A working-class family struggles to get by on a limited income in the fictional town of Lanford, Illinois.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UARHgxTm7xwhcEHiVDwF0Gv4j0.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:2706'),
  ('219313140816674747', 'Rosehaven', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Celia Pacquola, Luke McGregor', 'Celia Pacquola, Luke McGregor', 'Celia Pacquola, Luke McGregor', null, 'When Daniel returns to his hometown, Rosehaven, to take over his family''s troubled real estate business, he''s surprisingly joined by his best (city) friend Emma - who''s on the run from a marriage that didn''t last the honeymoon. Between Daniel''s crippling anxiety and Emma''s exuberant irresponsibility will they be able to save the business? It seems unlikely, but it will be fun to watch them try. And might their friendship mean more than they realise?', 'When Daniel returns to his hometown, Rosehaven, to take over his family''s troubled real estate business, he''s surprisingly joined by his best (city) friend Emma - who''s on the run from a marriage that didn''t last the honeymoon. Between Daniel''s crippling anxiety and Emma''s exuberant irresponsibility will they be able to save the business? It seems unlikely, but it will be fun to watch them try. And might their friendship mean more than they realise?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQpsurcTmqPr64bVMEbzmTzmV4r.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:68248'),
  ('598727324958185101', 'Rosemary & Thyme', 2003, 'Drama', 'Tom Clegg, Clive Exton, Brian Eastman', null, 'Pam Ferris, Felicity Kendal', null, 'Brought together by professional and personal heartache, two plucky ladies plant the seeds for a brighter future. Rosemary Boxer, with a doctorate in plant pathology, and Laura Thyme, a former police constable and avid gardener, discover their shared love of green-thumbness and start a gardening business. As they restore various English gardens back to their lavish states, the inquisitive pair also find themselves uncovering an assortment of mysteries.', 'Brought together by professional and personal heartache, two plucky ladies plant the seeds for a brighter future. Rosemary Boxer, with a doctorate in plant pathology, and Laura Thyme, a former police constable and avid gardener, discover their shared love of green-thumbness and start a gardening business. As they restore various English gardens back to their lavish states, the inquisitive pair also find themselves uncovering an assortment of mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqWPl0dZK1EPjUH0iZgEJuCtvuO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2059'),
  ('745481896868048911', 'Rosemary''s Baby', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', 'James Wong, Scott Abbott', null, 'Zoe Saldaña, Patrick J. Adams, Carole Bouquet, Christina Cole, Jason Isaacs, François Civil, Olivier Rabourdin, Mélanie Guth', 'TV-14', 'Young Rosemary Woodhouse and her husband Guy move in with a rich couple, who soon take an unusual interest in the Woodhouses'' attempts to have a second baby after Rosemary miscarried the first one. Guy soon has unusual success and Rosemary becomes pregnant, but it becomes clear that the two are connected and that the pregnancy may not be all that Rosemary hoped for...', 'Young Rosemary Woodhouse and her husband Guy move in with a rich couple, who soon take an unusual interest in the Woodhouses'' attempts to have a second baby after Rosemary miscarried the first one. Guy soon has unusual success and Rosemary becomes pregnant, but it becomes clear that the two are connected and that the pregnancy may not be all that Rosemary hoped for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJ9lgdZd8qGabCy4HJXSy5nJjYP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65813'),
  ('744884719581593976', 'Rosewood', 2015, 'Drama', 'Todd Harthan', null, 'Morris Chestnut, Anna Konkle, Lorraine Toussaint, Domenick Lombardozzi, Jaina Lee Ortiz, Gabrielle Dennis, Eddie Cibrian', 'TV-14', 'Dr. Beaumont Rosewood, Jr. is a brilliant private pathologist who uses wildly sophisticated technology and his drive to live life to the fullest to help a tough-as-nails detective and the Miami PD uncover clues no one else can see.', 'Dr. Beaumont Rosewood, Jr. is a brilliant private pathologist who uses wildly sophisticated technology and his drive to live life to the fullest to help a tough-as-nails detective and the Miami PD uncover clues no one else can see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjrfQbFzmOaOrgEbJHG2eIwjKbv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63329'),
  ('1127759382511698393', 'Roswell', 1999, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jason Katims', null, 'Jason Behr, Shiri Appleby, Katherine Heigl, Majandra Delfino, Brendan Fehr, Nick Wechsler, Adam Rodriguez, William Sadler', 'TV-PG', 'Bizarre things start happening in the little New Mexico town where UFOs were spotted in 1947. Cut to 1999, when a cute high-school student saves the life of a teenage waitress. Surrounded by cliques of clever, angst-filled classmates, the two form a bond that threatens the survival of a secret universe involving superhuman powers, a yen for hot sauce and an alien gene pool.', 'Bizarre things start happening in the little New Mexico town where UFOs were spotted in 1947. Cut to 1999, when a cute high-school student saves the life of a teenage waitress. Surrounded by cliques of clever, angst-filled classmates, the two form a bond that threatens the survival of a secret universe involving superhuman powers, a yen for hot sauce and an alien gene pool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47CaTpah62bxbAkWANDzZdJxkxw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4624'),
  ('603641017541461168', 'Roswell, New Mexico', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Carina Adly MacKenzie', null, 'Jeanine Mason, Nathan Parsons, Michael Vlamis, Lily Cowles, Tyler Blackburn, Heather Hemmens, Michael Trevino, Amber Midthunder', 'TV-14', 'After reluctantly returning to her tourist-trap hometown of Roswell, New Mexico, the daughter of undocumented immigrants discovers a shocking truth about her teenage crush who is now a police officer—he’s an alien who has kept his unearthly abilities hidden his entire life. She protects his secret as the two reconnect and begin to investigate his origins, but when a violent attack and long-standing government cover-up point to a greater alien presence on Earth, the politics of fear and hatred threaten to expose him and destroy their deepening romance.', 'After reluctantly returning to her tourist-trap hometown of Roswell, New Mexico, the daughter of undocumented immigrants discovers a shocking truth about her teenage crush who is now a police officer—he’s an alien who has kept his unearthly abilities hidden his entire life. She protects his secret as the two reconnect and begin to investigate his origins, but when a violent attack and long-standing government cover-up point to a greater alien presence on Earth, the politics of fear and hatred threaten to expose him and destroy their deepening romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gU19YwCQXCoeQ3PcIPTOHwY5l7k.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:82001'),
  ('1053519109922918729', 'Roswell: The Final Verdict', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anthony D. Call, Ben Hansen, Adam Oakley, Paul Andrew Goldsmith', null, 'Harrowing accounts drive an explosive and cinematic exploration of the Roswell incident through the eyes of those who were there. A frightening journey into the heart of the nation''s most disturbing alien encounter.', 'Harrowing accounts drive an explosive and cinematic exploration of the Roswell incident through the eyes of those who were there. A frightening journey into the heart of the nation''s most disturbing alien encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGZ63B3mTABb9eRb73PFG36B4Fc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128236'),
  ('793680595139149333', 'Rosy Lovers', 2014, 'Drama, Family, Romance', null, 'Kim Sa-gyeong', 'Lee Jang-woo, Han Seon-hwa, Lee Mi-sook, Chang Mi-hee, Park Sang-won, Jung Bo-seog, Im Ye-jin, Kim Min-seo', 'NR', 'A family drama about a college student couple who unintentionally becomes parents and realize the true meaning of love and life. Jang Mi is an immature mama’s girl who grew without experiencing any hardship in life. Unlike her parents’ will to marry her off to a promising man they choose for her, Jang Mi has the hope to marry someone she falls madly in love with. As she dates healthy and innocent engineering student Cha Dol, she slowly begins to realize the meaning of love.', 'A family drama about a college student couple who unintentionally becomes parents and realize the true meaning of love and life. Jang Mi is an immature mama’s girl who grew without experiencing any hardship in life. Unlike her parents’ will to marry her off to a promising man they choose for her, Jang Mi has the hope to marry someone she falls madly in love with. As she dates healthy and innocent engineering student Cha Dol, she slowly begins to realize the meaning of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKMNj20W3pDUhTwvSUnqXCLqUFP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61706'),
  ('1083061049883839383', 'Rote Rosen', 2006, 'Soap, Drama', null, 'Meibrit Ahrens', 'Gerry Hungbauer, Hermann Toelcke, Anja Franke, Jelena Mitschke, Claus Dieter Clausnitzer, Brigitte Antonius, Michael Meziani', null, 'Rote Rosen is a German telenovela produced by Studio Hamburg Serienwerft Lüneburg and broadcast by Das Erste since November 6, 2006. The show is a complex telenovela, who tells one love story every season about women in their forties.', 'Rote Rosen is a German telenovela produced by Studio Hamburg Serienwerft Lüneburg and broadcast by Das Erste since November 6, 2006. The show is a complex telenovela, who tells one love story every season about women in their forties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swL2qUjGrChFyj14ExwA0pwWtzv.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:27181'),
  ('1005687580052594287', 'Rotten', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Latif Nasser', 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries travels deep into the heart of the food supply chain to reveal unsavory truths and expose hidden forces that shape what we eat.', 'This docuseries travels deep into the heart of the food supply chain to reveal unsavory truths and expose hidden forces that shape what we eat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kv0mdKRMqUSDkItZ1AWEI68Zcd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:76153'),
  ('733563373138236178', 'Rotten Legacy', 2025, 'Drama', 'Pablo Alén, Breixo Corral, Carlos Montero', null, 'Jose Coronado, Belén Cuesta, Diego Martín, Natalia Huarte, Gustavo Salmerón, Nico Romero, Iván Pellicer, Maria Morera Colomer', null, 'After a grave illness, a media mogul discovers his children''s tactics threaten the empire he carefully built — and he''ll do whatever it takes to save it.', 'After a grave illness, a media mogul discovers his children''s tactics threaten the empire he carefully built — and he''ll do whatever it takes to save it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbfVpoQDQEtaQ7z3H43waHvX2o3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248716'),
  ('99558150064515484', 'Rough Diamonds', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jan Theys, Yuval Yefet, Rotem Shamir', null, 'Kevin Janssens, Marie Vinck, Dudu Fisher, Casper Knopf, Soroush Helali, Els Dottermans, Robbie Cleiren, Yona Elian', 'TV-MA', 'When a prodigal son sends his family''s empire into crushing debt, his estranged brother returns to Antwerp''s diamond district to pick up the pieces.', 'When a prodigal son sends his family''s empire into crushing debt, his estranged brother returns to Antwerp''s diamond district to pick up the pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dr8BsZpkMsw7YFqVCM6aLEog3It.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223668'),
  ('369966402396579907', 'Rough Riders', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'John Milius, Hugh Wilson', 'Hugh Wilson, John Milius', 'Tom Berenger, Sam Elliott, Gary Busey, Brad Johnson, Illeana Douglas, Dale Dye, Brian Keith, George Hamilton', 'NR', 'Explores the journey of the cavalry group led by Theodore Roosevelt in a charge up San Juan Hill during the Spanish-American War.', 'Explores the journey of the cavalry group led by Theodore Roosevelt in a charge up San Juan Hill during the Spanish-American War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gC9qxjhSFE3mguh2JrB4BbZScO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47093'),
  ('741565601463262068', 'Roughnecks: Starship Troopers Chronicles', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Duane Capizzi, Richard Raynis, Jeff Kline', null, 'Rider Strong, Irene Bedard, Steve Staley, James Horan, Nicholas Guest, David DeLuise, E. G. Daily, Rino Romano', 'TV-PG', 'The exploits of the Mobile Infantry squad, "Razak''s Roughnecks," during the SICON–Bugs War between a newly united humanity and an extraterrestrial race, known as the "Bugs," also sometimes referred to as Arachnids.', 'The exploits of the Mobile Infantry squad, "Razak''s Roughnecks," during the SICON–Bugs War between a newly united humanity and an extraterrestrial race, known as the "Bugs," also sometimes referred to as Arachnids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nsL5HOXthBIesyPp6j07mtUK8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1890'),
  ('908298392657911043', 'Round Table', 2016, 'Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Wentao Dou', null, 'This is a chat variety show for dinner, created by Dou Wentao, a famous media person and cultural celebrity, and Youku "Looking at the Ideal". The initiator Dou Wentao invites three old friends and guests to restore the chatting scenes in real life. The topics are all-encompassing, look at the world, and inspire infinite thinking.', 'This is a chat variety show for dinner, created by Dou Wentao, a famous media person and cultural celebrity, and Youku "Looking at the Ideal". The initiator Dou Wentao invites three old friends and guests to restore the chatting scenes in real life. The topics are all-encompassing, look at the world, and inspire infinite thinking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq8O0qg5DbqD582ReFx90w3CSCS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:95903'),
  ('923202938198013050', 'Round the Twist', 1990, 'Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Documentary', 'Paul Jennings', 'Christine Madafferi, Louise Fox, Robert Greenberg', 'Andrew S. Gilbert, Rian McLean, Ebonnie Masini, Mathew Waters, Brook Sykes, Esben Storm, Tom Budge, Mark Mitchell', 'NR', 'Round the Twist is a Logie Award-winning Australian children''s television series about three children and their father who live in a lighthouse and become involved in many bizarre magical adventures.', 'Round the Twist is a Logie Award-winning Australian children''s television series about three children and their father who live in a lighthouse and become involved in many bizarre magical adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxOScaEU2exYLBkqG8LiYL69z5l.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:695'),
  ('441787379013400588', 'Route 66', 1960, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Stirling Silliphant, Herbert B. Leonard', null, 'Glenn Corbett', 'TV-Y7', 'After discovering that his late father has gone through most of the family fortune, Tod Stiles hits the title trans-America highway in his Corvette in search of adventure with friend Buz Murdock, a survivor of New York''s mean streets. The two work odd jobs as they meet and interact with colorful characters and find themselves plunged into one situation after another, some of them romantic, some of them very dangerous. Later, Linc Case, a Vietnam war hero trying to find himself, takes over as Tod''s travel companion.', 'After discovering that his late father has gone through most of the family fortune, Tod Stiles hits the title trans-America highway in his Corvette in search of adventure with friend Buz Murdock, a survivor of New York''s mean streets. The two work odd jobs as they meet and interact with colorful characters and find themselves plunged into one situation after another, some of them romantic, some of them very dangerous. Later, Linc Case, a Vietnam war hero trying to find himself, takes over as Tod''s travel companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6T4wbgACiIggTUIcIwBvm88MDKs.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2181'),
  ('962280915000996215', 'Rove', 1999, 'Comedy', null, 'Rove McManus', 'Nick Maxwell, Rove McManus', null, 'Rove, formerly Rove Live, was an Australian television variety show which premiered on the Nine Network on 22 September 1999, before moving to Network Ten which aired the program from 2000 until November, 2009. The show was hosted by comedian Rove McManus, and featured an ensemble cast, who presented various segments throughout the course of the show. The show won the Logie Award for "Most Popular Light Entertainment Program" five times.', 'Rove, formerly Rove Live, was an Australian television variety show which premiered on the Nine Network on 22 September 1999, before moving to Network Ten which aired the program from 2000 until November, 2009. The show was hosted by comedian Rove McManus, and featured an ensemble cast, who presented various segments throughout the course of the show. The show won the Logie Award for "Most Popular Light Entertainment Program" five times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znUsPPMZndVOOxlGm6zLk6BpkFo.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:4461'),
  ('960491268790735088', 'Rovers', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Joe Wilkinson, Craig Cash, David Earl', 'Joe Wilkinson, David Earl', 'Sue Johnston, Craig Cash, Lolly Adefope, Steve Speirs, Jamie Demetriou, Diane Morgan, Pearce Quigley, Judith Barker', null, 'Established in 1884, Redbridge Rovers F.C. are one of the oldest club''s in England - and one of the worst. A sitcom that introduces us to the characters who gather within the social club of a non-league football club.', 'Established in 1884, Redbridge Rovers F.C. are one of the oldest club''s in England - and one of the worst. A sitcom that introduces us to the characters who gather within the social club of a non-league football club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ec7iRJDPqk9dlreMTUUynEJDGF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66609'),
  ('798232618919522383', 'Rowan & Martin''s Laugh-In', 1968, 'Comedy', 'George Schlatter, Ed Friendly', null, 'Richard Dawson, Dan Rowan, Dick Martin, Gary Owens, Ruth Buzzi, Lily Tomlin, Patti Deutsch, Sarah Kennedy', 'TV-PG', 'An American sketch comedy television program hosted by comedians Dan Rowan and Dick Martin.', 'An American sketch comedy television program hosted by comedians Dan Rowan and Dick Martin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abMymAYr5R1yVeNl9NZs3x27RoY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:9895'),
  ('284101394258377226', 'Royal Crackers', 2023, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jason Ruiz', null, 'Jason Ruiz, Andrew Santino, Jessica St. Clair, David Gborie, Maile Flanagan', 'TV-MA', 'Royal Crackers was once the king of snacks, but the empire is crumbling. When the family patriarch, tyrannical company founder Theodore Hornsby Sr. ends up in a “super coma,” the rest of the Hornsbys will take their lack of talent and business acumen and try to make Royal Crackers the success it once was.', 'Royal Crackers was once the king of snacks, but the empire is crumbling. When the family patriarch, tyrannical company founder Theodore Hornsby Sr. ends up in a “super coma,” the rest of the Hornsbys will take their lack of talent and business acumen and try to make Royal Crackers the success it once was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWcOkakVjLxqALDCYOt0fjjrNzw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:205504'),
  ('377053223038022403', 'Royal Nirvana', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', '雪满梁园', '雪满梁园', 'Luo Jin, Li Yitong, Huang Zhizhong, Zhang Zhijian, Miao Pu, Jin Han, Zheng Yecheng, Wang Yuanke', null, 'A story that follows a Crown Prince who faces enemies from all sides and falls in love with a maidservant who wants to kill him. He is a son simply yearning for his father''s love but is feared and suppressed due to his position. Despite the conflicts, the Crown Prince is a man willing to sacrifice his life and reputation for his country.', 'A story that follows a Crown Prince who faces enemies from all sides and falls in love with a maidservant who wants to kill him. He is a son simply yearning for his father''s love but is feared and suppressed due to his position. Despite the conflicts, the Crown Prince is a man willing to sacrifice his life and reputation for his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHPTdwi0yHdLAhM8OQMcCjQYET9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95385'),
  ('350947186937020029', 'Royal Pains', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Lenchewski', null, 'Mark Feuerstein, Paulo Costanzo, Reshma Shetty, Brooke D''Orsay, Ben Shenkman', 'TV-PG', 'A young E.R. doctor who, after being wrongly blamed for a patient''s death, moves to the Hamptons and becomes the reluctant "doctor for hire" to the rich and famous. When the attractive administrator of the local hospital asks him to treat the town''s less fortunate, he finds himself walking the line between doing well for himself and doing good for others.', 'A young E.R. doctor who, after being wrongly blamed for a patient''s death, moves to the Hamptons and becomes the reluctant "doctor for hire" to the rich and famous. When the attractive administrator of the local hospital asks him to treat the town''s less fortunate, he finds himself walking the line between doing well for himself and doing good for others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WW26JPHeG5mgrFkgjvv3Qmgcwg.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:18779'),
  ('1074887441655678136', 'Royal Secret Agent', 2020, 'Comedy, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'L, Kwon Na-ra, Lee Tae-hwan, Han Eun-seong, Lee Yi-kyung, Jo Soo-min, Ahn Nae-sang, Choi Jong-won', null, 'During the Joseon Dynasty, the Secret Royal Inspectors are the eyes and ears of the king. They travel the provinces undercover and listen to the plight of the common people, investigating abuses and corruption of government officials.', 'During the Joseon Dynasty, the Secret Royal Inspectors are the eyes and ears of the king. They travel the provinces undercover and listen to the plight of the common people, investigating abuses and corruption of government officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5oPht3t2MCkmIskIRKzcOcwH8u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114149'),
  ('1072880593200305266', 'Rozen Maiden', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Asami Sanada, Rie Tanaka, Sakura Nogawa, Natsuko Kuwatani, Rika Morinaga, Noriko Rikimaru, Ko Matsuo', null, 'Jun is a total recluse who won''t take a step outside his house and only loves online shopping. When Jun winds up a doll that suddenly appears in his room because of his mail-orders tendencies, he has no idea what he''s in for. The doll comes to life and proclaims herself to be ''Shinku''. She later binds Jun to her as a medium, her counterpart, and her magical power source, in an attempt to save his life. And so starts the beginning of a chaotic life for the Sakurada household as more Rozen Maidens arrive on their doorsteps. But what are the Rozen Maidens and why do they exist? And will Jun learn to open up his heart and face his fears? The main characters are: Sakurada Jun - The main lead of the story who has to learn to face his fears, thanks to the arrival of Shinku. The interaction between Jun and Shinku are often funny and at times, touching.', 'Jun is a total recluse who won''t take a step outside his house and only loves online shopping. When Jun winds up a doll that suddenly appears in his room because of his mail-orders tendencies, he has no idea what he''s in for. The doll comes to life and proclaims herself to be ''Shinku''. She later binds Jun to her as a medium, her counterpart, and her magical power source, in an attempt to save his life. And so starts the beginning of a chaotic life for the Sakurada household as more Rozen Maidens arrive on their doorsteps. But what are the Rozen Maidens and why do they exist? And will Jun learn to open up his heart and face his fears? The main characters are: Sakurada Jun - The main lead of the story who has to learn to face his fears, thanks to the arrival of Shinku. The interaction between Jun and Shinku are often funny and at times, touching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FIVOkcXrhyxMm6dMrioCMkQy7R.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42828'),
  ('760447247936523729', 'Rozen Maiden - Zurückspulen', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Rie Tanaka, Natsuko Kuwatani, Miyuki Sawashiro, Chiemi Chiba, Asami Sanada, Yumi Shimura', 'TV-14', 'During the events of the original Rozen Maiden, after circling "yes" on a paper and agreeing to wind an unknown "something," a traumatized Jun Sakurada fights alongside the lifelike dolls known as the Rozen Maidens. But what would have happened if Jun had circled "no"? Jun, having gotten over his school trauma from his younger days, spends his time attending college and working in a bookstore. However, he does not feel as though he belongs anywhere. One day, he finds a book containing instructions on how to make a Rozen Maiden. Mysteriously, when he arrives home that night, the second volume in the book series has been delivered to his house, along with some pieces of a doll. But as suddenly as they started arriving, the books stop coming, and Jun gets a notice that says that the books have ceased being published. With an incomplete doll in hand, and a message from his other self in another world, this Jun also finds his way into the world of the Rozen Maidens.', 'During the events of the original Rozen Maiden, after circling "yes" on a paper and agreeing to wind an unknown "something," a traumatized Jun Sakurada fights alongside the lifelike dolls known as the Rozen Maidens. But what would have happened if Jun had circled "no"? Jun, having gotten over his school trauma from his younger days, spends his time attending college and working in a bookstore. However, he does not feel as though he belongs anywhere. One day, he finds a book containing instructions on how to make a Rozen Maiden. Mysteriously, when he arrives home that night, the second volume in the book series has been delivered to his house, along with some pieces of a doll. But as suddenly as they started arriving, the books stop coming, and Jun gets a notice that says that the books have ceased being published. With an incomplete doll in hand, and a message from his other self in another world, this Jun also finds his way into the world of the Rozen Maidens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHYMi2FAhMg0msTxF4LgGMiJoy1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68963'),
  ('815081767718605644', 'RPG Real Estate', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Honoka Inoue, Hina Kino, Natsumi Kawaida, Manaka Iwami, Yoko Hikasa, Minami Takahashi, Honoka Kuroki', 'TV-14', 'The story begins 15 years after the demon king was defeated and the world has become peaceful. Kotone, who graduated from school and became a magician, inquired the kingdom-affiliated RPG Real Estate in order to find a new home. In reality, RPG Real Estate was Kotone''s place of employment, and together with Fa, a demi-human, the priest Rufuria, and the soldier Rakira, they help support the searches of new homes for the customers with various circumstances.', 'The story begins 15 years after the demon king was defeated and the world has become peaceful. Kotone, who graduated from school and became a magician, inquired the kingdom-affiliated RPG Real Estate in order to find a new home. In reality, RPG Real Estate was Kotone''s place of employment, and together with Fa, a demi-human, the priest Rufuria, and the soldier Rakira, they help support the searches of new homes for the customers with various circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yThvCUigJRtguDcysLS9QIehPyX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119631'),
  ('552983022168691801', 'RTL Tonight', 2025, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'In RTL Vanavond''s new talk show, presenters Renze Klamer, Beau van Erven Dorens, and Humberto Tan are joined by a whole squad of well-known divers. And there are some notable names among them.', 'In RTL Vanavond''s new talk show, presenters Renze Klamer, Beau van Erven Dorens, and Humberto Tan are joined by a whole squad of well-known divers. And there are some notable names among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m56sR1upTuxs3UZJU7vbku1cSAc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:296126'),
  ('841357367298231379', 'Rubble & Crew', 2023, 'Animation, Kids', 'Bradley Zweig', null, 'Luxton Handspiker, Shazdeh Kapadia, Alessandro Pugiotto, Alberta Bolan, Liam McKenna', 'TV-Y', 'Follow Rubble and his pup family as they use their awesome construction vehicles to build and repair whatever the town of Builder Cove needs in high-stakes adventures.', 'Follow Rubble and his pup family as they use their awesome construction vehicles to build and repair whatever the town of Builder Cove needs in high-stakes adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MA1tqT0yI57IlPBy0KRN6G2mhN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:214875'),
  ('317641236978085254', 'Rubi', 2020, 'Soap', 'Yolanda Vargas Dulché, Leonardo Padrón', 'Leonardo Padrón', 'Camila Sodi, José Ron, Rodrigo Guirao Díaz, Kimberly Dos Ramos, Ela Velden, Tania Lizardo, Henry Zakka, Lisardo Guarinos', 'TV-PG', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVh19iLGwTXp9fhIbzV33U9pmbh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98387'),
  ('289976959861018873', 'Rubí', 2004, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery', 'Yolanda Vargas Dulché', null, 'Bárbara Mori, Eduardo Santamarina, Jacqueline Bracamontes, Sebastián Rulli, Ana Martín, Yadhira Carrillo, Josefina Echánove, Antonio Medellín', null, 'Rubí Pérez is a very beautiful but poor woman who studies at an exclusive university thanks to the financial support from Cristina , her hard-working older sister. She is best friends with Maribel de la Fuente , a kind and wealthy young woman. Rubí is actually jealous of Maribel''s social status while pitying her disability and dreams of marrying a rich man to leave poverty behind.', 'Rubí Pérez is a very beautiful but poor woman who studies at an exclusive university thanks to the financial support from Cristina , her hard-working older sister. She is best friends with Maribel de la Fuente , a kind and wealthy young woman. Rubí is actually jealous of Maribel''s social status while pitying her disability and dreams of marrying a rich man to leave poverty behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUYw0HKpaxZWbKkzCIPgEwXPDr3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12961'),
  ('1105999445663061342', 'Rubicon', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Horwitch', null, 'James Badge Dale, Jessica Collins, Lauren Hodges, Dallas Roberts, Christopher Evan Welch, Arliss Howard, Miranda Richardson', 'TV-14', 'An intelligence analyst at a national think tank in New York City called the American Policy Institute discovers that he may be working with members of a secret society that manipulates world events on a grand scale.', 'An intelligence analyst at a national think tank in New York City called the American Policy Institute discovers that he may be working with members of a secret society that manipulates world events on a grand scale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYvsIIHsHkIz8fv3qbQCJpkgmLO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30892'),
  ('245567837425381370', 'Rubius Next Level Japón', 2023, 'Documentary, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Rubén Doblas Gundersen', 'TV-Y7', 'In search of his cat Wilson missing in Japan, Rubius will discover the places, characters and culture that make the country a unique place in the world, while testing his own limits by facing a new level he never imagined he was ready for.', 'In search of his cat Wilson missing in Japan, Rubius will discover the places, characters and culture that make the country a unique place in the world, while testing his own limits by facing a new level he never imagined he was ready for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDCTmGoru0fEHwa9WEfNB4jAdK2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234015'),
  ('811481990307430101', 'Ruby Gloom', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Carolyn Hay, Martin Hsu', null, 'Sarah Gadon, Adrian Truss, Scott McCord, Barbara Mamabolo, David Berni, Peter Keleghan, Stacey DePass, Emily Hampshire', 'TV-G', 'Ruby Gloom is a Canadian children''s show that revolves around the titular character, Ruby, who has a unique perspective on the world. While some kids might be afraid of the dark, Ruby embraces it and finds joy in the company of strange and quirky characters like Doom Kitty, Skull Boy, Misery, Boo Boo, and Mr. Buns. Together, they navigate various adventures and challenges. The series is based on an apparel franchise of the same name. The show was produced by Nelvana and began airing on October 13, 2006 in Canada on the network YTV. It features the voices of Sarah Gadon, Emily Hampshire, Peter Keleghan, and Adrian Truss.', 'Ruby Gloom is a Canadian children''s show that revolves around the titular character, Ruby, who has a unique perspective on the world. While some kids might be afraid of the dark, Ruby embraces it and finds joy in the company of strange and quirky characters like Doom Kitty, Skull Boy, Misery, Boo Boo, and Mr. Buns. Together, they navigate various adventures and challenges. The series is based on an apparel franchise of the same name. The show was produced by Nelvana and began airing on October 13, 2006 in Canada on the network YTV. It features the voices of Sarah Gadon, Emily Hampshire, Peter Keleghan, and Adrian Truss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnUpRoi4Z9BYthmjM9CCRwPR5vN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14165'),
  ('942619798482131820', 'Rudra: The Edge Of Darkness', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rajesh Mapuskar, Sameer Nair', 'Jay Sheela Bansal', 'Ajay Devgn, Raashii Khanna, Esha Deol, Atul Kulkarni, Ashwini Kalsekar, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Milind Gunaji, Vikram Singh Chauhan', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the Special Crimes Unit of the Mumbai Police, Revolving around DCP Rudraveer Singh, who is under the system’s radar despite being one of its best minds at work.', 'Set in the Special Crimes Unit of the Mumbai Police, Revolving around DCP Rudraveer Singh, who is under the system’s radar despite being one of its best minds at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EP4jCFSf5eYONcslGnpxkTnvId.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123888'),
  ('600125593918076348', 'Rugal', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Rilmae, Do Hyun-joo', 'Do Hyun-joo', 'Choi Jin-hyuk, Park Sung-woong, Cho Dong-hyuk, Jung Hye-in, Kim Min-sang, Park Sun-ho, Park Jeong-hak, Ji Dae-han', 'TV-MA', 'A police detective who loses everything to a criminal organization seeks payback when he gains special abilities through biotechnology.', 'A police detective who loses everything to a criminal organization seeks payback when he gains special abilities through biotechnology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLXeqmvJ6KnWz1ifLMBPHYOovCt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97766'),
  ('509773360583047906', 'Rugby', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ilya Kulikov', 'Ilya Kulikov, Anya Mirokhina, Vasiliy Vnukov', 'Margarita Abroskina, Oleg Gaas, Sergey Rudzevich, Aleksandra Rozanova, Viktoriya Belyakova, Kseniia Novysheva, Sergei Selin, Sergey Galakhov', null, 'In the story, Russian gymnastics champion Nastya quits her favorite sport due to a conflict with her coach. Unable to imagine life without victories, the girl goes to women''s rugby. Max, who left boxing and mixed martial arts at one time, trains in the men''s team of the same club. Everyone in their team is exploring the honest, uncompromising and brutal world of rugby.', 'In the story, Russian gymnastics champion Nastya quits her favorite sport due to a conflict with her coach. Unable to imagine life without victories, the girl goes to women''s rugby. Max, who left boxing and mixed martial arts at one time, trains in the men''s team of the same club. Everyone in their team is exploring the honest, uncompromising and brutal world of rugby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3e4jbMaJlr96OOZM7IFER8Dv1Dz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126342'),
  ('449898711430609196', 'Rugrats', 1991, 'Family, Animation, Kids, Comedy', 'Arlene Klasky, Paul Germain, Gábor Csupó', null, 'E. G. Daily, Kath Soucie, Cheryl Chase, Dionne Quan, Tara Strong, Joe Alaskey, Melanie Chartoff, Tress MacNeille', 'TV-Y7', 'Focuses on a group of toddlers, most prominently Tommy, Chuckie, Phil, Lil, and Angelica, and their day-to-day lives, usually involving common life experiences that become adventures in the babies'' imaginations. Adults in the series are almost always unaware of what the children are up to; however, this only provides more room for the babies to explore and discover their surroundings.', 'Focuses on a group of toddlers, most prominently Tommy, Chuckie, Phil, Lil, and Angelica, and their day-to-day lives, usually involving common life experiences that become adventures in the babies'' imaginations. Adults in the series are almost always unaware of what the children are up to; however, this only provides more room for the babies to explore and discover their surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmsINbZuEBLNP2Z26Xffx5NHJpW.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:3022'),
  ('466937252423691234', 'Rugrats', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'E. G. Daily, Nancy Cartwright, Cheryl Chase, Cree Summer, Kath Soucie, Ashley Rae Spillers, Tommy Dewey, Tony Hale', 'TV-Y7', 'A reinvention of the beloved 90s cartoon, Rugrats follows a group of adventurous babies as they discover the big world around them. Lead by Tommy Pickles, this toddler crew explores the world from their pint-sized and wildly imaginative perspective.', 'A reinvention of the beloved 90s cartoon, Rugrats follows a group of adventurous babies as they discover the big world around them. Lead by Tommy Pickles, this toddler crew explores the world from their pint-sized and wildly imaginative perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk5bqkQVYC32lozZO6Z0ZLw32jv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124920'),
  ('142312574986239238', 'Ruhsar', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Gani Müjde', 'Gani Müjde', 'Hande Ataizi, Cem Davran, Göksel Kortay, Hakan Gerçek, Mihrace Yekenkülüğ, Mehmet Ulay, Berat Yenilmez, Volkan Girgin', null, 'Mourning of his wife''s death, Mazhar creates a different reality. Mahzar and his ghost wife Ruhsar, who has magical powers, are happier than ever. But there is trouble in paradise, Mahzar''s mother Menkibe is trying her best to make him marry someone that she likes.', 'Mourning of his wife''s death, Mazhar creates a different reality. Mahzar and his ghost wife Ruhsar, who has magical powers, are happier than ever. But there is trouble in paradise, Mahzar''s mother Menkibe is trying her best to make him marry someone that she likes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CZee94C79kl6uVjCXqHHfs2tlD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:49324'),
  ('1136426391740907558', 'Rulers of Fortune', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Heitor Dhalia', 'Bernardo Barcellos', 'André Lamoglia, Xamã, Mel Maia, Giullia Buscacio, Juliana Paes, Chico Diaz, Ruan Aguiar, Igor Fernández', 'TV-MA', 'A young man aspires to rise through the ranks of Rio''s gambling underworld — unaware of the dangerous game of betrayal, lust and blood that awaits him.', 'A young man aspires to rise through the ranks of Rio''s gambling underworld — unaware of the dangerous game of betrayal, lust and blood that awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TqtXFRt1sE6ifbaq8PO7bzA8Ai.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282440'),
  ('791034101401828054', 'Rules of Engagement', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Tom Hertz', null, 'Patrick Warburton, David Spade, Megyn Price, Bianca Kajlich, Oliver Hudson, Adhir Kalyan', 'TV-14', 'Rules of Engagement is a comedy about the different phases of male/female relationships, as seen through the eyes of a newly engaged couple, Adam and Jennifer, a long-time married pair, Jeff and Audrey, and a single guy on the prowl, Russell. As they find out, the often confusing stages of a relationship can seem like being on a roller coaster. People can describe the ride to you, but to really know what it''s like you have to experience it for yourself.', 'Rules of Engagement is a comedy about the different phases of male/female relationships, as seen through the eyes of a newly engaged couple, Adam and Jennifer, a long-time married pair, Jeff and Audrey, and a single guy on the prowl, Russell. As they find out, the often confusing stages of a relationship can seem like being on a roller coaster. People can describe the ride to you, but to really know what it''s like you have to experience it for yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRma9RQCgwLXqkDrCPyrQwsazuJ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2755'),
  ('774048674226421227', 'Rules of the Game', 2015, 'Soap, Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Alessandro Marson, Thereza Falcão', 'Alexandre Nero, Giovanna Antonelli, Cauã Reymond, Vanessa Giácomo, Marco Pigossi, Eduardo Moscovis, José de Abreu, Tony Ramos', null, 'Discussing the limits between good and bad, the plot is set in Rio de Janeiro and tells the story of Romero Rômulo (Alexandre Nero), an ex-politician that has a life less obvious then it seems.', 'Discussing the limits between good and bad, the plot is set in Rio de Janeiro and tells the story of Romero Rômulo (Alexandre Nero), an ex-politician that has a life less obvious then it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQQaMPNPfOT3iB79PSK2Kns7oHj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63817'),
  ('898111857183215873', 'Rules of the Game', 2022, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Maxine Peake, Rakhee Thakrar, Dominic Vulliamy, Ben Batt, Alison Steadman, Amy Leeson, Zoë Tapper, Susan Wokoma', null, 'Sam is a hard-headed manager at a family-run business in the North West. However, when Sam arrives at work one day to find a dead body in the office reception she is forced to reckon with not only murky behaviour in the present, but murderous secrets from the past as well.', 'Sam is a hard-headed manager at a family-run business in the North West. However, when Sam arrives at work one day to find a dead body in the office reception she is forced to reckon with not only murky behaviour in the present, but murderous secrets from the past as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Pm7oywq9aUVKGS6NYutuyPJeGN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154390'),
  ('886840997624942724', 'Rumble Garanndoll', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Seiichiro Yamashita, Fairouz Ai, Aina Suzuki, Shiori Izawa, Takamitsu Fukuchi, Takuma Terashima, Rina Hidaka, Yukiyo Fujii', 'TV-14', 'Japan, 2019, just before the dawn of a new era. Suddenly, a rift to another dimension appears in the sky, revealing an alternative world "Shinkoku Nippon," with the sky and the earth upside down. This parallel world keeps the former militarism, with its era being Eternal Showa. The military invades the real Japan with giant humanoid robots called "GARANN" and their gas weapons "GENMU", rendering our modern weapons ineffective. "Shinkoku Nippon" instantly seizes the government and achieves de facto conquest of Japan. The new era, "Reiwa," has not arrived for Japan.', 'Japan, 2019, just before the dawn of a new era. Suddenly, a rift to another dimension appears in the sky, revealing an alternative world "Shinkoku Nippon," with the sky and the earth upside down. This parallel world keeps the former militarism, with its era being Eternal Showa. The military invades the real Japan with giant humanoid robots called "GARANN" and their gas weapons "GENMU", rendering our modern weapons ineffective. "Shinkoku Nippon" instantly seizes the government and achieves de facto conquest of Japan. The new era, "Reiwa," has not arrived for Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h20Bf9yhuaWG3EKWyjignEG4561.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122286'),
  ('819889402308378329', 'Rumbling Hearts', 2003, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Minami Kuribayashi, Chiaki Takahashi, Kisho Taniyama, Kaori Mizuhashi, Kiyomi Asai, Kozue Yoshizumi, Yasuhiko Kawazu, Emi Uwagawa', 'TV-14', 'At first, Takayuki Narumi is befriended by Mitsuki Hayase only because Mitsuki''s best friend, Haruka Suzumiya has a crush on him; however since then, Takayuki, his pal Shinji Taira, and Mitsuki have grown to be the best of friends. Then one day, Haruka confesses to Takayuki her love for him. Not wanting to hurt her feelings, Takayuki agrees to go out with her. After a few incidents, their relationship gets intimate, even while Takayuki and Mitsuki begin to realize their feelings for each other. But suddenly, when tragedy strikes, things are never the same for these four friends again.', 'At first, Takayuki Narumi is befriended by Mitsuki Hayase only because Mitsuki''s best friend, Haruka Suzumiya has a crush on him; however since then, Takayuki, his pal Shinji Taira, and Mitsuki have grown to be the best of friends. Then one day, Haruka confesses to Takayuki her love for him. Not wanting to hurt her feelings, Takayuki agrees to go out with her. After a few incidents, their relationship gets intimate, even while Takayuki and Mitsuki begin to realize their feelings for each other. But suddenly, when tragedy strikes, things are never the same for these four friends again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66jZ55jSMIiBPO7t1U7nwRc03hC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42855'),
  ('410581765877668535', 'Rumpole of the Bailey', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'John Mortimer', null, 'Leo McKern, Patricia Hodge, Julian Curry, Robin Bailey, Peter Blythe, Richard Murdoch, Jonathan Coy, Abigail McKern', 'TV-PG', 'Rumpole of the Bailey is a British television series created and written by the British writer and barrister John Mortimer. It stars Leo McKern as Horace Rumpole, an aging London barrister who defends any and all clients, and has been spun off into a series of short stories, novels, and radio programmes.', 'Rumpole of the Bailey is a British television series created and written by the British writer and barrister John Mortimer. It stars Leo McKern as Horace Rumpole, an aging London barrister who defends any and all clients, and has been spun off into a series of short stories, novels, and radio programmes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UNZ0w9tc2T7tDbE2DO4wF718I7.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4123'),
  ('438708898934378970', 'Run', 2013, 'Drama', 'Marlon Smith, Daniel Fajemisin-Duncan', 'Daniel Fajemisin-Duncan, Marlon Smith', 'Katharina Schüttler, Katie Leung, Olivia Colman, Lennie James, Chris Jarman, Simona Brown, Sarah Hoare, Jaime Winstone', null, 'Four gritty no-holds-barred human stories of the streets, all linked together in some respect.', 'Four gritty no-holds-barred human stories of the streets, all linked together in some respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjXcUJsLfHzpLahLbGuulwMIheD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63859'),
  ('1053054379166867164', 'RUN', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vicky Jones', null, 'Merritt Wever, Domhnall Gleeson, Archie Panjabi, Rich Sommer', 'TV-MA', 'Ruby is living a humdrum existence when one day she gets a text inviting her to fulfill a youthful pact, promising true love and self-reinvention, by stepping out of her life to take a journey with her oldest flame.', 'Ruby is living a humdrum existence when one day she gets a text inviting her to fulfill a youthful pact, promising true love and self-reinvention, by stepping out of her life to take a journey with her oldest flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbYfDspa6vUTAxif5SZJABgB8pr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87393'),
  ('83342128070298799', 'Run Away', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Harlan Coben', null, 'James Nesbitt, Alfred Enoch, Minnie Driver, Ruth Jones, Ellie de Lange, Lucian Msamati, Amy Gledhill, Annette Badland', 'TV-MA', 'A desperate father searching for his runaway daughter gets caught up in a murder case — and stumbles upon secrets which could destroy his family for good.', 'A desperate father searching for his runaway daughter gets caught up in a murder case — and stumbles upon secrets which could destroy his family for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frKxKytEHIA2vXg4RAz14Sc0UmS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244244'),
